        "dateAdded": "2026-04-27T05:53:30.542Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:35.17] We got married on a cold mid-winter's morning\n[00:44.52] We said our lines then kissed and it was over\n[00:53.06] Those pronouncements had such weight\n[00:57.20] I guess they made us hesitate, hesitate\n[01:05.14] \n[01:11.17] When she moved her hips and swayed in my direction\n[01:19.34] I thought we could make it yet\n[01:22.76] And beat the isolation\n[01:29.46] But in that gentle dark\n[01:33.61] Man, we tore ourselves apart\n[01:37.79] Through the fire and rain\n[01:42.33] Through the wilderness and pain\n[01:46.82] Through the losses, through the gains\n[01:51.37] On love's rollercoaster train\n[01:55.52] I call your name\n[01:59.26] \n[02:04.43] I call your name\n[02:08.08] \n[02:13.64] Through the fire and rain\n[02:18.13] Through the wilderness and pain\n[02:22.69] Through the losses, through the gains\n[02:27.19] On love's roller coaster train\n[02:31.39] I call your name\n[02:35.56] We used to laugh\n[02:40.97] Is the fire dying, babe? It hurts to ask\n[02:49.83] Let me hold you for a while\n[02:55.01] \n[03:02.94] Through the fire and rain\n[03:07.54] On love's roller coaster train\n[03:11.72] I call your name\n[03:15.43] \n[03:20.67] I call your name\n[03:22.38] Hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo, hoo-ooh, woo-hoo, hoo-hoo\n[03:32.50] Hoo-hoo woo-hoo\n[03:34.44] Ow\n[03:34.50] Woo-hoo, hoo-ooh, hoo-hoo, hoo-ooh, hoo-ooh, hoo-hoo\n[03:54.38] \n[04:05.77] Woo-hoo, hoo-hoo\n[04:14.86] We got married on a cold mid-winter's morning\n[04:42.97]",
