        "fullLyrics": "[00:26.93] Back in black, I hit the sack\n[00:29.79] I've been too long, I'm glad to be back\n[00:31.82] Yes, I'm let loose from the noose\n[00:35.26] That's kept me hanging about\n[00:37.05] I'm just looking at the sky 'cause it's getting me high\n[00:40.17] Forget the hearse, 'cause I'll never die\n[00:42.13] I got nine lives, cat's eyes\n[00:45.45] Abusing every one of them and running wild\n[00:47.53] 'Cause I'm back, yes I'm back\n[00:52.43] Well, I'm back, yes I'm back\n[00:57.34] Well, I'm back, back\n[01:02.60] Well, I'm back in black\n[01:05.21] Yes, I'm back in black, oh\n[01:08.01] Back in the back of a Cadillac\n[01:10.42] Number one with a bullet, I'm a power pack\n[01:12.83] Yes, I'm in a bang with a gang\n[01:16.30] They've got to catch me if they want me to hang\n[01:18.08] 'Cause I'm back on the track and I'm beatin' the flack\n[01:20.98] Nobody's gonna get me on another rap\n[01:23.26] So look at me now, I'm just making my play\n[01:26.11] Don't try to push your luck, just get out of my way\n[01:28.54] 'Cause I'm back, yes I'm back\n[01:33.45] Well, I'm back, yes I'm back\n[01:38.46] Well, I'm back, back\n[01:43.80] Well, I'm back in black\n[01:46.09] Yes, I'm back in black\n[01:49.44] \n[02:29.61] Well, I'm back, yes I'm back\n[02:34.69] Well, I'm back, yes I'm back\n[02:39.57] Well, I'm back, back\n[02:44.74] Well, I'm back in black\n[02:47.10] Yes, I'm back in black, aw!\n[02:52.50] Ah, yeah\n[02:54.54] Oh, yeah\n[02:57.11] Take my love\n[02:59.47] Yeah-yeah\n[03:02.89] Yeah\n[03:04.88] Oh, hey yeah\n[03:07.60] Ooh, yeah\n[03:09.44] Well, I'm back (I'm back)\n[03:12.81] Back, well I'm (I'm back)\n[03:15.42] Back (I'm back)\n[03:18.09] Back (I'm back)\n[03:20.61] Back (I'm back)\n[03:22.92] Back, back in black\n[03:27.20] Yes, I'm back in black\n[03:31.07] \n[03:33.34] I've hit the sack\n[03:33.96]",
