        "chorus": "Am D C G/B 4x",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "VERSE",
        "dateAdded": "2026-06-05T17:48:02.333Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[01:27.28] I'm rolling thunder, pouring rain\n[01:31.95] I'm coming on like a hurricane\n[01:36.35] My lightning's flashing across the sky\n[01:40.99] You're only young, but you're gonna die\n[01:45.44] I won't take no prisoners, won't spare no lives\n[01:50.31] Nobody's putting up a fight\n[01:54.39] I got my bell, I'm gonna take you to hell\n[01:58.85] I'm gonna get ya, Satan get ya\n[02:02.22] Hells bells\n[02:06.62] Hells bells, you got me ringing\n[02:11.64] Hells bells, my temperature's high\n[02:15.98] Hells bells\n[02:19.76] \n[02:30.14] I'll give you black sensations up and down your spine\n[02:34.89] If you're into evil, you're a friend of mine\n[02:39.24] See the white light flashing as I split the night\n[02:43.45] Cos if good's on the left then I'm sticking to the right\n[02:48.39] I won't take no prisoners, won't spare no lives\n[02:52.99] Nobody's puttin' up a fight\n[02:57.05] I got my bell, I'm gonna take you to hell\n[03:01.64] I'm gonna get ya, Satan get ya\n[03:05.32] Hells bells\n[03:09.84] Hells bells, you got me ringing\n[03:14.67] Hells bells, my temperature's high\n[03:19.06] Hells bells\n[03:22.52] \n[04:07.96] Hells bells, Satan's coming to you\n[04:12.00] Hells bells, he's ringing them now\n[04:16.86] Those hells bells, the temperature's high\n[04:21.10] Hells bells, across the sky\n[04:26.10] Hells bells, they're taking you down\n[04:30.36] Hells bells, they're dragging you down\n[04:34.88] Hells bells, gonna split the night\n[04:39.17] Hells bells, there's no way to fight\n[04:45.40] \n[05:07.23] Hells bells\n[05:10.53]",
