        "chorus": "D# A# D7 D# A# | D# A# C7 F",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "BRIDGE",
        "dateAdded": "2026-05-13T10:51:29.788Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:25.91] When the rain is blowing in your face\n[00:32.11] And the whole world is on your case\n\n[00:38.34] I could offer you a warm embrace\n\n[00:44.46] To make you feel my love\n\n[00:50.62] When the evening shadows and the stars appear\n\n[00:56.82] And there is no one there to dry your tears\n[01:03.23] I could hold you for a million years\n[01:09.11] To make you feel my love\n\n[01:15.47] I know you haven't made your mind up yet\n[01:21.72] But I would never do you wrong\n\n[01:28.03] I've known it from the moment that we met\n[01:33.73] No doubt in my mind where you belong\n\n[01:40.68] I'd go hungry, I'd go black and blue\n\n[01:47.05] I'd go crawling down the avenue\n\n[01:53.39] Know there's nothing that I wouldn't do\n[01:59.14] To make you feel my love\n\n[02:30.29] The storms are raging on the rolling sea\n[02:36.57] And on the highway of regret\n[02:42.78] The winds of change are blowing wild and free\n[02:48.58] You ain't seen nothing like me yet\n[02:54.70] I could make you happy, make your dreams come true\n[03:01.73] Nothing that I wouldn't do\n[03:07.87] Go to the ends of the earth for you\n[03:13.96] To make you feel my love\n[03:20.26] To make you feel my love\n[03:23.74]",
