        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.16] I heard that you're settled down\n[00:21.05] That you found a girl and you're married now\n[00:29.36] I heard that your dreams came true\n[00:35.52] Guess she gave you things I didn't give to you\n[00:42.89] Old friend, why are you so shy?\n[00:49.53] Ain't like you to hold back or hide from the light\n[00:57.05] I hate to turn up out of the blue, uninvited\n[01:00.64] But I couldn't stay away, I couldn't fight it\n[01:04.48] I had hoped you'd see my face\n[01:06.53] And that you'd be reminded that for me, it isn't over\n[01:13.72] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\n[01:19.84] I wish nothing but the best for you, too\n[01:26.80] Don't forget me, I beg\n[01:30.48] I'll remember, you said\n[01:34.07] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\n[01:40.82] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\n[01:48.63] \n[01:51.23] You know how the time flies\n[01:57.12] Only yesterday was the time of our lives\n[02:04.21] We were born and raised in a summer haze\n[02:11.39] Bound by the surprise of our glory days\n[02:19.01] I hate to turn up out of the blue, uninvited\n[02:22.44] But I couldn't stay away, I couldn't fight it\n[02:26.18] I had hoped you'd see my face\n[02:28.55] And that you'd be reminded that for me, it isn't over\n[02:34.02] \n[02:36.82] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\n[02:43.13] I wish nothing but the best for you, too\n[02:50.58] Don't forget me, I beg\n[02:54.09] I'll remember, you said\n[02:57.10] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\n[03:05.03] Nothing compares, no worries or cares\n[03:08.96] Regrets and mistakes, they're memories made\n[03:12.66] Who would have known how bittersweet this would taste?\n[03:21.29] \n[03:24.09] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\n[03:30.32] I wish nothing but the best for you\n[03:37.08] Don't forget me, I beg\n[03:40.68] I'll remember, you said\n[03:44.36] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\n[03:52.23] Never mind, I'll find someone like you\n[03:58.83] I wish nothing but the best for you, too\n[04:05.84] Don't forget me, I beg\n[04:09.17] I'll remember, you said\n[04:12.55] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead\n[04:19.89] Sometimes it lasts in love, but sometimes it hurts instead...\n[04:26.08]",
