        "chorusTitle": "Chorus",
        "dateAdded": "2026-04-20T06:07:48.045Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:29.40] Pink, it's my new obsession\n[00:34.85] Pink, it's not even a question,\n[00:40.00] Pink, on the lips of your lover\n[00:45.07] (Oh)\n[00:46.29] 'Cause Pink is the love you discover\n[00:51.33] Pink, as the bing on your cherry\n[00:56.71] Pink, 'cause you are so very\n[01:02.25] Pink, it's the color of passion\n[01:07.60] Ah, 'cause today it just goes with the fashion\n[01:13.64] Pink, it was love at first sight\n[01:19.31] Yeah, Pink when I turn out the light\n[01:24.68] And Pink gets me high as a kite\n[01:30.46] And I think everything is going to be all right\n[01:36.98] No matter what we do tonight\n[01:43.31] You could be my flamingo\n[01:47.40] 'Cause pink, it's the new kinda of lingo\n[01:52.48] Pink - like a deco umbrella\n[01:58.18] It's pink but you don't ever tell her\n[02:03.92] Pink, it was love at first sight\n[02:09.76] And Pink when I turn out the light\n[02:15.27] Pink gets me high as a kite\n[02:20.81] And I think everything is going to be all right\n[02:27.31] No matter what we do tonight\n[02:55.89] I want to be your lover\n[03:02.60] I, I wanna wrap you in rubber\n[03:07.35] And it's pink as the sheets that we lay on\n[03:12.26] 'Cause Pink, it's my favorite crayon\n[03:17.32] Yeah!\n[03:18.90] Pink, it was love at first sight\n[03:23.97] Pink,  when I turn out the light\n[03:28.86] Pink, it's like red but not quite\n[03:34.75] And I think, everything is going to be all right\n[03:41.72] No matter what we do tonight\n[03:50.90]",
