        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.89] Grab a bottle of wine at the county line stop and go\n[00:19.83] Make it fast I'll be waiting outside\n[00:26.05] I can hear what you're thinking just a little way down the road\n[00:32.27] I can see your smile behind the headlights\n[00:37.08] And you said I been waiting on this moment\n[00:40.93] All day, it's all that I wanted\n[00:44.08] So just give me a minute let me take you in\n[00:49.22] And I said\n[00:51.12] While you're at it\n[00:53.82] Pull off and turn the radio down low\n[00:56.91] 'Cause all night, we have it\n[00:59.82] You can take your time pulling me in close\n[01:03.28] I hear everything that you're saying\n[01:06.17] Your hands are speaking my language\n[01:09.27] So tell me about it\n[01:12.07] While you're at it\n[01:18.74] While you're at it\n[01:21.35] Grab a blanket out the back wrap me up in the flatbed\n[01:27.53] Throw a rope around the moon and paint it blue, mm\n[01:32.61] I said I been waiting on this moment\n[01:36.49] All day, it's all that I wanted\n[01:39.49] You got me spinning in the stars\n[01:41.82] Right from the start making me fall\n[01:45.33] So while you're at it\n[01:48.95] Pull off and turn the radio down low\n[01:52.22] 'Cause all night, we have it\n[01:55.16] You can take your time pulling me in close\n[01:58.38] I hear everything that you're saying\n[02:01.30] Your hands are speaking my language\n[02:04.39] So tell me about it\n[02:07.94] While you're at it, oh\n[02:14.10] While you're at it\n[02:23.03] While you're at it\n[02:25.91] Pull off and turn the radio down low\n[02:29.02] 'Cause all night, we have it\n[02:32.15] You can take your time pulling me in close\n[02:35.26] I hear everything that you're saying\n[02:38.29] Your hands are speaking my language\n[02:41.50] So tell me about it\n[02:44.69] While you're at it\n[02:47.38] (I been waiting on this moment)\n[02:49.64] Oh, while you're at it (all day, it's all that I wanted)\n[02:53.51] (I been waiting on this moment)\n[02:55.67] Oh-whoa, while you're at it",
