        "fullLyrics": "[00:10.73] An old man turned 98\n[00:16.13] He won the lottery and died the next day\n[00:21.42] It's a black fly in your Chardonnay\n[00:26.87] It's a death row pardon two minutes too late\n[00:32.73] And isn't it ironic, don't you think?\n[00:38.63] It's like rain on your wedding day\n[00:43.93] It's a free ride when you've already paid\n[00:49.58] It's the good advice that you just didn't take\n[00:55.45] And who would've thought, it figures\n[01:01.20] Mr. Play It Safe was afraid to fly\n[01:05.95] He packed his suitcase and kissed his kids goodbye\n[01:11.89] He waited his whole damn life to take that flight\n[01:17.68] And as the plane crashed down, he thought\n[01:21.78] \"Well, isn't this nice?\"\n[01:23.88] And isn't it ironic, don't you think?\n[01:28.90] It's like rain on your wedding day\n[01:34.73] It's a free ride when you've already paid\n[01:40.18] It's the good advice that you just didn't take\n[01:45.97] And who would've thought, it figures\n[01:51.56] Well, life has a funny way of sneaking up on you\n[01:56.12] When you think everything's okay and everything's going right\n[02:02.46] \n[02:04.50] And life has a funny way of helping you out\n[02:07.66] When you think everything's gone wrong and everything blows up\n[02:11.37] In your face\n[02:14.51] A traffic jam when you're already late\n[02:19.36] A no-smoking sign on your cigarette break\n[02:25.29] It's like ten thousand spoons when all you need is a knife\n[02:31.13] It's meeting the man of my dreams\n[02:35.09] And then meeting his beautiful wife\n[02:39.10] And isn't it ironic, don't you think?\n[02:42.86] A little too ironic\n[02:48.12] And, yeah, I really do think\n[02:49.59] It's like rain on your wedding day\n[02:55.68] It's a free ride when you've already paid\n[03:00.49] It's the good advice that you just didn't take\n[03:07.57] And who would've thought, it figures\n[03:11.34] \n[03:17.68] And, yeah, life has a funny way of sneaking up on you\n[03:24.98] Life has a funny, funny way of helping you out\n[03:32.40] Helping you out\n[03:32.51]",
