        "fullLyrics": "[00:11.25] How 'bout getting off of these antibiotics?\n[00:17.67] \n[00:21.76] How 'bout stopping eating when I'm full up?\n[00:28.44] \n[00:32.12] How 'bout them transparent dangling carrots?\n[00:39.35] \n[00:42.49] How 'bout that ever-elusive kudo?\n[00:48.82] \n[00:51.23] Thank you, India\n[00:53.85] Thank you, terror\n[00:56.54] Thank you, disillusionment\n[01:01.68] Thank you, frailty\n[01:04.34] Thank you, consequence\n[01:06.82] Thank you, thank you, silence\n[01:13.74] How 'bout me not blaming you for everything?\n[01:20.99] \n[01:24.10] How 'bout me enjoying the moment for once?\n[01:31.48] \n[01:34.68] How 'bout how good it feels to finally forgive you?\n[01:41.96] \n[01:45.07] How 'bout grieving it all one at a time?\n[01:51.67] \n[01:53.82] Thank you, India\n[01:56.53] Thank you, terror\n[01:58.92] Thank you, disillusionment\n[02:04.21] Thank you, frailty\n[02:06.89] Thank you, consequence\n[02:09.31] Thank you, thank you, silence\n[02:15.43] The moment I let go of it\n[02:20.07] Was the moment I got more than I could handle\n[02:25.96] The moment I jumped off of it\n[02:30.32] Was the moment I touched down\n[02:36.92] How 'bout no longer being masochistic?\n[02:44.59] \n[02:47.58] How 'bout remembering your divinity?\n[02:53.11] \n[02:58.19] How 'bout unabashedly bawling your eyes out?\n[03:05.51] \n[03:08.50] How 'bout not equating death with stopping?\n[03:17.23] Thank you, India\n[03:19.86] Thank you, providence\n[03:22.46] Thank you, disillusionment\n[03:27.69] Thank you, nothingness\n[03:30.32] Thank you, clarity\n[03:32.98] Thank you, thank you, silence\n[03:37.48] Yeah, yeah\n[03:40.66] Oh, oh, oh\n[03:51.23] No, oh, oh, oh\n[04:01.73] No, oh, oh, oh\n[04:12.05] Oh, oh\n[04:15.98]",
