        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.05] I keep on fallin' in\n[00:05.88] \n[00:09.41] And out of love with you\n[00:16.43] Sometimes I love you\n[00:19.81] Sometimes you make me blue\n[00:23.87] Sometimes I feel good\n[00:27.69] At times I feel used\n[00:31.69] Lovin' you darlin'\n[00:35.19] Makes me so confused\n[00:38.32] I keep on fallin' in and out\n[00:43.53] Of love with you\n[00:46.58] I never loved someone\n[00:50.65] The way that I love you\n[00:54.04] Oh, oh, I\n[00:57.80] Never felt this way\n[01:01.39] How do you give me so much pleasure\n[01:04.93] And cause me so much pain? (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:09.09] Just when I think\n[01:12.65] I've taken more than would a fool\n[01:16.53] I start fallin' back in love with you\n[01:23.31] I keep on fallin' in and out\n[01:28.52] Of love with you\n[01:31.69] I never loved someone\n[01:35.87] The way that I love you\n[01:39.25] Oh, baby\n[01:40.84] I, I, I, I'm fallin' (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:47.61] I, I, I, I'm fallin'\n[01:55.15] Fall, fall, fall (Sing)\n[02:02.60] Fall\n[02:08.58] I keep on fallin' in and out (Out)\n[02:13.66] Of love (Love), with you (With you)\n[02:16.68] I never loved someone\n[02:21.04] The way that I love you\n[02:24.18] I'm fallin' in and out\n[02:28.52] Of love (Of love), with you (With you)\n[02:31.75] I never loved someone\n[02:35.96] The way that I love you\n[02:39.41] I'm fallin' in and out\n[02:43.65] Of love (Of love), with you (With you)\n[02:46.65] I never (No), loved someone (No, no)\n[02:50.93] The way that I love you\n[02:54.18] What?\n[03:00.32]",
