        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.16] On the first part of the journey\n[00:12.68] I was looking at all the life\n[00:16.42] There were plants and birds and rocks and things\n[00:20.82] There was sand and hills and rings\n[00:24.63] The first thing I met was a fly with a buzz\n[00:28.48] And the sky with no clouds\n[00:32.43] The heat was hot and the ground was dry\n[00:36.30] But the air was full of sound\n[00:40.42] I've been through the desert on a horse with no name\n[00:44.03] It felt good to be out of the rain\n[00:47.98] In the desert you can remember your name\n[00:51.87] 'Cause there ain't no one for to give you no pain\n[00:56.05] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[01:03.59] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[01:11.23] After two days in the desert sun\n[01:15.17] My skin began to turn red\n[01:18.96] After three days in the desert fun\n[01:22.65] I was looking at a river bed\n[01:26.43] And the story it told of a river that flowed\n[01:30.95] Made me sad to think it was dead\n[01:34.24] You see\n[01:35.60] I've been through the desert on a horse with no name\n[01:38.16] It felt good to be out of the rain\n[01:42.07] In the desert you can remember your name\n[01:45.91] Because there ain't no one for to give you no pain\n[01:50.38] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[01:57.95] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[02:04.78] \n[02:20.92] And after nine days I let the horse run free\n[02:24.73] 'Cause the desert had turned to sea\n[02:28.51] There were plants and birds and rocks and things\n[02:32.37] There was sand and hills and rings\n[02:36.59] The ocean is a desert with its life underground\n[02:40.20] And a perfect disguise above\n[02:43.99] Under the cities lies a heart made of ground\n[02:47.82] But the humans will give no love\n[02:50.93] You see\n[02:52.48] I've been through the desert on a horse with no name\n[02:55.65] It felt good to be out of the rain\n[02:59.34] In the desert you can remember your name\n[03:03.20] 'Cause there ain't no one for to give you no pain\n[03:07.69] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[03:15.02] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[03:23.08] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[03:30.35] La, la, la lala la la la, la, la\n[03:36.08]",
