        "dateAdded": "2026-06-29T11:10:03.255Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.97] Young lovers in a picture frame\n[00:17.06] Ever notice how there ain't no rain\n[00:20.74] Nobody hangs hard times on the wall\n[00:27.51] You won't see it in an 8 by 10\n[00:30.95] But there's a storm every now and then\n[00:34.20] A slamming door down the hall\n[00:39.98] Sometimes love is a white flag\n[00:43.46] Sometimes love is standing tall\n[00:46.98] Sometimes love is a feather\n[00:50.64] Sometimes a cannon ball\n[00:53.48] But it's worth fighting for (it's worth fighting for)\n[00:57.72] Baby, sometimes love is war\n[01:12.15] An old couple on a front porch swing\n[01:15.66] On a walk down memory lane\n[01:19.31] Been through the fire and back again\n[01:25.85] Through the clear and the cloudy skies\n[01:29.05] Still love in each other's eyes\n[01:32.63] Sometimes love is war but sometimes you win\n[01:38.08] Sometimes love is a white flag\n[01:41.54] Sometimes love is standing tall\n[01:45.39] Sometimes love is a feather\n[01:48.82] Sometimes a cannon ball\n[01:51.94] And it's worth fighting for (yeah, it's worth fighting for)\n[01:55.98] Baby, sometimes love is war\n[01:59.55] Sometimes love is all that can save us\n[02:02.23] Sometimes love can kill a man\n[02:05.53] Yeah sometimes love is a soft touch\n[02:09.19] Or a pistol in your hand\n[02:12.95] Sometimes love is a white flag\n[02:16.35] Sometimes love is standing tall\n[02:19.57] Sometimes love is a feather\n[02:23.32] Sometimes a cannon ball\n[02:26.01] But it's worth fighting for (it's worth fighting for)\n[02:30.71] Baby, sometimes love is\n[02:33.94] Baby, sometimes love is war\n[02:41.46]",
