        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.09] Someday somebody's gonna pull me out\n[00:15.58] Pick me up where you let me down\n[00:18.60] Break the same old circle I been walkin' 'round\n[00:24.31] I bet she's gonna be cool, real, and kind\n[00:29.36] And she'll want everything you left behind\n[00:36.34] Some day, some way\n[00:40.56] Somebody's gonna come along\n[00:43.92] Somewhere out there\n[00:46.85] If there's a God He's gonna be workin' on\n[00:50.95] The broken road that's gonna lead\n[00:53.89] Me to her, and her to me\n[00:56.97] And you won't be my whole world\n[01:00.06] Yeah just like that you'll be just\n[01:03.47] Some girl\n[01:08.47] She'll break the ice right off of me\n[01:13.63] She'll hear me out and let me bleed\n[01:17.72] She'll see the me you couldn't see\n[01:21.65] There's gonna be days when I break down\n[01:26.34] Yeah but she'll break me out\n[01:33.88] Some day, some way\n[01:38.05] Somebody's gonna come along\n[01:41.69] Somewhere out there\n[01:44.72] If there's a God He's gonna be workin' on\n[01:49.28] The broken road that's gonna lead\n[01:51.84] Me to her, and her to me\n[01:54.99] And you won't be my whole world\n[01:58.05] Yeah just like that you'll be just\n[02:01.14] Some girl\n[02:04.87] Some girl\n[02:07.98] Yeah just like that you'll be just\n[02:12.85] Some girl\n[02:16.77] I pass on the street\n[02:17.86] Some memory\n[02:19.16] That I don't know and don't know me\n[02:21.97] And when she asks who's that\n[02:24.52] You'll be just some girl\n[02:27.99] Just some girl\n[02:37.53] Some day, some way\n[02:42.25] Somebody's gonna come along\n[02:45.54] Somewhere out there\n[02:48.78] If there's a God He's gonna be workin' on\n[02:52.83] The broken road that's gonna lead\n[02:55.92] Me to her, and her to me\n[02:59.05] And you won't be my whole world\n[03:01.91] Yeah just like that you'll be just\n[03:05.89] Some girl\n[03:11.57] Yeah you'll be just some girl\n[03:12.52] Yeah just like that you'll be\n[03:19.73]",
