        "dateAdded": "2026-04-28T11:32:35.147Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.35] I've always been a dreamer\n[00:05.10] With my head in the clouds\n[00:11.43] Never one to choose my own way\n[00:16.64] I'm happy to follow the crowds\n[00:22.46] But something started and it won't go away\n[00:28.69] Stirring from deep inside\n[00:35.08] Something's changing, what it is I cannot say\n[00:40.30] I want to lead the way\n[00:47.49] Come crashing down\n[00:51.56] Like water, like rain\n[00:59.04] Something's started\n[01:02.39] I can feel again\n[01:09.69] Ain't no use in sitting around\n[01:12.93] Waiting for the world to change\n[01:16.00] Never too late to stand your ground\n[01:18.86] Do what it takes to make them proud\n[01:21.39] And never too late the change your mind\n[01:24.67] The book has not been written\n[01:27.49] The page is blank, the scene is set\n[01:30.24] Let's start at the beginning\n[01:45.60] Now I know exactly where I stand\n[01:50.61] Open my heart, the future in my hands\n[01:57.39] How can it be that someone like me\n[02:02.31] Can be the voice, a face, a choice, a future generation\n[02:08.22] And there ain't no use in sitting around\n[02:11.60] Waiting for the world to change\n[02:14.33] Never too late to stand your ground\n[02:17.35] Do what it takes to make them proud\n[02:20.10] And never too late the change your mind\n[02:23.02] The book has not been written\n[02:25.72] The page is blank, the scene is set\n[02:28.75] Let's start at the beginning\n[02:33.02] I heard a voice\n[02:37.77] Calling in my head\n[02:44.60] Why wait until tomorrow?\n[02:49.49] The future stars today\n[02:55.55] Ain't no use in sitting around\n[02:58.48] Waiting for the world to change\n[03:01.49] Never too late to stand your ground\n[03:04.15] Do what it takes to make them proud\n[03:06.94] And never too late the change your mind\n[03:10.24] The book has not been written\n[03:12.84] The page is blank, the scene is set\n[03:15.64] Let's start at the beginning\n[03:18.48] And ain't no use in sitting around\n[03:22.04] Waiting for the world to change\n[03:24.71] Never too late to stand your ground\n[03:27.77] Do what it takes to make them proud\n[03:30.42] And never too late the change your mind\n[03:33.42] The book has not been written\n[03:36.34] The page is blank, the scene is set\n[03:39.16] Let's start at the beginning\n[03:41.87] And never too late the change your mind\n[03:45.19] The book has not been written\n[03:47.78] The page is blank, the scene is set\n[03:50.62] Let's start at the beginning\n[04:00.62]",
