        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.13] Who's the one that makes you happy?\n[00:22.54] Who's the one that always makes you laugh\n[00:29.16] Who's the reason you're smiling?\n[00:36.09] And dragged you through these time, so rough\n[00:43.88] I was the one that made you happy\n[00:50.60] I was the one that eased the pain\n[00:57.59] But I'm the reason that you're crying now\n[01:04.26] My own tears scattered by the rain\n[01:11.54] You can sacrifice me\n[01:18.39] You can sacrifice me\n[01:25.09] You can set me free\n[01:32.83] You can be who you wanna be\n[01:41.40] Mmmm, mmmm\n[01:53.46] Deeper than deep you took me on a trip baby\n[02:01.19] You shared your wildest dreams and more\n[02:07.27] You dare me to express my feelings to you\n[02:13.99] I, I never felt that need before\n[02:21.95] But suddenly you needed freedom\n[02:29.20] You felt the need to break free\n[02:36.12] Ohw, you started drowning in your sorrow\n[02:42.29] You didn't wanna know I had the key, yeah\n[02:50.11] You can sacrifice me\n[02:57.32] You can sacrifice me, baby\n[03:04.30] You can set me free, yeahhey\n[03:11.73] You can be who you wanne be, you can be who you wanna be\n[03:20.95] You, you, you\n[03:24.70] You, you, you can sacrifice me\n[03:34.22] Sacrifice me\n[03:39.82] You can be who you wanna\n[03:42.85] You can be who you wanna be\n[03:52.82]",
