        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.923] Yeah-eh-eh\n[00:09.948] You are my fire\n[00:14.812] The one desire\n[00:19.820] Believe when I say\n[00:25.100] I want it that way\n[00:29.420] But we are two worlds apart\n[00:36.604] Can't reach to your heart\n[00:41.420] When you say\n[00:44.050] That I want it that way\n[00:48.787] Tell me why\n[00:49.858] Ain't nothing but a heartache\n[00:53.538] Tell me why\n[00:54.690] Ain't nothing but a mistake\n[00:58.339] Tell me why\n[00:59.498] I never wanna hear you say\n[01:03.818] I want it that way\n[01:08.194] Am I your fire\n[01:12.914] Your one desire\n[01:17.699] Yes I know it's too late\n[01:22.858] But I want it that way\n[01:27.394] Tell me why\n[01:28.587] Ain't nothing but a heartache\n[01:31.354] Tell me why\n[01:33.401] Ain't nothing but a mistake\n[01:37.052] Tell me why\n[01:38.281] I never wanna hear you say\n[01:42.577] I want it that way\n[01:47.537] Now I can see that we're falling apart\n[01:52.096] From the way that it used to be yeah\n[01:56.801] No matter the distance\n[01:59.196] I want you to know\n[02:01.612] That deep down inside of me\n[02:06.469] You are my fire\n[02:11.109] The one desire\n[02:15.932] You are\n[02:17.110] You are you are you are\n[02:24.042] Don't wanna hear you say\n[02:26.642] Ain't nothin' but a heartache\n[02:31.258] Ain't nothin' but a mistake\n[02:34.866] Don't wanna hear you say\n[02:36.043] I never wanna hear you say\n[02:40.138] Oh yeah\n[02:41.546] I want it that way\n[02:45.245] Tell me why\n[02:46.157] Ain't nothing but a heartache\n[02:49.269] Tell me why\n[02:51.013] Ain't nothing but a mistake\n[02:54.613] Tell me why\n[02:55.872] I never wanna hear you say\n[02:58.794] Don't wanna hear you say\n[03:00.337] I want it that way\n[03:04.505] Tell me why\n[03:05.561] Ain't nothin' but a heartache\n[03:10.402] Ain't nothin' but a mistake\n[03:13.979] Tell me why\n[03:15.249] I never wanna hear you say\n[03:17.702] Never wanna hear you say yeah\n[03:19.552] I want it that way\n[03:24.197] 'Cause I want it that way",
