        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.62] When the night has come\n[00:21.07] And the land is dark\n[00:23.62] And the moon is the only light we'll see\n[00:31.61] No, I won't be afraid, oh, I won't be afraid\n[00:39.52] Just as long as you stand, stand by me\n[00:45.89] So darlin', darlin', stand by me\n[00:51.14] Oh, stand by me\n[00:55.67] Oh, stand\n[00:58.87] Stand by me, stand by me\n[01:03.65] If the sky that we look upon\n[01:09.15] Should tumble and fall\n[01:11.75] Or the mountain should crumble to the sea\n[01:19.79] I won't cry, I won't cry, no I won't shed a tear\n[01:27.79] Just as long as you stand, stand by me\n[01:34.36] And darlin', darlin'\n[01:36.54] Stand by me, oh stand by me\n[01:43.90] Whoa, stand now\n[01:47.23] Stand by me, stand by me\n[02:22.83] Darlin', darlin', stand by me\n[02:27.69] Oh, stand by me\n[02:32.18] Oh, stand now\n[02:34.46] Stand by me, stand by me\n[02:38.69] Whenever you're in trouble, won't you stand by me?\n[02:43.67] Oh, stand by me\n[02:47.39] Whoa, just stand now\n[02:50.19] Oh, stand, stand by me\n[02:54.15] When all of your friends have gone",
