        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.998] I want you to stay\n[00:08.559] 'Til I'm in the grave\n[00:13.089] 'Til I rot away dead and buried\n[00:17.613] 'Til I'm in the casket you carry\n[00:21.987] If you go I'm goin' too uh\n[00:26.565] 'Cause it was always you\n[00:29.906] Alright\n[00:31.138] And if I'm turnin' blue please don't save me\n[00:35.972] Nothin' left to lose without my baby\n[00:41.826] Birds of a feather we should stick together I know\n[00:46.460] I said I'd never think I wasn't better alone\n[00:51.068] Can't change the weather might not be forever\n[00:54.754] But if it's forever it's even better\n[01:00.216] And I don't know what I'm cryin' for\n[01:04.948] I don't think I could love you more\n[01:09.482] It might not be long but baby I\n[01:15.457] I'll love you 'til the day that I die\n[01:21.023] 'Til the day that I die\n[01:25.523] 'Til the light leaves my eyes\n[01:29.908] 'Til the day that I die\n[01:35.457] I want you to see hmm\n[01:39.899] How you look to me hmm\n[01:44.451] You wouldn't believe if I told ya\n[01:49.013] You would keep the compliments I throw ya\n[01:53.520] But you're so full of shit uh\n[01:58.202] Tell me it's a bit oh\n[02:02.763] Say you don't see it your mind's polluted\n[02:07.283] Say you wanna quit don't be stupid\n[02:13.452] And I don't know what I'm cryin' for\n[02:18.343] I don't think I could love you more\n[02:22.618] Might not be long but baby I\n[02:29.426] Don't wanna say goodbye\n[02:31.749] Birds of a feather we should stick together I know\n[02:35.910] 'Til the day that I die\n[02:37.070] I said I'd never think I wasn't better alone\n[02:40.686] 'Til the light leaves my eyes\n[02:41.942] Can't change the weather might not be forever\n[02:44.870] 'Til the day that I die\n[02:46.534] But if it's forever it's even better\n[02:50.358] I knew you in another life\n[02:54.990] You had that same look in your eyes\n[02:59.638] I love you don't act so surprised",
