        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.000] White Wedding - Part 1 (Edit) - Billy Idol\n[00:28.984] Hey little sister what have you done\n[00:35.464] Hey little sister who's the only one\n[00:41.864] Hey little sister who's your superman\n[00:45.174] Hey little sister who's the one you want\n[00:48.344] Hey little sister shot gun \n[00:52.004] It's a nice day to start again\n[00:57.694] It's a nice day for a white wedding\n[01:04.234] It's a nice day to start again \n[01:11.333] Hey little sister what have you done\n[01:17.613] Hey little sister who's the only one\n[01:24.843] I've been away for so long （so long）\n[01:27.843] I've been away for so long （so long）\n[01:30.643] I let you go for so long\n[01:33.673] It's a nice day to start again  Come on \n[01:40.223] It's a nice day for a white wedding\n[01:46.602] It's a nice day to start again \n[02:25.344] Pick it up\n[02:27.574] Take me back home  man\n[02:32.224] There is nothin' fair in this world\n[02:38.524] There is nothin' safe in this world\n[02:44.944] And there's nothin' sure in this world\n[02:48.234] And there's nothin' pure in this world\n[02:51.454] Look for something left in this world\n[02:57.444] Start again\n[03:00.964] Come on\n[03:01.804] It's a nice day for a white wedding\n[03:08.064] It's a nice day to start again \n[03:14.554] It's a nice day to start again \n[03:21.063] It's a nice day to start again \n[03:26.493] What's you want with a nice day for",
