        "dateAdded": "2026-06-01T11:07:22.525Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:01.28] Maybe\n[00:03.67] I know it's just maybe\n[00:07.62] And we're only dreaming\n[00:11.42] For how this will go\n[00:16.58] But maybe\n[00:19.66] One day this day dream\n[00:23.34] Will turn into real things\n[00:27.36] For all that we know\n[00:32.71] We could be doing anything that we love\n[00:41.06] Just be carried by the way the wind blows on\n[00:49.08] You could be doing anything you dream of\n[00:56.66] If you believe in the things that make you strong\n[01:04.45] Someday\n[01:07.03] We'll meet on the high street\n[01:11.04] We'll laugh about when we worried about what we might be\n[01:19.70] Then maybe\n[01:22.88] We'll talk about old days\n[01:26.84] We'll smile in our old ways\n[01:31.19] You'll always be a part of me\n[01:36.43] We could be doing anything that we love\n[01:44.78] Just be carried by the way the wind blows on\n[01:52.41] You could be doing anything you dream of\n[02:00.46] If you believe in the things that make you strong\n[02:24.55] You could be doing anything you dream of\n[02:31.76] If you believe in the things that make you strong\n[02:39.62] Maybe\n[02:42.25] I know it's just maybe\n[02:46.23] And we're only dreaming\n[02:50.02] For how this will go\n[02:55.04] Just maybe\n[02:56.90] (You could be doing anything you dream of)\n[02:59.70] Maybe\n[03:03.81] Maybe\n[03:06.92]",
