        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.82] You're crashin' into me like waves on the coast\n[00:20.61] Every time we talk, you move in close\n[00:24.86] I don't want you stop, I don't want you to stop tonight\n[00:32.66] We've got the last two glasses on a straw hook bar\n[00:37.05] Trying to remember what number we are\n[00:41.31] String of white lights makin' your eyes shine tonight\n[00:49.47] We're buzzin' like that no vacancy sign out front\n[00:54.12] Your skin is beggin' to be kissed by a little more than the sun\n[00:58.89] You take my hand in yours, you lean in\n[01:02.13] And your lips taste like sangria, your lips taste like sangria\n[01:10.96] \n[01:18.32] Recking ball dancin' down the hallway\n[01:22.97] You're holdin' your shoes, wearin' my shades\n[01:26.99] We fall against the door, we fall into a wild warm kiss\n[01:35.90] We're buzzin' like that no vacancy sign out front\n[01:40.11] Your skin is beggin' to be kissed by a little more than the sun\n[01:44.32] You take my hand in yours, you lean in\n[01:47.62] And your lips taste like sangria, your lips taste like sangria\n[01:56.82] \n[02:04.30] Only thing I want to do tonight is drink you like a Spanish wine\n[02:08.50] Let you let this head of mine keep spinnin', spinnin' around\n[02:13.25] \n[02:21.36] We're buzzin' like that no vacancy sign out front\n[02:25.66] Your skin is beggin' to be kissed by a little more than the sun\n[02:29.65] You take my hand in yours, you lean in\n[02:33.11] And your lips taste like sangria, your lips taste like sangria\n[02:41.87] Your lips taste like sangria, your lips taste like sangria\n[02:51.37] \n[03:07.31] Only thing I want to do tonight is drink you like a Spanish wine\n[03:10.82] Let you let this head of mine keep spinnin', spinnin' around\n[03:14.18]",
