        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.91] All the small things\n[00:17.33] True care, truth brings\n[00:20.70] I'll take one lift\n[00:23.63] Your ride, best trip\n[00:26.95] Always, I know\n[00:30.20] You'll be at my show\n[00:33.42] Watching, waiting\n[00:36.63] Commiserating\n[00:39.75] Say it ain't so\n[00:41.62] I will not go\n[00:43.16] Turn the lights off\n[00:44.70] Carry me home\n[00:45.69] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[00:48.75] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[00:52.18] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[00:55.29] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[00:59.49] \n[01:12.36] Late night, come home\n[01:15.54] Work sucks, I know\n[01:18.64] She left me roses by the stairs\n[01:22.84] Surprises let me know she cares\n[01:25.34] Just say it ain't so\n[01:27.08] I will not go\n[01:28.74] Turn the lights off\n[01:30.31] Carry me home\n[01:31.27] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[01:34.52] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[01:37.72] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[01:40.84] Na-na, na-na, na-na, na-na, na, na\n[01:45.33] \n[02:10.47] Just say it ain't so\n[02:12.47] I will not go\n[02:13.99] Turn the lights off\n[02:15.78] Carry me home\n[02:17.13] Keep your head still\n[02:18.92] I'll be your thrill\n[02:20.58] The night will go on\n[02:22.18] My little windmill\n[02:23.80] Say it ain't so\n[02:25.40] I will not go\n[02:27.06] Turn the lights off\n[02:28.84] Carry me home\n[02:30.36] Keep your head still\n[02:32.12] I'll be your thrill\n[02:33.65] The night will go on\n[02:35.15] The night will go on\n[02:36.88] My little windmill\n[02:37.83]",
