        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.650] all our times have come\n[00:20.370] here but now they're gone\n[00:27.060] seasons don't fear the reaper\n[00:29.910] nor do the wind, the sun or the rain\n[00:32.790] we can be like they are\n[00:34.860] come on baby\n[00:36.240] don't fear the reaper （baby take my hand\n[00:39.630] don't fear the reaper （we'll be able to fly\n[00:42.990] don't fear the reaper （baby i'm your man\n[00:49.260] laaaa la laaa la la la\n[00:57.120] laaaa la laaa la la la\n[01:23.190] valentine is done\n[01:30.060] here but now they're gone\n[01:37.290] romeo and juliet\n[01:39.960] are together in eternity （romeo and juliet\n[01:43.830] forty thousand men and women everyday （like romeo and juliet\n[01:47.280] forty thousand men and women everyday （redefine happiness\n[01:50.760] another forty thousand coming everyday （we can be like they are\n[01:54.870] come on baby\n[01:56.250] don't fear the reaper （baby take my hand\n[01:59.610] don't fear the reaper （we'll be able to fly\n[02:03.000] don't fear the reaper （baby i'm your man\n[02:09.180] laaaa la laaa la la la\n[02:16.860] laaaa la laaa la la la\n[03:36.720] love of two is one\n[03:43.590] here but now they're gone\n[03:50.310] came the last night of sadness\n[03:53.820] clear she couldn't go on\n[03:57.240] door was open and the wind appeared\n[04:00.420] the candles blew then disappeared\n[04:03.840] the curtains flew then he appeared\n[04:06.360] saying don't be afraid\n[04:08.310] come on baby\n[04:09.720] and she had no fear\n[04:11.970] and she ran to him\n[04:13.110] then she started to fly\n[04:14.670] they looked backward and said goodbye\n[04:16.770] she had become like they are\n[04:18.090] she had taken his hand\n[04:19.650] she had become like they are\n[04:21.900] come on baby\n[04:23.250] don't fear the reaper",
