        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:35.37] Sitting here wasted and wounded\n[00:38.62] At this old piano\n[00:43.41] Trying hard to capture\n[00:46.11] The moment this morning I don't know\n[00:52.04] 'Cause a bottle of Vodka's still lodged in my head\n[00:56.76] And some blonde gave me nightmares\n[00:59.42] Think that she's still in my bed\n[01:03.31] \n[01:05.42] As I dream about movies\n[01:07.83] They won't make of me when I'm dead\n[01:12.05] \n[01:14.61] With an ironclad fist\n[01:17.07] I wake up and french kiss the morning\n[01:20.64] \n[01:23.02] While some marching band keeps its own beat in my head\n[01:27.53] While we're talking\n[01:32.03] About all of the things that I long to believe\n[01:36.58] About love, the truth, what you mean to me\n[01:41.25] And the truth is\n[01:45.59] Baby you're all that I need\n[01:49.06] \n[01:51.34] I want to lay you down in a bed of roses\n[02:00.39] For tonight I'll sleep on a bed of nails\n[02:08.07] Oh I want to be just as close as the Holy Ghost is\n[02:18.38] And lay you down on a bed of roses\n[02:27.10] \n[02:29.38] Well I'm so far away\n[02:31.70] Each step that I take is on my way home\n[02:35.46] \n[02:37.83] A king's ransom in dimes, I'd give each night\n[02:41.77] To see through this payphone\n[02:46.56] Still I run out of time\n[02:48.96] Or it's hard to get through\n[02:51.31] Till the bird on the wire flies me back to you\n[02:55.84] I'll just close my eyes and whisper\n[03:00.42] \"Baby, blind love is true\"\n[03:05.97] I want to lay you down in a bed of roses\n[03:15.01] For tonight I'll sleep on a bed of nails\n[03:22.65] Oh I want to be just as close as the Holy Ghost is\n[03:33.08] And lay you down on a bed of roses\n[03:41.59] \n[03:43.73] Well this hotel bar's hangover whiskey's gone dry\n[03:48.29] The barkeeper's wig's crooked\n[03:50.65] And she's giving me the eye\n[03:52.76] Well I might have said yeah\n[03:56.31] But I laughed so hard I think I died\n[04:01.88] Ooh yeah\n[04:05.85] \n[04:40.67] Now as you close your eyes\n[04:43.30] Know I'll be thinking about you\n[04:48.91] While my mistress she calls me\n[04:51.51] To stand in her spotlight again\n[04:57.02] Tonight I won't be alone\n[05:00.39] But you know that don't mean I'm not lonely\n[05:06.36] I've got nothing to prove\n[05:08.72] For it's you that I'd die to defend\n[05:14.63] I want to lay you down in a bed of roses\n[05:23.45] For tonight I'll sleep on a bed of nails\n[05:31.60] I want to be just as close as the Holy Ghost is\n[05:41.31] And lay you down\n[05:49.44] I want to lay you down in a bed of roses\n[05:58.30] For tonight I'll sleep on a bed of nails\n[06:06.64] I want to be just as close as the Holy Ghost is\n[06:16.22] And lay you down\n[06:23.17] On a bed of roses\n[06:26.54]",
