        "fullLyrics": "[00:47.68] It's all the same\n[00:51.32] Only the names will change\n[00:54.62] Everyday\n[00:56.83] It seems we're wasting away\n[01:00.88] Another place\n[01:04.04] Where the faces are so cold\n[01:07.10] I drive all night just to get back home\n[01:13.52] I'm a cowboy\n[01:16.53] On a steel horse I ride\n[01:20.28] I'm wanted\n[01:23.07] Dead or alive\n[01:26.85] Wanted\n[01:30.19] Dead or alive\n[01:34.85] \n[01:45.93] Sometimes I sleep\n[01:49.27] Sometimes it's not for days\n[01:52.46] The people I meet\n[01:55.15] Always go their seperate ways\n[01:58.93] Sometimes you tell the day\n[02:01.95] By the bottle that you drink\n[02:05.24] And times when you're alone\n[02:08.60] All you do is think\n[02:11.36] I'm a cowboy\n[02:14.57] On a steel horse I ride\n[02:17.92] I'm wanted (wanted)\n[02:21.28] Dead or alive\n[02:24.75] Wanted (wanted)\n[02:28.02] Dead or alive\n[02:33.88] \n[02:42.54] Oh, I ride\n[02:47.65] \n[03:08.81] I'm a cowboy\n[03:12.27] On a steel horse I ride\n[03:15.89] I'm wanted (wanted)\n[03:19.09] Dead or alive\n[03:23.39] I walk these streets\n[03:26.72] A loaded six-string on my back\n[03:29.93] I play for keeps\n[03:32.78] 'Cause I might not make it back\n[03:35.95] I been everywhere, oh yeah\n[03:38.84] Still I'm standing tall\n[03:42.90] I've seen a million faces\n[03:45.59] And I've rocked them all\n[03:48.92] 'Cause I'm a cowboy\n[03:52.38] On a steel horse I ride\n[03:55.35] I'm wanted (wanted)\n[03:58.72] Dead or alive\n[04:01.22] But I'm a cowboy\n[04:04.62] I got the night on my side\n[04:08.19] And I'm wanted (wanted) dead or alive\n[04:13.87] And I ride (and I ride), dead or alive\n[04:20.36] I still drive (still drive), dead or alive\n[04:27.34] Dead or alive\n[04:30.82] Dead or alive\n[04:34.05] Dead or alive\n[04:37.00] Dead or alive\n[04:45.12]",
