        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.750] Shot through the heart\n[00:02.240] And you're to blame\n[00:04.050] You give love a bad name\n[00:31.600] An angel's smile is what you sell\n[00:35.410] You promise me heaven' then put me through hell\n[00:39.400] Chains of love got a hold on me\n[00:43.080] When passion's a prison' you can't break free\n[00:47.270] (wo  )\n[00:48.700] You're a loaded gun(oh yeah)\n[00:57.060] (wo  )\n[00:57.440] There's nowhere to run\n[00:58.810] No one can save me\n[01:00.680] The damage is done\n[01:02.800] Shot through the heart\n[01:04.550] And you're to blame\n[01:06.620] You give love a bad name\n[01:10.540] I play my part and you play your game\n[01:14.600] You give love a bad name\n[01:17.780] You give love a bad name\n[01:31.570] You paint your smile on your lips\n[01:35.310] Blood red nails on your fingertips\n[01:38.930] A school boy's dream' you act so shy\n[01:42.800] Your very first kiss was your first kiss goodbye\n[01:46.980] (wo  )\n[01:48.230] You're a loaded gun\n[01:55.280] (wo  )\n[01:56.470] There's nowhere to run\n[01:58.780] No one can save me\n[02:00.340] The damage is done\n[02:02.400] Shot through the heart\n[02:04.210] And you're to blame\n[02:06.260] You give love a bad name\n[02:10.010] I play my part and you play your game\n[02:14.060] You give love a bad name\n[02:18.180] You give love   \n[02:20.800] (solo)\n[02:39.520] Shot through the heart\n[02:41.330] And you're to blame\n[02:43.140] You give love a bad name\n[02:47.390] I play my part and you play your game\n[02:51.500] You give love a bad name\n[02:55.370] Shot through the heart\n[02:57.060] And you're to blame\n[02:59.050] You give love a bad name\n[03:02.920] I play my part and you play your game\n[03:06.980] You give love a bad name\n[03:10.970] You give love",
