        "dateAdded": "2026-03-26T21:00:00.000Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.24] I looked out this morning and the sun was gone\n[00:21.84] Turned on some music to start my day\n[00:26.13] I lost myself in a familiar song\n[00:30.36] I closed my eyes and I slipped away\n[00:37.97] \n[00:50.19] It's more than a feeling (more than a feeling)\n[00:54.27] When I hear that old song they used to play\n[00:57.27] (More than a feeling)\n[00:59.27] I begin dreaming (More than a feeling)\n[01:02.83] 'Til I see Marianne walk away\n[01:09.19] I see my Marianne walkin' away\n[01:21.93] \n[01:54.73] When I'm tired and thinking cold\n[01:59.05] I hide in my music, forget the day\n[02:03.61] And dream of a girl I used to know\n[02:07.94] I closed my eyes and she slipped away\n[02:20.10] She slipped away\n[02:32.73] \n[02:47.66] It's more than a feeling (More than a feeling)\n[02:51.42] When I hear that old song they used to play\n[02:54.62] (More than a feeling)\n[02:56.63] I begin dreaming (More than a feeling)\n[03:00.34] 'Til I see Marianne walk away\n[03:14.99]",
