        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.96] You and me, we were the pretenders\n[00:13.36] We let it all slip away\n[00:17.40] In the end, what you don't surrender\n[00:21.52] Well, the world just strips away\n[00:25.49] Girl, ain't no kindness in the face of strangers\n[00:29.39] We ain't gonna find no miracles here\n[00:33.86] Well, you can wait on your blessings, my darlin'\n[00:38.04] I got a deal for you right here\n[00:42.23] I ain't lookin' for praise or pity\n[00:46.64] I ain't comin' 'round searchin' for a crutch\n[00:50.68] I just want someone to talk to\n[00:54.85] And a little of that human touch\n[00:59.09] Just a little of that human touch\n[01:02.46] \n[01:11.49] Ain't no mercy on the streets of this town\n[01:15.63] Ain't no bread from heavenly skies\n[01:19.87] Ain't nobody drawin' wine from this blood\n[01:23.80] It's just you and me tonight\n[01:28.07] Tell me, in a world without pity\n[01:32.29] Do you think what I'm asking's too much?\n[01:36.42] I just want something to hold on to\n[01:40.67] And a little of that human touch\n[01:44.81] Just a little of that human touch\n[01:48.81] \n[02:14.05] Oh girl, that feeling of safety you prize\n[02:19.04] Well, it comes with a hard, hard price\n[02:23.26] You can't shut off the risk and the pain\n[02:27.47] Without losin' the love that remains\n[02:32.18] We're all riders on this train\n[02:35.38] \n[03:07.95] So you've been broken and you've been hurt?\n[03:12.37] Show me somebody who ain't\n[03:16.57] Yeah, I know I ain't nobody's bargain\n[03:19.78] But, hell, a little touch-up and a little paint\n[03:24.73] You might need somethin' to hold on to\n[03:28.93] When all the answers, they don't amount to much\n[03:33.18] Somebody that you can just talk to\n[03:37.56] And a little of that human touch\n[03:41.53] Baby, in a world without pity\n[03:45.78] Do you think what I'm asking's too much?\n[03:50.02] I just want to feel you in my arms\n[03:53.96] And share a little of that human touch\n[03:58.11] Share a little of that human touch\n[04:02.37] Feel a little of that human touch in you\n[04:06.54] Feel a little of that human touch\n[04:10.57] Share a little of that human touch\n[04:13.66] I wanna feel a little of that human touch\n[04:18.91] Give you a little of that human touch of me\n[04:23.19] Give me a little of that human touch\n[04:27.08] \n[04:34.73] Hey now\n[04:38.73] Oh, God\n[04:42.88] Hey-hey, my\n[04:48.02] Share a little of that human touch\n[04:52.54] Get a little of that human touch\n[04:56.55] Get a little of that human touch\n[05:05.14] Feel a little of that human touch\n[05:09.20] Get a little of that human touch\n[05:12.99] (Give me a little of that human touch)\n[05:17.47] \n[05:24.20] Ooh-hoo (give me a little of that human touch)\n[05:28.17] Hey now\n[05:31.37]",
