        "dateAdded": "2026-04-16T21:44:29.421Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:21.55] Hey, little girl, is your daddy home?\n[00:23.54] Did he go away and leave you all alone?\n[00:28.29] I got a bad desire\n[00:32.29] Oh-oh-oh, I'm on fire\n[00:37.59] Tell me now, baby, is he good to you\n[00:40.06] And can he do to you the things that I do?\n[00:42.56] Oh no, I can take you higher\n[00:48.24] Oh-oh-oh, I'm on fire\n[00:53.93] \n[01:13.64] Sometimes it's like someone took a knife, baby, edgy and dull\n[01:17.94] And cut a six-inch valley through the middle of my skull\n[01:22.62] At night, I wake up with the sheets soaking wet\n[01:26.97] And a freight train running through the middle of my head\n[01:29.98] Only you can cool my desire\n[01:35.60] Oh-oh-oh, I'm on fire\n[01:41.25] Oh-oh-oh, I'm on fire\n[01:46.30] Oh-oh-oh, I'm on fire\n[01:49.74]",
