        "fullLyrics": "[00:04.500] Easy come Easy go\n[00:06.630] That's just how you live oh\n[00:08.760] Take take take it all\n[00:10.980] But you never give'\n[00:13.080] Should of known you were trouble\n[00:15.270] From the first kiss had your eyes wide open'\n[00:19.920] Why were they open?\n[00:21.870] Gave you all I had\n[00:23.370] And you tossed it in the trash'\n[00:25.710] You tossed it in the trash' you did.\n[00:29.910] To give me all your love is all I ever asked cause\n[00:35.250] What you don't understand'\n[00:37.440] Is id catch a grenade for ya.\n[00:41.790] Throw my hand on the blade for ya'\n[00:46.230] Id jump in front of a train for ya.\n[00:50.400] You know I'd do anything for ya.\n[00:54.720] Ohhh\n[00:56.160] I would go through all this pain'\n[01:00.420] Take a bullet straight through my brain.\n[01:04.230] Yes I would die for ya baby'\n[01:07.740] But you won't do the same.\n[01:18.180] Nooooo\n[01:18.270] Black' black' black and blue\n[01:20.490] Beat me till I'm am numb tell the devil I said hey when you get back to where you're from.\n[01:26.940] Mad women bad women\n[01:29.190] That's just what you are yeah\n[01:31.080] You smile in my face than rip the breaks out my car.\n[01:35.670] Gave you all I had and you tossed it in the trash'\n[01:39.570] You tossed it in the trash yes you did.\n[01:43.800] To give me all your ******* love is all I ever asked but\n[01:49.230] What you don't understand is id catch a grenade for ya.\n[01:55.710] Throw my hand on the blade for ya'\n[02:00.060] Id jump in front of a train for ya.\n[02:04.260] You know I'd do anything for ya.\n[02:08.610] Ohhh I would go through all this pain\n[02:14.220] Take a bullet straight through my brain.\n[02:17.940] Yes I would die for ya baby.\n[02:21.570] But you won't do the same.\n[02:25.110] If my body was on fire\n[02:29.190] Ooh you would watch me burn down in flames.\n[02:33.480] You said you loved me you're a liar cause you never ever ever did baby...\n[02:47.070] But darling I can catch a grenade for ya\n[02:52.350] Throw my hand on the blade for ya'\n[02:56.550] Id jump in front of a train for ya.\n[03:00.720] You know I'd do anything for ya.\n[03:05.100] Ohhh I would go through all this pain\n[03:11.370] Take a bullet straight through my brain.\n[03:14.550] Yes I would die for ya baby.\n[03:18.030] But you won't do the same.\n[03:22.350] No you won't do the same.\n[03:26.700] You won't do the same.\n[03:30.660] Ohh you never do the same.\n[03:41.940] Nooooo...",
