        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.46] Same bed but it feels just a little bit bigger now\n[00:20.05] Our song on the radio but it don't sound the same\n[00:26.61] When our friends talk about you\n[00:27.45] All it does is just tear me down\n[00:30.89] \n[00:33.01] 'Cause my heart breaks a little\n[00:35.38] When I hear your name\n[00:37.66] It all just sounds like ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh\n[00:45.79] Mmm, too young, too dumb to realize\n[00:50.74] That I should've bought you flowers\n[00:54.98] And held your hand\n[00:57.12] Should've gave you all my hours\n[01:01.05] When I had the chance\n[01:03.96] Take you to every party\n[01:06.32] 'Cause all you wanted to do was dance\n[01:10.45] Now my baby's dancing\n[01:13.25] But she's dancing with another man\n[01:17.19] \n[01:22.03] My pride, my ego, my needs, and my selfish ways\n[01:29.19] Caused a good strong woman like you\n[01:31.75] To walk out my life\n[01:35.10] Now I never, never get to clean up the mess I made\n[01:42.32] And it haunts me every time I close my eyes\n[01:46.75] It all just sounds like ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh\n[01:54.79] Mmm, too young, too dumb to realize\n[01:59.66] That I should've bought you flowers\n[02:03.83] And held your hand\n[02:06.44] Should've gave you all my hours\n[02:10.09] When I had the chance\n[02:12.86] Take you to every party\n[02:15.05] 'Cause all you wanted to do was dance\n[02:19.47] Now my baby's dancing\n[02:22.53] But she's dancing with another man\n[02:27.12] Although it hurts\n[02:30.01] I'll be the first to say that I was wrong\n[02:39.64] Oh, I know I'm probably much too late\n[02:43.67] To try and apologize for my mistakes\n[02:46.63] But I just want you to know\n[02:52.12] I hope he buys you flowers\n[02:56.44] I hope he holds your hand\n[02:59.71] Give you all his hours\n[03:03.27] When he has the chance\n[03:06.43] Take to every party\n[03:08.53] 'Cause I remember how much you loved to dance\n[03:12.54] Do all the things I should have done\n[03:16.99] When I was your man\n[03:19.25] Do all the things I should have done\n[03:24.50] When I was your man\n[03:26.22]",
