        "fullLyrics": "[00:21.728] You might stop a hurricane\n[00:26.033] Might even stop the drivin' rain\n[00:30.371] You might have a dozen other guys\n[00:33.530] But if you wanna stop me baby don't even try\n[00:37.725] I'm goin' one way your way\n[00:45.702] It's such a strong way let's make it our way\n[00:54.131] Now baby can't stop this thing we started\n[01:01.256] You gotta know it's right\n[01:04.434] Can't stop this course we've plotted yeah\n[01:12.928] This thing called love we got it\n[01:17.447] No place for the brokenhearted\n[01:21.220] I can't stop this thing we started no way\n[01:28.169] I'm goin' your way\n[01:34.137] You might stop the world spinnin' round\n[01:38.219] Might even walk on holy ground\n[01:42.454] I ain't superman and I can't fly\n[01:45.878] But if you wanna stop me baby don't even try\n[01:49.776] I'm goin' one way your way\n[01:58.099] It's such a strong way let's make it our way\n[02:06.382] Now baby can't stop this thing we started\n[02:13.268] You gotta know it's right\n[02:16.594] I can't stop this course we've plotted yeah\n[02:25.128] This thing called love we got it\n[02:29.632] No place for the brokenhearted\n[02:33.455] I can't stop this thing we started no way\n[02:40.504] I'm goin' your way that's where I'm goin'\n[02:45.576] Oh why take it slow\n[02:53.674] I gotta know\n[02:57.912] Hey 'cause nothing can stop this thing that we got\n[03:18.651] Oh yeah I can't stop this thing we started\n[03:24.563] Yeah you gotta know it's right\n[03:28.776] Can't stop this course we've plotted oh yeah\n[03:37.406] This thing called love we got it\n[03:41.399] Ain't no place for the brokenhearted\n[03:45.631] I can't stop it\n[03:47.636] I can't stop it\n[03:49.832] Can't stop this thing we started\n[03:55.212] You gotta know it's alright\n[03:58.508] Can't stop this course we've plotted oh yeah\n[04:05.294] Baby\n[04:07.042] Can't stop it\n[04:09.198] Can't stop it\n[04:11.051] I can't stop it yeah yeah can't stop",
