        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.49] Drivin' home this evening\n[00:22.83] I coulda sworn we had it all worked out\n[00:30.19] You had this boy believin'\n[00:32.79] Way beyond the shadow of a doubt, yeah\n[00:39.58] Well I heard it on the street\n[00:42.88] I heard you mighta found somebody new, yeah\n[00:50.15] Well who is he baby, who is he\n[00:53.64] And tell me what he means to you, oh yeah\n[01:00.37] I took it all for granted\n[01:02.77] But how was I to know\n[01:05.13] That you'd be letting go\n[01:09.50] Now it cuts like a knife\n[01:14.43] But it feels so right\n[01:18.94] Yeah, it cuts like a knife\n[01:24.08] Oh, but it feels so right\n[01:30.24] There's times I've been mistaken\n[01:32.64] There's times I thought I'd been misunderstood, ooo yeah\n[01:40.14] So wait a minute darlin'\n[01:42.89] Can't you see we did the best we could, ooo we could\n[01:50.23] Wouldn't be the first time\n[01:52.58] That things have gone astray\n[01:55.33] Now you've thrown it all away\n[01:59.34] Now it cuts like a knife\n[02:04.11] Yeah but it feels so right\n[02:08.85] Oh it cuts like a knife\n[02:14.07] Yeah but it feels so right\n[02:18.82] Oh it's cut like a knife\n[02:23.37] But it feels so right, baby\n[02:28.96] Oh it cuts like a knife, yeah\n[02:55.49] I took it all for granted\n[02:57.76] But how was I to know\n[03:00.28] That you'd be letting go\n[03:04.70] Now it cuts like a knife\n[03:09.21] Yeah but it feels so right, mmm\n[03:14.53] Now it cuts like a knife\n[03:18.58] Yeah, but it feels so right\n[03:23.61] Yeah\n[03:33.00] Oh it cuts like a knife\n[03:39.83] Oh oh\n[03:43.39] But it feels so right, baby\n[03:49.04] Oh yeah\n[03:51.65] It cuts like a knife\n[03:53.82] Now give it to me now\n[03:59.34] Oh yeah, come on boys, awh\n[04:10.14] Cuts like a knife, yeah yeah yeah\n[04:22.49] Na, it cuts like a knife now\n[04:30.00] It feels so right, yeah yeah\n[04:33.62] It feels so right, baby\n[04:39.19] Na na yeah, it feels so right\n[04:43.28] And it cuts like a knife",
