        "fullLyrics": "[00:27.73] When the feelin' is ended\n[00:30.99] There ain't no use pretendin'\n[00:33.15] Don't ya worry,it's only love\n[00:37.76] When your world has been shattered\n[00:40.51] Ain't nothin' else matters\n[00:42.88] It ain't over,it's only love\n[00:46.67] And that's all,ya\n[00:49.41] \n[00:55.69] When your heart has been broken\n[00:59.41] Hard words have been spoken\n[01:01.70] It ain't easy but it's only love\n[01:06.02] And if your life ain't worth livin'\n[01:08.99] And you're ready to give in\n[01:11.27] Just remember,that it's only love,ooh\n[01:17.12] Only love\n[01:30.24] \n[01:32.83] Yeah\n[01:36.25] You can live without the aggravation\n[01:40.40] Ya gotta wanna win,ya gotta wanna win\n[01:45.41] You keep lookin' back in desperation\n[01:49.24] Over and over and over again\n[01:56.68] \n[02:04.70] Yeah,yeah,It's only love baby(ooh,love)\n[02:14.15] Ooh,baby,baby,it's only(love,love,love)\n[02:19.84] \n[02:22.52] (Love,love,love)\n[02:24.87] When your world is shattered\n[02:27.01] Ain't nothin' else matters\n[02:29.03] It ain't over,it's only love\n[02:33.42] If your life ain't worth livin'\n[02:36.53] And you're ready to give in\n[02:38.81] Just remember,that it's only love\n[02:42.74] Ya,that's all\n[02:45.48] \n[03:00.18] Ya it ain't easy baby\n[03:04.76] \n[03:09.70] But it's only love and that's all\n[03:11.17]",
