        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:46.30] It still feels like our first night together\n[00:54.45] Feels like the first kiss\n[00:58.04] And it's getting better baby\n[01:01.55] No one can better this\n[01:05.17] I'm still holding on, you're still the one\n[01:12.77] The first time our eyes met\n[01:16.04] Same feeling I get\n[01:19.47] Only feels much stronger\n[01:23.17] And I wanna love you longer\n[01:26.68] You still turn the fire on\n[01:32.73] So if you're feeling lonely, don't\n[01:39.13] You're the only one I ever want\n[01:45.28] I only wanna make it good\n[01:51.66] So if I love you a little more than I should\n[01:59.82] Please forgive me, I know not what I do\n[02:05.07] Please forgive me, I can't stop loving you\n[02:10.32] Don't deny me, this pain I'm going through\n[02:15.76] Please forgive me, if I need you like I do\n[02:20.91] Please believe me, every word I say is true\n[02:26.37] Please forgive me, I can't stop loving you\n[02:30.70] \n[02:32.97] \n[02:44.63] Still feels like our best times are together\n[02:50.54] \n[02:52.66] Feels like the first touch\n[02:55.86] We're still getting closer baby\n[02:59.71] Can't get close enough\n[03:03.29] I'm still holding on, you're still number one\n[03:10.23] I remember the smell of your skin\n[03:14.22] I remember everything\n[03:17.67] I remember all your moves\n[03:21.52] I remember you, yeah\n[03:25.13] I remember the nights, you know I still do\n[03:30.44] So if you're feeling lonely, don't\n[03:37.33] You're the only one I ever want\n[03:43.69] I only wanna make it good\n[03:49.79] So if I love you a little more than I should\n[03:57.69] Please forgive me, I know not what I do\n[04:03.26] Please forgive me, I can't stop loving you\n[04:08.56] Don't deny me, this pain I'm going through\n[04:13.73] Please forgive me, if I need you like I do\n[04:18.94] Oh, believe me, every word I say is true\n[04:24.44] Please forgive me, I can't stop loving you\n[04:31.12] \n[04:45.62] The one thing I'm sure of\n[04:49.47] Is the way we make love\n[04:52.98] The one thing I depend on\n[04:56.30] Is for us to stay strong\n[04:59.84] With every word and every breath I'm praying\n[05:05.80] That's why I'm saying\n[05:10.78] Please forgive me, I know not what I do\n[05:16.56] Please forgive me, I can't stop loving you\n[05:21.97] Don't deny me, this pain I'm going through\n[05:27.17] Please forgive me, if I need you like I do\n[05:32.53] Babe, believe me, every word I say is true\n[05:38.00] Please forgive me, if I can't stop loving you\n[05:43.63] Never leave me, I don't know what I do\n[05:48.70] Please forgive me, I can't stop loving you\n[05:55.73] \n[06:01.22] Can't stop loving you\n[06:07.43]",
