        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.73] Driving down Trans-Canada One\n[00:15.40] Top down, I got the radio on, alright\n[00:18.54] Gonna get there tonight\n[00:27.06] A little closer, every bend in the road\n[00:30.60] Motor runnin', think I'm gonna explode, alright\n[00:35.73] I got you in my sights\n[00:41.02] Blacktop burnin' underneath my wheels\n[00:45.85] It's crazy how I feel\n[00:48.53] I'm so happy it hurts\n[00:51.76] I'm so happy it hurts\n[00:56.10] I'm so glad it's outrageous\n[00:59.39] I'm so happy it hurts\n[01:04.05] That stupid grin on my face\n[01:06.98] Must be some kind of curse\n[01:10.99] You put a spell on me, baby\n[01:15.75] I'm so happy it hurts\n[01:22.34] Sun is shinin', there ain't no more rain\n[01:25.25] Step on the gas and forget all the pain, let it go\n[01:30.54] Out on the open road\n[01:34.54] Rocky mountains in the rearview mirror\n[01:40.88] I can't wait 'til I get there, alright\n[01:44.84] I'm gonna drive all night\n[01:50.32] Been around the world, there ain't much I've missed\n[01:55.57] But I ain't felt nothin' like this\n[01:58.62] I'm so happy it hurts\n[02:01.72] I'm so happy it hurts\n[02:06.54] I'm so glad it's outrageous\n[02:10.46] I'm so happy it hurts\n[02:14.58] That stupid grin on my face\n[02:17.69] Must be some kind of curse\n[02:21.38] You put a spell on me, baby\n[02:25.02] I'm so happy it hurts\n[02:28.83] Oh!\n[02:49.69] I'm so happy it hurts\n[02:52.68] I'm so happy it hurts\n[02:56.80] I'm so glad it's outrageous\n[03:01.31] You know, I think it's contagious\n[03:05.27] That stupid grin on my face\n[03:07.53] Must be some kind of curse\n[03:11.06] You put a spell on me, baby\n[03:15.83] I'm so happy it hurts\n[03:19.65] I'm so happy it hurts\n[03:24.25] I'm so happy it hurts\n[03:33.98]",
