        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.76] I been lookin' for someone\n[00:25.33] Between the fire and the flame\n[00:28.57] \n[00:31.88] We're all lookin' for somethin'\n[00:33.95] To ease the pain\n[00:36.80] \n[00:41.49] Now who can you turn to\n[00:45.92] When it's all black 'n' white\n[00:49.01] \n[00:51.85] And the winners are losers\n[00:54.08] You see it every night\n[00:57.18] \n[01:00.46] I need somebody\n[01:03.74] Somebody like you\n[01:05.64] Everybody needs somebody\n[01:10.69] I need somebody\n[01:13.55] Hey, what about you?\n[01:15.46] Everybody needs somebody\n[01:18.35] \n[01:40.18] When you're out on the front line\n[01:45.43] And you're watchin' them fall\n[01:50.02] Doesn't take long to realize\n[01:52.81] It ain't worth fightin' for\n[01:55.99] \n[01:58.54] I thought I saw the Madonna\n[02:02.86] When you walked in the room\n[02:06.13] \n[02:09.12] Oh, your eyes were like diamonds\n[02:12.43] And they cut right through, oh they cut right through\n[02:18.44] I need somebody\n[02:22.31] Somebody like you\n[02:24.17] Everybody needs somebody, oh yeah\n[02:28.32] I need somebody\n[02:32.03] Hey, what about you?\n[02:34.34] We all need somebody\n[02:37.69] \n[03:07.59] Another night, another lesson learned\n[03:13.75] It's the distance that keeps us sane\n[03:18.80] But when the silence leads to sorrow\n[03:22.24] We do it all again, all again, yeah!\n[03:28.49] I need somebody\n[03:31.38] Somebody like you\n[03:33.48] Everybody needs somebody, oh yeah\n[03:37.69] I need somebody\n[03:41.31] Hey, what about you?\n[03:44.04] Everybody needs somebody\n[03:47.68] I need somebody\n[03:50.97] Somebody like you\n[03:52.86] Everybody needs somebody, I need somebody\n[03:57.42] I need somebody\n[04:01.24] Yeah, what about you?\n[04:03.03] We all needs somebody\n[04:07.28] I need somebody\n[04:10.81] Everybody needs somebody\n[04:15.03] \n[04:17.76] I need somebody\n[04:22.18] Everybody needs somebody\n[04:23.87]",
