        "dateAdded": "2026-04-24T21:37:33.657Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:04.52] When you're gone!\n[00:06.89] I've been wandering around the house all night wondering what the hell to do\n[00:14.66] Yeah, I'm trying to concentrate, but all I can think of is you\n[00:22.32] Well, the phone don't ring, 'cause my friends ain't home\n[00:26.43] I'm tired of being all alone\n[00:30.05] Got the TV on 'cause the radio's playing songs that remind me of you\n[00:37.10] Baby, when you're gone, I realize I'm in love\n[00:45.01] Days go on and on and the nights just seem so long\n[00:51.94] Even food don't taste that good\n[00:55.50] Drink ain't doing what it should\n[01:00.14] Things just feel so wrong\n[01:03.72] Baby, when you're gone\n[01:07.17] Yeah!\n[01:08.01] I've been driving up and down these streets\n[01:12.44] Trying to find somewhere to go\n[01:15.92] Yeah, I'm looking for a familiar face but, there's no one I know\n[01:23.63] Oh, this is torture, this is pain\n[01:27.71] It feels like I'm gonna go insane\n[01:31.44] I hope you're coming back real soon\n[01:35.28] 'Cause I don't know what to do\n[01:38.20] Baby, when you're gone (when you're gone)\n[01:42.28] I realize I'm in love\n[01:46.08] Days go on and on (on and on)\n[01:49.45] And the nights just seem so long\n[01:53.14] Even food don't taste that good\n[01:56.99] Drink ain't doing what it should\n[02:01.14] Things just feel so wrong (uh, yeah)\n[02:05.01] Baby, when you're gone\n[02:08.91] \n[02:39.09] Oh, baby, when you're gone (when you're gone)\n[02:43.35] I realize I'm in love (so in love)\n[02:46.72] The days go on and on\n[02:50.52] And the nights just seem so long\n[02:54.24] Even food don't taste that good (ah, ah)\n[02:57.98] Drink ain't doing what it should\n[03:02.34] Things just feel so wrong (so wrong)\n[03:06.28] Baby, when you're gone (yeah, gone)\n[03:09.84] Oh, baby, when you're gone\n[03:13.24] Yeah, baby, when you're gone\n[03:15.09]",
        "genre": [
            "Rock"
        ],
