        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.10] 'Cause I, I, I'm in the stars tonight\n[00:04.02] So, watch me bring the fire, and set the night alight\n[00:08.84] Your shoes on, get up in the morn'\n[00:10.74] Cup of milk, let's rock 'n' roll\n[00:13.24] King Kong, kick the drum\n[00:14.81] Rolling on like a Rolling Stone\n[00:17.37] Sing-song when I'm walking home\n[00:19.18] Jump up to the top, LeBron\n[00:21.46] Ding-dong, call me on my phone\n[00:23.19] Ice tea and a game of ping pong\n[00:25.57] This is getting heavy, can you hear the bass boom? I'm ready (woo-hoo)\n[00:29.85] Life is sweet as honey, yeah, this beat cha-ching like money, huh\n[00:34.19] Disco overload, I'm into that, I'm good to go\n[00:38.14] I'm diamond, you know I glow up\n[00:40.52] Hey, so let's go\n[00:41.92] 'Cause I, I, I'm in the stars tonight\n[00:45.88] So watch me bring the fire, and set the night alight (hey)\n[00:50.67] Shining through the city with a little funk and soul\n[00:54.44] So I'ma light it up like dynamite, whoa-oh-oh\n[00:59.16] Bring a friend, join the crowd, whoever wanna come along\n[01:03.65] Word up, talk the talk, just move like we off the wall\n[01:07.84] Day or night, the sky's alight, so we dance to the break of dawn (hey)\n[01:12.00] Ladies and gentlemen, I got the medicine\n[01:13.76] So you should keep ya eyes on the ball, huh\n[01:16.01] This is getting heavy, can you hear the bass boom? I'm ready (woo-hoo)\n[01:20.47] Life is sweet as honey, yeah, this beat cha-ching like money, huh\n[01:24.33] Disco overload, I'm into that, I'm good to go\n[01:28.38] I'm diamond, you know I glow up\n[01:31.31] Let's go\n[01:32.44] 'Cause I, I, I'm in the stars tonight\n[01:36.42] So watch me bring the fire, and set the night alight (hey)\n[01:41.11] Shining through the city with a little funk and soul\n[01:44.86] So I'ma light it up like dynamite, whoa-oh-oh\n[01:49.76] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na, life is dynamite\n[01:53.75] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na, life is dynamite\n[01:57.91] Shining through the city with a little funk and soul\n[02:01.77] So I'ma light it up like dynamite, whoa-oh-oh\n[02:06.32] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na, na-na, ayy\n[02:09.00] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na, na-na, ayy\n[02:10.83] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na, na-na, ayy\n[02:12.92] Light it up like dynamite\n[02:14.87] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na, na-na, ayy\n[02:17.20] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na, na-na, ayy\n[02:19.11] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na, na-na, ayy\n[02:21.32] Light it up like dynamite\n[02:23.13] 'Cause I, I, I'm in the stars tonight\n[02:26.82] So watch me bring the fire, and set the night alight\n[02:31.80] Shining through the city with a little funk and soul\n[02:35.50] So I'ma light it up like dynamite\n[02:39.56] (This is ah) 'cause I, I, I'm in the stars tonight\n[02:43.66] So watch me bring the fire, and set the night alight (alight, oh)\n[02:48.54] Shining through the city with a little funk and soul\n[02:52.31] So I'ma light it up like dynamite, whoa-oh-oh (light it up like dynamite)\n[02:57.17] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na, life is dynamite (life is dynamite)\n[03:01.21] Dyn-na-na-na, na-na-na-na-na, na-na-na, life is dynamite (oh)\n[03:05.32] Shining through the city with a little funk and soul\n[03:09.04] So I'ma light it up like dynamite, whoa-oh-oh\n[03:13.09]",
