        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.22] Got a hole in my boots\n[00:10.27] So I gotta watch where I spit\n[00:11.91] Every time I chew\n[00:13.13] Got a hole in my boots\n[00:16.42] Got a hole in my jeans\n[00:19.13] Been working so hard\n[00:20.01] They about to fall apart\n[00:20.94] At the seams\n[00:22.78] I got a hole in my jeans\n[00:25.50] It's a Friday night\n[00:27.28] And I'm out on the town\n[00:30.08] Man you know you're gonna\n[00:31.75] Find me somewhere\n[00:33.54] There's a hole in a bottle\n[00:35.49] Tonight I'm probably in it\n[00:38.14] Taking all my worries\n[00:39.91] Gonna bury em down\n[00:41.79] There's a hole in a bottle\n[00:44.45] Just hit me bartender\n[00:46.72] Gonna sink to the bottom\n[00:48.72] And drink my way out\n[00:50.54] Gonna drink my way out\n[00:54.28] Gonna drink my way out\n[00:58.64] There's a hole in the wall\n[01:01.38] Where the neon lights\n[01:02.14] Shine bright as a disco ball\n[01:05.04] That's my hole in the wall\n[01:07.09] Well I got a hole in my heart\n[01:09.59] I can slide right up to some\n[01:11.35] Pretty little thing at the bar\n[01:13.14] Pass that hole in my heart\n[01:16.71] You can pop a top\n[01:17.73] You can twist that lid\n[01:20.36] Doesn't really matter\n[01:22.15] Just as long as you get\n[01:24.05] That hole in a bottle\n[01:26.60] Tonight I'm probably in it\n[01:28.26] Taking all my worries\n[01:31.20] Gonna bury em down\n[01:33.19] That hole in a bottle\n[01:34.76] Just hit me bartender\n[01:37.48] Gonna sink to the bottom\n[01:39.37] And drink my way out\n[01:41.22] Gonna drink my way out\n[01:45.62] Gonna drink my way out\n[01:50.27] I don't care if it's from Tennessee\n[01:54.76] Kentucky or Denver, Colorado\n[01:59.14] Make it from wheat\n[02:00.96] Make it from corn\n[02:02.71] I don't really care\n[02:04.26] Just make it pour\n[02:06.58] From that hole in a bottle\n[02:09.17] Tonight I'm probably in it\n[02:11.05] Taking all my worries\n[02:13.64] Gonna bury em down\n[02:15.44] In that hole in a bottle\n[02:18.10] Just hit me bartender\n[02:19.99] Gonna sink to the bottom\n[02:21.74] And drink my way out\n[02:23.59] Gonna drink my way out\n[02:28.13] Gonna drink my way out\n[02:32.18]",
