        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.81] Hey girl, I'm just a small town run around\n[00:18.72] I get my kicks out on the outskirts of town\n[00:22.07] I could never do it like a pretty city boy\n[00:25.23] I'm more a fishin' in the dark nitty gritty boy\n[00:28.56] So lay back and let me paint you a picture\n[00:31.72] The way I wanna kiss you is\n[00:35.20] Slow as the Mississippi\n[00:38.63] Strong as a fifth of whiskey\n[00:41.78] Steady as a Tom Petty track\n[00:44.66] I wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[00:48.35] Deeper than a sunset sky\n[00:51.47] Sweeter than muscadine wine\n[00:55.23] All night 'til the sun comes back\n[00:58.40] I wanna love, wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[01:14.46] When I'm with you I can see down the road girl\n[01:18.47] Not just the gravel one we're travelin' on girl\n[01:21.70] And I'm bettin' that it's gonna be a wild ride\n[01:24.98] But I promise that I'm gonna be there by your side\n[01:28.13] I think we got another memory in the makin'\n[01:31.34] So baby let's take it, take it\n[01:35.06] Slow as the Mississippi\n[01:38.29] Strong as a fifth of whiskey\n[01:41.47] Steady as a Tom Petty track\n[01:44.46] I wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[01:47.95] Deeper than a sunset sky\n[01:51.31] Sweeter than muscadine wine\n[01:55.22] All night 'til the sun comes back\n[01:57.25] I wanna love, wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[02:14.48] And I ain't gonna do it like a pretty city boy\n[02:18.00] I'm a fishin' in the dark nitty gritty boy, yeah\n[02:22.58] So let me love you\n[02:24.56] Slow as the Mississippi\n[02:27.87] Strong as a fifth of whiskey\n[02:31.23] Steady as a Tom Petty track, girl\n[02:34.50] I wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[02:37.73] Deeper than a sunset sky\n[02:40.80] Sweeter than muscadine wine\n[02:44.11] All night 'til the sun comes back\n[02:47.84] I wanna love, wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[02:53.20] Baby\n[02:54.20] I wanna love, wanna love, wanna love you like that\n[03:03.00] Yeah!\n[03:04.54] I could never do it like a pretty city boy\n[03:07.49] I'm more a fishin' in the dark nitty gritty boy",
