        "fullLyrics": "[00:18.180] I could lift you up\n[00:21.330] I could show you what you wanna see\n[00:23.610] and take you where you wanna be\n[00:26.220] You could be my luck\n[00:29.400] Even if the sky is falling down\n[00:31.770] I know that we'll be safe and sound\n[00:42.360] I could fill your cup\n[00:45.330] You know my river won't evaporate\n[00:48.000] This world we still appreciate\n[00:50.640] You could be my luck\n[00:53.790] Even in a hurricane of frowns\n[00:56.190] I know that we'll be safe and sound\n[01:15.240] I could show you love\n[01:18.150] In a tidal wave of mystery\n[01:20.520] You'll still be standing next to me\n[01:23.160] You could be my luck\n[01:26.340] Even if we're six feet underground\n[01:28.740] I know that we'll be safe and sound\n[02:03.960] I could lift you up\n[02:07.080] I could show you what you want to see\n[02:09.420] and take you where you want to be\n[02:12.060] You could be my luck\n[02:15.150] Even if the sky is falling down\n[02:17.550] I know that we'll be safe and sound\n[02:20.250] I could lift you up\n[02:23.130] I could show you what you want to see\n[02:25.680] and take you where you want to be\n[02:28.260] You could be my luck\n[02:31.440] Even if the sky is falling down\n[02:33.840] I know that we'll be safe and sound",
