        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.64] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[00:13.44] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[00:16.24] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[00:25.31] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[00:29.06] Said goodbye, turned around\n[00:31.88] And you were gone, gone, gone\n[00:36.27] Faded into the setting sun\n[00:41.59] Slipped away\n[00:43.17] But I won't cry\n[00:44.55] 'Cause I know I'll never be lonely\n[00:50.88] For you are the stars to me\n[00:55.94] You are the light I follow\n[01:02.42] I will see you again, oh\n[01:07.12] This is not where it ends\n[01:10.48] I will carry you with me, oh\n[01:16.67] 'Til I see you again\n[01:19.94] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[01:22.36] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[01:24.75] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[01:27.44] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[01:40.40] I can hear those echoes in the wind at night\n[01:48.06] Calling me back in time\n[01:52.81] Back to you\n[01:54.77] In a place far away where the water meets the sky\n[02:02.13] The thought of it makes me smile\n[02:07.48] You are my tomorrow\n[02:13.61] I will see you again, oh\n[02:18.45] This is not where it ends\n[02:21.72] I will carry you with me, oh\n[02:27.91] 'Til I see you again\n[02:31.97] Sometimes I feel my heart is breaking\n[02:41.46] But I stay strong, and I hold on 'cause I know\n[02:51.75] I will see you again, oh\n[02:56.41] This is not where it ends\n[02:59.67] I will carry you with me, yeah, yeah\n[03:06.02] I will see you again, oh\n[03:10.79] This is not where it ends\n[03:14.03] I will carry you with me, oh\n[03:20.12] 'Til I see you again\n[03:23.47] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[03:23.79] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[03:32.00] 'Til I see you again\n[03:33.81] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[03:35.42] Oh-oh, oh-oh\n[03:41.52] 'Til I see you again, yeah, yeah, yeah, whoa\n[03:50.70] 'Til I see you again\n[03:53.39] Said goodbye turned around\n[03:56.36] And you were gone, gone, gone\n[04:01.26]",
