        "fullLyrics": "[00:25.303] Who's gonna tell you when\n[00:29.114] It's too late\n[00:36.694] Who's gonna tell you things\n[00:40.570] Aren't so great\n[00:48.508] You can't go on\n[00:51.818] Thinking nothing's wrong\n[00:57.728] Who's gonna drive you home tonight\n[01:11.196] Who's gonna pick you up\n[01:14.943] When you fall\n[01:22.569] Who's gonna hang it up\n[01:26.508] When you call\n[01:34.131] Who's gonna pay attention\n[01:37.881] To your dreams\n[01:45.379] And who's gonna plug their ears\n[01:49.321] When you scream\n[01:57.443] You can't go on\n[02:00.633] Thinking nothing's wrong\n[02:06.632] Who's gonna drive you home tonight\n[02:37.280] Who's gonna hold you down\n[02:41.092] When you shake\n[02:48.779] Who's gonnae around\n[02:52.655] When you break\n[03:00.652] You can't go on\n[03:03.902] Thinking nothing's wrong\n[03:09.842] Who's gonna drive you home tonight\n[03:18.714] You can't go on\n[03:23.902] Thinking nothing's wrong\n[03:32.216] Who's gonna drive you home tonight",
