        "fullLyrics": "[00:04.65] I am so high, I can hear heaven\n[00:13.29] I am so high, I can hear heaven\n[00:22.70] Whoa, but heaven, no, heaven don't hear me\n[00:31.24] And they say that a hero could save us\n[00:35.30] I'm not gonna stand here and wait\n[00:40.77] I'll hold on to the wings of the eagles\n[00:45.39] Watch as we all fly away\n[00:54.48] Someone told me love would all save us\n[01:02.10] But how can that be? Look what love gave us\n[01:10.14] A world full of killing and blood spilling\n[01:15.20] That world never came\n[01:19.81] And they say that a hero could save us\n[01:23.89] I'm not gonna stand here and wait\n[01:29.02] I'll hold on to the wings of the eagles\n[01:33.62] Watch as we all fly away, (Ahhaaaa)\n[02:00.50] Now that the world isn't ending\n[02:01.04] It's love that I'm sending to you\n[02:06.35] It isn't the love of a hero\n[02:10.90] And that's why I fear it won't do\n[02:16.63] And they say that a hero could save us\n[02:21.73] I'm not gonna stand here and wait\n[02:25.75] I'll hold on to the wings of the eagles\n[02:30.62] Watch as we all fly away\n[02:35.47] And they're watching us, (watching us)\n[02:38.41] They're watching us, (watching us)\n[02:40.89] As we all fly away\n[02:45.46] And they're watching us, (watching us)\n[02:48.38] They're watching us, (watching us)\n[02:50.79] As we all fly away, yeeah(yeah, yeaaah...)\n[02:56.95] And they're watching us, (watching us)\n[02:58.05] They're watching us, (watching us)\n[03:00.75] As we all fly away\n[03:06.95] (Yeah, yeah, Whoahoa)\n[03:10.44]",
