        "dateAdded": "2026-05-03T17:51:00.145Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.86] If I could turn back time\n[00:20.84] If I could find a way\n[00:25.21] I'd take back those words that have hurt you\n[00:29.37] And you'd stay\n[00:33.91] I don't know why I did the things I did\n[00:37.73] I don't know why I said the things I said\n[00:42.14] Pride's like a knife, it can cut deep inside\n[00:46.14] Words are like weapons, they wound sometimes\n[00:51.41] I didn't really mean to hurt you\n[00:57.25] I didn't wanna see you go\n[01:00.58] I know I made you cry, but baby\n[01:03.63] If I could turn back time\n[01:07.56] If I could find a way\n[01:11.95] I'd take back those words that have hurt you\n[01:16.09] And you'd stay\n[01:19.62] If I could reach the stars\n[01:22.66] I'd give 'em all to you\n[01:27.37] Then you'd love me, love me\n[01:31.15] Like you used to do\n[01:36.36] (If I could turn back time)\n[01:38.80] My world was shattered, I was torn apart\n[01:41.97] Like someone took a knife and drove it deep in my heart\n[01:46.33] When you walked out that door\n[01:48.90] I swore that I didn't care\n[01:50.57] But I lost every thing, darlin', then and there\n[01:57.55] Too strong to tell you I was sorry\n[02:02.12] Too proud to tell you I was wrong\n[02:04.80] I know that I was blind, and darlin'\n[02:07.85] If I could turn back time\n[02:11.81] If I could find a way\n[02:16.27] I'd take back those words that have hurt you\n[02:21.11] And you'd stay\n[02:23.36] If I could reach the stars\n[02:27.29] I'd give 'em all to you\n[02:31.70] Then you'd love me, love me\n[02:35.37] Like you used to do, ohh\n[02:42.10] If I could turn back time\n[02:46.73] (If I could turn back time)\n[02:50.71] If I could turn back time\n[02:55.81] (If I could turn back time)\n[02:58.28] If I could turn back time, ohh baby\n[03:05.00] I didnt really mean to hurt you\n[03:08.15] I didn't wanna see you go\n[03:10.75] I know I made you cry\n[03:13.15] But ohh\n[03:15.15] If I could turn back time\n[03:18.08] If I could find a way\n[03:21.62] I'd take back those words that have hurt you\n[03:26.62] If I could reach the stars\n[03:30.43] I'd give them all to you\n[03:34.38] Then you'd love me, love me\n[03:38.93] Like you used to do\n[03:42.50] If I could turn back time\n[03:46.85] \n[03:49.32] (Turn back time)\n[03:53.43] If I could find a way (Find a way)\n[03:55.68] Then maybe, maybe, maybe you'd stay\n[03:57.37] (Reach the stars)\n[03:58.39]",
