        "fullLyrics": "[00:22.13] Used to spend my nights out in a barroom\n[00:28.19] \n[00:31.58] Liquor was the only love I've known\n[00:38.24] \n[00:41.21] But you rescued me from reaching for the bottom\n[00:47.86] And brought me back from being too far gone\n[00:57.65] You're as smooth as Tennessee whiskey\n[01:04.89] \n[01:07.06] You're as sweet as strawberry wine\n[01:14.81] \n[01:17.12] You're as warm as a glass of brandy\n[01:25.55] And honey, I stay stoned on your love all the time\n[01:33.47] \n[01:38.43] I've looked for love in all the same old places\n[01:43.33] \n[01:47.82] Found the bottom of a bottle's always dry\n[01:54.22] \n[01:57.04] But when you poured out your heart, I didn't waste it\n[02:04.30] 'Cause there's nothing like your love to get me high\n[02:13.30] And you're as smooth as Tennessee whiskey\n[02:20.36] \n[02:22.71] You're as sweet as strawberry wine\n[02:29.97] \n[02:32.63] You're as warm as a glass of brandy\n[02:41.24] And honey, I stay stoned on your love all the time\n[02:49.59] \n[03:25.69] \n[03:29.09] You're as smooth as Tennessee whiskey\n[03:31.46] \n[03:38.48] You're as sweet as strawberry wine\n[03:46.01] \n[03:48.37] You're as warm as a glass of brandy\n[03:57.05] And honey, I stay stoned on your love all the time\n[04:06.80] You're as smooth as Tennessee whiskey\n[04:16.03] Tennessee whiskey, Tennessee whiskey\n[04:25.64] You're as smooth as Tennessee whiskey\n[04:35.16] Tennessee whiskey, Tennessee whiskey\n[04:41.99]",
