        "dateAdded": "2026-03-26T21:00:00.000Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:30.296] Lights go out and I can't be saved\n[00:33.656] Tides that I tried to swim against\n[00:37.276] Put me down upon my knees\n[00:41.136] Oh I beg, I beg and plead\n[00:44.646] Singing come out of things unsaid\n[00:48.266] Shoot an apple off my head\n[00:51.816] And trouble that can't be named\n[00:55.496] Tigers waiting to be tamed\n[00:59.046] Singing you are...\n[01:06.666] You are...\n[01:29.196] Confusion that never stops\n[01:32.386] Closing walls and ticking clocks\n[01:35.806] Gonna come back and take you home\n[01:39.436] I could not stop but you now know\n[01:43.106] Singing come out upon my seas\n[01:46.856] Curse missed opportunities\n[01:50.476] Am I a part of the cure\n[01:54.086] Or am I part of the disease\n[01:57.776] Singing you are...\n[02:06.696] You are...\n[02:13.996] You are...\n[02:21.486] You are...\n[02:28.916] You are...\n[02:30.526] You are...\n[02:31.026] And nothing else compares...\n[02:35.836] And nothing else compares...\n[02:43.266] And nothing else compares...\n[03:27.936] You are...\n[03:29.566] You are...\n[03:30.566] ~~END~~",
