        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.84] How long before I get in?\n[00:21.73] Before it starts, before I begin\n[00:25.48] How long before you decide?\n[00:28.58] Before I know what it feels like\n[00:33.41] Where to, where do I go?\n[00:36.44] If you never try, then you'll never know\n[00:41.01] How long do I have to climb\n[00:45.58] Up on the side of this mountain of mine?\n[01:04.26] Look up, I look up at night\n[01:07.78] Planets are moving at the speed of light\n[01:12.18] Climb up, up in the trees\n[01:15.33] Every chance that you get is a chance you seize\n[01:19.90] How long am I gonna stand\n[01:23.54] With my head stuck under the sand?\n[01:27.40] I'll start before I can stop\n[01:30.52] Or before I see things the right way up\n[01:36.73] All that noise, and all that sound\n[01:44.44] All those places I got found\n[01:51.24] And birds go flying at the speed of sound\n[01:55.42] To show you how it all began\n[02:00.06] Birds came flying from the underground\n[02:02.89] If you could see it then you'd understand\n[02:16.97] Ideas that you'll never find\n[02:19.79] All the inventors could never design\n[02:27.28] The buildings that you put up\n[02:28.66] Japan and China, all lit up\n[02:32.18] The sign that I couldn't read\n[02:36.74] Or a light that I couldn't see\n[02:39.53] Some things you have to believe\n[02:43.32] But others are puzzles, puzzling me\n[02:48.89] All that noise, and all that sound\n[02:57.37] All those places I got found\n[03:03.44] And birds go flying at the speed of sound\n[03:07.37] To show you how it all began\n[03:11.25] Birds came flying from the underground\n[03:14.74] If you could see it then you'd understand\n[03:18.81] Oh, when you see it then you'll understand\n[03:33.86] All those signs, I knew what they meant\n[03:37.61] Some things you can't invent\n[03:41.47] Some get made, and some get sent\n[03:45.83] Ooh-ooh\n[03:48.38] Birds go flying at the speed of sound\n[03:52.31] To show you how it all began\n[03:55.85] Birds came flying from the underground\n[03:59.72] If you could see it then you'd understand\n[04:03.61] Oh, when you see it then you'll understand\n[04:12.96]",
