        "dateAdded": "2026-03-26T21:00:00.000Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:36.863] Oh brother I can't  I can't get through\n[00:43.393] I've been trying hard to reach you 'cause I don't know what to do\n[00:52.303] Oh brother I can't believe it's true\n[00:59.123] I'm so scared about the future and I wanna talk to you\n[01:07.243] Oh I wanna talk to you\n[01:19.493] You can take a picture of something you see\n[01:28.403] In the future where will I be \n[01:35.413] You can climb a ladder up to the sun\n[01:43.712] Or write a song nobody has sung or do\n[01:49.142] Something that's never been done\n[02:00.931] Are you lost or incomplete \n[02:07.261] Do you feel like a puzzle  you can't find your missing piece \n[02:15.111] Tell me how do you feel \n[02:23.311] Well I feel like they're talking in a language I don't speak\n[02:30.891] And they're talking it to me\n[02:43.101] So you take a picture of something you see\n[02:52.321] In the future where will I be \n[02:59.271] You can climb a ladder up to the sun\n[03:07.490] Or  write a song nobody has sung or do\n[03:12.930] Something that's never been done  do\n[03:16.800] Something that's never been done\n[04:14.933] So you don't know where you're going and you wanna talk\n[04:23.213] And you feel like you're going where you've been before\n[04:31.563] You tell anyone who'll listen but you feel ignored\n[04:39.413] Nothing's really making any sense at all  let's talk\n[04:45.083] Let's talk  let's talk  let's talk",
