        "fullLyrics": "[00:28.354] Come up to meet you\n[00:31.538] Tell you I'm sorry\n[00:34.755] You don't know how lovely you are\n[00:41.413] I had to find you\n[00:44.533] Tell you I need you\n[00:47.882] Tell you I set you apart\n[00:54.426] Tell me your secrets\n[00:57.488] And ask me your questions\n[01:00.946] Oh let's go back to the start\n[01:07.657] Running in circles\n[01:10.896] Coming up tails\n[01:14.065] Heads on a science apart\n[01:20.212] Nobody said it was easy\n[01:26.925] It's such a shame for us to part\n[01:33.518] Nobody said it was easy\n[01:39.996] No one ever said it would be this hard\n[01:49.171] Oh take me back to the start\n[02:19.792] I was just guessing\n[02:22.879] At numbers and figures\n[02:26.205] Pulling the puzzles apart\n[02:32.781] Questions of science\n[02:35.940] Science and progress\n[02:39.268] Do not speak as loud as my heart\n[02:45.869] Tell me you love me\n[02:48.834] Come back and haunt me\n[02:52.383] Oh and I rush to the start\n[02:59.035] Running in circles\n[03:02.275] Chasing our tails\n[03:05.496] Coming back as we are\n[03:11.699] Nobody said it was easy\n[03:18.054] Oh it's such a shame for us to part\n[03:24.799] Nobody said it was easy\n[03:31.384] No one ever said it would be so hard\n[03:40.406] I'm going back to the start\n[04:12.071] Oh-ooh ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[04:24.770] Oh-ooh ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[04:37.855] Oh-ooh ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[04:50.960] Oh-ooh ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh",
