        "fullLyrics": "[00:29.914] Oh no I see\n[00:35.204] A spider web it's tangled up with me\n[00:40.134] And I lost my head\n[00:45.624] The thought of all the stupid things I said\n[01:07.818] Oh no what's this\n[01:12.998] A spider web and I'm caught in the middle\n[01:17.918] Oh I turned to run\n[01:23.418] The thought of all the stupid things I've done\n[01:30.528] And oh I never meant to cause you trouble\n[01:37.388] And oh and I never meant to do you wrong\n[01:44.068] And oh well if I ever caused you trouble\n[01:51.118] Oh no I never meant to do you harm\n[02:18.313] Oh no I see\n[02:18.230] A spider web and it's me in the middle\n[02:23.160] So I twist and turn\n[02:28.590] Here am I in my little bubble\n[02:34.830] Singing out oh I never meant to cause you trouble\n[02:42.630] Oh I never meant to do you wrong\n[02:49.370] Oh well if I ever caused you trouble\n[02:56.170] Oh no I never meant to do you harm\n[03:32.197] They spun a web for me\n[03:38.817] They spun a web for me\n[03:45.687] They spun a web for me\n[03:56.917] Over",
