        "fullLyrics": "[00:33.580] Look at the stars\n[00:36.300] Look how they shine for you\n[00:41.819] And everything you do\n[00:47.417] Yeah they were all yellow\n[00:50.225] I came along\n[00:52.894] I wrote a song for you\n[00:58.393] And all the things you do\n[01:04.003] And it was called yellow\n[01:09.469] So then I took my turn\n[01:15.028] Oh what a thing to have done\n[01:20.637] And it was all yellow\n[01:29.185] Your skin\n[01:31.715] Oh yeah your skin and bones\n[01:34.653] Turn into something beautiful\n[01:40.192] You know you know I love you so\n[01:48.182] You know I love you so\n[02:13.089] I swam across\n[02:15.959] I jumped across for you\n[02:21.428] Oh what a thing to do\n[02:27.028] 'Cause you were all yellow\n[02:29.775] I drew a line\n[02:32.503] I drew a line for you\n[02:37.992] Oh what a thing to do\n[02:43.722] And it was all yellow\n[02:52.147] Your skin\n[02:54.516] Oh yeah your skin and bones\n[02:57.684] Turn into something beautiful\n[03:03.003] And you know\n[03:05.772] For you I'd bleed myself dry\n[03:11.112] For you I'd bleed myself dry\n[03:35.261] It's true\n[03:38.830] Look how they shine for you\n[03:44.459] Look how they shine for you\n[03:49.928] Look how they shine for\n[03:55.448] Look how they shine for you\n[04:00.968] Look how they shine for you\n[04:06.588] Look how they shine\n[04:09.377] Look at the stars\n[04:12.095] Look how they shine for you\n[04:17.713] And all the things that you do",
