        "fullLyrics": "[00:06.310] I see the bad moon rising\n[00:11.350] I see trouble on the way\n[00:16.700] I see earthquakes and lightnin'\n[00:22.000] I see bad times today\n[00:27.300] Don't go 'round tonight\n[00:29.550] It's bound to take your life\n[00:32.610] There's a bad moon on the rise\n[00:37.920] I hear hurricanes a blowin'\n[00:43.350] I know the end ismin' soon\n[00:48.650] I fear rivers over flowing\n[00:53.970] I hear the voice of rage and ruin\n[00:59.390] Don't go 'round tonight\n[01:01.570] It's bound to take your life\n[01:04.760] There's a bad moon on the rise\n[01:31.490] Hope you got your things together\n[01:36.790] Hope you are quite prepared to die\n[01:41.970] Looks like we'er in for nasty weather\n[01:47.450] One eye is taken for an eye\n[01:52.760] Don't go 'round tonight\n[01:55.000] It's bound to take your life\n[01:58.660] There's a bad moon on the rise don't go round tonight it's bound to take your life There's a bad moon on the rise",
