        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.000] Someone told me long ago \n[00:17.870] There's a calm before the storm \n[00:20.930] I know  and it's been comin' for some time \n[00:30.400] When it's over  so they say  it'll rain a sunny day \n[00:37.430] I know  shinin' down like water \n[00:47.300] I want to know  have you ever seen the rain \n[00:55.300] I want to know  have you ever seen the rain\n[01:03.870] Comin' down on a sunny day \n[01:11.840] Yesterday  and days before \n[01:15.840] Sun is cold and rain is hard \n[01:18.870] I know  been that way for all my time \n[01:28.320] 'Til forever on it goes through the circle fast and slow \n[01:35.240] I know  and it can't stop  I wonder \n[01:45.120] I want to know  have you ever seen the rain \n[01:53.260] I want to know  have you ever seen the rain\n[02:01.820] Comin' down on a sunny day \n[02:07.220] I want to know  have you ever seen the rain \n[02:17.900] I want to know  have you ever seen the rain\n[02:26.510] Comin' down on a sunny day",
