        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.73] There is freedom within\n[00:16.29] There is freedom without\n[00:18.73] Try to catch the deluge in a paper cup\n[00:25.02] There's a battle ahead\n[00:28.07] Many battles are lost\n[00:30.79] But you'll never see the end of the road\n[00:32.40] While you're travelling with me\n[00:35.82] Hey now, hey now\n[00:38.52] Don't dream it's over\n[00:42.12] Hey now, hey now\n[00:44.80] When the world comes in\n[00:47.69] They come, they come\n[00:50.86] To build a wall between us\n[00:54.16] We know they won't win\n[01:00.24] Now I'm towing my car\n[01:03.81] There's a hole in the roof\n[01:05.97] My possessions are causing me suspicion\n[01:08.31] But there's no proof\n[01:12.42] In the paper today\n[01:15.84] Tales of war and of waste\n[01:18.24] But you turn right over to the TV page\n[01:23.61] Hey now, hey now\n[01:26.15] Don't dream it's over\n[01:29.38] Hey now, hey now\n[01:32.13] When the world comes in\n[01:35.26] They come, they come\n[01:38.75] To build a wall between us\n[01:41.89] We know they won't win\n[01:47.45] \n[02:24.82] Now I'm walking again\n[02:28.06] To the beat of a drum\n[02:30.17] And I'm counting the steps to the door of your heart\n[02:36.66] Only shadows ahead\n[02:39.76] Barely clearing the roof\n[02:42.00] Get to know the feeling of liberation and release\n[02:47.47] Hey now, hey now\n[02:49.83] Don't dream it's over\n[02:53.30] Hey now, hey now\n[02:55.87] When the world comes in\n[02:58.75] They come, they come\n[03:02.12] To build a wall between us\n[03:05.10] You know they won't win\n[03:10.51] \n[03:13.75] Don't let them win (Hey now, hey now)\n[03:20.91] Hey now, hey now\n[03:26.27] Hey now, hey now\n[03:31.61] Don't let them win (They come, they come)\n[03:37.16] Don't let them win (Hey now, hey now), yeah\n[03:44.58] Hey now, hey now\n[03:46.43]",
