        "dateAdded": "2026-05-03T17:53:47.471Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:19.37] Walking 'round the room singing \"Stormy Weather\"\n[00:24.66] At 57 Mount Pleasant Street\n[00:27.28] \n[00:29.98] Well it's the same room, but everything's different\n[00:34.86] You can fight the sleep, but not the dream\n[00:41.53] Things ain't cookin' in my kitchen\n[00:46.71] Strange affliction, wash over me\n[00:51.86] Julius Caesar and the Roman Empire\n[00:57.05] Couldn't conquer the blue sky\n[01:05.57] \n[01:44.39] Well, there's a small boat made of china\n[01:49.46] It's going nowhere on the mantlepiece\n[01:54.69] Well, do I lie like a loungeroom lizard\n[01:59.72] Or do I sing like a bird released?\n[02:04.88] Everywhere you go, always take the weather with you\n[02:09.93] Everywhere you go, always take the weather\n[02:15.08] Everywhere you go, always take the weather with you\n[02:20.16] Everywhere you go, always take the weather, the weather with you\n[02:28.11]\n\n[02:45.64] Everywhere you go, always take the weather with you\n[02:50.98] Everywhere you go, always take the weather\n[02:56.08] Everywhere you go, always take the weather with you\n[03:01.25] Everywhere you go, always take the weather, take the weather\n[03:08.07] The weather with you\n[03:11.37]\n\n[03:34.47] Everywhere you go, always take the weather with you\n[03:39.55] Everywhere you go, always take the weather\n[03:44.46] Everywhere you go, always take the weather with you\n[03:49.52] Everywhere you go, always take the weather, take the weather\n[03:56.90] The weather with you\n[03:58.25]",
