        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.14] A wild ride\n[00:18.79] Over stony ground\n[00:22.54] And such a lust for life\n[00:26.55] The circus comes to town\n\n[00:30.42] We are the hungry ones\n[00:34.43] On a lightning raid\n[00:38.51] Just like a river runs\n[00:42.62] Like a fire needs flame\n[00:45.65] Oh, I burn for you\n\n[00:48.73] I got ta feel it in my blood\n[00:53.62] Whoa oh\n[00:56.95] I need your touch don't need your love\n[01:01.71] Whoa oh\n\n[01:03.54] And I want\n[01:05.62] And I need\n[01:07.71] And I lust\n[01:09.58] Animal\n[01:11.66] And I want\n[01:13.71] And I need\n[01:15.59] And I lust\n[01:17.62] Animal\n\n[01:19.61] I cry wolf\n[01:22.99] Givin' mouth to mouth\n[01:26.70] Like a movin' heartbeat\n[01:30.94] In the witching hour\n\n[01:34.71] I'm runnin' with the wind\n[01:38.75] A shadow in the dust\n[01:42.73] I'm like the drivin' rain\n[01:46.10] Yeah, like the restless rust\n[01:50.92] I never sleep\n\n[01:52.67] I got to feel it in my blood\n[01:57.86] Whoa oh\n[02:00.98] I need your touch don't need your love\n[02:05.94] Whoa oh\n\n[02:07.63] And I want\n[02:09.98] And I need\n[02:11.66] And I lust\n[02:13.90] Animal\n[02:15.91] And I want\n[02:17.87] And I need\n[02:19.82] And I lust\n[02:21.99] Animal\n\n[02:26.71] Cry wolf, baby\n[02:29.64] Cry tough\n[02:31.07] Gonna hunt you like an an-an-animal\n[02:38.85] Gonna take your love and run\n\n[02:57.30] I got to feel it in my blood\n[03:02.07] Whoa oh\n[03:05.07] I need your touch, don't need your love\n[03:09.98] Whoa oh\n\n[03:12.03] And I want\n[03:14.14] And I need\n[03:15.79] And I lust\n[03:18.23] Animal\n[03:20.14] And I want\n[03:22.26] And I need\n[03:24.18] And I lust\n[03:26.03] Animal\n\n[03:28.35] And I want (and I want)\n[03:30.26] And I need (and I need)\n[03:32.22] And I lust (and I lust)\n[03:34.38] Animal (animal)\n\n[03:36.51] And I want (take me)\n[03:38.34] And I need (tame me)\n[03:40.38] And I lust (make me)\n[03:42.35] Animal (your animal)\n\n[03:44.42] And I want (show me)\n[03:46.30] And I need (stroke me)\n[03:48.42] And I lust (let me be your)\n[03:50.42] Animal (animal)\n\n[03:54.30] And I want (I want)\n[03:56.43] And I need (ooh-ooh-ooh)\n[03:58.42] And I lust (animal)\n[04:00.39] Animal\n[04:02.75]",
