        "fullLyrics": "[00:29.03] Last time I was sober, man, I felt bad\n[00:33.84] Worst hangover that I ever had\n[00:36.70] It took six hamburgers and scotch all night\n[00:40.68] Nicotine for breakfast just to put me right\n[00:44.14] 'Cause if you wanna run cool\n[00:47.89] If you wanna run cool\n[00:51.23] If you wanna run cool, you got to run\n[00:55.18] On heavy, heavy fuel\n[00:58.81] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[01:02.66] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[01:05.91] \n[01:20.95] My life makes perfect sense\n[01:24.36] Lust and food and violence\n[01:27.82] Sex and money are my major kicks\n[01:31.55] Get me in a fight I like the dirty tricks\n[01:34.33] 'Cause if you wanna run cool\n[01:38.62] If you wanna run cool\n[01:41.64] Yes, if you wanna run cool, you got to run\n[01:45.80] On heavy, heavy fuel\n[01:50.00] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[01:53.31] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[01:57.32] My chick loves a man who's strong\n[02:00.83] The things she'll do to turn me on\n[02:04.49] I love the babes, don't get me wrong\n[02:08.18] Hey, that's why I wrote this song\n[02:11.49] \n[02:33.27] I don't care if my liver is hanging by a thread\n[02:36.85] Don't care if my doctor says I ought to be dead\n[02:40.00] When my ugly big car won't a-climb this hill\n[02:43.53] I'll write a suicide note on a hundred dollar bill\n[02:47.54] 'Cause if you wanna run cool\n[02:51.16] If you wanna run cool\n[02:54.69] Yes, if you wanna run cool, you got to run\n[02:58.78] On heavy, heavy fuel\n[03:02.70] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[03:06.39] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[03:13.56] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[03:16.94] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[03:38.99] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[03:53.29] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[04:07.93] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[04:22.20] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[04:36.36] Heavy, heavy fuel\n[04:43.59]",
