        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.52] Lady writer on the TV\n[00:15.94] Talk about the Virgin Mary\n[00:18.93] Reminded me of you\n[00:22.34] Expectation left to come up to yeah\n[00:26.31] Lady writer on the TV\n[00:29.34] Yeah, she had another quality\n[00:32.59] The way you used to look\n[00:35.71] And I know you never read a book\n[00:38.99] Just the way that her hair fell down around her face\n[00:45.38] Then I recall my fall from grace\n[00:52.26] Another time, another place\n[00:58.54] Lady writer on the TV\n[01:01.10] She had all her brains and the beauty\n[01:05.14] The picture does not fit\n[01:07.51] You talked to me when you felt like it\n[01:11.59] Just the way that her hair fell down around her face\n[01:17.15] And I recall my fall from grace\n[01:21.39] \n[01:24.62] Another time, another place\n[01:30.53] Yes and your rich old man\n[01:33.15] You know he'd call her a dead ringer\n[01:37.48] You got the same command\n[01:39.55] Plus your mother was a jazz singer\n[01:42.97] \n[02:10.29] Just the way that her hair fell down around her face\n[02:15.85] Then I recall my fall from grace\n[02:20.07] \n[02:22.84] (Oh yeah) Another time, another place\n[02:29.30] Lady writer on the TV\n[02:32.49] She knew all about a history\n[02:35.85] You couldn't hardly write your name\n[02:38.54] I think I want you just the same as the\n[02:42.22] Lady writer on the TV\n[02:45.53] Talking about the Virgin Mary\n[02:48.46] Yeah you know I'm talking about you and me\n[02:51.65] And lady writer on the TV\n[02:55.16] Lady writer on the TV\n[02:58.50] Talking about the Virgin Mary\n[03:01.56] Yeah you know I'm talking about you and me\n[03:04.41] And lady writer on the TV\n[03:08.20] (Lady writer on the TV)\n[03:11.96] (Lady writer)\n[03:15.18] (Lady writer on the TV)\n[03:19.48] (Lady writer on the TV)\n[03:22.61] \n[03:25.23] (Lady writer)\n[03:29.02] (Lady writer on the TV)\n[03:30.26]",
