        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.40] I want my\n[00:00.66] I want my, I want my MTV\n[00:01.15] I want my, I want my MTV\n[00:01.42] I want my, I want my MTV\n[01:01.84] Now look at them yo-yos, that's the way you do it\n[01:06.57] You play the guitar on the MTV\n[01:10.35] That ain't workin', that's the way you do it\n[01:13.35] Money for nothin' and your chicks for free\n[01:17.30] Now that ain't workin', that's the way you do it\n[01:20.86] Lemme tell ya, them guys ain't dumb\n[01:24.61] Maybe get a blister on your little finger\n[01:28.20] Baby, get a blister on your thumb\n[01:32.17] We gotta install microwave ovens\n[01:35.09] Custom kitchen deliveries\n[01:38.87] We've got to move these refrigerators\n[01:42.23] We've got to move these colour TVs\n[01:48.22] See the little faggot with the earring and the makeup\n[01:52.88] Yeah buddy, that's his own real hair\n[01:57.06] The little faggot got his own jet airplane\n[01:59.75] The little faggot, he's a millionaire\n[02:04.06] We gotta install microwave ovens\n[02:07.52] Custom kitchen deliveries\n[02:11.26] We've got to move these refrigerators\n[02:14.89] We've got to move these colour TVs\n[02:35.97] Got to install microwave ovens\n[02:39.66] Custom kitchen deliveries\n[02:43.13] We've got to move these refrigerators\n[02:46.95] We've got to move these colour TVs (look at him)\n[02:53.31] I shoulda learned to play the guitar\n[02:57.69] I shoulda learned to play them drums\n[03:00.65] Look at that mama, she come in stickin' in the camera\n[03:04.50] Man, we could have some fun\n[03:08.13] And he's up there, what's that? Hawaiian noises?\n[03:11.49] He's bangin' on the bongos like a chimpanzee\n[03:15.12] That ain't workin', that's the way you do it\n[03:18.66] Get your money for nothin', get your chicks for free\n[03:22.15] We gotta install microwave ovens\n[03:26.47] Custom kitchen deliveries\n[03:29.82] We've got to move these refrigerators\n[03:33.36] We've got to move these colour TVs, lord\n[03:52.73] Listen here\n[03:54.52] Now, that ain't workin', that's the way you do it\n[03:58.05] You play the guitar on the MTV\n[04:01.21] That ain't workin', that's the way you do it\n[04:05.20] Money for nothin' and your chicks for free\n[04:09.01] Money for nothin'\n[04:10.42] Chicks for free\n[04:14.43] Get your money for nothin'\n[04:18.70] And your chicks for free\n[04:25.39] Oozin' money for nothin'\n[04:26.47] And your chicks for free\n[04:26.96] Get your money for nothin'\n[04:27.21] Chicks for free\n[04:27.53] Money for nothin' (all that money for nothing)\n[04:27.74] Chicks for free\n[04:28.07] Get your money for nothin'\n[04:28.40] Get your chicks for free\n[04:28.69] Get your money for nothin'\n[04:28.80] And your chicks for free\n[04:29.19] Get your money for nothin' (what's that?)\n[04:29.47] And your chicks for free (look at that, look at that)\n[04:29.64] Get your money for nothin' (I want my, I want my)\n[04:29.99] And your chicks for free (I want my MTV)\n[04:30.29] Money for nothin' (I want my, I want my)\n[04:30.54] Chicks for free (I want my MTV)\n[04:30.70] Get your money for nothin' (I want my, I want my)\n[04:31.07] And your chicks for free (I want my MTV)\n[04:31.40] Get your money for nothin' (I want my, I want my)\n[04:31.57] And your chicks for free (I want my MTV)\n[04:31.90] Easy, easy money (for nothing)\n[04:32.14] Easy, easy chicks (for free)\n[04:32.41] Easy, easy money (for nothing)\n[04:32.61] Chicks for free (I want my MTV)\n[04:32.99] That ain't workin'\n[04:33.21] Money for nothing\n[04:33.43] Chicks for free\n[04:33.70] Money for nothing\n[04:34.03] Chicks for free\n[04:34.25]",
