        "fullLyrics": "[00:01.463] There's gotta be a record of you some place\n[00:05.584] You gotta be on somebody's books\n[00:10.149] The lowdown - a picture of your face\n[00:15.212] Your injured looks\n[00:19.820] The sacred and profane\n[00:22.634] The pleasure and the pain\n[00:26.072] Somewhere your fingerprints remain concrete\n[00:32.197] And it's your face i'm looking for\n[00:37.944] On every street\n[00:54.635] A ladykiller - regulation tattoo\n[00:58.883] Silver spurs on his heels\n[01:03.697] Says - what can i tell you as i'm standing next to you\n[01:07.383] She threw herself under my wheels\n[01:11.695] Oh it's a dangerous road\n[01:15.883] And a hazardous load\n[01:18.759] And the fireworks over liberty expode in the heat\n[01:25.571] And it's your face i'm looking for\n[01:31.573] On every street\n[01:57.479] A three-chord symphony crashes into space\n[02:02.040] The moon is hanging upside down\n[02:06.417] I don't know why it is i'm still on the case\n[02:11.788] It's a ravenous town\n[02:15.355] And you still refuse to be traced\n[02:19.167] Seems to me such a waste\n[02:23.418] And every victory has a taste that's bittersweet\n[02:29.729] And it's your face i'm looking for\n[02:35.477] On every street\n[02:39.729] And it's your face i'm looking for\n[02:45.418] On every street",
