        "fullLyrics": "[01:25.898] Its a mystery to me\n[01:28.834] The game commences\n[01:31.461] For the usual fee\n[01:34.889] Plus expenses\n[01:36.459] Confidential information\n[01:40.583] Its a in diary\n[01:42.789] This is my investigation\n[01:45.596] Its not a public inquiry\n[02:00.038] I go checking out the reports\n[02:02.968] Digging up the dirt\n[02:05.727] You get to meet all sorts\n[02:08.537] In this line of work\n[02:10.412] Treachery and treason\n[02:14.285] Theres always an excuse for it\n[02:17.223] And when I find the reason\n[02:19.287] I still can't get used to it\n[02:34.299] And what got have you at the end of the day \n[02:40.233] What have you got to take away \n[02:45.668] A bottle of whiskey and a new set of lies\n[02:51.356] Blinds window on the and a pain behind the eyes\n[03:37.129] Scarred for life\n[03:39.631] No compensation\n[03:45.981] Private investigations",
