        "fullLyrics": "[00:23.950] A lovestruck Romeo sings a streetsuss serenade\n[00:29.280] Laying everybody low with a lovesong that he made\n[00:34.809] Finding the streetlight steps out of the shade\n[00:38.918] Says something like\n[00:40.928] You and me babe how about it\n[00:45.828] Juliet says hey it's Romeo you nearly\n[00:48.878] Gimme a heart attack\n[00:51.648] He's underneath the window she's singing\n[00:54.168] Hey la my boyfriend's back\n[00:57.378] You shoudn't come around here singing up\n[00:59.748] At people like that\n[01:02.348] Anyway what you gonna do about it\n[01:07.016] Juliet the dice were loaded from the start\n[01:12.406] And I bet and you exploded in my heart\n[01:17.565] And I forget I forget the movie song\n[01:24.125] When you gonna realize it was just\n[01:26.635] That the time was wrong juliet\n[01:41.301] Come up on different streets they both\n[01:44.191] Were streets of shame\n[01:46.281] Both dirty both mean yes and the dream\n[01:50.061] Was just the same\n[01:51.751] And I dreamed your dream for you and\n[01:54.271] Now your dream is real\n[01:57.621] How can you look at me as I was just\n[01:59.851] Another one of your deals\n[02:01.951] When you can fall for chains of silver\n[02:05.431] You can fall for chains of gold\n[02:08.211] You can fall for pretty strangers and\n[02:11.130] The promises they hold\n[02:13.859] You promised me everything you\n[02:16.739] Promised me thick and thin\n[02:19.059] Now you just say oh Romeo yeah you\n[02:21.018] Know I used to have a scene with him\n[02:23.598] Juliet when we made love you used to cry\n[02:29.017] You said I love you like the stars above\n[02:32.037] I'll love you till I die\n[02:34.086] There's a place for us you know the movie song\n[02:40.586] When you gonna realize it was just\n[02:42.996] That the time was wrong Juliet\n[02:58.066] I can't do the talk like they talking on the TV\n[03:02.865] And I can't do a love song like\n[03:05.815] The way its meant to be\n[03:08.585] I can't do everything but I'd do anything for you\n[03:14.295] I can't do anything except be in love with you\n[03:19.604] And all I do is miss you and the\n[03:22.434] Way we used to be\n[03:25.334] All I do is keep the beat and bad company\n[03:30.834] All I do is kiss you through the bars of a rhyme\n[03:35.974] Julie I'd do the stars with you any time\n[03:40.653] Juliet when we made love you used to cry\n[03:46.001] You said I love you like the stars above\n[03:48.891] I'll love you till I die\n[03:51.001] There's a place for us you know the movie song\n[03:57.330] When you gonna realize it was\n[03:59.619] Just that the time was wrong Juliet\n[04:25.475] A lovestruck Romeo sings a\n[04:28.455] Streetsuss serenade\n[04:30.845] Laying everybody low with\n[04:33.934] A lovesong that he made\n[04:36.703] Finds a convenient streetlight\n[04:39.032] Steps out of the shade\n[04:40.502] Says something like you and me\n[04:43.221] Babe how about it",
