        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:42.289] I seen a girl on a one way corridor\n[00:45.289] Stealing down a wrong way street\n[00:51.328] For all the world like an urban toreador\n[00:54.787] She had wheels on on her feet\n[00:59.836] Well the cars do the usual dances\n[01:03.816] Sames old cruise and the kerbside crawl\n[01:07.935] But the rollergirl she's taking chances\n[01:12.194] They just love to see her take them all\n[01:16.093] No fears alone at night she's sailing through the crowd\n[01:20.193] In her ears the phones are tight\n[01:21.983] And the musics playing loud\n[01:28.003] Hallelujah here she comes queens rollerball\n[01:35.842] Enchante what can I say don't care at all\n[01:45.062] You know she used to have to wait around\n[01:47.372] She used to be the lonely one\n[01:52.842] But now that she can skate around town\n[01:56.682] She's the only one\n[02:00.572] No fears alone at night she's sailing through the crowd\n[02:04.721] In her ears the phones are tight\n[02:06.001] And the musics playing loud\n[02:10.861] She gets rock n roll a rock n roll station\n[02:16.391] And a rock n roll dream\n[02:19.911] She's making movies on location\n[02:24.790] She don't know what it means\n[02:27.299] But the music make her wanna be the story\n[02:31.149] And the story was whatever was the song\n[02:34.229] What it was\n[02:36.069] Rollergirl don't worry\n[02:40.259] D j  play the movies all night long\n[02:55.458] She tortures taxi drivers just for fun\n[02:58.608] She like to read their lips\n[03:01.748] Says toro toro taxi see ya tomorrow my son\n[03:07.158] I swear she let a big truck graze her hip\n[03:11.477] She got her own world in the city\n[03:15.287] You can't intrude on her\n[03:19.576] She got her own world in the city\n[03:23.436] Cos the citys been so rude to her\n[03:27.436] No fears alone at night she's sailing through the crowd\n[03:31.476] In her ears the phones are tight\n[03:33.016] And the musics playing loud\n[03:37.556] She gets rock n roll a rock n roll station\n[03:43.216] And a rock n roll dream\n[03:46.636] She's making movies on location\n[03:51.586] She don't know what it means\n[03:53.936] But the music make her wanna be the story\n[03:57.886] And the story was whatever was the song\n[04:00.766] What it was\n[04:02.776] Rollergirl don't worry\n[04:06.806] D j  play the movies all night long\n[04:23.246] Come slippin and a slidin\n[04:26.066] Lifes a rollerball\n[04:29.376] Slippin and a slidin\n[04:33.905] Skateaway thats all\n[04:45.418] Shala shalay hey hey skateaway\n[05:01.947] She's singing shala shalay hey hey\n[05:05.807] Skateaway",
