        "fullLyrics": "[00:48.52] High and dry in the long hot day\n[00:56.62] Lost and lonely every way\n[01:03.63] Got the flats all around me sky up above\n[01:12.11] Yes, I need a little water of love\n[01:19.38] I've been too long lonely and my heart feels pain\n[01:27.92] Crying out for some soothing rain\n[01:36.63] I believe I have taken enough\n[01:43.73] Yes, I need a little water of love\n[01:51.78] Water of love deep in the ground\n[01:55.35] But there ain't no water here to be found\n[01:59.69] Some day, baby, when the river runs free\n[02:03.24] It's gonna carry that water of love to me\n[02:08.04] \n[02:23.39] There's a bird up in a tree sitting up high\n[02:32.07] Just a-waiting for me to die\n[02:40.48] If I don't get some water soon\n[02:47.08] I'll be dead and gone in the afternoon\n[02:55.60] Water of love deep in the ground\n[02:59.13] But there ain't no water here to be found\n[03:03.67] Some day, baby, when the river runs free\n[03:07.16] It's gonna carry that water of love to me\n[03:11.91] \n[03:27.86] Once I had a woman I could call my own\n[03:35.51] Once I had a woman, now my woman she gone\n[03:43.34] Once there was a river, now there's a stone\n[03:51.62] You know it's evil when you're living alone\n[03:59.27] Water of love deep in the ground\n[04:02.61] But there ain't no water here to be found\n[04:07.25] Some day, baby, when the river runs free\n[04:10.68] It's gonna carry that water of love to me (carry that)\n[04:15.23] Water of love deep in the ground\n[04:18.99] But there ain't no water here to be found\n[04:23.25] Some day, baby, when the river runs free\n[04:26.86] It's gonna carry that water of love to me\n[04:31.62]",
