        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.79] Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\n[00:13.49] I'm begging of you, please, don't take my man\n[00:19.49] Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\n[00:25.96] Please don't take him just because you can\n[00:32.86] Your beauty is beyond compare\n[00:34.73] With flaming locks of auburn hair\n[00:36.94] With ivory skin, and eyes of emerald green\n[00:42.24] Your smile is like a breath of spring\n[00:45.42] Your voice is soft like summer rain\n[00:48.07] And I cannot compete with you, Jolene\n[00:53.88] He talks about you in his sleep\n[00:56.50] And there's nothing I can do to keep\n[00:58.84] From crying when he calls your name, Jolene\n[01:03.60] And I can easily understand\n[01:07.48] How you could easily take my man\n[01:09.56] But you don't know what he means to me, Jolene\n[01:15.67] Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\n[01:21.37] I'm begging of you, please, don't take my man\n[01:27.23] Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\n[01:33.10] Please don't take him just because you can\n[01:40.23] You could have your choice of men\n[01:42.30] But I could never love again\n[01:44.42] He's the only one for me, Jolene\n[01:50.03] I had to have this talk with you\n[01:53.14] My happiness depends on you\n[01:55.34] And whatever you decide to do, Jolene\n[02:01.21] Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\n[02:07.16] I'm begging of you, please, don't take my man\n[02:13.19] Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\n[02:19.26] Please don't take him even though you can\n[02:26.19] Jolene, Jolene\n[02:32.27]",
        "genre": [
            "Country"
        ],
