        "fullLyrics": "[00:05.51] Boots on the ground, heart in the sky\n[00:08.16] I'm living life not asking why\n[00:10.89] Wasn't raised on open fields or underneath the big blue sky\n[00:15.10] Haven't seen the world from every side\n[00:18.17] But I've felt the rain, I've felt the tide\n[00:23.11] Don't feel the urge to break away from what I know and who I've got\n[00:28.13] Some people spend their lifetime waiting for a sign from up above\n[00:32.61] But I found my purpose being with the people, the people that I love\n[00:39.41] Staring at the stars in the sky tonight\n[00:42.68] I am at a place where I belong\n[00:45.50] Never felt so much alive and we shout out this world is our home\n[00:50.36] I can feel it in the air tonight\n[00:52.95] I am at a place where I belong\n[00:55.56] My heart is open wide\n[00:57.65] And we shout out this world is our home\n[01:10.58] We all try our best to tell a story, people want to hear\n[01:15.33] Then you realize that silence is a sound you truly fear\n[01:20.32] And every scar that has been made won't fade in poetry and beer\n[01:26.64] Staring at the stars in the sky tonight\n[01:30.08] I am at a place where I belong\n[01:32.94] Never felt so much alive and we shout out this world is our home\n[01:37.91] I can feel it in the air tonight\n[01:40.02] I am at a place where I belong\n[01:42.94] My heart is open wide\n[01:45.38] And we shout out this world is our home\n[01:57.97] Feel the sun, feel the rain, touch the ground\n[02:02.96] See the stars, see the moon, kiss the sky\n[02:07.50] Staring at the stars in the sky tonight\n[02:10.04] I am at a place where I belong\n[02:12.77] Never felt so much alive and we shout out this world is our home\n[02:17.97] I can feel it in the air tonight\n[02:20.15] I am at a place where I belong\n[02:23.04] My heart is open wide\n[02:25.15] And we shout out this world is our home\n[02:31.15] This world is our home\n[02:35.91] This world is our home\n[02:38.06] Feel the sun, feel the rain, touch the ground\n[02:41.48] This world is our home\n[02:43.21] See the stars, see the moon, kiss the sky\n[02:46.48] This world is our home\n[02:49.86]",
