        "fullLyrics": "[00:33] Two hearts, a collision course\n[00:35] You can feel the heat radiating straight from the source\n[00:38] It's the kind of love, a natural force\n[00:41] You just grab onto the rocket and go\n[00:44] Mayday, they're about to crash\n[00:46] Falling into one another, better brace for the blast\n[00:50] When the future's just another point in the past\n[00:53] And the supernova's ready to blow\n[00:57] I thought I'd call just to let you know\n\n[01:02] (It could have been us)\n[01:04] Hey, you're breaking my heart\n[01:05] Tryna keep it all together while you pick it apart\n[01:09] (It could have been us)\n[01:10] Hey, don't wanna let go\n[01:11] But this wild ride's turned into a rodeo\n[01:15] (Should've known from the start)\n[01:17] You'd be the one to fuck me up\n[01:19] And leave me standing in the cold\n[01:21] (It could have been us)\n[01:23] Hey, I wish I was the one you loved\n[01:27] Then it could have been us (Mm)\n[01:35] Hey, it should have been us\n\n[01:42] They built a house and they made it a home\n[01:44] They've taken their vows and they set 'em in stone\n[01:47] A couple kids, backyard and a dog with a bone\n[01:50] We had the world in the palm of our hands\n\n[01:54] I thought I'd call to make you understand\n\n[01:59] (It could have been us)\n[02:01] Hey, you're breaking my heart\n[02:03] Tryna keep it all together while you pick it apart\n[02:06] (It could have been us)\n[02:07] Hey, don't wanna let go\n[02:09] But this wild ride's turned into a rodeo\n[02:12] (Should've known from the start)\n[02:14] You'd be the one to fuck me up\n[02:15] And leave me standing in the cold\n[02:19] (It could have been us)\n[02:20] Hey, I wish I was the one you loved\n[02:25] It should have been us\n\n[02:29] Oh\n[02:32] It should have been us\nOh\n[02:35] It could have been us\nHey\n\n[02:40] (It could have been us)\n[02:42] Hey, you're breaking my heart\n[02:44] Tryna keep it all together while you pick it apart\n[02:47] (It could have been us)\n[02:49] Hey, don't wanna let go\n[02:50] But this wild ride's turned into a rodeo\n[02:53] (Should've known from the start)\n[02:54] You'd be the one to fuck me up\n[02:57] And leave me standing in the cold\n[02:59] (It could have been us)\n[03:01] Hey, I wish I was the one you loved\n[03:04] Then it could have been us (Oh, yeah)\n[03:12] Hey, it should have been us (Ooh)\n[03:17] Then it could have been us",
