        "fullLyrics": "[00:44.910] It's my life take it or leave it\n[00:46.740] Set me free what's that crap papa-knew-it-all\n[00:49.440] I got my own life you got your own life\n[00:51.540] Live your life and set me free\n[00:53.190] Mind your business and leave my business\n[00:55.140] You know everything papa-knew-it-all\n[00:56.820] Very little knowledge is dangerous\n[00:58.890] Stop bugging me stop bothering me\n[01:00.720] Stop bugging me stop forcing me\n[01:02.580] Stop fighting me stop yelling me\n[01:04.530] It's my life\n[01:06.090] Chorus:\n[01:06.420] It's my life it's my life my worries!\n[01:12.000] It's my life it's my life my problems!\n[01:14.220] It's my life it's my life my worries!\n[01:17.610] It's my life it's my life my problems!\n[01:21.660] It's my life do you understand\n[01:24.000] I live the way I want to live\n[01:25.800] I make decisions day and night\n[01:27.720] Show me signs and good examples\n[01:29.700] Stop telling me how to run your business\n[01:31.590] Take a trip to east and west\n[01:33.240] You find that you don't know anything\n[01:35.250] Every's getting tired of you\n[01:36.960] Sometimes you have to look and listen\n[01:39.000] You can even learn from me\n[01:40.800] Little knowledge is dangerous\n[01:42.780] It's my life\n[01:50.850] (Repeat Chorus)\n[01:58.980] It's my life set me free\n[02:01.260] So you bed so you lie\n[02:03.180] What you see is what you get\n[02:05.070] Listen to people and sort things out\n[02:06.930] Things I do I do them no more\n[02:08.880] Things I say I say them no more\n[02:10.710] Changes come once in life\n[02:12.540] Stop bugging me stop bothering me\n[02:14.400] Stop bugging me stop forcing me\n[02:16.260] Stop fighting me stop yelling me\n[02:18.120] Stop telling me stop seeing me\n[02:20.100] It's my life.\n[02:35.610] (Repeat Chorus)\n[02:39.930] It's my life(x4)\n[02:40.350] Ohhhhhhhh yeah\n[02:41.340] It's my life...Stop bugging me stop bothering me\n[03:20.700] It's my life...Stop forcing me stop yelling at me\n[03:31.920] It's my life...it's my life(x2)\n[03:35.640] It's my life...Stop bugging me stop bothering me\n[03:39.630] It's my life...Stop",
