        "chorus": "G A Bm E",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "PRE CHORUS",
        "dateAdded": "2026-05-27T15:37:09.221Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:06.52] Baby, you can find me under the lights\n[00:10.83] Diamonds under my eyes\n[00:13.71] Turn the rhythm up, don't you wanna just come along for the ride?\n[00:17.55] Ooh, my outfit so tight, you can see my heartbeat tonight\n[00:21.58] I can take the heat, baby, best believe that's the moment I shine\n[00:26.31] 'Cause every romance shakes and it bends, don't give a damn\n[00:30.18] When the night's here, I don't do tears, baby, no chance\n[00:35.19] I could dance, I could dance, I could dance\n[00:39.86] Watch me dance\n[00:42.34] Dance the night away\n[00:44.90] My heart could be burnin', but you won't see it on my face\n[00:48.55] Watch me dance\n[00:51.31] Dance the night away\n[00:53.69] I'll still keep the party runnin', not one hair out of place\n[00:57.46] Lately I've been moving close to the edge\n[01:02.13] I'll still be lookin' my best\n[01:04.22] I stay on the beat, you can count on me, I ain't missin' no steps\n[01:08.75] 'Cause every romance shakes and it bends, don't give a damn\n[01:13.19] When the night's here, I don't do tears, baby, no chance\n[01:17.45] I could dance, I could dance, I could dance\n[01:21.78] Watch me dance\n[01:25.14] Dance the night away\n[01:27.44] My heart could be burnin', but you won't see it on my face\n[01:31.19] Watch me dance\n[01:33.89] Dance the night away\n[01:36.25] I'll still keep the party runnin', not one hair out of place\n[01:40.15] When my heart breaks (they never see it, never see it)\n[01:44.31] When my world shakes (I feel alive, I feel alive)\n[01:48.63] I don't play it safe\n[01:50.97] Don't you know about me?\n[01:53.25] I could dance, I could dance, I could dance\n[01:58.26] Even when the tears are flowin' like diamonds on my face\n[02:01.90] I'll still keep the party goin', not one hair out of place (yes, I can)\n[02:06.36] Even when the tears are flowin' like diamonds on my face (yes, I can, yes, I can)\n[02:10.90] I'll still keep the party goin', not one hair out of place\n[02:15.10] Watch me dance\n[02:17.47] Dance the night away\n[02:19.99] My heart could be burnin', but you won't see it on my face\n[02:23.48] Watch me dance\n[02:26.13] Dance the night away\n[02:28.13] I'll still keep the party runnin', not one hair out of place\n[02:32.58] When my heart breaks (they never see it, never see it)\n[02:36.66] When my world shakes (I feel alive, I feel alive)\n[02:41.14] I don't play it safe\n[02:43.17] Don't you know about me?\n[02:45.81] I could dance, I could dance, I could dance\n[02:50.06] Dance the night\n[02:52.78]",
