        "fullLyrics": "[00:19.33] There's talk on the street, it sounds so familiar\n[00:28.93] Great expectations, everybody's watching you\n[00:37.98] People you meet, they all seem to know you\n[00:47.07] Even your old friends treat you like you're something new\n[00:55.95] Johnny-come-lately\n[01:00.19] The new kid in town\n[01:04.83] Everybody loves you\n[01:08.97] So don't let them down\n[01:13.66] You look in her eyes, the music begins to play\n[01:23.25] Hopeless romantics, here we go again\n[01:31.93] But after awhile, you're lookin' the other way\n[01:39.05] It's those restless hearts that never mend (oh)\n[01:50.24] Johnny-come-lately\n[01:54.20] The new kid in town\n[01:59.16] Will she still love you\n[02:03.37] When you're not around?\n[02:09.10] \n[02:25.51] There's so many things you should have told her\n[02:34.48] But night after night, you're willing to hold her\n[02:39.95] Just hold her\n[02:42.41] Tears on your shoulder\n[02:47.63] There's talk on the street, it's there to remind you\n[02:56.81] Doesn't really matter which side you're on\n[03:05.17] You're walking away and they're talking behind you\n[03:12.49] They will never forget you 'til somebody new comes along\n[03:23.29] Where you been lately?\n[03:27.49] There's a new kid in town\n[03:32.12] Everybody loves him, don't they?\n[03:36.63] He's holding her and you're still around\n[03:43.38] Oh, my, my\n[03:47.05] There's a new kid in town\n[03:55.14] Just another new kid in town\n[04:05.90] (Ooh-ooh) everybody's talking 'bout the new kid in town (ooh-ooh)\n[04:14.89] (Ooh-ooh) everybody's walking like the new kid in town (ooh-ooh)\n[04:22.83] There's a new kid in town (I don't wanna hear it)\n[04:27.38] There's a new kid in town (I don't wanna hear it, ah-ooh)\n[04:31.75] There's a new kid in town\n[04:36.02] There's a new kid in town\n[04:40.52] There's a new kid in town (everybody's talking)\n[04:44.72] There's a new kid in town (people started walking)\n[04:49.39] There's a new kid in town (mm-hm-mm)\n[04:53.57] There's a new kid in town (mm-hm-mm)\n[04:58.05] There's a new kid in town\n[05:00.74]",
