        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.00] When your legs don't work like they used to before\n[00:14.77] And I can't sweep you off of your feet\n[00:17.93] \n[00:21.23] Will your mouth still remember the taste of my love?\n[00:24.66] \n[00:27.26] Will your eyes still smile from your cheeks?\n[00:31.06] And, darling, I will\n[00:34.62] Be loving you 'til we're 70\n[00:36.84] \n[00:43.39] And, baby, my heart\n[00:46.53] Could still fall as hard at 23\n[00:53.82] And I'm thinking 'bout how\n[00:56.57] People fall in love in mysterious ways\n[01:02.22] Maybe just the touch of a hand\n[01:08.43] Well, me, I fall in love with you every single day\n[01:14.74] And I just wanna tell you I am\n[01:19.73] So, honey, now\n[01:22.78] \n[01:25.09] Take me into your loving arms\n[01:30.89] Kiss me under the light of a thousand stars\n[01:37.19] Place your head on my beating heart\n[01:41.66] I'm thinking out loud\n[01:44.66] Maybe we found love right where we are\n[01:48.94] \n[01:52.23] When my hair's all but gone and my memory fades\n[01:58.24] And the crowds don't remember my name\n[02:04.24] When my hands don't play the strings the same way, mhm\n[02:10.62] I know you will still love me the same\n[02:14.77] 'Cause, honey, your soul\n[02:17.88] Could never grow old, it's evergreen\n[02:22.55] \n[02:27.10] And, baby, your smile's\n[02:30.54] Forever in my mind and memory\n[02:35.49] \n[02:38.11] I'm thinking 'bout how\n[02:39.67] People fall in love in mysterious ways\n[02:45.76] And maybe it's all part of a plan\n[02:51.97] Well, I'll just keep on making the same mistakes\n[02:58.07] Hoping that you'll understand\n[03:03.13] That, baby, now\n[03:08.20] Take me into your loving arms\n[03:11.64] \n[03:14.33] Kiss me under the light of a thousand stars\n[03:20.30] Place your head on my beating heart\n[03:25.02] I'm thinking out loud\n[03:27.93] And maybe we found love right where we are, oh-oh\n[03:35.01] \n[03:58.24] So, baby, now\n[04:02.64] Take me into your loving arms\n[04:06.50] \n[04:09.01] Kiss me under the light of a thousand stars\n[04:13.76] Oh, darling, place your head on my beating heart\n[04:19.58] I'm thinking out loud\n[04:22.56] That maybe we found love right where we are\n[04:28.59] Oh, baby, we found love right where we are\n[04:35.17] And we found love right where we are\n[04:39.81]",
