        "dateAdded": "2026-06-15T09:24:33.064Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:05.71] We're caught in a trap\n[00:10.22] I can't walk out\n[00:14.07] Because I love you too much, baby\n[00:23.05] Why can't you see\n[00:26.82] What you're doing to me\n[00:31.03] When you don't believe a word I say?\n[00:40.03] We can't go on together\n[00:43.73] With suspicious minds (suspicious minds)\n[00:47.93] And we can't build our dreams\n[00:52.13] On suspicious minds\n[00:56.33] So if an old friend I know\n[01:00.46] Stops by to say hello\n[01:04.61] Would I still see suspicion in your eyes?\n[01:13.39] Here we go again\n[01:17.19] Asking where I've been\n[01:21.39] You can't see the tears are real, I'm crying\n[01:26.17] (Yes I'm crying)\n[01:30.18] We can't go on together\n[01:33.97] With suspicious minds (suspicious minds)\n[01:38.14] And we can't build our dreams\n[01:42.35] On suspicious minds\n[01:47.74] Oh, let our love survive\n[01:53.30] I'll dry the tears from your eyes\n[01:58.19] Let's don't let a good thing die\n[02:03.32] When honey, you know I've never lied to you\n[02:09.46] Hum (ye, ye)\n[02:16.72] We're caught in a trap\n[02:20.67] I can't walk out\n[02:24.85] Because I love you too much, baby\n[02:32.98] Why can't you see\n[02:37.07] What you're doing to me\n[02:41.23] When you don't believe a word I say?\n[02:48.18] Well, don't you know I'm caught in a trap?\n[02:53.37] I can't walk out\n[02:57.56] Because I love you too much, baby\n[03:04.98] Well, don't you know I'm caught in a trap?\n[03:10.19] I can't walk out\n[03:14.05] Because I love you too much, baby\n[03:21.19] Don't you know I'm caught in a trap?\n[03:26.63] I can't walk out\n[03:30.70] Because I love you too much, baby\n[03:46.56]",
