        "fullLyrics": "[00:44.160] So the world goes round and round\n[00:47.632] With all you ever knew\n[00:51.588] They say the sky high above\n[00:56.310] Is Caribbean blue\n[01:21.013] If every man says all he can\n[01:26.022] If every man is true\n[01:30.666] Do I believe the sky above\n[01:35.290] Is Caribbean blue\n[01:39.040] Boreas\n[02:00.298] Zephryus\n[02:18.488] If all you told was turned to gold\n[02:23.065] If all you dreamed were new\n[02:27.558] Imagine sky high above\n[02:32.205] In Caribbean blue\n[02:37.072] Eurus\n[02:58.626] Afer Ventus\n[03:00.215] Zephryus\n[03:00.333] Boreas\n[03:02.693] Africus\n[03:04.374] Chords",
