        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:27.32] I've been meaning to tell you\n[00:31.93] I've got this feelin' that won't subside\n[00:40.62] I look at you and I fantasize\n[00:47.02] You're mine tonight\n[00:52.20] Now, I've got you in my sights\n[00:59.81] With these hungry eyes\n[01:06.63] One look at you and I can't disguise\n[01:10.87] I've got hungry eyes\n[01:15.05] I feel the magic between you and I\n[01:24.03] I want to hold you so hear me out\n[01:32.33] I want to show you what love's all about\n[01:39.49] Darling tonight\n[01:44.50] Now, I've got you in my sights\n[01:52.10] With these hungry eyes\n[01:58.64] One look at you and I can't disguise\n[02:02.87] I've got hungry eyes\n[02:07.76] I feel the magic between you and I\n[02:11.10] I've got hungry eyes\n[02:16.22] Now I've got you in my sights\n[02:21.19] With those hungry eyes\n[02:24.58] Now, did I take you by surprise?\n[02:35.57] I need you to see\n[02:43.24] This love was meant to be\n[02:43.64] I've got hungry eyes\n[03:08.24] One look at you and I can't disguise\n[03:12.27] I've got hungry eyes\n[03:16.95] I feel the magic between you and I\n[03:21.29] I've got hungry eyes\n[03:25.78] Now I've got you in my sights\n[03:30.14] With the hungry eyes\n[03:34.27] But did I take you by surprise?\n[03:38.31] With my hungry eyes\n[03:46.48] I'm dizzy, hungry eyes\n[03:51.99] Now, I've got you in my sights\n[03:56.11] With my hungry eyes\n[04:00.47]",
