        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.06] See if you can spot this one\n[00:02.96] \n[00:34.15] What will you do when you get lonely\n[00:39.21] And no one's waiting by your side?\n[00:44.57] You've been running and hiding much too long\n[00:49.71] You know it's just your foolish pride\n[00:53.12] Layla\n[00:56.94] You've got me on my knees, Layla\n[01:02.24] Begging darling please, Layla\n[01:07.31] Darling, won't you ease my worried mind?\n[01:13.34] \n[01:15.65] Tried to give you consolation\n[01:20.98] Your old man, he let you down\n[01:25.83] Like a fool, I fell in love with you\n[01:31.16] You turned my whole world upside down\n[01:34.45] Layla\n[01:38.19] You've got me on my knees, Layla\n[01:43.42] Begging darling please, Layla\n[01:48.46] Darling, won't you ease my worried mind?\n[01:54.04] \n[01:56.57] Make the best of the situation\n[02:01.65] Before I finally go insane\n[02:06.76] Please don't say we'll never find a way\n[02:12.00] Or tell me all my love's in vain\n[02:15.37] Layla\n[02:18.94] You've got me on my knees, Layla\n[02:24.10] Begging darling please, Layla\n[02:29.17] Darling, won't you ease my worried mind?\n[02:36.05] Layla\n[02:39.32] You've got me on my knees, Layla\n[02:44.30] Begging darling please, Layla\n[02:49.45] Darling, won't you ease my worried mind?\n[02:54.68] \n[03:35.31] Layla\n[03:38.37] You've got me on my knees, Layla\n[03:43.31] Begging darling please, Layla\n[03:48.36] Darling, won't you ease my worried mind?\n[03:55.38] Layla\n[03:58.29] You've got me on my knees, Layla\n[04:03.37] Begging darling please, Layla\n[04:08.20] Darling, won't you ease my worried mind?\n[04:18.78] \n[04:23.73] Thank you\n[04:24.93]",
