        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.76] Would you know my name\n[00:19.86] If I saw you in heaven?\n[00:26.23] Would it be the same\n[00:32.40] If I saw you in heaven?\n[00:39.03] I must be strong\n[00:45.25] And carry on\n[00:48.65] 'Cause I know I don't belong\n[00:55.48] Here in heaven\n[00:58.84] \n[01:09.73] Would you hold my hand\n[01:13.95] \n[01:16.22] If I saw you in heaven?\n[01:22.34] Would you help me stand\n[01:28.50] If I saw you in heaven?\n[01:35.29] I'll find my way\n[01:41.47] Through night and day\n[01:45.13] 'Cause I know I just can't stay\n[01:51.54] Here in heaven\n[01:55.26] \n[02:06.03] Time can bring you down\n[02:09.21] Time can bend your knees\n[02:13.18] \n[02:18.70] Time can break your heart\n[02:21.81] Have you begging please\n[02:26.13] Begging please\n[02:29.93] \n[02:56.38] Beyond the door\n[03:00.29] \n[03:02.66] There's peace, I'm sure\n[03:06.22] And I know there'll be no more\n[03:13.02] Tears in heaven\n[03:16.89] \n[03:27.48] Would you know my name\n[03:33.49] If I saw you in heaven?\n[03:39.80] Would you be the same\n[03:46.13] If I saw you in heaven?\n[03:52.66] I must be strong\n[03:56.79] \n[03:59.16] And carry on\n[04:02.50] 'Cause I know I don't belong\n[04:09.23] Here in heaven\n[04:10.81]",
