        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.05] Yep\n[00:00.49] \n[00:19.29] Well, I work all day\n[00:21.62] Puttin' myself half in the grave\n[00:23.94] And I ain't got nothin' to show for it\n[00:26.38] 'Cause I burn my pay\n[00:29.05] Late nights in the yard\n[00:30.73] Just tryna see how damn far it'll be\n[00:33.13] 'Til I can pack my things\n[00:35.48] And head out towards the stars\n[00:37.55] Where there's a payphone on the wall\n[00:39.65] And empty beer cans in the stalls\n[00:42.17] And there ain't nobody in here\n[00:44.32] With pourin' old blood alcohol\n[00:46.61] And I got the boys all with me\n[00:48.91] And we're all singin' along\n[00:51.14] And there ain't no place we'd rather be\n[00:53.56] Than right here at home\n[00:55.63] Oh-oh-oh, oh, oh, at home\n[01:00.23] Oh-oh-oh, oh, oh-oh\n[01:04.04] \n[01:23.23] Well, I'll say it once, and I'll say it twice\n[01:25.71] Them city lights shouldn't take over the sky\n[01:28.07] 'Cause I haven't seen a starlight all damn week\n[01:32.32] And my head is beatin', I'm tired of the heat\n[01:34.83] So I'll get on my own two feet and crack a couple cold ones\n[01:39.33] And sing real loud\n[01:41.38] Where there's a payphone on the wall\n[01:43.55] And empty beer cans in the stalls\n[01:45.89] And there ain't nobody in here\n[01:48.04] With pourin' old blood alcohol\n[01:50.39] And I got the boys all with me\n[01:52.57] And we're all singin' along\n[01:54.78] And there ain't no place we'd rather be\n[01:57.28] Than right here at home\n[02:00.10] Yes, sir\n[02:03.84] Oh-oh-oh, oh, oh\n[02:07.29] \n[02:17.77] And there'll be the beers and the tears\n[02:20.56] From laughin' too hard\n[02:23.26] We all know we're lucky to be right\n[02:27.01] Where we are\n[02:31.64] With that payphone on the wall\n[02:33.92] And empty beer cans in the stalls\n[02:36.17] And there ain't nobody in here\n[02:38.41] With pourin' old blood alcohol\n[02:40.66] And I got the boys all with me\n[02:42.99] And we're all singin' along\n[02:45.23] And there ain't no place we'd rather be\n[02:47.59] Than right here at home\n[02:52.05] (Oh, that's it)\n[02:52.86]",
