        "fullLyrics": "[00:43.86] I've gone through changes, I've gone through pain\n[00:48.18] But there's not enough reason for me to go insane\n[00:52.72] I know that feeling, just when it grows\n[00:57.48] I'm in a rage up from my head down to my toes\n[01:01.95] You know it ain't easy running out of thrills\n[01:06.42] You know it ain't easy when you don't know what you want\n[01:09.34] What do you want?\n[01:12.51] Whoa-oh-oh, you want to\n[01:15.28] Rock now, rock the night\n[01:17.59] 'Til early in the morning light\n[01:19.19] Rock now, rock the night\n[01:21.09] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh, yeah\n[01:23.82] Rock now, rock the night\n[01:26.63] You'd better believe it's right\n[01:28.58] Rock now, rock the night\n[01:30.35] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh\n[01:31.45] Oh-oh-oh-oh\n[01:37.90] I know my limit, just what it takes\n[01:42.59] When things ain't good enough I just pull the brake\n[01:46.73] Sometimes it's easy, sometimes so tough\n[01:51.58] But just have one thing clear I can't get enough\n[01:56.25] You know it ain't easy running out of thrills\n[02:00.42] You know it ain't easy when you don't know what you want\n[02:04.61] What do you want?\n[02:06.92] Whoa-oh-oh, you want to\n[02:09.29] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:12.08] 'Til early in the morning light\n[02:13.66] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:15.44] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh, yeah\n[02:18.11] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:21.36] You'd better believe it's right\n[02:22.81] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:24.79] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh\n[02:27.86] Yeah, yeah\n[02:31.39] Oh, rock now, rock the night\n[02:36.25] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:40.38] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:45.22] Rock now, rock the night\n[02:49.16] Rock it!\n[03:07.17] Oh, you know it ain't easy running out of thrills\n[03:12.72] You know it ain't easy when you don't know what you want\n[03:16.96] What do you want?\n[03:19.15] Whoa-oh-oh, you want to\n[03:21.34] Rock now, rock the night\n[03:24.38] 'Til early in the morning light\n[03:26.24] Rock now, rock the night\n[03:27.90] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh, yeah\n[03:30.53] Rock now, rock the night\n[03:33.74] You, you'd better believe it's right\n[03:35.18] Rock now, rock the night\n[03:36.85] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh\n[03:39.14] Yeah!\n[03:57.04] Rock\n[03:58.29] Rock now, rock the night\n[04:00.25] 'Til early in the morning light\n[04:01.66] Rock now, rock the night\n[04:03.47] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh, yeah\n[04:06.43] Rock now, rock the night\n[04:09.31] You, you'd better believe it's right\n[04:11.12] Rock now, rock the night\n[04:12.95] Whoa-oh, whoa-oh\n[04:18.07]",
