        "dateAdded": "2026-05-17T09:41:53.188Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:22.53] Saying \"I love you\"\n[00:26.31] Is not the words I want to hear from you\n[00:32.71] It's not that I want you\n[00:36.79] Not to say but if you only knew\n[00:43.10] How easy, it would be to show me how you feel\n[00:53.65] More than words is all you have to do to make it real\n[01:03.95] Then you wouldn't have to say that you love me\n[01:12.85] 'Cause I'd already know\n[01:19.95] What would you do\n[01:24.88] If my heart was torn in two?\n[01:30.02] More than words to show you feel\n[01:35.42] That your love for me is real\n[01:40.63] What would you say\n[01:45.68] If I took those words away?\n[01:50.93] Then you couldn't make things new\n[01:56.20] Just by saying \"I love you\"\n[02:03.52] La-di-da, da-di-da\n[02:06.83] Di-dai-dai-da\n[02:09.48] More than words\n[02:13.47] La-di-da, da-di-da\n[02:18.39] \n[02:22.75] Now that I've tried to\n[02:26.70] Talk to you and make you understand\n[02:33.43] All you have to do is close your eyes\n[02:40.38] And just reach out your hands and touch me\n[02:47.76] Hold me close, don't ever let me go\n[02:54.45] More than words is all I ever needed you to show\n[03:04.93] Then you wouldn't have to say that you love me\n[03:13.85] 'Cause I'd already know\n[03:22.04] What would you do\n[03:26.20] If my heart was torn in two?\n[03:31.46] More than words to show you feel\n[03:36.77] That your love for me is real\n[03:41.11] What would you say\n[03:47.28] If I took those words away?\n[03:52.45] Then you couldn't make things new\n[03:57.71] Just by saying \"I love you\"\n[04:02.95]",
        "genre": [
            "Rock"
        ],
