        "fullLyrics": "[00:07.33] A company\n[00:11.35] Always on the run\n[00:16.10] A destiny\n[00:19.72] Oh, it's the risin' sun\n[00:28.02] I was born\n[00:32.55] A shotgun in my hands\n[00:37.72] Behind the gun\n[00:40.96] I'll make my final stand, yeah\n[00:48.30] And that's why they call me\n[00:51.79] Bad company, I can't deny\n[00:59.05] Bad, bad company, 'til the day I die\n[01:07.29] Until the day I die\n[01:11.39] Until the day I die\n[01:18.55] Rebel souls\n[01:23.24] Deserters we've been called\n[01:28.24] Chose a gun\n[01:31.44] And threw away the sun, oh\n[01:40.54] Now these towns\n[01:44.08] Well, they all know our name\n[01:48.84] The death punch sound\n[01:52.61] Is our claim to fame\n[02:00.57] That's why they call me\n[02:03.32] Bad company, I can't deny\n[02:06.82] Bad, bad company, 'til the day I die\n[02:18.94] Until the day I die\n[02:23.36] Until the day I die\n[02:27.48] Until the day I die\n[02:33.29] Eye for an eye\n[02:35.78] Tooth for a tooth\n[02:38.63] Blood for blood\n[02:40.93] We've all gotta die\n[02:43.88] We've all gotta die\n[03:25.98] And that's why they call me\n[03:32.50] Bad company, I won't deny\n[03:39.60] Bad, bad company, 'til the day I die\n[03:48.56] Bad company, I won't deny\n[03:56.93] Bad, bad company, 'til the day I die\n[04:04.06] Until the day I die\n[04:08.22] Until the day I die\n[04:12.65] Until the day I die\n[04:16.96] Until the day I die\n[04:22.28]",
