        "fullLyrics": "[00:04.34] Can you hear me calling\n[00:34.35] Out your name?\n[00:36.14] You know that I'm falling\n[00:38.18] And I don't know what to say\n[00:40.13] I'll speak a little louder\n[00:42.32] I'll even shout\n[00:44.24] You know that I'm proud\n[00:46.10] And I can't get the words out\n[00:48.18] Oh, I\n[00:50.27] I want to be with you everywhere\n[00:55.82] Oh, I\n[01:00.63] I want to be with you everywhere\n[01:04.22] (Wanna be with you everywhere)\n[01:06.11] Something's happening\n[01:14.49] Happening to me\n[01:16.32] My friends say I'm acting peculiarly\n[01:20.03] Come on, baby\n[01:22.67] We better make a start\n[01:24.75] You better make it soon\n[01:26.42] Before you break my heart\n[01:28.12] Oh, I\n[01:32.18] I want to be with you everywhere\n[01:35.99] Oh, I\n[01:40.40] I want to be with you everywhere\n[01:45.13] (Wanna be with you everywhere)\n[01:47.06] Can you hear me calling\n[02:02.76] Out your name?\n[02:04.59] You know that I'm falling\n[02:06.72] And I don't know what to say\n[02:08.58] Come along, baby\n[02:10.68] We better make a start\n[02:12.27] You better make it soon\n[02:14.23] Before you break my heart\n[02:15.73] Oh, I\n[02:19.44] I want to be with you everywhere\n[02:24.37] Oh, I\n[02:28.35] I want to be with you everywhere\n[02:32.59] Oh, I\n[02:36.49] I want to be with you everywhere\n[02:40.33] Oh, I\n[02:44.56] I want to be with you everywhere\n[02:48.40] (Wanna be with you everywhere)\n[02:50.07]",
