        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.66] Loving you\n[00:06.11] Isn't the right thing to do\n[00:11.39] How can I\n[00:13.43] Ever change things that I feel\n[00:18.52] If I could\n[00:20.17] Baby, I'd give you my world\n[00:25.32] How can I\n[00:27.33] When you won't take it from me\n[00:32.54] (You can go your own way)\n[00:36.73] Go your own way\n[00:40.19] You can call it another lonely day\n[00:46.39] (You can go your own way)\n[00:50.89] Go your own way\n[00:53.76] Tell me why\n[00:56.26] Everything turned around\n[01:00.83] Packing up\n[01:02.64] Shacking up's all you wanna do\n[01:07.64] If I could\n[01:09.92] Baby, I'd give you my world\n[01:14.87] Open up\n[01:17.08] Everything's waiting for you\n[01:22.60] (You can go your own way)\n[01:26.44] Go your own way\n[01:29.90] You can call it another lonely day\n[01:36.87] (You can go your own way)\n[01:40.96] Go your own way\n[01:44.61] \n[02:12.47] (You can go your own way)\n[02:16.28] Go your own way\n[02:19.63] You can call it another lonely day\n[02:24.50] Another lonely day\n[02:26.73] (You can go your own way)\n[02:30.50] Go your own way\n[02:33.82] You can call it another lonely day\n[02:39.50] \n[03:17.23] You can go your own way\n[03:21.09] \n[03:23.64] You can call it another lonely day\n[03:30.64] You can go your own way\n[03:32.75]",
