        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.790] Sometimes I feel like throwing my hands up in the air\n[00:04.790] I know I can count on you\n[00:09.450] Sometimes I feel like saying \"Lord I just don't care\"\n[00:13.840] But you've got the love I need To see me through\n[00:18.100] Sometimes it seems that the going is just too rough\n[00:22.120] And things go wrong no matter what I do\n[00:26.500] Now and then it seems that life is just too much\n[00:31.250] But you've got the love I need to see me through\n[00:35.270] When food is gone you are my daily meal\n[00:44.279] When friends are gone I know my saviour's love is real\n[00:49.859] Your love is real\n[00:53.139] You got the love\n[00:55.169] You got the love\n[00:56.809] You got the love\n[01:01.639] You got the love\n[01:03.869] You got the love\n[01:05.619] You got the love\n[01:10.589] Time after time I think \"Oh Lord what's the use \"\n[01:14.398] Time after time I think it's just no good\n[01:19.338] Sooner or later in life  the things you love you loose\n[01:23.718] But you got the love I need to see me through\n[01:28.028] You got the love\n[01:30.088] You got the love\n[01:31.858] You got the love\n[01:36.718] You got the love\n[01:38.838] You got the love\n[01:40.548] You got the love\n[01:45.398] You got the love\n[01:47.618] You got the love\n[01:49.168] You got the love\n[01:54.138] You got the love\n[01:56.348] You got the love\n[01:58.048] You got the love\n[02:20.290] Sometimes I feel like throwing my hands up in the air\n[02:24.110] I know I can count on you\n[02:29.010] Sometimes I feel like saying \"Lord I just don't care\"\n[02:33.570] But you've got the love I need to see me through",
