        "fullLyrics": "[00:04.76] Baby you're a song\n[00:06.06] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[00:10.22] \n[00:21.02] \n[00:23.32] Yeah, when I first saw that bikini top on her\n[00:26.85] She's poppin' right out of the South Georgia water\n[00:30.13] Thought, \"Oh, good Lord, she had them long tanned legs\"\n[00:33.32] Couldn't help myself so I walked up and said\n[00:36.74] Baby you're a song\n[00:38.40] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[00:43.00] Down a back road blowin' stop signs through the middle\n[00:46.11] Every little farm town with you\n[00:49.32] In this brand new Chevy with a lift kit\n[00:52.83] Would look a hell lot better with you up in it\n[00:55.99] So baby you're a song\n[00:57.68] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[01:02.68] \n[01:08.87] She was sippin' on southern and singin' Marshall Tucker\n[01:12.15] We were falling in love in the sweet heart of summer\n[01:15.40] She hopped right up into the cab of my truck and said\n[01:18.94] \"Fire it up, let's go get this thing stuck\"\n[01:22.14] Baby you're a song\n[01:23.86] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[01:28.09] Down a back road blowin' stop signs through the middle\n[01:31.58] Every little farm town with you\n[01:34.80] In this brand new Chevy with a lift kit\n[01:37.79] Would look a hell lot better with you up in it\n[01:41.26] So baby you're a song\n[01:42.94] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[01:48.94] \n[02:00.69] When that summer sun fell to its knees\n[02:03.89] I looked at her and she looked at me\n[02:07.33] And I turned on those KC lights and drove all night\n[02:12.00] 'Cause it felt so right, her and I, man we felt so right\n[02:17.06] I put it in park and\n[02:18.69] Grabbed my guitar\n[02:20.37] And strummed a couple chords\n[02:22.09] And sang from the heart\n[02:23.85] Girl you sure got the beat in my chest bumpin'\n[02:27.00] Hell I can't get you out of my head\n[02:30.11] Baby you're a song\n[02:31.89] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[02:36.31] Down a back road blowin' stop signs through the middle\n[02:39.82] Every little farm town with you\n[02:43.10] Baby you're a song\n[02:44.83] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[02:49.25] Down a back road blowin' stop signs through the middle\n[02:52.30] Every little farm town with you\n[02:55.82] In this brand new Chevy with a lift kit\n[02:58.92] Would look a hell lot better with you up in it\n[03:02.05] Come on\n[03:03.02] Baby you're a song\n[03:04.26] You make me wanna roll my windows down and cruise\n[03:09.26] \n[03:11.80] Come on girl\n[03:13.79] Get those windows down and cruise\n[03:17.79] \n[03:21.05] Aww yeah\n[03:22.54]",
