        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.40] Say you will, say you won't\n[00:03.51] Make up your mind tonight\n[00:08.13] Say you do, say you don't\n[00:11.08] Wanna be mine\n[00:15.75] Say you will, say you won't\n[00:18.82] Make up your mind this time\n[00:23.12] Say you will, say you will\n[00:26.28] Be mine tonight\n[00:31.39] I can't sleep, I keep dreaming, I'm losing you\n[00:38.61] Feel so alone in the night, scared to open my eyes\n[00:45.94] I'm in too deep, I'm in over my head this time\n[00:53.56] Can't get you out of my mind no matter how hard I try\n[00:59.77] So won't you say you will, say you won't\n[01:04.70] Make up your mind tonight?\n[01:08.83] Say you will, say you won't\n[01:12.08] Be my guiding light\n[01:16.68] Say you will, say you won't\n[01:19.86] Make up your mind this time\n[01:24.24] Say you do, say you do\n[01:26.83] You wanna be mine\n[01:30.11] \n[01:32.14] I get the feeling, I've never been here before\n[01:39.27] 'Cause no one I've known's ever moved me the way that you do\n[01:45.55] And I know this is the real thing, it's all I've been searching for\n[01:53.99] I've put it all on the line, now I'm hoping you feel that way, too\n[02:00.78] And if you do\n[02:01.84] Why don't you say you will, say you won't\n[02:05.46] Make up your mind tonight?\n[02:09.71] Say you do, say you don't\n[02:12.87] Wanna be mine\n[02:16.98] Now will you say you will, you say you won't\n[02:20.61] Make up your mind this time?\n[02:25.07] Say you will, say you will\n[02:27.81] You'll be mine tonight\n[02:31.12] \n[02:35.86] Will you tell me how much I mean to you?\n[02:39.64] Will you say you always will be true?\n[02:44.66] I need more than a come-on sign\n[02:48.28] So won't you say you will be mine?\n[02:54.07] Now won't you say you will, say you won't\n[02:57.94] Make up your mind tonight?\n[03:02.38] Say you will, say you will\n[03:05.18] Be my guiding light\n[03:09.98] Say you will, say you will\n[03:13.13] Make up your mind this time\n[03:17.54] Say you do, say you do\n[03:20.29] You wanna be mine\n[03:23.66] (C'mon, c'mon)\n[03:25.62] Say you will\n[03:28.47] Make up your mind tonight\n[03:32.63] Say you will, say you will\n[03:35.66] Be mine tonight\n[03:38.59] \n[03:43.11] Be mine tonight\n[03:49.27] Say you will\n[03:50.54] Be mine tonight, yeah\n[03:56.67] Say you will\n[03:58.47] Be mine tonight\n[04:02.12] \n[04:04.32] Say you will\n[04:06.39] Say you will\n[04:06.93]",
