        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.98] Strumming my pain with his fingers\n[00:05.98] Singing my life with his words\n[00:11.19] Killing me softly with his song\n[00:15.21] Killing me softly with his song\n[00:20.43] Telling my whole life with his words\n[00:25.67] Killing me softly with his song\n[00:38.26] Yo (yeah, yeah)\n[00:40.16] This is Wyclef, Refugee Camp (L Boogie up in here)\n[00:42.42] Pra'zrel (Pra'zrel up in here)\n[00:44.45] Little Base sittin' up there on the bass (Refugees up in here)\n[00:47.73] While I'm on this, I got my girl L\n[00:51.47] One time (one time)\n[00:52.51] One time (one time)\n[00:53.85] Ayo L, you know you got the lyrics\n[00:59.38] I heard he sang a good song\n[01:04.43] I heard he had a style\n[01:09.50] And so I came to see him\n[01:12.65] And listen for a while\n[01:20.46] And there he was\n[01:22.32] This young boy, stranger to my eyes\n[01:30.79] Strumming my pain with his fingers (one time, one time)\n[01:34.17] Singing my life with his words (two times, two times)\n[01:39.49] Killing me softly with his song\n[01:43.31] Killing me softly with his song\n[01:48.71] Telling my whole life with his words\n[01:55.33] Killing me softly with his song\n[02:06.60] I felt all flushed with fever\n[02:12.56] Embarrassed by the crowd\n[02:17.32] I felt he found my letters\n[02:20.94] Then read each one out loud\n[02:27.55] I prayed that he would finish\n[02:32.31] But he just kept right on\n[02:36.62] Strumming my pain with his fingers (one time, one time)\n[02:41.64] Singing my life with his words (two times, two times)\n[02:46.81] Killing me softly with his song\n[02:51.24] Killing me softly with his song\n[02:56.42] Telling my whole life with his words\n[03:01.57] Killing me softly\n[03:08.22] With his song (yo, L Boog, take me to the bridge)\n[03:12.64] Bust it\n[03:14.43] Whoa\n[03:17.23] Whoa\n[03:20.62] Huh, huh-uh\n[03:23.35] La-la-la, la-la-la (la)\n[03:27.98] Whoa, la-ah (la, la)\n[03:33.20] Whoa, la-ah (la, la)\n[03:36.78] Yeah, ha, ha, ha (c'mon)\n[03:49.48] La (c'mon, c'mon, c'mon)\n[03:50.15] Strumming my pain with his fingers (yes, he was)\n[03:54.74] Singing my life with his words (mine)\n[04:01.49] Killing me softly with his song\n[04:06.24] Killing me softly with his song (yeah)\n[04:09.21] Telling my whole life (whole life) with his words (his words)\n[04:12.99] Killing me softly\n[04:19.36] With his song\n[04:25.32] Yo (strumming my pain), put your hands together\n[04:27.83] For L Boogie (yeah) from the Refugee Camp\n[04:28.55] (Singing my life with his words) Refugees up in here\n[04:28.88] (You know how we do) L Boogie up in here (yeah)\n[04:29.24] I said, L Boogie up in here (Wyclef, Prazrel) Wyclef, up in here\n[04:29.68] (Killing me softly with his song) my man Little Base\n[04:30.04] Pra'zrel up in here (Jerry one time), little T Rocks up in here\n[04:30.34] (Killing me softly) we got Warren up in here (this is how we)\n[04:30.80] Warren up, up in here (with his song)\n[04:32.39] Outsiders up in here (Refugee Camp)\n[04:34.16] (Telling my whole life)\n[04:35.54] We got Fallon up in here (Refugee Camp), Mulaney\n[04:36.61] Mulaney (with his words), Mulaney's up in here (yeah, Refugee Camp)\n[04:39.03] We got Val' up in here (killing me softly)\n[04:39.57] Everybody got a breaking point, kid\n[04:40.26] And they'll rat on you, the family niggas'll rat on you\n[04:40.66] That's why we gotta be prepared (yeah, motherfucker)\n[04:42.30] To take whoever out we need to (I told you I was gon' get you next)\n[04:42.56]",
