        "fullLyrics": "[00:19.54] When the fear takes you down\n[00:24.09] When the doubt takes you under\n[00:28.55] When you sink like a stone\n[00:33.06] And you can't breathe\n[00:37.71] When the tears take control\n[00:42.28] When the demons take over\n[00:46.77] Won't be in this alone\n[00:51.29] You got me\n[00:55.71] Oo-oo-oo\n[01:00.30] Oo-oo-oo, yeah\n[01:04.82] Oo-oo-oo\n[01:09.40] You got me\n[01:13.96] When the walls all cave in\n[01:18.42] When the nights all get colder\n[01:23.03] When you hang by a thread\n[01:27.55] Of sanity\n[01:32.00] Rest your head on my heart\n[01:36.51] And your pain on my shoulders\n[01:41.14] Make your way to my arms\n[01:45.30] 'Cause you got me\n[01:49.84] Oo-oo-oo\n[01:54.52] Oo-oo-oo, yeah\n[01:59.17] Oo-oo-oo\n[02:03.61] You got me\n[02:07.03] I'll be the one to lead you home\n[02:11.62] I'll be the one to keep you warm\n[02:16.23] I'll take you way out of the storms\n[02:19.71] When you can't stand\n[02:21.65] I'll stand up for you\n[02:26.38] When the fear takes you down\n[02:30.90] When the doubt takes you under\n[02:35.48] You're not in this alone\n[02:39.98] You got me\n[02:44.45] Oo-oo-oo\n[02:48.94] Oo-oo-oo, yeah\n[02:53.59] Oo-oo-oo\n[02:58.04] You got me, yeah\n[03:02.51] Oo-oo-oo\n[03:06.99] Oo-oo-oo, yeah\n[03:11.65] Oo-oo-oo\n[03:16.12] You got me\n[03:19.42] I'll be the one to lead you home\n[03:24.14] I'll be the one to keep you warm\n[03:28.68] I'll take you in out of the storms\n[03:32.34] When you can't stand\n[03:34.38] I'll stand up for you\n[03:40.03]",
