        "fullLyrics": "[00:26.283] I've had enough of danger\n[00:32.883] People on the streets\n[00:38.364] I'm looking out for angels\n[00:44.329] Just trying to find some peace\n[00:50.404] Now I think it's time\n[00:56.502] That you let me know\n[01:01.966] So if you love me say you love me\n[01:08.173] But if you don't just let me go\n[01:14.735] Cause teacher\n[01:17.836] There are things that I don't want to learn\n[01:25.836] And the last one I had\n[01:30.032] Made me cry\n[01:35.628] So I don't want to learn to hold you touch you\n[01:45.017] Think that you're mine\n[01:48.925] Because it ain't no joy\n[01:55.017] For an uptown boy\n[01:58.181] Whose teacher has told him goodbye goodbye goodbye\n[02:08.942] When you were just a stranger\n[02:15.226] And I was at your feet\n[02:21.133] I didn't feel the danger\n[02:26.131] Now I feel the heat\n[02:32.943] That look in your eyes\n[02:39.454] Telling me no\n[02:43.419] So you think that you love me\n[02:46.799] Know that you need me\n[02:50.304] I wrote the song I know it's wrong\n[02:52.925] Just let me go\n[02:57.405] And teacher\n[03:00.595] There are things that I don't want to learn\n[03:08.718] Oh the last one I had\n[03:13.898] Made me cry\n[03:18.498] So I don't want to learn to\n[03:20.554] Hold you touch you\n[03:27.874] Think that you're mine\n[03:31.689] Because it ain't no joy\n[03:37.820] For an uptown boy\n[03:41.001] Whose teacher has told him goodbye goodbye goodbye\n[04:26.096] So when you say that you need me\n[04:30.124] That you'll never leave me\n[04:33.128] I know you're wrong you're not that strong\n[04:36.379] Let me go\n[04:40.260] And teacher\n[04:43.447] There are things that I still have to learn\n[04:51.573] But the one thing I have is my pride\n[05:00.419] Oh so I don't want to learn to\n[05:03.534] Hold you touch you\n[05:10.676] Think that you're mine\n[05:14.504] Because there ain't no joy\n[05:20.606] For an uptown boy\n[05:24.101] Who just isn't willing to try\n[05:29.550] I'm so cold inside\n[05:36.380] Maybe just one more try",
