        "dateAdded": "2026-06-27T15:00:26.068Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:07.92] I got a little change in my pocket going jing-a-lang-a-ling\n[00:12.43] Want to call you on the telephone, baby, I give you a ring\n[00:17.11] But each time we talk I get the same old thing\n[00:20.87] Always, \"No huggy, no kissy, until I get a wedding ring\"\n[00:25.52] My honey, my baby, don't put my love upon no shelf\n[00:29.24] She said, \"Don't hand me no lines and keep your hands to yourself\"\n[00:33.69] \n[00:41.84] Cruel baby, baby, baby, why you want to treat me this way?\n[00:45.98] You know, I'm still your lover boy, I still feel the same way\n[00:50.15] That's when she told me a story 'bout free milk and a cow\n[00:54.40] And said, \"No huggy, no kissy, until I get a wedding vow\"\n[00:59.04] My honey, my baby, don't put my love upon no shelf\n[01:02.50] She said, \"Don't hand me no lines and keep your hands to yourself\"\n[01:06.92] \n[01:56.37] You see, I wanted her real bad and I was about to give in\n[02:00.68] And that's when she started talkin' about true love, started talkin' about sin\n[02:05.09] I said, \"Honey, I live with you for the rest of my life\"\n[02:09.20] She said, \"No huggy, no kissy, until you make me your wife\"\n[02:13.73] My honey, my baby, don't put my love upon no shelf\n[02:17.38] She said, \"Don't hand me no lines and keep your hands to yourself\"\n[02:22.16]",
