        "fullLyrics": "[00:18.88] I still change the station\n[00:20.91] Every time they play that song\n[00:26.85] Can't drive past your house\n[00:29.09] So I take the long way home\n[00:35.48] Your black leather jacket\n[00:37.57] Still hangin' in my closet\n[00:39.76] I wish that I could give it away\n[00:43.72] Oh even though you're gone, somehow you stay\n[00:52.57] And every other time a love said goodbye\n[00:56.54] I'd just shake it off, shake it off\n[01:01.12] Pour another drink so I don't feel a thing\n[01:04.92] I'd just shake it off, break it off\n[01:09.34] Erased all your numbers, blocked all your calls\n[01:13.89] Tried another lover, built up my walls\n[01:18.13] Told myself it's over, don't know what else I can do\n[01:25.43] I can't shake you\n[01:34.83] I didn't wanna be here\n[01:37.13] But my friends all love this bar\n[01:43.46] I don't wanna see you\n[01:45.43] But I'm wondering where you are\n[01:52.01] And why am I still keepin'\n[01:54.04] The shirt you used to sleep in\n[01:56.13] It's been sitting there for over a year\n[02:00.18] Oh, even though you left me, you're still here\n[02:08.92] And every other time a love said goodbye\n[02:12.83] I'd just shake it off, shake it off\n[02:17.61] Pour another drink so I don't feel a thing\n[02:21.34] I'd just shake it off, break it off\n[02:25.83] Erased all your numbers, blocked all your calls\n[02:30.34] Tried another lover, built up my walls\n[02:34.51] Told myself it's over, don't know what else I can do\n[02:41.83] I can't shake you\n[02:45.42] I can't shake you\n[02:47.28] No matter how hard I try\n[02:50.77] I can't shake you\n[02:53.88] I can't shake you\n[02:55.68] And I don't know why\n[03:00.33] And every other time a love said goodbye\n[03:03.91] I'd just shake it off, shake it off\n[03:08.54] Pour another drink so I don't feel a thing\n[03:12.38] I'd just shake it off, break it off\n[03:16.88] Erased all your numbers, blocked all your calls\n[03:21.33] Tried another lover, built up my walls\n[03:25.50] Told myself it's over, don't know what else I can do\n[03:32.74] I can't shake you\n[03:43.63] I can't shake you\n[03:48.80] No no, no no\n[03:52.00] I can't shake you",
