        "chorus": "E5 B5 F#5 B5 Bsus2 C#5",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "PRE-CHORUS",
        "dateAdded": "2026-06-21T08:57:00.403Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:47.92] I've been drivin' all night, my hands wet on the wheel\n[00:52.28] There's a voice in my head that drives my heel\n[00:56.98] It's my baby callin', sayin', \"I need you here\"\n[01:01.76] And it's a half past four and I'm shiftin' gear\n[01:07.04] When she is lonely and the longing gets too much\n[01:12.03] She sends a cable, coming in from above\n[01:16.74] Don't need no phone at all\n[01:19.48] We've got a thing that's called radar love\n[01:24.35] We've got a wave in the air\n[01:28.19] Radar love\n[01:48.38] The radio's playin' some forgotten song\n[01:53.03] Brenda Lee's \"Coming On Strong\"\n[01:57.76] The road has got me hypnotized\n[02:02.40] And I'm speedin' into a nude sunrise\n[02:07.77] When I get lonely and I'm sure I've had enough\n[02:12.58] She sends her comfort coming in from above\n[02:17.11] We don't need no letter at all\n[02:19.98] We've got a thing tthat's called a radar love\n[02:24.60] We've got a line in the sky\n[02:28.55] Radar love\n[04:53.64] No more speed, I'm almost there\n[04:58.15] Gotta keep cool, now gotta take care\n[05:02.87] Last car to pass, here I go\n[05:07.27] And the line of cars go down real slow, woah\n[05:11.74] And the radio played that forgotten song\n[05:16.87] Brenda Lee's \"Coming On Strong\"\n[05:20.27] And the newsman sang his same song\n[05:25.98] Oh, one more radar lover gone\n[05:31.23] When I get lonely and I'm sure I've had enough\n[05:35.83] She sends her comfort coming in from above\n[05:40.18] We don't need no letter at all\n[05:42.66] We've got a thing that's called radar love\n[05:47.42] We've got a line in the sky\n[05:51.87] We've got a thing that's called radar love\n[05:56.72] We've got a thing that's called\n[06:00.66] Radar love\n[06:02.30]",
