        "fullLyrics": "[00:12.10] And I'd give up forever to touch you\n[00:16.60] 'Cause I know that you feel me somehow\n[00:21.06] You're the closest to heaven that I'll ever be\n[00:25.93] And I don't wanna go home right now\n[00:30.96] And all I can taste is this moment\n[00:35.42] And all I can breathe is your life\n[00:39.95] And sooner or later, it's over\n[00:44.35] I just don't wanna miss you tonight\n[00:49.28] And I don't want the world to see me\n[00:53.97] 'Cause I don't think that they'd understand\n[00:58.66] When everything's made to be broken\n[01:03.27] I just want you to know who I am\n[01:08.12] \n[01:19.86] And you can't fight the tears that ain't coming\n[01:24.42] Or the moment of truth in your lies\n[01:29.31] When everything feels like the movies\n[01:33.85] Yeah, you bleed just to know, you're alive\n[01:38.84] And I don't want the world to see me\n[01:43.38] 'Cause I don't think that they'd understand\n[01:48.45] When everything's made to be broken\n[01:52.79] I just want you to know who I am\n[01:57.66] \n[03:30.32] And I don't want the world to see me\n[03:35.38] 'Cause I don't think that they'd understand\n[03:40.13] When everything's made to be broken\n[03:44.58] I just want you to know who I am\n[03:51.65] And I don't want the world to see me\n[03:56.03] 'Cause I don't think that they'd understand\n[04:00.67] When everything's made to be broken\n[04:04.97] I just want you to know who I am\n[04:09.65] I just want you to know who I am\n[04:14.26] I just want you to know who I am\n[04:18.96] I just want you to know who I am\n[04:23.95]",
