        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:11.87] I walk a lonely road\n[00:14.41] The only one that I have ever known\n[00:18.02] Don't know where it goes\n[00:20.15] But it's home to me, and I walk alone\n[00:24.86] \n[00:29.24] I walk this empty street\n[00:31.71] On the Boulevard of Broken Dreams\n[00:35.35] Where the city sleeps\n[00:37.59] And I'm the only one, and I walk alone\n[00:43.43] I walk alone, I walk alone\n[00:49.06] I walk alone, I walk a-\n[00:52.25] My shadow's the only one that walks beside me\n[00:58.19] My shallow heart's the only thing that's beating\n[01:03.82] Sometimes, I wish someone out there will find me\n[01:09.66] 'Til then, I walk alone\n[01:15.37] Ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah\n[01:21.45] Ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah\n[01:26.76] I'm walking down the line\n[01:29.40] That divides me somewhere in my mind\n[01:32.97] On the borderline\n[01:35.13] Of the edge, and where I walk alone\n[01:40.11] \n[01:44.10] Read between the lines\n[01:46.57] What's fucked up, and everything's alright\n[01:50.15] Check my vital signs\n[01:52.32] To know I'm still alive, and I walk alone\n[01:58.50] I walk alone, I walk alone\n[02:04.05] I walk alone, I walk a-\n[02:07.11] My shadow's the only one that walks beside me\n[02:12.97] My shallow heart's the only thing that's beating\n[02:18.61] Sometimes, I wish someone out there will find me\n[02:24.46] 'Til then, I walk alone\n[02:30.28] Ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah\n[02:36.30] Ah-ah, ah-ah, I walk alone, I walk a-\n[02:42.72] \n[03:07.27] I walk this empty street\n[03:10.00] On the Boulevard of Broken Dreams\n[03:13.53] Where the city sleeps\n[03:15.61] And I'm the only one, and I walk a-\n[03:19.11] My shadow's the only one that walks beside me\n[03:25.08] My shallow heart's the only thing that's beating\n[03:30.50] Sometimes, I wish someone out there will find me\n[03:36.35] 'Til then, I walk alone\n[03:41.83]",
