        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.72] Another turnin' point, a fork stuck in the road\n[00:20.41] Time grabs you by the wrist, directs you where to go\n[00:25.39] So make the best of this test, and don't ask why\n[00:30.41] It's not a question, but a lesson learned in time\n[00:35.14] It's somethin' unpredictable, but in the end is right\n[00:39.87] I hope you had the time of your life\n[00:44.83] \n[00:53.35] So take the photographs and still frames in your mind\n[00:57.92] Hang it on a shelf in good health and good time\n[01:02.92] Tattoos of memories, and dead skin on trial\n[01:08.08] For what it's worth, it was worth all the while\n[01:12.99] It's somethin' unpredictable, but in the end is right\n[01:17.60] I hope you had the time of your life\n[01:22.94] \n[01:51.63] It's somethin' unpredictable, but in the end is right\n[01:55.86] I hope you had the time of your life\n[02:00.66] \n[02:08.96] It's somethin' unpredictable, but in the end is right\n[02:13.89] I hope you had the time of your life\n[02:16.98]",
