        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.98] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[00:23.28] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[00:26.29] Take me home (I want you, please, take me home)\n[00:31.01] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[00:33.71] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[00:36.43] Take me home (I want you, please, take me home)\n[01:30.39] Just an urchin living under the street\n[01:32.17] I'm a hard case that's tough to beat\n[01:34.13] I'm your charity case, so buy me somethin' to eat\n[01:36.94] I'll pay you at another time\n[01:40.45] Take it to the end of the line\n[01:53.01] Rags and riches, or so they say, you gotta\n[01:54.82] Keep pushing for the fortune and fame\n[01:57.15] You know it's, it's all a gamble when it's just a game\n[01:59.51] You treat it like a capital crime\n[02:03.04] Everybody's doing their time\n[02:05.43] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[02:07.78] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[02:10.12] Oh, won't you please take me home? Yeah-yeah\n[02:14.93] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[02:17.63] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[02:19.63] Take me home\n[02:34.92] Strapped in the chair of the city's gas chamber\n[02:36.65] Why I'm here, I can't quite remember\n[02:39.08] The surgeon general says it's hazardous to breathe\n[02:41.11] I'd have another cigarette, but I can't see\n[02:44.68] Tell me, who you're gonna believe?\n[02:47.08] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[02:49.16] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[02:51.84] Take me home, yeah-yeah\n[02:56.10] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[02:58.65] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[03:01.62] I want you, please, take me home\n[03:06.39] Yeah\n[03:26.36] So far away\n[03:31.13] So far away\n[03:35.53] So far away\n[03:40.54] So far away\n[03:45.59] Captain America's been torn apart now\n[03:47.65] He's a court jester with a broken heart\n[03:50.28] He said, \"Turn me around and take me back to the start\"\n[03:52.34] I must be losin' my mind, \"Are you blind?\"\n[03:55.64] \"I've seen it all a million times\"\n[03:58.59] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[04:00.69] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[04:03.35] Take me home, yeah-yeah\n[04:07.75] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[04:10.41] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[04:13.04] I want you, please, take me home\n[04:17.47] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[04:19.55] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[04:22.15] Take me home, yeah-yeah\n[04:26.60] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[04:29.26] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[04:31.60] Oh, won't you please take me home?\n[04:40.59] Home\n[05:04.46] I wanna go, I wanna know\n[05:09.28] I want you, please, take me home\n[05:13.38] I wanna see how good it can be\n[05:18.03] I want you, please, take me home\n[05:22.12] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[05:24.47] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[05:27.06] Take me home (I want you, please, take me home)\n[05:31.44] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[05:33.57] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[05:36.11] I want you, please, take me home\n[05:39.97] Take me down, ooh yeah, spin me 'round\n[05:44.78] Oh, won't you please take me home?\n[05:49.47] I wanna see how good it can be\n[05:53.86] I want you, please, take me home\n[06:06.94] I wanna see how good it can be\n[06:11.65] Oh, oh, take me home\n[06:15.70] Take me down to the Paradise City\n[06:17.88] Where the grass is green and the girls are pretty\n[06:20.45] I want you, please, take me home (I want you, I want you, take me home)\n[06:24.99] I wanna go (I wanna), I wanna know (I wanna)\n[06:29.04] I want you, please, take me home\n[06:36.79] Baby, yeah\n[06:42.91]",
