        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.89] It was a rainy night\n[00:22.64] When he came into sight\n[00:27.62] Standing by the road\n[00:31.88] No umbrella, no coat\n[00:37.03] So I pulled up along side\n[00:41.83] And I offered him a ride\n[00:45.55] He accepted with a smile\n[00:50.47] So we drove for a while\n[00:55.17] I didn't ask him his name\n[00:59.69] This lonely boy in the rain\n[01:04.88] Fate, tell me it's right, is this love at first sight?\n[01:09.92] Please don't make it wrong, just stay for the night\n[01:14.63] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[01:18.69] Say you will, you want me too\n[01:23.88] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[01:28.31] I've got lovin' arms to hold on to\n[01:34.11] So we found this hotel\n[01:37.66] It was a place I knew well\n[01:41.33] We made magic that night\n[01:46.16] Oh, he did everything right\n[01:51.33] He brought the woman out of me\n[01:55.45] So many times, easily\n[02:00.06] And in the mornin' when he woke\n[02:05.29] All I left him was a note\n[02:09.17] I told him I am the flower, you are the seed\n[02:14.66] We walked in the garden, we planted a tree\n[02:19.58] Don't try to find me, please don't you dare\n[02:24.07] Just live in my memory, you'll always be there\n[02:28.73] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[02:33.21] One night of love was all we knew\n[02:37.95] All wanna do is make love to you\n[02:42.64] I've got lovin' arms to hold on to, oh\n[02:47.39] Ooh, we made love\n[02:51.24] \n[02:54.26] Love like strangers\n[02:56.79] All night long\n[03:00.72] We made love\n[03:05.29] Then it happened one day\n[03:08.23] We came 'round the same way\n[03:10.88] You can imagine his surprise\n[03:14.95] When he saw his own eyes\n[03:19.14] I said, \"Please, please understand\n[03:23.98] I'm in love with another man\n[03:28.48] And what he couldn't give me, oh-oh\n[03:33.85] Was the one little thing that you can\"\n[03:40.86] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[03:45.46] One night of love was all we knew\n[03:50.16] All I want to do is make love to you\n[03:54.96] C'mon, say you will, you want me, too\n[03:59.73] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[04:04.20] One night of love was all we knew\n[04:08.24] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[04:12.95] Say you will, baby, want me too\n[04:17.44] All night long (all I wanna do is make love to you)\n[04:22.18] All night long (all I wanna do)\n[04:27.04] All night long (all I wanna do is make love to you)\n[04:31.52] All night long (all I wanna do)\n[04:34.65] All I wanna do (is make love to you)\n[04:37.61] All I wanna do\n[04:41.49] All I wanna do\n[04:44.18] All I wanna do\n[04:46.32] All I wanna do is make love to you\n[04:50.94] One night of love was all we knew, yeah (all I wanna do)\n[04:55.12] (All I wanna do is make love to you)\n[04:59.42] All night long (all I wanna do)\n[05:02.50] All night long\n[05:03.34]",
