        "dateAdded": "2026-05-22T21:59:41.019Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.57] The snow glows white on the mountain tonight\n[00:17.46] Not a footprint to be seen\n[00:21.04] A kingdom of isolation\n[00:24.26] And it looks like I'm the queen\n[00:28.41] The wind is howling like this swirling storm inside\n[00:35.76] Couldn't keep it in, heaven knows I tried\n[00:42.48] Don't let them in, don't let them see\n[00:46.26] Be the good girl you always have to be\n[00:49.55] Conceal, don't feel, don't let them know\n[00:55.73] Well, now they know\n[00:59.04] Let it go, let it go\n[01:02.80] Can't hold it back anymore\n[01:06.18] Let it go, let it go\n[01:09.54] Turn away and slam the door\n[01:14.09] I don't care what they're going to say\n[01:20.03] Let the storm rage on\n[01:24.18] The cold never bothered me anyway\n[01:28.41] \n[01:31.31] It's funny how some distance makes everything seem small\n[01:38.06] And the fears that once controlled me can't get to me at all\n[01:45.55] It's time to see what I can do\n[01:49.16] To test the limits and break through\n[01:52.92] No right, no wrong, no rules for me\n[01:56.85] I'm free\n[02:00.33] Let it go, let it go\n[02:04.02] I am one with the wind and sky\n[02:07.44] Let it go, let it go\n[02:11.00] You'll never see me cry\n[02:15.11] Here I stand and here I'll stay\n[02:21.31] Let the storm rage on\n[02:25.69] \n[02:32.73] My power flurries through the air into the ground\n[02:39.83] My soul is spiraling in frozen fractals all around\n[02:46.89] And one thought crystallizes like an icy blast\n[02:53.88] I'm never going back, the past is in the past\n[03:01.67] Let it go, let it go\n[03:05.25] And I'll rise like the break of dawn\n[03:08.80] Let it go, let it go\n[03:12.53] That perfect girl is gone\n[03:16.54] Here I stand in the light of day\n[03:24.66] Let the storm rage on\n[03:30.39] The cold never bothered me anyway\n[03:32.76]",
