        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.03] When the days are cold\n[00:02.89] And the cards all fold\n[00:05.59] And the saints we see are all made of gold\n[00:10.97] When your dreams all fail\n[00:13.45] And the ones we hail\n[00:16.10] Are the worst of all, and the blood's run stale\n[00:22.63] I wanna hide the truth\n[00:25.64] I wanna shelter you\n[00:28.26] But with the beast inside\n[00:30.79] There's nowhere we can hide\n[00:33.48] No matter what we breed\n[00:36.10] We still are made of greed\n[00:38.89] This is my kingdom come\n[00:41.46] This is my kingdom come\n[00:44.44] When you feel my heat, look into my eyes\n[00:49.59] It's where my demons hide\n[00:52.29] It's where my demons hide\n[00:55.14] Don't get too close, it's dark inside\n[00:59.90] It's where my demons hide\n[01:02.66] It's where my demons hide\n[01:04.79] At the curtain's call\n[01:06.77] It's the last of all\n[01:09.60] When the lights fade out, all the sinners crawl\n[01:14.64] So they dug your grave\n[01:17.40] And the masquerade\n[01:20.21] Will come calling out at the mess you've made\n[01:26.79] Don't wanna let you down\n[01:29.41] But I am hell-bound\n[01:32.12] Though this is all for you\n[01:34.80] Don't wanna hide the truth\n[01:37.53] No matter what we breed\n[01:40.15] We still are made of greed\n[01:42.80] This is my kingdom come\n[01:45.42] This is my kingdom come\n[01:48.52] When you feel my heat, look into my eyes\n[01:53.45] It's where my demons hide\n[01:56.12] It's where my demons hide\n[01:59.26] Don't get too close, it's dark inside\n[02:04.20] It's where my demons hide\n[02:06.89] It's where my demons hide\n[02:09.46] They say it's what you make\n[02:12.18] I say it's up to fate\n[02:14.89] It's woven in my soul\n[02:17.45] I need to let you go\n[02:20.14] Your eyes, they shine so bright\n[02:22.84] I wanna save that light\n[02:25.44] I can't escape this now\n[02:28.14] Unless you show me how\n[02:31.19] When you feel my heat, look into my eyes\n[02:36.14] It's where my demons hide\n[02:38.81] It's where my demons hide\n[02:41.77] Don't get too close, it's dark inside\n[02:46.82] It's where my demons hide\n[02:49.32] It's where my demons hide\n[02:51.57]",
