        "fullLyrics": "[00:28.04] I'm waking up to ash and dust\n[00:31.98] I wipe my brow, and I sweat my rust\n[00:35.55] I'm breathing in the chemicals\n[00:39.40] \n[00:42.89] I'm breaking in, shaping up\n[00:46.03] Then checking out on the prison bus\n[00:49.58] This is it, the apocalypse, woah\n[00:54.65] I'm waking up\n[00:56.66] I feel it in my bones\n[00:59.58] Enough to make my system blow\n[01:03.23] Welcome to the new age, to the new age\n[01:07.02] Welcome to the new age, to the new age\n[01:10.62] Woah-oh-oh-oh, oh\n[01:12.25] Whoa-oh-oh-oh, I'm\n[01:13.96] Radioactive, radioactive\n[01:17.42] Whoa-oh-oh-oh, oh\n[01:19.03] Whoa-oh-oh-oh, I'm\n[01:20.74] Radioactive, radioactive\n[01:24.61] I raise my flag, dye my clothes\n[01:28.58] It's a revolution, I suppose\n[01:31.93] We're painted red to fit right in, woah\n[01:38.84] I'm breaking in, shaping up\n[01:42.33] Then checking out on the prison bus\n[01:45.58] This is it, the apocalypse, woah\n[01:50.96] I'm waking up\n[01:53.10] I feel it in my bones\n[01:55.05] Enough to make my system blow\n[01:58.70] Welcome to the new age, to the new age\n[02:02.67] Welcome to the new age, to the new age\n[02:06.18] Woah-oh-oh-oh, oh\n[02:08.09] Woah-oh-oh-oh, I'm\n[02:09.61] Radioactive, radioactive\n[02:12.63] Woah-oh-oh-oh, oh\n[02:15.97] Woah-oh-oh-oh, I'm\n[02:17.07] Radioactive, radioactive\n[02:20.58] All systems go\n[02:23.51] The sun hasn't died\n[02:27.34] Deep in my bones\n[02:30.52] Straight from inside\n[02:33.49] I'm waking up\n[02:34.69] I feel it in my bones\n[02:37.86] Enough to make my system blow\n[02:41.31] Welcome to the new age, to the new age\n[02:44.95] Welcome to the new age, to the new age\n[02:48.76] Woah-oh-oh-oh, oh\n[02:50.59] Woah-oh-oh-oh, I'm\n[02:52.44] Radioactive, radioactive\n[02:55.85] Woah-oh-oh-oh, oh\n[02:57.61] Woah-oh-oh-oh, I'm\n[02:59.54] Radioactive, radioactive\n[03:02.97]",
