        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:57.34] Don't ask me\n[01:00.70] What you know is true\n[01:03.53] Don't have to tell you\n[01:08.25] I love your precious heart\n[01:11.88] I\n[01:15.16] I was standing\n[01:18.84] You were there\n[01:22.23] Two worlds collided\n[01:25.88] And they could never tear us apart\n[01:30.28] \n[01:41.06] We could live\n[01:45.16] For a thousand years\n[01:48.57] But if I hurt you\n[01:52.13] I'd make wine from your tears\n[01:56.11] I told you\n[01:59.52] That we could fly\n[02:03.94] 'Cause we all have wings\n[02:07.17] But some of us don't know why\n[02:11.94] \n[02:15.43] I was standing\n[02:18.72] You were there\n[02:21.73] Two worlds collided\n[02:25.22] And they could never, ever tear us apart\n[02:32.78] \n[02:55.37] I (Don't ask me)\n[02:58.02] I was standing (You know it's true)\n[03:01.84] Mm, you were there (Worlds collided)\n[03:04.94] Two worlds collided (We're shining through)\n[03:09.09] And they could never tear us apart\n[03:13.95] You (Don't ask me)\n[03:17.50] You were standing (You know it's true)\n[03:20.55] I was there (Worlds collided)\n[03:24.20] Two worlds collided (We're shining through)\n[03:26.87] And they could never tear us apart\n[03:31.59] I-I-I\n[03:35.08] I was standing\n[03:39.21] You were there\n[03:39.63]",
