        "dateAdded": "2026-04-24T13:19:37.638Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:46.89] I rest my head\n[00:54.81] Between the bed and sky.\n[01:03.60] Download my dread,\n[01:11.62] Disarm my mind, make it dry.\n[01:19.59] There's nothing in motion, and I'm satisfied.\n[01:28.26] And no disappointment 'til I wake up.\n[01:37.02] I don't want to wake up.\n[01:53.63] Into clear space.\n[02:01.45] Vivid vision, see her shape.\n[02:10.10] At my bedside,\n[02:18.51] Beam up my mind, please.\n[02:26.95] There's nothing in motion, I'm not satisfied.\n[02:34.90] And no disappointment 'til I wake up.\n[02:43.54] There's nothing in motion, and I'm satisfied.\n[02:52.02] And no disappointment 'til I wake up.\n[03:01.07] I don't want to wake up.\n[03:04.21] Hooooh\n[03:16.43] Hooooh\n[03:25.72] There's nothing in motion, I'm not satisfied.\n[03:34.03] And no disappointment 'til I wake up.\n[03:41.91] There's nothing in motion, and I'm satisfied.\n[03:50.64] And no disappointment 'til I wake up.\n[03:57.38] I don't want to wake up.\n[04:05.10] I don't want to wake up.\n[04:14.88] Hooooh\n[04:22.99] Hooooh\n[04:32.55] I don't want to wake up,\n[04:37.74] No.\n[04:43.19]",
