        "fullLyrics": "[00:28.702] Who's to say what's impossible \n[00:33.027] Well they forgot this world keeps spinning\n[00:37.282] And with each new day\n[00:40.544] I can feel a change in everything\n[00:45.270] And as the surface breaks reflections fade\n[00:49.966] But in some ways they remain the same\n[00:54.600] And as my mind begins to spread its wings\n[00:59.280] There's no stopping curiosity\n[01:03.948] I want to turn the whole thing upside down\n[01:08.668] I'll find the things they say just can't be found\n[01:13.246] I'll share this love I find with everyone\n[01:17.938] We'll sing and dance to Mother Nature's songs\n[01:22.524] I don't want this feeling to go away\n[01:43.490] Who's to say I can't do everything \n[01:47.896] Well I can try  and as I roll along I begin to find\n[01:55.469] Things aren't always just what they seem\n[02:00.145] I want to turn the whole thing upside down\n[02:04.842] I'll find the things they say just can't be found\n[02:09.568] I'll share this love I find with everyone\n[02:14.231] We'll sing and dance to Mother Nature's song\n[02:18.926] This world keeps spinning and there's no time to waste\n[02:25.085] Well it all keeps spinning  spinning\n[02:29.170] Round and round and upside down\n[02:32.910] Who's to say what's impossible and can't be found \n[02:37.577] I don't want this feeling to go away\n[02:47.153] Please don't go away\n[02:56.626] Please don't go away\n[03:05.975] Please don't go away\n[03:15.046] Is this how it's supposed to be \n[03:20.826] Is this how it's supposed to be",
        "id": "1776252325100jfhchlfzj",
