        "dateAdded": "2026-06-11T20:38:28.650Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:12.63] I heard you got yourself a date already.\n[00:16.25] Funny thought you needed your space just five nights ago.\n[00:25.40] You'll probably take her to our favorite spot,\n[00:29.02] Blanket down, on the ground, chicken from your mommas stove,\n[00:36.32] And when you pull her in close...\n[00:40.85] I hope it rains on you,\n[00:45.32] Maybe a little bit of lightning too.\n[00:48.96] And I hope it comes a flood, lots of mud,\n[00:52.60] Messin' up your whole day.\n[00:58.09] I hope it rains.\n[01:08.05] Don't get me wrong I hope she's really the one.\n[01:11.68] And if it's love you know I wish you the best.\n[01:20.69] You'll probably have yourself an outside wedding,\n[01:24.35] Violins, all our friends, and her in her pretty white dress.\n[01:31.54] And right before that first kiss...\n[01:36.04] I hope it rains on you,\n[01:39.64] Maybe a little bit of lightning too.\n[01:44.14] And I hope it comes a flood, lots of mud,\n[01:47.88] Messin' up your whole day.\n[01:53.24] I hope it rains,\n[01:57.81] And I hope it rains...\n[02:02.37] I hope it rains,\n[02:04.12] Hope it pours,\n[02:05.92] I hope shes in heels, and some little white shorts.\n[02:10.44] You cant find the keys to unlock your door...\n[02:16.76] And I hope it rains on you,\n[02:21.37] Maybe a little bit of lightning too.\n[02:25.00] And I hope it comes a flood, lots of mud,\n[02:28.58] Messin' up your whole day.\n[02:33.92] I hope it rains,\n[02:38.52] And I hope it rains.\n[02:42.18]",
