        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.50] I toss and turn, I'm losing sleep\n[00:11.59] Can't seem to make any sense of anything\n[00:15.76] I keep wandering around in circles, in a daze\n[00:25.16] Just when I start awakeneing\n[00:28.44] I find that something's intoxicating me\n[00:32.41] Til' I'm tangled up, lost inside a maze\n[00:40.17] I can't outrun it\n[00:44.71] Just keeps comin'\n[00:48.82] Girl, your love is relentless\n[00:58.54] Just like the waves against the sand\n[01:01.64] Over and over and time and time again\n[01:06.71] Your love keeps on reaching out to me\n[01:13.45] I can't outrun it\n[01:18.08] Just keeps comin'\n[01:22.23] Girl your love is, relentless\n[01:30.66] I can't fight it\n[01:34.65] There's no hiding\n[01:38.59] Girl your love is, relentless\n[01:49.32] I'm staring at a hurricane\n[01:53.66] A hundred miles of driving rain\n[01:58.27] I just smile and lean into the wind\n[02:03.45] Cause' I can't outrun it\n[02:11.21] \n[02:20.16] I can't outrun it\n[02:24.70] Just keeps comin'\n[02:28.97] Girl, your love is relentless\n[02:37.43] I can't fight it\n[02:41.50] There's no hiding\n[02:45.67] Girl, your love is relentless\n[02:55.55] I toss and turn, I'm losing sleep\n[02:58.52] Can't seem to make any sense of anything\n[03:02.70] I keep wandering round in circles, in a daze\n[03:11.75] Just when I start awakening\n[03:15.21] I find that something's intoxicating me\n[03:19.37] Till I'm tangled up, lost inside a maze\n[03:32.21]",
