        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.09] Tell 'em all I'm on vacation\n[00:22.04] Say I went to visit friends\n[00:26.86] \n[00:29.01] That you ain't heard or seen from me in quite a while\n[00:35.09] When they ask you where I've been\n[00:42.05] Tell 'em I'm out on the West Coast, where it don't ever rain\n[00:50.02] And that I'm probably doing fine\n[00:55.02] Just don't tell 'em I've gone crazy\n[01:03.04] That I'm still strung out over you\n[01:09.08] Tell 'em anything you want to\n[01:13.04] Just don't tell 'em all the truth\n[01:17.08] Yeah, don't tell 'em all the truth\n[01:22.38] \n[01:26.04] Tell 'em all I'm out in Vegas\n[01:32.04] Blowin' every dollar I ever made\n[01:39.09] Tell 'em that I must be into something bad for me cause\n[01:46.09] I sure lost a lot of weight\n[01:52.05] Tell 'em I'm out on the road with some old rock and roll band\n[02:00.04] Living like a gypsy can\n[02:06.01] Just don't tell 'em I've gone crazy\n[02:13.03] That I'm still strung out over you\n[02:19.06] Tell 'em anything you want to\n[02:23.05] Just don't tell 'em all the truth\n[02:27.05] Yeah, don't tell 'em all the truth\n[02:32.32] \n[02:36.00] The truth is that I'm asking you to lie\n[02:41.06] And we both know that it ain't right\n[02:44.00] But if you ever loved me please\n[02:49.09] Have some mercy on me\n[02:53.06] Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[03:00.73] \n[03:03.08] Tell 'em anything you want to\n[03:07.07] Just don't tell 'em all the truth\n[03:11.02] Yeah, don't tell 'em all the truth\n[03:17.02] I still need you\n[03:21.07] Yeah, that's the truth\n[03:24.36] \n[03:27.06] I still love you\n[03:30.47] \n[03:33.04] Baby, that's the truth\n[03:34.81]",
