        "chorus": "B C#m G#m E",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "CHORUS",
        "dateAdded": "2026-04-24T13:16:14.775Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.29] It's late at night, all lights are down\n[00:11.80] It's me coming home\n[00:16.58] I refrain from calling your name\n[00:19.58] But you already know\n[00:24.45] Cause mama said he'll be back after midnight\n[00:27.94] And kiss you goodnight\n[00:32.80] As I stand here watching you dreaming\n[00:37.24] It cuts like a knife\n[00:40.22] Please forgive me\n[00:45.89] I know daddy doesn't see you that much\n[00:49.85] Please know that I will never leave you\n[00:53.92] Hope you sense that I love you so much\n[00:57.92] That even when I'm away I'm with you\n[01:02.04] I'm here pouring my heart out to you\n[01:05.08] While you're fast asleep\n[01:10.14] Holding on to a glimmer of hope\n[01:13.28] That it will be received\n[01:17.74] Please forgive me\n[01:23.24] I know daddy doesn't see you that much\n[01:27.29] Please know that I will never leave you\n[01:31.39] Hope you sense that I love you so much\n[01:35.45] That even when I'm away I'm with you\n[01:39.44] In everything you do I see myself in you\n[01:43.51] And for every time I failed, I'm sorry\n[01:47.53] Every waste of day that I slipped away\n[01:51.56] I will make it up to you, I'm sorry\n[01:57.19] \n[02:06.75] I know daddy doesn't see you that much\n[02:10.75] Please know that I will never leave you\n[02:14.70] Hope you sense that I love you so much\n[02:18.86] That even when I'm away I'm with you\n[02:22.80] In everything you do I see myself in you\n[02:26.99] And for every time I failed, I'm sorry\n[02:31.06] Only time will tell if you'll be proud as well\n[02:35.08] No regrets and know I'll say I'm sorry\n[02:39.55]",
