        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.66] Maybe it's the fact we grew up\n[00:12.26] Wilder than a field of horses\n[00:17.21] Or the way we can rise with the sun\n[00:19.98] And still rock till two in the morning\n[00:25.37] Yeah, if you wonder where\n[00:26.89] Them down home boys will be\n[00:29.81] It ain't no mystery\n[00:32.41] If you're looking for bees just go find honey\n[00:36.72] If you're looking for rich folks, go find money, oh, oh\n[00:42.39] It's the same all around the world\n[00:46.56] Country boys love country girls\n[00:50.52] (Country boys love country girls)\n[00:54.93] (Country boys love country girls)\n[00:58.85] Maybe it's the way we can hang\n[01:01.70] Drink-for-drink with the guys at the dive bar\n[01:06.01] Or the way our kisses taste strawberry wine sweet\n[01:10.14] That makes 'em wanna be wherever we are\n[01:14.50] If you're looking for bees just go find honey\n[01:18.54] If you're looking for rich folks, go find money, oh, oh\n[01:24.12] It's the same all around the world\n[01:28.37] Country boys love country girls\n[01:31.31] Like a moth into a fire\n[01:35.33] It's just a natural desire, oh, oh\n[01:40.72] It's the same all around the world\n[01:45.03] Country boys love country girls\n[01:57.01] Yeah, if you wonder where\n[01:58.54] Them down home boys will be\n[02:01.68] It ain't no mystery\n[02:04.50] If you're looking for bees just go find honey\n[02:08.58] If you're looking for rich folks, go find money, oh, oh\n[02:14.18] It's the same all around the world\n[02:18.35] Country boys love country girls\n[02:21.54] It don't matter what we're wearin'\n[02:25.40] Yeah, when we're dancin' they'll be starin', oh, oh\n[02:30.64] It's the same all around the world\n[02:34.91] Country boys love country girls\n[02:39.19] (Country boys love country girls) They love country girls\n[02:43.35] (Country boys love country girls)\n[02:47.42] (Country boys love country girls) They love country girls\n[02:51.62] (Country boys love country girls)\n[02:56.04]",
