        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.35] Okay, Coconut man, Moonheads and Pea\n[00:10.15] You ready?\n[00:13.00] Seems like everybody's got a price\n[00:15.96] I wonder how they sleep at night\n[00:18.40] When the sale comes first and the truth comes second\n[00:21.39] Just stop for a minute and smile\n[00:24.36] Why is everybody so serious?\n[00:27.18] Acting so damn mysterious\n[00:29.67] Got shades on your eyes\n[00:30.92] And your heels so high that you can't even have a good time\n[00:35.42] Everybody look to their left\n[00:38.07] Everybody look to their right\n[00:40.36] Can you feel that? Yeah\n[00:42.04] We're paying with love tonight\n[00:43.96] It's not about the money, money, money\n[00:46.91] We don't need your money, money, money\n[00:49.36] We just wanna make the world dance\n[00:52.38] Forget about the price tag\n[00:55.06] Ain't about the, uh, cha-ching cha-ching\n[00:58.15] Ain't about the, yeah, ba-bling ba-bling\n[01:00.83] Wanna make the world dance\n[01:03.24] Forget about the price tag\n[01:06.51] Okay\n[01:08.19] We need to take it back in time\n[01:10.74] When music made us all unite\n[01:13.49] And it wasn't low blows and video hoes\n[01:16.33] Am I the only the one getting tired?\n[01:19.28] Why is everybody so obsessed?\n[01:21.91] Money can't buy us happiness\n[01:24.46] Can we all slow down and enjoy right now?\n[01:27.25] Guarantee we'll be feeling alright\n[01:30.26] Everybody look to their left (to their left)\n[01:32.92] Everybody look to their right (to their right)\n[01:35.35] Can you feel that? Yeah\n[01:36.93] We're paying with love tonight\n[01:38.82] It's not about the money, money, money\n[01:41.74] We don't need your money, money, money\n[01:44.10] We just wanna make the world dance\n[01:47.10] Forget about the price tag\n[01:50.02] Ain't about the, uh, cha-ching cha-ching\n[01:52.93] Ain't about the, yeah, ba-bling ba-bling\n[01:55.64] Wanna make the world dance\n[01:58.09] Forget about the price tag\n[02:00.58] Yeah, yeah, well, keep the price tag and take the cash back\n[02:03.98] Just give me six strings (six strings) and a half-stack (half stack)\n[02:06.86] And you can, can keep the cars, leave me the garage\n[02:09.50] And all I, yes, all I need are keys and guitars\n[02:12.13] And guess what? In thirty seconds, I'm leaving to Mars (Mars)\n[02:15.04] Yeah, we leaping across these undefeatable odds (odds)\n[02:17.66] It's like this, man, you can't put a price on a life (na-ah)\n[02:20.89] We do this for the love, so we fight and sacrifice every night\n[02:24.28] So we ain't gon' stumble and fall, never (nah)\n[02:26.41] Waiting to see this in the sign of defeat, uh-uh\n[02:29.19] So we gon' keep everyone moving their feet\n[02:31.47] So bring back the beat and then everyone sing\n[02:33.85] It's not about the money, money, money\n[02:36.80] We don't need your money, money, money\n[02:39.20] We just wanna make the world dance\n[02:42.04] Forget about the price tag\n[02:44.80] Ain't about the, uh, cha-ching, cha-ching\n[02:47.76] Ain't about the, yeah, ba-bling, ba-bling\n[02:50.50] Wanna make the world dance\n[02:53.17] Forget about the price tag (hey, hey)\n[02:55.79] It's not about the money, money, money (we don't need it)\n[02:58.54] We don't need your money, money, money (no, no)\n[03:01.01] (We don't need it) we just wanna make the world dance (dance)\n[03:04.01] Forget about the price tag (dance, dance, dance)\n[03:06.99] Ain't about the, uh, cha-ching cha-ching\n[03:09.81] Ain't about the (it ain't about), yeah, ba-bling ba-bling\n[03:12.43] Wanna make the world dance (yeah, yeah)\n[03:14.91] Forget about the price tag (forget about the price tag)\n[03:18.63] (Ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh)\n[03:29.26] Yeah, yeah (ahh)\n[03:31.60] Ooh, ooh, ooh (ahh)\n[03:34.03] Forget about the price tag, yeah (ahh, ahh)\n[03:41.42]",
