        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:34.28] Well, she's walkin'\n[00:38.03] Through the clouds\n[00:41.50] With a circus mind\n[00:44.62] That's running wild\n[00:49.13] Butterflies and zebras\n[00:51.98] And moonbeams and fairy tales\n[00:57.87] That's all she ever thinks about\n[01:01.25] Riding with the wind\n[01:03.99] \n[01:07.49] When I'm sad\n[01:10.13] She comes to me\n[01:14.57] With a thousand smiles\n[01:17.16] She gives to me free\n[01:21.35] Oh, it's alright, she says, it's alright\n[01:26.83] Take anything you want from me\n[01:31.25] Anything\n[01:33.54] Anything\n[01:37.02] \n[01:40.10] Fly on, little wing\n[01:48.34] \n[01:55.76] Yeah-yeah, yeah, fly on, little wing\n[02:08.03]",
