        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.913] Imagine there's no heaven\n[00:20.921] It's easy if you try\n[00:27.505] No hell below us\n[00:33.865] Above us only sky\n[00:39.945] Imagine all the people\n[00:45.745] Living for today\n[00:50.659] I\n[00:53.497] Imagine there's no countries\n[00:59.401] It isn't hard to do\n[01:05.913] Nothing to kill or die for\n[01:12.017] And no religion too\n[01:18.153] Imagine all the people\n[01:23.743] Living life in peace\n[01:28.567] You\n[01:31.353] You may say I'm a dreamer\n[01:37.570] But I'm not the only one\n[01:43.553] I hope someday you'll join us\n[01:50.227] And the world will be as one\n[01:56.385] Imagine no possessions\n[02:02.841] I wonder if you can\n[02:08.698] No need for greed or hunger\n[02:14.619] A brotherhood of man\n[02:21.275] Imagine all the people\n[02:27.043] Sharing all the world\n[02:31.763] You\n[02:34.603] You may say I'm a dreamer\n[02:40.707] But I'm not the only one\n[02:46.715] I hope someday you'll join us\n[02:53.451] And the world will live as one",
