        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.61] Know I've done wrong, left your heart torn\n[00:18.49] Is that what devils do?\n[00:21.83] Took you so low, where only fools go\n[00:25.52] I shook the angel in you\n[00:29.67] Now I'm rising from the ground\n[00:33.33] Rising up to you\n[00:36.83] Filled with all the strength I found\n[00:40.84] There's nothing I can't do\n[00:44.37] \n[00:50.83] I need to know now, know now\n[00:55.49] Can you love me again?\n[00:57.79] I need to know now, know now\n[01:03.09] Can you love me again?\n[01:05.26] I need to know now, know now\n[01:10.56] Can you love me again?\n[01:13.03] I need to know now, know now\n[01:18.24] Can you love me again?\n[01:21.29] \n[01:27.34] Can you love me again?\n[01:29.22] It's unforgivable\n[01:30.57] I stole and burnt your soul\n[01:32.48] Is that what demons do?\n[01:36.00] They rule the worst of me\n[01:38.34] Destroy everything\n[01:40.10] They bring down angels like you\n[01:43.97] Now I'm rising from the ground\n[01:47.76] Rising up to you\n[01:51.67] Filled with all the strength I found\n[01:55.57] There's nothing I can't do\n[02:00.73] I need to know now, know now\n[02:05.80] Can you love me again?\n[02:08.03] I need to know now, know now\n[02:13.41] Can you love me again?\n[02:16.36] \n[02:30.22] Can you love me again?\n[02:32.98] \n[02:45.83] Oh, I told you once again\n[02:48.84] I can't do this again, do this again, oh\n[02:54.04] I told you once again\n[02:56.81] I can't do this again, do this again, oh no\n[03:02.94] \n[03:11.46] I need to know now, know now\n[03:16.38] Can you love me again?\n[03:18.86] I need to know now, know now\n[03:23.99] Can you love me again?\n[03:26.67] I need to know now, know now\n[03:31.65] Can you love me again (Oh, oh)\n[03:35.99] \n[03:40.78] Can you love me again?\n[03:43.24] Can you love me again?\n[03:44.72] Can you love me again?\n[03:44.98]",
