        "chorus": "D#m7 Bsus2 C#sus4 G# Bsus2 C#sus4",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "BRIDGE",
        "dateAdded": "2026-05-17T11:12:05.106Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:19.23] Everytime I think of you\n[00:23.23] I always catch my breath\n[00:27.30] And I'm still standing here\n[00:29.56] And you're miles away\n[00:32.53] And I'm wonderin' why you left\n[00:36.44] And there's a storm that's raging\n[00:41.45] Through my frozen heart tonight\n[00:45.85] I hear your name in certain circles\n[00:50.92] And it always makes me smile\n[00:54.82] I spend my time thinkin' about you\n[00:59.95] And it's almost driving me wild\n[01:04.13] And there's a heart that's breaking\n[01:08.54] Down this long distance line tonight\n[01:12.10] I ain't missing you at all (Missing you)\n[01:17.47] Since you've been gone away (Missing you)\n[01:20.29] I ain't missing you (Missing you)\n[01:26.83] No matter what I might say (Missing you)\n[01:32.31] There's a message in the wire\n[01:36.62] And I'm sending you this signal tonight\n[01:41.00] You don't know how desperate I've become\n[01:45.91] And it looks like I'm losing this fight\n[01:50.12] In your world I have no meaning\n[01:55.24] Though I'm trying hard to understand\n[02:01.28] And it's my heart that's breaking\n[02:04.36] Down this long distance line tonight\n[02:07.65] I ain't missing you at all (Missing you)\n[02:12.61] Since you've been gone away (Missing you)\n[02:15.74] Oh hey, I ain't missing you (Missing you)\n[02:21.81] No matter what my friends say (Missing you)\n[02:28.62] And there's a message that I'm sending out\n[02:31.97] Like a telegraph to your soul\n[02:37.53] And if I can't bridge this distance\n[02:40.57] Stop this heartbreak overload\n[02:44.34] I ain't missing you at all (Missing you)\n[02:49.13] Since you've been gone away (Missing you)\n[02:52.04] I ain't missing you (Missing you)\n[02:58.28] No matter what my friends say (Missing you)\n[03:03.29] I ain't missing you (Missing you)\n[03:06.55] I ain't missing you, I can't lie to myself (Missing you)\n[03:14.53] And there's a storm that's raging\n[03:17.63] Through my frozen heart tonight\n[03:20.97] I ain't missing you at all (Missing you)\n[03:26.06] Since you've been gone away (Missing you)\n[03:30.02] I ain't missing you (Missing you)\n[03:34.90] No matter what my friends say (Missing you)\n[03:39.54] Ain't missing you\n[03:43.26] I ain't missing you\n[03:45.78] I ain't missing you,\n[03:48.09] I can't lie to myself\n[03:51.04] Ain't missing you\n[03:52.94] I ain't missing you\n[03:54.79] I ain't missing you\n[03:57.41] I ain't missing you\n[03:59.59] I ain't missing you\n[04:02.13] I ain't missing you\n[04:04.25] Ain't missing you, oh no\n[04:13.00] No matter what my friends might say\n[04:15.99] I ain't missing you",
