        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:12.95] I hurt myself today\n[00:18.28] To see if I still feel\n[00:23.42] I focus on the pain\n[00:28.82] The only thing that's real\n[00:34.24] The needle tears a hole\n[00:39.58] The old familiar sting\n[00:44.53] Try to kill it all away\n[00:49.60] But I remember everything\n[00:55.72] What have I become\n[01:01.33] My sweetest friend\n[01:06.29] Everyone I know goes away\n[01:12.78] In the end\n[01:16.65] And you could have it all\n[01:22.09] My empire of dirt\n[01:27.33] I will let you down\n[01:32.57] I will make you hurt\n[01:37.60] \n[01:48.06] I wear this crown of thorns\n[01:53.45] Upon my liar's chair\n[01:58.63] Full of broken thoughts\n[02:03.95] I cannot repair\n[02:09.24] Beneath the stains of time\n[02:14.40] The feelings disappear\n[02:19.96] You are someone else\n[02:25.07] I am still right here\n[02:30.91] What have I become\n[02:36.58] My sweetest friend\n[02:41.25] Everyone I know goes away\n[02:47.81] In the end\n[02:51.53] And you could have it all\n[02:57.01] My empire of dirt\n[03:02.37] I will let you down\n[03:07.59] I will make you hurt\n[03:12.59] If I could start again\n[03:17.69] A million miles away\n[03:22.92] I would keep myself\n[03:24.60] \n[03:28.13] I would find a way\n[03:32.59]",
