        "fullLyrics": "[00:46.86] I wake up in the morning\n[00:49.17] And I raise my weary head\n[00:52.29] I got an old coat for a pillow\n[00:55.08] And the earth was last night's bed\n[00:58.52] I don't know where I'm goin'\n[01:01.52] Only God knows where I've been\n[01:04.68] I'm a devil on the run\n[01:06.48] A six gun lover\n[01:08.10] A candle in the wind, yeah\n[01:23.50] You're brought into this world\n[01:25.16] But they say you're born in sin\n[01:28.43] Well at least they've given me something\n[01:31.76] I didn't have to steal or have to win\n[01:35.12] Well, they tell me that I'm wanted\n[01:37.85] Yeah I'm a wanted man\n[01:41.25] I'm colt in your stable\n[01:42.98] I'm what Cain was to Able\n[01:44.67] Mister catch me if you can\n[01:46.66] I'm goin' down in a blaze of glory\n[01:52.97] Take me now but know the truth\n[01:59.56] I'm goin' down in a blaze of glory\n[02:05.82] Lord I never drew first\n[02:07.51] But I drew first blood\n[02:09.15] I'm no one's son\n[02:11.04] Call me young gun\n[02:18.88] You ask about my conscience\n[02:20.96] And I offer you my soul\n[02:23.39] You ask if I'll grow to be a wise man\n[02:26.93] Well I ask if I'll grow old\n[02:29.78] You ask me if I known love\n[02:32.94] And what it's like to sing songs in the rain\n[02:36.28] Well, I've seen love come\n[02:38.15] I've seen it shot down\n[02:39.63] I've seen it die in vain\n[02:41.77] Shot down in a blaze of glory\n[02:48.67] Take me now but know the truth\n[02:54.45] But I'm going down in a blaze of glory\n[03:00.36] Lord, I never drew first\n[03:02.16] But I drew first blood\n[03:03.75] I'm a devil's son\n[03:05.66] Call me young gun\n[03:50.02] Each night I go to bed\n[03:58.79] I pray the Lord my soul to keep\n[04:02.13] No, I ain't lookin' for forgiveness\n[04:04.55] But before I'm six foot deep\n[04:08.24] Lord, I got to ask a favor\n[04:10.68] And I'll hope you'll understand\n[04:14.03] 'Cause I've lived life to the fullest\n[04:15.82] Let this boy die like a man\n[04:20.14] Starin' down the bullet\n[04:22.80] Let me make my final stand\n[04:30.58] Shot down in a blaze of glory\n[04:36.57] Take me now but know the truth\n[04:42.52] I'm going down in a blaze of glory\n[04:48.33] Lord, I never drew first\n[04:50.42] But, I drew first blood\n[04:52.01] I'm no one's son\n[04:53.79] Call me young gun\n[04:59.71] I'm the young gun\n[05:06.24] Young gun, yea eee yea\n[05:12.88] Young gun\n[05:30.05]",
