        "dateAdded": "2026-04-21T18:30:38.288Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.81] I close my eyes\n[00:25.67] Only for a moment and the moment's gone\n[00:30.82] All my dreams\n[00:35.63] Pass before my eyes, a curiosity\n[00:41.04] Dust in the wind\n[00:44.86] All they are is dust in the wind\n[00:50.97] Same old song\n[00:56.59] Just a drop of water in an endless sea\n[01:01.78] All we do\n[01:06.73] Crumbles to the ground, though we refuse to see\n[01:11.82] Dust in the wind (ah, aah, aah)\n[01:16.88] All we are is dust in the wind\n[01:24.58] Oh, oh, oh\n[01:29.82] \n[02:10.80] Now, don't hang on\n[02:16.11] Nothin' last forever but the earth and sky\n[02:21.56] It slips away\n[02:26.33] And all your money won't another minute buy\n[02:32.36] Dust in the wind\n[02:36.72] All we are is dust in the wind (all we are is dust in the wind)\n[02:43.15] Dust in the wind (everything is dust in the wind)\n[02:47.65] Everything is dust in the wind\n[02:58.23] \n[02:56.28]",
