        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.59] Saw the man in black, spotlight in the air\n[00:07.87] Heard a thousand screams, I saw my daddy stare\n[00:12.01] Feel like I've been runnin' since the day that I was born\n[00:15.88] Eagle on my back, phoenix on my arm\n[00:20.52] This goes out to the drifters\n[00:23.33] And all of the dreamers ready to fly\n[00:28.63] All those born to be rock stars\n[00:31.64] Lifting their guitars and painting the sky\n[00:36.31] Can you hear me?\n[00:37.78] All of you lost ones who aren't really lost ones\n[00:41.81] Keep shining your light\n[00:44.99] This goes out to the wild cards and all of the wild hearts\n[00:50.19] Just like mine\n[00:59.99] Now listen\n[01:01.16] Has anyone ever told you, you'll never amount to anything\n[01:05.02] You're just wasting your time chasing the tail of a dragon kind of dream\n[01:09.19] But I'm here to tell you anything can happen in this life\n[01:13.00] If you got that heart and the passion and a God lit fire inside\n[01:17.88] This goes out to the drifters\n[01:20.72] And all of the dreamers ready to fly\n[01:26.09] All those born to be rock stars\n[01:28.97] Lifting their guitars and painting the sky\n[01:33.66] Can you hear me?\n[01:35.25] All of you lost ones who aren't really lost ones\n[01:39.00] Keep shining your light\n[01:42.43] This goes out to the wild cards and all of the wild hearts\n[01:47.43] Just like mine\n[01:50.18] Oh, yeah\n[01:52.05] Woo, ha\n[01:57.75] Just like mine\n[02:02.23] Oh oh, oh yeah, mm\n[02:06.38] Ooh and this goes out to the drifters\n[02:09.92] And all of the dreamers ready to fly\n[02:15.30] All you born to be rock stars\n[02:17.90] Lifting your guitars and painting the sky, ooh\n[02:23.66] This goes out to the drifters (woo)\n[02:26.22] And all of the dreamers ready to fly (hey)\n[02:31.87] All those born to be rock stars\n[02:34.36] Keep lifting your guitars and painting the sky (oh, hear me now)\n[02:38.03] (Can you hear me?) Can you hear me?\n[02:40.94] All of you lost ones who aren't really lost ones (woo)\n[02:44.71] Keep shining your light (uh, keep shining)\n[02:47.94] This goes out to the wild cards who's got the wild heart\n[02:53.17] Just like mine",
