        "dateAdded": "2026-04-24T13:18:06.142Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.30] Met him at a party\n[00:17.82] Accidentally brushed his body\n[00:19.83] On the way to get a drink at the bar\n[00:23.88] I couldn't wait 'til later\n[00:25.86] Talking in the elevator\n[00:27.84] Then we're kissing in the back of the car\n[00:31.80] That voice in my head says to slow down\n[00:36.10] But it can't see the way you lookin' at me right now\n[00:40.02] It may not be next week what I need\n[00:43.98] Then again, maybe it might be\n[00:48.35] Could be forever, or we might break\n[00:52.42] That's just the kind of risk that we take\n[00:56.32] My head is yellin' that I could get hurt\n[00:59.42] But I'm gonna jump right in, baby, with my heart first\n[01:04.49] I gotta have it\n[01:05.98] Gotta see if this works\n[01:08.45] I gotta have it\n[01:10.05] Wake up in your T-shirt\n[01:12.31] Who knows what'll happen\n[01:13.86] Ain't it always kinda magic\n[01:15.81] When you don't know who's holding the cards? (Ah-ah)\n[01:19.69] Could be a wish I never knew ya\n[01:21.87] Or permanently tattoo, ya\n[01:24.08] Only the moon knows what's in the stars (what's in the stars)\n[01:27.45] Mmm, that voice in my head says to slow down\n[01:31.99] But it can't feel your hands on my hips right now\n[01:36.02] It may not be next year what I need\n[01:40.25] Then again, maybe it might be\n[01:44.47] Could be forever, or we might break\n[01:48.42] That's just the kind of risk that we take\n[01:52.46] My head is yellin' that I could get hurt\n[01:55.55] But I'm gonna jump right in, baby, with my heart first\n[02:00.44] I gotta have it\n[02:02.08] Gotta see if this works (I gotta have it)\n[02:04.55] I gotta have it\n[02:06.09] Wake up in your T-shirt\n[02:08.43] I gotta have it\n[02:10.04] Diving in heart first (diving in heart first)\n[02:12.59] I gotta have it\n[02:14.05] Ooh, I gotta have ya\n[02:18.04] And I can't even stop myself anymore\n[02:22.33] (Ooh, I gotta have it, yeah-yeah)\n[02:25.38] Oh, it could be the perfect night outside my front door\n[02:32.36] Could be forever, or we might break\n[02:36.46] That's just the kind of risk that we take\n[02:40.47] My head is yellin' that I could get hurt\n[02:43.62] But I'm gonna jump right in, baby, with my heart first\n[02:48.42] I gotta have it\n[02:50.12] Gotta see if this works (I gotta have it)\n[02:52.65] I gotta have it\n[02:54.17] Wake up in your T-shirt (wake up in your T-shirt, yeah)\n[02:56.53] I gotta have it\n[02:58.02] Diving in heart first (diving in heart first)\n[03:00.53] I gotta have it\n[03:02.11] Yeah, I gotta have ya\n[03:04.88]",
