        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.27] She was aware of her insecurities\n[00:20.18] As she took the stage\n[00:24.28] But she was convinced if she got up there\n[00:27.21] That she'd be discovered some day\n[00:30.92] So she belted it\n[00:35.06] She hit the high notes fearlessly\n[00:38.67] Oh, she melted them\n[00:43.65] She brought them to their feet\n[00:47.25] She was a big star\n[00:49.41] At Banana Joe's Bar\n[00:51.06] Where she sang karaoke every night\n[00:55.23] She said if you work hard to get where you are\n[00:58.94] It feels good in the hot spotlight\n[01:01.97] She was a big star\n[01:11.55] She made the local cable shows\n[01:14.91] Where the camera fell in love with her face\n[01:19.74] After a couple of weekends\n[01:22.04] The groupies were crawling all over the place\n[01:26.29] And she signed autographs\n[01:30.72] Like she was Garth Brooks in a skirt\n[01:34.05] And in the aftermath\n[01:38.67] That small time town was hers\n[01:42.93] She was a big star\n[01:44.74] At Banana Joe's Bar\n[01:47.17] Where she sang karaoke every night\n[01:50.70] She said if you work hard to get where you are\n[01:54.75] It feels good in the hot spotlight\n[01:57.52] She was a big star\n[02:15.46] Hey, she doesn't care anymore\n[02:18.71] That her high school girlfriends cut her down\n[02:23.50] The only thought she entertains is where they aren't\n[02:29.57] And where she is now\n[02:35.48] A few old neighbors swear they are certain\n[02:39.19] She slept her way to the top\n[02:43.19] She knows you don't get where you're goin'\n[02:46.75] Unless you got something they ain't got\n[02:51.23] So she sings tonight\n[02:55.56] To twenty thousand plus\n[02:58.46] And the young girls scream out loud\n[03:03.86] Man that could be us\n[03:07.46] She's a big star\n[03:09.82] She eats caviar\n[03:11.31] Just before she performs every night\n[03:15.06] She says if you work hard to get where you are\n[03:19.53] It feels good in the hot spotlight\n[03:22.30] She's a big star",
