        "dateAdded": "2026-06-25T11:41:09.181Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.86] She was 69, still smokin'\n[00:18.66] Serving hurricanes since the Schooner's Wharf opened\n[00:21.57] When she poured me one, I asked the secret\n[00:25.15] She said, \"Don't ever let grass grow up underneath you\"\n[00:28.46] Carry on karaoke, it don't matter if you can't\n[00:32.13] Carry a tune in a bucket anyways\n[00:35.39] Carry on, who cares what the naysayers say?\n[00:38.64] If it's Saturday night, get carried away\n[00:42.05] Carry on, carry on\n[00:45.24] You can't carry nothin' with you, and it won't be long\n[00:48.68] 'Til it's six carrying you home\n[00:52.63] 'Til then you gotta carry on\n[00:58.92] Well, it turns out she kissed Elvis\n[01:02.35] The story she told would make Penny Lane jealous\n[01:05.51] And she said, \"Hun, my shift's ending\"\n[01:09.18] Beside a peace sign at the bottom of my ticket\n[01:12.37] Carry on karaoke, it don't matter if you can't\n[01:16.22] Carry a tune in a bucket anyways\n[01:19.14] Carry on, who cares what the naysayers say?\n[01:22.53] If it's Saturday night, get carried away\n[01:25.72] Carry on, carry on\n[01:29.20] You can't carry nothin' with you, and it won't be long\n[01:32.72] 'Til it's six carrying you home\n[01:36.53] 'Til then you gotta carry on\n[01:52.88] Carry on, carry on\n[01:56.16] If it feels good, do it, if it doesn't, then don't\n[01:59.73] Carry on, carry on\n[02:03.22] Yeah, man, you gotta carry on\n[02:06.28] Carry on karaoke, it don't matter if you can't\n[02:10.19] Carry a tune in a bucket anyways\n[02:13.11] Carry on, who cares what the naysayers say?\n[02:16.63] If it's Saturday night, get carried away\n[02:19.96] Carry on, carry on\n[02:23.26] If it feels good, do it, if it doesn't, then don't\n[02:26.69] Carry on, carry on\n[02:30.52] Yeah, man, you gotta carry on\n[02:33.59] Yeah, man, you gotta carry on\n[02:37.08] Yes, ma'am, I'm gonna carry on\n[02:41.46]",
