        "dateAdded": "2026-05-21T14:34:53.319Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:26.65] I turned on the evening news\n[00:30.14] Saw an old man being interviewed\n[00:33.82] Turning a hundred and two today\n[00:38.73] Asked him what's the secret to life?\n[00:42.86] He looked up from his old pipe\n[00:46.65] Laughed and said, \"All I can say is\n[00:52.05] Don't blink, just like that you're six years old\n[00:57.40] And you take a nap\n[00:58.96] And you wake up and you're twenty-five\n[01:02.00] And your high school sweetheart becomes your wife\n[01:05.29] Don't blink, you just might miss\n[01:10.06] Your babies growing like mine did\n[01:12.68] Turning into moms and dads\n[01:15.27] Next thing you know your better half\n[01:18.33] Of fifty years is there in bed\n[01:21.72] And you're praying God takes you instead\n[01:25.27] Trust me friend a hundred years\n[01:28.26] Goes faster than you think, so don't blink\n[01:34.22] \n[01:44.54] I was glued to my TV, when it looked\n[01:48.76] Like he looked at me and said\n[01:51.71] \"Best start putting first things first\"\n[01:57.36] 'Cause when your hourglass runs out of sand\n[02:00.58] You can't flip it over and start again\n[02:04.46] Take every breathe God gives you for what it's worth\n[02:09.95] Don't blink, 'cause just like that you're six years old\n[02:15.13] And you take a nap\n[02:17.04] And you wake up and you're twenty-five\n[02:19.91] And your high school sweetheart becomes your wife\n[02:23.19] Don't blink, you just might miss\n[02:26.24] Your babies growing like mine did\n[02:30.09] Turning into moms and dads\n[02:33.13] Next thing you know your better half\n[02:35.98] Of fifty years is there in bed\n[02:39.61] And you're praying God takes you instead\n[02:43.26] Trust me friend a hundred years\n[02:46.05] Goes faster than you think, so don't blink\n[02:52.43] \n[03:02.96] So I've been trying to slow it down\n[03:05.02] I've been trying to take it in\n[03:08.65] In this 'here today, gone tomorrow' world we're living in\n[03:14.73] So don't blink, 'cause just like that you're six years old\n[03:20.12] And you take a nap\n[03:21.54] And you wake up and you're twenty-five\n[03:25.30] And your high school sweetheart becomes your wife\n[03:28.10] Don't blink, you just might miss\n[03:31.51] Your babies growing like mine did\n[03:35.22] Turning into moms and dads\n[03:37.83] Next thing you know your better half\n[03:40.99] Of fifty years is there in bed\n[03:44.48] And you're praying God takes you instead\n[03:47.67] Trust me friend a hundred years\n[03:51.15] Goes faster than you think, so don't blink\n[03:57.20] \n[03:59.70] No, don't blink\n[04:03.41] \n[04:05.83] Don't blink\n[04:10.34] Life goes faster than you think\n[04:13.46] So don't blink\n[04:16.49] Life goes faster than you think\n[04:20.08] Don't blink\n[04:23.34] \n[04:26.10] Don't blink\n[04:29.49] Life goes faster than you think\n[04:34.06]",
