        "dateAdded": "2026-05-21T14:37:26.542Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:01.49] When I was a boy\n[00:08.04] Four houses down from me\n[00:10.19] Was a family with an only child\n[00:13.67] She was the only girl\n[00:16.28] In this whole world that can make me smile\n[00:21.48] I made up reasons to go\n[00:29.20] Somewhere inside of me\n[00:34.23] There was something she took a liking to\n[00:38.88] Well, I ask her to marry me\n[00:40.66] She said she really wanted to\n[00:48.26] See what life's gonna hold\n[00:52.51] Her momma wants to know\n[00:58.54] Am I washed in the blood or just in the water?\n[01:02.42] Her daddy wants to know\n[01:04.27] If I make enough to take his daughter\n[01:11.91] Before he could let her go\n[01:24.25] And now down the street from here\n[01:34.98] There's an engineer with an only son\n[01:39.33] And our baby girl says\n[01:42.09] She believes that he is the only one\n[01:50.35] Her momma wants to know\n[01:52.26] Is he washed in the blood or just in the water?\n[01:56.71] And I wanna know\n[01:58.58] That he makes enough to take my daughter\n[02:04.47] When it comes time to go\n[02:12.50] You know I wanna help her go\n[02:24.71] Down, down, down that road\n[02:33.90] Down, down, down that road\n[02:53.32]",
        "genre": [
            "Country"
        ],
