        "fullLyrics": "[00:32.84] For me it's a beach bar\n[00:34.88] Or on a boat underneath the stars\n[00:37.82] Or with my band up on a stage\n[00:40.25] For a while everything's okay\n[00:43.12] For some it's a fast car\n[00:45.21] Moonshine in a mason jar\n[00:48.37] And everybody has their way\n[00:51.17] Somehow to escape\n[00:53.06] Reality, yeah, sometimes life\n[00:56.61] Ain't all that it's cracked up to be\n[01:01.08] So let's take a chance and live this fantasy\n[01:05.92] 'Cause everybody needs to break free from reality, oh yeah\n[01:24.59] Yeah, some days it's a bitch, it's a bummer\n[01:26.84] We need a rock 'n' roll show in the summer\n[01:29.63] To let the music take us away\n[01:31.98] Take our minds to a better place\n[01:34.90] Where we feel that sense of freedom\n[01:37.31] Leave our worries behind, we don't need 'em\n[01:39.72] All we need is a sunny day and an old tailgate\n[01:43.73] And we'll escape\n[01:44.93] Reality, yeah, sometimes life\n[01:48.81] Ain't all that it's cracked up to be\n[01:52.79] So let's take a chance and live this fantasy\n[01:57.66] 'Cause everybody needs to break free from reality\n[02:06.76] Everybody raise your hands and voice tonight\n[02:11.14] Set your soul free, let's take a carpet ride\n[02:15.61] We'll leave it all behind, oh yeah\n[02:39.08] Oh, reality, yeah, sometimes life\n[02:42.91] Ain't all that it's cracked up to be\n[02:46.93] So let's take a chance and live this fantasy\n[02:52.74] 'Cause everybody needs to break free from reality\n[03:04.85] Yeah, oh yeah\n[03:08.82] Come on everybody, break free\n[03:14.15] Come on everybody, break free\n[03:27.08]",
