        "fullLyrics": "[00:06.46] Some folks livin' in the country can't wait to get in their pickup trucks and go to town\n[00:25.05] There's people livin' in a penthouse dying to get out in the sticks and ride around\n[00:33.96] There's a man up on a mountain top who wants to go down and breathe the salt air by the shore\n[00:43.22] There's a guy on an island he ain't smilin' and don't want to be on an island anymore\n[00:51.75] There's a lady locked in a love affair wouldn't care if she was single again\n[01:00.73] There's a lonely soul who's only goal is to get that golden ring upon their hand\n[01:10.12] In the middle of nowhere there's a nobody tryin' to get that 15 minutes of fame\n[01:19.14] Someplace there's a superstar thinkin' Lord if I could only change my name\n[01:28.10] Round and round and round and round we go\n[01:36.90] Why we can't be satisfied I don't know\n[01:45.91] I don't know...\n[01:51.12] There's a young man wishin\" he could grab the hands of a time and speed em' up a year or two\n[02:04.13] There's and old man wishin' he could just go back and stop the clock and hang on to his youth\n[02:12.59] There's a stoner on the sidewalk wishin' he could just get straight for a day\n[02:21.88] There's a man in a suit and tie thinkin' gettin' high might be a better way\n[02:30.98] Round and round and round and round we go\n[02:40.45] Why we can't be satisfied I don't know\n[02:48.50] From the day we're born it seems like it never stops\n[02:57.83] Why do we always want somethin' we ain't got\n[03:06.64] Aww we ain't got...\n[03:10.96] (Instrumental)\n[03:26.19] Round and round and round and round we go\n[03:33.68] Why we can't be satisfied I don't know\n[03:42.30] Till the day we got seems like it never stops\n[03:51.39] Why we always wantin' somethin' we ain't got\n[04:00.26] Oh we ain't got...\n[04:11.64] Round and round and round and round we go\n[04:18.59] Round and round and round and round we go\n[04:27.29] Round and round and round and round we go\n[04:36.23] Round and round and round and round we go\n[04:45.30]",
