        "dateAdded": "2026-04-21T20:59:38.467Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.51] Her hair is Harlow gold\n[00:19.45] Her lips, a sweet surprise\n[00:23.78] Her hands are never cold\n[00:27.43] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[00:29.79] She'll turn the music on you\n[00:34.05] You won't have to think twice\n[00:38.17] She's pure as New York snow\n[00:42.01] She got Bette Davis eyes\n[00:47.68] And she'll tease you\n[00:49.67] She'll unease you\n[00:51.69] All the better just to please you\n[00:55.81] She's precocious\n[00:57.80] And she knows just what it takes to make a pro blush\n[01:04.02] She got Greta Garbo stand-off sighs\n[01:08.30] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[01:12.47] \n[01:17.36] She'll let you take her home\n[01:21.62] It whets her appetite\n[01:25.73] She'll lay you on a throne\n[01:29.45] She got Bette Davis eyes\n[01:32.00] She'll take a tumble on you\n[01:36.01] Roll you like you were dice\n[01:40.04] Until you come up blue\n[01:43.90] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[01:49.34] She'll expose you\n[01:51.42] When she snows you\n[01:53.67] Off your feet with the crumbs she throws you\n[01:57.71] She's ferocious\n[01:59.83] And she knows just what it takes to make a pro blush\n[02:06.82] All the boys think she's a spy\n[02:09.93] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[02:13.65] \n[02:28.71] And she'll tease you\n[02:30.65] She'll unease you\n[02:32.58] All the better just to please you\n[02:36.60] She's precocious\n[02:38.58] And she knows just what it takes to make a pro blush\n[02:45.88] All the boys think she's a spy\n[02:48.95] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[02:58.07] \n[03:07.64] She'll tease you\n[03:11.59] She'll unease you\n[03:15.74] Just to please you\n[03:18.21] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[03:23.89] She'll expose you\n[03:27.85] When she snows you\n[03:32.02] 'Cause she knows you\n[03:34.52] She's got Bette Davis eyes\n[03:35.91]",
