        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.73] Can't sleep, 'cause everything's changing\n[00:21.72] You don't want to leave things behind\n[00:26.44] Can't breathe, 'cause too many things going on\n[00:31.30] Going wrong in your life\n[00:35.18] Tears in your eyes\n[00:39.57] Sweet goodbyes\n[00:42.62] I know how you feel right now\n[00:47.33] Losing dreams you've come to care about\n[00:51.22] I know what you need right now\n[00:55.71] You need to come on home, so I can hold you tight\n[01:00.49] Get you through the night\n[01:04.51] I'll get you through the night\n[01:09.94] Wake up, the sun's shining bright\n[01:13.97] Let's go out of bed, into the light\n[01:18.75] Shape up, we won't forget\n[01:22.52] Still there's lots of love left to hold tight\n[01:27.52] Tears in your eyes\n[01:31.88] Sweet goodbyes\n[01:35.09] I know how you feel right now\n[01:39.60] Losing dreams you've come to care about\n[01:43.73] I know what you need right now\n[01:48.26] You need to come on home, so I can hold you tight\n[01:52.76] Get you through the night\n[01:54.49] Everything I love between us will get us through the night\n[01:58.62] All the things we've lost will teach us, see the pretty things in life\n[02:03.28] All the places that we've been to, the people we relate to\n[02:07.38] All the love that we give in to\n[02:10.06] Blow the tears from our eyes\n[02:15.43] Sweet goodbyes\n[02:18.64] I know how you feel right now\n[02:23.14] Losing dreams you've come to care about\n[02:27.37] I know what you need right now\n[02:31.85] You need to come on home, so I can hold you tight\n[02:36.09] I know how you feel right now\n[02:40.48] Losing dreams you've come to care about\n[02:44.83] I know what you need right now\n[02:49.36] You need to come on home, so I can hold you tight\n[02:54.90] I'll get you through the night\n[02:58.77]",
