        "fullLyrics": "[00:06.96] Have some scratches and some holes from rusty nails\n[00:14.62] Have some dirt and dust from all those broken trails\n[00:22.35] But you shine 'em up brand new\n[00:25.93] Girl, like only you could do\n[00:29.72] Somehow you put this runaway train back on the rails\n[00:37.24] Yeah, these boots, never walkin' out on you\n[00:45.00] They ain't got no more running left to do\n[00:52.60] Whoa, here I am\n[00:56.31] Whoa, forever your man\n[01:00.32] These boots, never walkin', walkin' out on you\n[01:07.87] \n[01:11.53] Oh, oh, oh\n[01:15.39] It's a miracle they found their way to your door yeah\n[01:23.18] It's like they forgot all the places they been before, oh\n[01:30.97] Took awhile to find their place\n[01:34.65] Girl, you know they're here to stay\n[01:37.80] Yeah, these boots, never walkin' out on you\n[01:45.53] They ain't got no more running left to do\n[01:53.54] Whoa, here I am\n[01:57.06] Whoa, forever your man\n[02:00.59] Girl, these boots, never walkin', walkin' out on you, oh\n[02:14.64] \n[02:21.29] These boots are never walkin' (no, not this time)\n[02:24.90] These boots are never walkin' (no, not this time)\n[02:28.70] These boots are never walkin' out on you\n[02:35.16] Oh, these boots, never walkin' out on you\n[02:42.64] Girl, they ain't got no more running left to do\n[02:50.69] Whoa, here I am\n[02:54.09] Whoa, forever your man\n[02:57.83] Girl, these boots, never walkin', walkin' out on you\n[03:09.50] Oh, never walkin', baby\n[03:27.56]",
