        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.89] I run from hate\n[00:23.10] I run from prejudice, I run from pessimists\n[00:28.63] But I run too late\n[00:33.03] I run my life or is it running me?\n[00:40.98] Run from my past\n[00:42.85] I run too fast or too slow, it seems\n[00:50.14] When lies become the truth\n[00:58.30] That's when I run to you\n[01:07.89] This world keeps spinning faster\n[01:11.93] Into a new disaster so I run to you\n[01:17.08] I run to you, baby\n[01:20.65] When it all starts coming undone\n[01:24.72] Baby, you're the only one I run to\n[01:31.31] I run to you\n[01:33.77] \n[01:40.32] We run on fumes\n[01:48.10] Your life and mine\n[01:50.07] Like the sands of time slippin' right on through\n[01:57.15] And our love's the only truth\n[02:05.94] That's why I run to you\n[02:13.92] Whoa, yeah\n[02:15.35] This world keeps spinning faster\n[02:19.20] Into a new disaster so I run to you\n[02:24.58] I run to you, baby\n[02:27.86] When it all starts coming undone\n[02:32.18] Baby, you're the only one I run to\n[02:38.85] I run to you\n[02:43.58] Whoa, oh\n[02:46.03] Oh, I run to you\n[02:50.51] \n[02:57.45] This world keeps spinning faster\n[03:01.36] Into a new disaster so I run to you\n[03:06.62] I run to you, baby\n[03:10.15] When it all starts coming undone\n[03:14.25] Baby, you're the only one I run to\n[03:21.34] I run to you, I run to you, yeah\n[03:29.88] Whoa, oh\n[03:32.35] Oh, I run to you\n[03:34.99] I run to you, girl\n[03:38.93] Whoa\n[03:42.44]",
