        "fullLyrics": "[00:18.88] Picture perfect memories\n[00:20.96] Scattered all around the floor\n[00:25.11] \n[00:27.58] Reaching for the phone cause\n[00:29.64] I can't fight it anymore\n[00:35.08] And I wonder if I ever cross your mind\n[00:43.72] For me it happens all the time\n[00:48.25] It's a quarter after one\n[00:51.06] I'm all alone and I need you now\n[00:57.11] Said I wouldn't call, but I lost all control\n[01:00.85] And I need you now\n[01:04.27] \n[01:07.05] And I don't know how I can do without\n[01:11.43] I just need you now\n[01:16.43] \n[01:22.58] Another shot of whisky\n[01:26.64] Can't stop looking at the door\n[01:31.79] Wishing you'd come sweeping in the way you did before\n[01:37.32] And I wonder if I ever cross your mind\n[01:46.04] For me it happens all the time\n[01:51.78] It's a quarter after one\n[01:55.85] I'm a little drunk and I need you now\n[02:01.83] Said I wouldn't call, but I lost all control\n[02:06.33] And I need you now\n[02:10.38] And I don't know how I can do without\n[02:16.15] I just need you now\n[02:22.18] \n[02:27.46] (Whoa-whoa)\n[02:32.77] \n[02:37.08] Guess I rather hurt than feel nothing at all\n[02:44.52] It's a quarter after one\n[02:46.61] I'm all alone and I need you now\n[02:52.81] And I said I wouldn't call\n[02:56.04] But I'm a little drunk and I need you now\n[03:02.46] And I don't know how I can do without\n[03:04.72] I just need you now\n[03:11.25] \n[03:16.02] I just need you now\n[03:22.95] \n[03:35.03] Oh, baby, I need you now\n[03:42.48]",
