        "dateAdded": "2026-05-29T18:03:52.924Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.70] Makes you wanna take a Sunday drive\n[00:24.76] Throws you right back to a different time\n[00:28.80] Puts your lighter up\n[00:30.49] Singing loud and out of tune\n[00:36.77] It puts a little sound in an empty space\n[00:41.08] And for a little while, lets you drift away\n[00:45.07] It's simple, but it's true\n[00:46.82] Yeah, it's crazy what a song can do\n[00:51.82] It can make you dance and make you cry\n[00:56.57] Make you wanna give it one more try\n[01:00.46] Start a band and kiss that girl\n[01:04.54] And break some rules\n[01:08.27] It'll make you give your heart and get it back\n[01:12.92] Change your mind just like that\n[01:16.96] When it's like every single line was written just for you\n[01:23.58] Ain't it crazy what a song can do?\n[01:30.14] \n[01:34.46] Makes you make a call at 4 a.m.\n[01:38.35] Makеs you say you want him all over again\n[01:42.13] It's like you knew it all along\n[01:44.94] Ain't it crazy that a song\n[01:49.60] Can makе you dance and make you cry\n[01:54.08] Make you wanna give it one more try\n[01:57.94] Start a band and kiss that girl\n[02:01.89] And break some rules\n[02:05.63] It'll make you give your heart and get it back\n[02:10.19] Change your mind just like that\n[02:14.51] When it's like every single line was written just for you\n[02:20.86] Ain't it crazy what a song can do?\n[02:27.55] Woah, crazy what a song can do\n[02:38.96] Shake the ground, steal your breath\n[02:43.02] Feel that pounding in your chest\n[02:47.45] Bring you to your knees right there in that old church pew\n[02:54.33] Ooh, make you give your heart and get it back\n[02:59.62] Change your mind just like that\n[03:03.74] And most of all it's what brought me here to you\n[03:10.10] Ain't it crazy what a song (crazy what a song)\n[03:14.60] Crazy what a song can do?\n[03:20.81] (Ooh) crazy what a song can do\n[03:27.02] Crazy what a song can do\n[03:29.41]",
