        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.66] Tell me somethin', girl\n[00:20.52] Are you happy in this modern world?\n[00:25.69] Or do you need more?\n[00:30.53] Is there somethin' else you're searchin' for?\n[00:35.15] I'm fallin'\n[00:40.24] In all the good times I find myself longin' for change\n[00:50.18] And in the bad times, I fear myself\n[00:55.94] \n[01:05.43] Tell me something, boy\n[01:10.53] Aren't you tired tryin' to fill that void?\n[01:15.54] Or do you need more?\n[01:20.70] Ain't it hard keepin' it so hardcore?\n[01:25.28] I'm falling\n[01:30.37] In all the good times I find myself longing for change\n[01:40.02] And in the bad times, I fear myself\n[01:45.03] I'm off the deep end, watch as I dive in\n[01:50.12] I'll never meet the ground\n[01:55.01] Crash through the surface, where they can't hurt us\n[01:59.79] We're far from the shallow now\n[02:05.41] In the sha-ha-sha-ha-low\n[02:10.63] In the sha-ha-sha-la-la-la-low\n[02:15.68] In the sha-ha-sha-ha-ha-low\n[02:19.85] We're far from the shallow now\n[02:25.05] \n[02:27.62] Whoah, oh, oh, oh\n[02:32.02] Whoah, oh, oh, whoah\n[02:39.47] \n[02:45.18] I'm off the deep end, watch as I dive in\n[02:50.19] I'll never meet the ground\n[02:55.10] Crash through the surface, where they can't hurt us\n[02:59.73] We're far from the shallow now\n[03:05.66] In the sha-ha-sha-ha-low\n[03:10.56] In the sha-ha-ha-la-la-la-low\n[03:15.69] In the sha-ha-sha-ha-ha-low\n[03:19.72] We're far from the shallow now\n[03:23.22]",
