        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.53] Ooh\n[00:06.67] \n[00:09.16] I, I just woke up from a dream\n[00:15.86] Where you and I had to say goodbye\n[00:20.41] And I don't know what it all means\n[00:24.99] But since I survived, I realized\n[00:29.73] Wherever you go, that's where I'll follow\n[00:34.03] Nobody's promised tomorrow\n[00:38.77] So I'ma love you every night like it's the last night\n[00:42.72] Like it's the last night\n[00:45.13] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[00:54.24] If the party was over and our time on Earth was through\n[01:03.13] I'd wanna hold you just for a while and die with a smile\n[01:12.39] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[01:20.89] Ooh\n[01:25.49] Ooh, lost, lost in the words that we scream\n[01:33.56] I don't even wanna do this anymore\n[01:38.16] 'Cause you already know what you mean to me\n[01:41.83] And our love's the only war worth fighting for\n[01:47.04] Wherever you go, that's where I'll follow\n[01:51.74] Nobody's promised tomorrow\n[01:56.12] So I'ma love you every night like it's the last night\n[01:59.97] Like it's the last night\n[02:02.58] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[02:11.61] If the party was over and our time on Earth was through\n[02:20.74] I'd wanna hold you just for a while and die with a smile\n[02:29.70] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[02:38.57] Right next to you\n[02:43.06] Next to you\n[02:47.67] Right next to you\n[02:51.37] Oh-oh, oh\n[02:55.27] \n[03:10.13] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[03:19.60] If the party was over and our time on Earth was through\n[03:29.03] I'd wanna hold you just for a while and die with a smile\n[03:38.20] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[03:47.32] If the world was ending, I'd wanna be next to you\n[03:55.93] Ooh\n[03:59.44] I'd wanna be next to you\n[04:02.28]",
