        "fullLyrics": "[00:12.326] I'm on the way down\n[00:15.506] Freefall to judgement day\n[00:18.346] I'm losing faith now\n[00:21.376] I spent all my saving grace\n[00:24.386] There's a dead reckoning for me\n[00:27.196] Everything's tremblin' beneath\n[00:30.336] I'm on the way down\n[00:33.716] But I'm holdin' the reigns\n[00:36.426] Oh, I'm chasing the wind\n[00:39.736] Free like a mustang, born again\n[00:42.476] Oh, I may never win\n[00:45.406] But I feel it coming, I'm catching up\n[00:48.566] Oh, I'm chasing the wind\n[00:51.736] I hear the thunder rollin' in\n[00:54.476] Oh, I may never win\n[00:57.396] But I feel it coming, I'm catching up now\n[01:03.636] I feel it coming, I'm catching up now\n[01:12.350] Hell on the highway\n[01:15.370] Only the road's staring back at me\n[01:18.350] Doing it my way\n[01:21.380] Holding the curses in my teeth\n[01:24.160] I see fire, I see rain\n[01:27.190] There's a tempest in my brain\n[01:30.370] Hell on the highway\n[01:33.530] No, there ain't no chains on me\n[01:36.410] Oh, I'm chasing the wind\n[01:39.740] Free like a mustang, born again\n[01:42.470] Oh, I may never win\n[01:45.400] But I feel it coming, I'm catching up\n[01:48.650] Oh, I'm chasing the wind\n[01:51.740] I hear the thunder rollin' in\n[01:54.480] Oh, I may never win\n[01:57.400] But I feel it coming, I'm catching up now\n[02:03.660] I feel it coming, I'm catching up now\n[02:12.930] I'm chasing the wind\n[02:15.720] Free like a mustang, born again\n[02:18.460] Oh, I may never win\n[02:21.430] But I feel it coming, I'm catching up\n[02:24.640] Oh, I'm chasing the wind\n[02:27.600] I hear the thunder rollin' in\n[02:30.480] Oh, I may never win\n[02:33.390] But I feel it coming, I'm catching up now\n[02:38.130] I'm catching up now\n[02:47.310] I'm catching up now",
