        "dateAdded": "2026-06-04T09:55:20.110Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:52.93] There's a lady who's sure, all that glitters is gold\n[00:59.48] And she's buying a stairway to heaven\n[01:06.22] When she gets there she knows\n[01:09.76] If the stores are all closed\n[01:12.95] With a word, she can get what she came for\n[01:17.26] Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh\n[01:26.12] And she's buying a stairway to heaven\n[01:32.95] There's a sign on the wall, but she wants to be sure\n[01:39.53] 'Cause you know, sometimes words have two meanings\n[01:46.52] In a tree by the brook, there's a songbird who sings\n[01:53.04] Sometimes all of our thoughts are misgiven\n[01:59.66] \n[02:17.90] Ooh, it makes me wonder\n[02:23.50] \n[02:27.00] Ooh, it makes me wonder\n[02:34.31] \n[02:38.41] There's a feeling I get when I look to the west\n[02:44.42] And my spirit is crying for leaving\n[02:50.53] In my thoughts, I have seen rings of smoke through the trees\n[02:56.79] And the voices of those who stand looking\n[03:03.02] \n[03:09.48] Ooh, it makes me wonder\n[03:13.79] \n[03:20.47] Ooh, it really makes me wonder\n[03:25.59] \n[03:29.35] And it's whispered that soon, if we all call the tune\n[03:35.10] Then the piper will lead us to reason\n[03:41.13] And a new day will dawn for those who stand long\n[03:46.94] And the forests will echo with laughter\n[03:53.29] \n[04:11.06] Whoa-whoa-whoa, oh-oh\n[04:15.49] \n[04:19.99] If there's a bustle in your hedgerow, don't be alarmed now\n[04:25.68] It's just a spring clean for the May Queen\n[04:31.20] Yes, there are two paths you can go by, but in the long run\n[04:37.29] And there's still time to change the road you're on\n[04:42.59] \n[04:49.56] And it makes me wonder\n[04:53.45] \n[04:58.84] Oh, whoa-oh\n[05:03.54] \n[05:07.49] Your head is humming and it won't go\n[05:10.89] In case you don't know\n[05:13.03] The piper's calling you to join him\n[05:18.70] Dear lady, can you hear the wind blow?\n[05:22.26] And did you know\n[05:24.29] Your stairway lies on the whispering wind?\n[05:30.31] \n[06:44.57] And as we wind on down the road\n[06:49.29] Our shadows taller than our soul\n[06:53.94] There walks a lady we all know\n[06:58.60] Who shines white light and wants to show\n[07:03.31] How everything still turns to gold\n[07:08.09] And if you listen very hard\n[07:12.61] The tune will come to you at last\n[07:17.32] When all are one and one is all, yeah\n[07:21.90] To be a rock and not to roll\n[07:46.13] And she's buying a stairway to heaven\n[07:55.82]",
