        "fullLyrics": "[00:26.77] I hope you never lose your sense of wonder\n[00:33.28] You get your fill to eat but always keep that hunger\n[00:39.29] May you never take one single breath for granted\n[00:45.70] God forbid love ever leave you empty handed\n[00:51.63] I hope you still feel small when you stand beside the ocean\n[00:58.77] Whenever one door closes, I hope one more opens\n[01:05.06] Promise me that you'll give faith a fighting chance\n[01:11.46] And when you get the choice to sit it out or dance\n[01:17.31] I hope you dance\n[01:23.64] I hope you dance\n[01:30.02] I hope you never fear those mountains in the distance\n[01:36.77] Never settle for the path of least resistance\n[01:43.21] Livin' might mean takin' chances, but they're worth takin'\n[01:49.55] Lovin' might be a mistake, but it's worth makin'\n[01:55.78] Don't let some Hell bent heart leave you bitter\n[02:02.03] When you come close to sellin' out, reconsider\n[02:08.19] Give the Heavens above more than just a passing glance\n[02:15.05] And when you get the choice to sit it out or dance\n[02:20.66] I hope you dance (Time is a wheel in constant motion)\n[02:27.91] I hope you dance (Always rolling us along)\n[02:33.48] I hope you dance (Tell me who wants to look back on their years and wonder)\n[02:40.57] I hope you dance (Where those years have gone?)\n[02:46.19] I hope you still feel small when you stand beside the ocean\n[02:53.01] Whenever one door closes, I hope one more opens\n[02:58.90] Promise me that you'll give faith a fighting chance\n[03:05.72] And when you get the choice to sit it out or dance\n[03:12.09] Dance\n[03:18.16] I hope you dance\n[03:23.92] I hope you dance (Time is a wheel in constant motion)\n[03:31.03] I hope you dance (Always rolling us along)\n[03:36.55] I hope you dance (Tell me who wants to look back on their years and wonder)\n[03:43.80] I hope you dance (Where those years have gone?)\n[03:50.11] Tell me who wants to look back on their years\n[03:54.74] And wonder where those years have gone\n[04:01.20]",
