        "fullLyrics": "[00:26.005] I wish that I could fly\n[00:27.781] Into the sky\n[00:29.348] So very high\n[00:32.117] Just like a dragonfly\n[00:38.152] I'd fly above the trees\n[00:39.902] Over the seas\n[00:41.443] In all degrees\n[00:43.716] To anywhere I please\n[00:48.261] Oh, I want to get away\n[00:52.388] I want to fly away\n[00:56.046] Yea, yea, yea\n[01:01.244] I want to get away\n[01:04.562] I want to fly away\n[01:08.166] Yea, yea, yea\n[01:14.122] Let's go and see the stars\n[01:16.003] The Milky Way or even Mars\n[01:20.052] Where it could just be ours\n[01:26.034] Let's fade into the sun\n[01:27.863] Let your spirit fly\n[01:29.561] Where we are one\n[01:32.147] Just for a little fun\n[01:34.655] Oh, oh, oh yea\n[01:37.345] I want to get away\n[01:40.375] I want to fly away\n[01:44.111] Yea, yea, yea\n[01:49.675] I want to get away\n[01:52.313] I want to fly away\n[01:56.153] Yea, yea, yea\n[02:12.846] I got to get away\n[02:18.410] Girl I got to get away\n[02:22.615] Oh, oh, oh yea\n[02:25.332] I want to get away\n[02:28.336] I want to fly away\n[02:32.098] Yea, yea, yea\n[02:35.990] (With you )\n[02:36.225] Oh yeah\n[02:37.453] I want to get away\n[02:40.353] I want to fly away\n[02:44.088] Yea, yea, yea\n[02:47.850] (With you )\n[02:48.006] I got to get away\n[02:49.495] I want to get away\n[02:51.820] I want to get away\n[02:55.686] I want to get away\n[02:57.933] I want to get away\n[03:00.415] Yea\n[03:01.329] I want to get away\n[03:04.359] I want to fly away\n[03:08.095] Yea, yea, yea\n[03:11.700] (With you )\n[03:11.856] Girl I got to get away\n[03:13.424] I want to get away\n[03:15.905] I want to get away\n[03:19.301] I want to get away\n[03:21.966] I want to get away\n[03:24.160] Yea\n[03:25.362] I want to get away\n[03:28.627] I want to fly away\n[03:32.049] Yea, yea, yea\n[03:35.654] (With you )\n[03:35.837] Yea, yea, yea, yea, yea",
