        "fullLyrics": "[00:05.26] Man, what in the world is happening down here in the hall?\n[00:07.43] I wouldn't have a clue, let's go check this thing out\n[00:10.97] \n[00:18.62] \n[00:21.34] (Woo)\n[00:26.24] Woo!\n[00:28.61] \n[00:33.97] What is happening here?\n[00:37.55] Something's going on that's not quite clear\n[00:41.39] Somebody turn on the lights\n[00:44.68] We're gonna have a party, it's starting tonight\n[00:49.83] Oh, what a feeling\n[00:53.36] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[00:56.90] Oh, what a feeling\n[01:00.47] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[01:02.18] The room is hot and that's good\n[01:06.61] Some of my friends came by from the neighborhood\n[01:10.07] The people startin' a-climb the walls\n[01:12.90] Ooh, it looks like everybody is having a ball\n[01:18.75] Oh, what a feeling\n[01:22.04] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[01:26.05] Oh, what a feeling\n[01:29.27] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[01:33.17] Oh, oh what a feeling\n[01:36.34] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[01:40.37] Oh, what a feeling\n[01:43.87] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[01:45.88] Come on!\n[01:49.02] \n[01:52.83] Woo!\n[02:00.93] Alright\n[02:02.88] Everybody starts to lose control when the music is right\n[02:09.86] If you see somebody hangin' around don't get up-tight\n[02:17.52] The only thing we wanna do tonight\n[02:23.57] Is go 'round and 'round and turn upside down\n[02:29.52] Come on let's get down!\n[02:31.86] (Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey)\n[02:44.90] So come on, let's get loose\n[02:48.97] Don't hold back 'cause ain't no use\n[02:52.93] Hard to keep your feet on the ground\n[02:55.76] 'Cause when we like to party we only wanna get down\n[03:00.76] Oh, what a feeling\n[03:04.61] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[03:08.59] Oh, what a feeling\n[03:11.73] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[03:15.52] Oh, what a feeling, baby\n[03:18.97] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[03:22.82] Oh, what a feeling\n[03:26.33] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[03:31.94] Say what?\n[03:35.63] Can't stop now\n[03:39.69] Just getting started\n[03:41.49] Everybody clap your hands\n[03:46.39] Come on\n[03:52.26] Everybody let's dance\n[03:57.06] Oh-oh-oh-oh, oh what a feeling\n[04:02.53] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[04:06.14] Oh, what a feeling\n[04:09.54] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[04:13.62] Oh, what a feeling\n[04:16.88] When we're dancing on the ceiling\n[04:18.88] Baby, baby\n[04:24.90] Oh, we gonna dance all night\n[04:28.94]",
