        "fullLyrics": "[00:32.39] Some things you can't go back to\n[00:36.17] Some things need left alone\n[00:39.68] Don't mess with the memories of a life passed on\n[00:47.68] Oh, the tumbling reservations\n[00:51.30] At the heart of my mistakes\n[00:55.53] Oh, some things you can't go back to\n[00:59.57] 'Cause you let them slip away\n[01:03.74] \n[01:21.66] I don't wanna be a witness\n[01:24.76] To a path that's overgrown\n[01:29.61] I don't wanna see this house not be a home\n[01:36.74] 'Cause time has taken toll on what we couldn't see\n[01:44.82] No, I don't wanna be a witness\n[01:48.37] To the end of you and me\n[01:52.52] \n[02:26.42] How am I gonna make each moment\n[02:30.35] Better than the last\n[02:34.58] How am I gonna make it better\n[02:37.44] If I can't go back\n[02:44.39] \n[03:13.09] Oh, the tumbling reservations\n[03:17.05] At the heart of my mistakes\n[03:21.26] Oh, some things you can't go back to\n[03:24.71] 'Cause you let them slip away\n[03:28.88] Oh, some things you can't go back to\n[03:35.07]",
