        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.35] Last night in Memphis\n[00:20.84] Tonight in New Orleans\n[00:27.28] Tomorrow I'll be miles from here\n[00:32.43] Ain't nothin' to me, nothin' to me\n[00:41.39] \n[00:43.82] Sweet gypsy highway\n[00:50.44] Won't you let me chase my dream\n[00:57.00] 'Cause I got a song to take me there\n[01:02.98] And it's somethin' to see, somethin' to see\n[01:08.57] Lord, I was born with a suitcase in my hand\n[01:16.02] Livin' in a life that few could understand\n[01:22.93] Sometimes it gets so confusin'\n[01:26.02] That I don't know where I am\n[01:31.21] But I always know who I'm with\n[01:33.89] I'm with the band\n[01:48.61] Cheap whiskey midnight\n[01:55.23] Another round with my friends\n[02:02.17] Watchin' the world through the windshield\n[02:07.65] And we're rollin' again, rollin' again\n[02:13.62] Lord, I was born with a suitcase in my hand\n[02:21.62] Livin' in a life that few could understand\n[02:28.08] Sometimes it gets so confusin'\n[02:31.20] That I don't know where I am\n[02:36.30] But I always know who I'm with\n[02:38.93] I'm with the band\n[02:58.76] Lord, I was born with a suitcase in my hand\n[03:06.82] \n[03:17.66] Livin' in a life that few could understand\n[03:24.59] Sometimes it gets so confusin'\n[03:28.02] That I don't know where I am\n[03:33.38] But I always know who I'm with\n[03:35.58] I'm with the band\n[03:47.66] Last night in Memphis\n[03:55.07] \n[03:57.53] Tonight in New Orleans\n[04:04.03] Tomorrow I'll be miles from here\n[04:09.24] Ain't nothin' to me, nothin' to me\n[04:14.57]",
