        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.27] I wanna walk that line a little crooked\n[00:19.41] And live my life a little on the rise\n[00:25.93] Laugh at everytime I fell\n[00:28.92] Not afraid of makin' a fool of myself\n[00:32.73] And keep on dancin' when the music stops\n[00:38.41] 'Cause I love being in love\n[00:41.74] It's the best kind of drug\n[00:44.18] Drunk on the high\n[00:45.60] Leanin' on your shoulder\n[00:47.18] Sweet like wine as it gets older\n[00:50.58] When I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[00:56.15] Oh when I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[01:02.04] You're like drinkin' from a never ending vital\n[01:08.10] When I think it's gone there's always a little more left\n[01:14.64] Lay back with you and close my eyes\n[01:17.81] Let the big ol' world spin on by\n[01:21.89] And sayin' your name with my last breath\n[01:27.85] I love being in love\n[01:30.92] It's the best kind of drug\n[01:33.42] Drunk on the high\n[01:34.84] Leanin' on your shoulder\n[01:36.38] Sweet like wine as it gets older\n[01:39.74] When I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[01:45.38] Oh when I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[02:04.74] I love being in love\n[02:07.84] It's the best kind of drug\n[02:10.29] Drunk on the high\n[02:11.70] Leanin' on your shoulder\n[02:13.25] Sweet like wine as it gets older\n[02:16.64] When I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[02:22.11] Oh I love being in love\n[02:26.23] It's the best kind of drug\n[02:28.76] Drunk on the high\n[02:30.15] Leanin' on your shoulder\n[02:31.75] Sweet like wine as it gets older\n[02:35.10] When I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[02:41.26] When I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[02:47.40] When I die - I don't wanna go sober\n[02:52.49]",
