        "dateAdded": "2026-06-11T19:45:02.302Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.10] If you get lucky, you'll get a shiner on your eye\n[00:21.49] From the playground bully in the second grade\n[00:24.56] And if you get lucky, she'll make a senior prom promise\n[00:29.74] Just before she leaves for college out of state\n[00:33.29] Your big dreams are gonna look hazy\n[00:37.59] But don't think a thing of it when they call you crazy\n[00:42.63] Hey, you're gonna stumble through the dark\n[00:46.00] Trippin' while you're wishin' on a fallin' star\n[00:51.06] But hey, you'll learn to love your scars\n[00:54.49] Make a pot of gold out of a broken heart\n[00:58.37] If you get lucky (if you get lucky, ah, ah, ah)\n[01:06.49] If you get lonely, I hope you run across somebody\n[01:11.74] That makes you a little better than you used to be\n[01:15.00] And if you worry 'cause you think the Jones' got it better\n[01:20.32] I hope you come back down to reality\n[01:24.29] Some nights are gonna last forever\n[01:28.11] But the bravest of hearts, babe, they stay together now\n[01:33.12] Hey, you're gonna stumble through the dark\n[01:36.60] Trippin' while you're wishin' on a fallin' star\n[01:41.43] But hey, you'll learn to love your scars\n[01:45.05] Make a pot of gold out of a broken heart\n[01:48.70] If you get lucky\n[01:57.12] If you get lucky, you'll watch your parents grow old\n[02:02.62] But either way, you gotta let 'em go\n[02:05.75] If you get lucky, you'll get half of what you wanted\n[02:10.12] But hope you find the light before it calls you home\n[02:15.46] Hey, you're gonna stumble through the dark\n[02:18.90] Trippin' while you're wishin' on a fallin' star\n[02:23.59] But hey, you'll learn to love your scars\n[02:27.25] Make a pot of gold out of a broken heart\n[02:30.98] If you get lucky (if you get lucky)\n[02:34.49] Yeah, if you get lucky (ah, ah, ah)\n[02:38.66] Oh, if you get lucky (if you get lucky, ah, ah, ah)\n[02:48.14]",
