        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.23] I've been reading books of old\n[00:10.31] The legends and the myths\n[00:12.77] Achilles and his gold\n[00:15.09] Hercules and his gifts\n[00:18.59] Spiderman's control\n[00:19.79] And Batman with his fists\n[00:22.62] And clearly I don't see myself upon that list\n[00:26.13] But she said, where'd you wanna go?\n[00:28.98] How much you wanna risk?\n[00:31.15] I'm not looking for somebody\n[00:33.34] With some superhuman gifts\n[00:35.90] Some superhero\n[00:38.29] Some fairytale bliss\n[00:40.63] Just something I can turn to\n[00:42.88] Somebody I can kiss\n[00:45.15] I want something just like this\n[00:47.72] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[00:48.21] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[00:52.42] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[00:54.19] Oh, I want something just like this\n[00:56.77] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[00:57.55] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[01:00.54] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[01:03.41] Oh, I want something just like this\n[01:08.29] \n[01:12.96] I want something just like this\n[01:17.54] \n[01:22.20] I've been reading books of old\n[01:24.98] The legends and the myths\n[01:27.26] The testaments they told\n[01:29.58] The moon and its eclipse\n[01:31.94] And Superman unrolls\n[01:34.28] A suit before he lifts\n[01:37.62] But I'm not the kind of person that it fits\n[01:40.75] She said, where'd you wanna go?\n[01:43.56] How much you wanna risk?\n[01:45.61] I'm not looking for somebody\n[01:47.85] With some superhuman gifts\n[01:50.55] Some superhero\n[01:52.83] Some fairytale bliss\n[01:55.28] Just something I can turn to\n[01:57.54] Somebody I can miss\n[01:59.59] I want something just like this\n[02:04.41] \n[02:08.92] I want something just like this\n[02:13.26] \n[02:18.24] I want something just like this\n[02:20.98] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[02:21.35] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[02:21.63] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[02:27.34] Oh, I want something just like this\n[02:31.92] \n[02:36.39] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo\n[02:36.65] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[02:37.05] Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo-doo\n[02:37.47] Where'd you wanna go?\n[02:39.43] How much you wanna risk?\n[02:41.51] I'm not looking for somebody\n[02:43.81] With some superhuman gifts\n[02:46.34] Some superhero\n[02:48.76] Some fairytale bliss\n[02:51.12] Just something I can turn to\n[02:53.42] Somebody I can kiss\n[02:55.53] I want something just like this\n[03:00.26] \n[03:13.81] Oh, I want something just like this\n[03:18.78] \n[03:32.57] Oh, I want something just like this\n[03:37.72] Oh, I want something just like this\n[03:54.03]",
