        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.448] Love and Theft - Whiskey On My Breath\n[00:23.812] I woke up poundin' head\n[00:30.365] With a bottle layin' in the bed\n[00:37.038] There was a little a little bit left\n[00:43.224] So I picked it up and I killed the rest\n[00:50.436] Oh I know I'm going to heaven\n[00:56.933] But I can't go with me like this\n[01:03.602] I need to pull myself together before then\n[01:17.126] No and I ain't afraid of dyin'\n[01:23.804] But what scares me to death\n[01:30.356] Is meetin' Jesus with whiskey on my breath\n[01:43.824] I lost her and all my friends\n[01:50.075] Broke all but one of my Lord's ten\n[01:56.748] But Jesus died for all my sins\n[02:03.368] That's how I know I'm getting in\n[02:10.406] Oh I know I'm going to heaven\n[02:16.951] But I can't go with me like this\n[02:23.562] I need to pull myself together before then\n[02:36.993] No and I ain't afraid of dyin'\n[02:43.489] But what scares me to death\n[02:50.452] Is meetin' Jesus with whiskey on my breath\n[03:23.818] Oh I know I'm going to heaven\n[03:30.350] I can't go with me like this\n[03:36.918] I need to pull myself together before then\n[03:50.230] No and I ain't afraid of dyin'\n[03:56.967] But what scares me to death\n[04:03.867] Is meetin' Jesus with whiskey on my breath\n[04:16.997] Is meetin' Jesus with whiskey on my breath",
