        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.47] Fast\n[00:15.55] That's the kind of car you wanna drive when you're sixteen\n[00:19.38] Fast\n[00:21.74] That's the kind of boys that you want on your home team\n[00:25.92] Fast\n[00:28.72] Yeah, you think you're gonna catch your big dreams just like that\n[00:34.28] Fast\n[00:35.57] And here you are, looking back\n[00:38.74] Sixty seconds now feels more like thirty\n[00:42.56] Tick-tock, won't stop, and 'round it goes\n[00:45.65] Sand through the glass sure falls in a hurry\n[00:49.14] And all you keep tryin' to do is slow it down, soak it in\n[00:54.70] To tryin' to make the good times last as long as you can\n[00:59.96] But you can't, man\n[01:03.21] It just goes too fast\n[01:07.47] \n[01:12.47] Fast\n[01:14.43] That's what your parents said when we were fallin' in love\n[01:18.38] It's too fast\n[01:21.01] There ain't no way the two of us were ever gonna last\n[01:26.44] But we did, and here we are, and our only problem is\n[01:31.72] Sixty seconds now feels more like thirty\n[01:35.01] Tick-tock, won't stop, and 'round it goes\n[01:38.56] Sand through the glass sure falls in a hurry\n[01:41.86] And all you keep tryin' to do is slow it down, soak it in\n[01:47.45] To tryin' to make the good times last as long as you can\n[01:52.51] But you can't, man\n[01:56.47] It just goes too fast\n[02:01.08] \n[02:11.02] Looking at you looking out the window right now\n[02:14.69] Those eyes, that dress, that smile, that laugh\n[02:17.83] If I could hit pause I would somehow\n[02:20.92] But it don't work like that\n[02:24.97] Sixty seconds now feels more like thirty\n[02:27.89] Tick-tock, won't stop, and 'round it goes\n[02:31.00] Sand through the glass sure falls in a hurry\n[02:34.31] And all you keep tryin' to do is slow it down, soak it in\n[02:39.92] To tryin' to make the good times last as long as you can\n[02:45.02] But you can't, ya man\n[02:48.90] It goes too fast\n[02:53.05] \n[02:55.99] It just goes too fast\n[02:59.88] \n[03:03.16] Way too fast\n[03:05.19]",
