        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.03] Whoa, whoa, mmm\n[00:20.48] \n[00:25.52] If I could make a livin' walkin' in the woods\n[00:28.21] You could bet I'd be sittin' pretty good\n[00:31.49] High on a hill lookin' at a field downwind\n[00:37.81] If I could make a nickel off a turning 'em bass\n[00:42.33] Never worry about the price of gas\n[00:44.17] I'd be wheelin' and dealin' and sittin' there reelin' 'em in\n[00:49.25] A huntin', fishin', and lovin' every day\n[00:53.52] That's the prayer that a country boy prays\n[00:56.22] Thank God He made me this way\n[00:59.98] Huntin' and fishin' and lovin' every day\n[01:03.19] Early in the mornin' and late in the evenin'\n[01:09.50] I'm gettin' red dirt rich and Flint River pay\n[01:12.23] Huntin' and fishin' and lovin' every day\n[01:15.14] \n[01:24.46] I'd get a little farm pond buzz\n[01:25.46] Sound of gravel when I back it up\n[01:27.69] And pullin' the string on a nine point nine two-stroke\n[01:32.42] Murphy\n[01:33.78] I love it when my baby wants to roll with me\n[01:36.58] Throws her boots on, climbs in a tree\n[01:40.16] Tuckin' her hair in my hat and she's ready to go\n[01:45.73] And we'd get to huntin', fishin' and lovin' every day\n[01:49.73] That's the prayer that a country boy prays\n[01:52.74] Thank God He made me this way\n[01:55.67] Huntin', fishin' and lovin' every day\n[01:58.85] Early in the mornin' and late in the evenin'\n[02:04.99] I'm gettin' red dirt rich, Flint River pay\n[02:08.18] Huntin' and fishin' and lovin' every day\n[02:11.70] \n[02:26.13] So, while y'all are up there\n[02:28.26] Breathin' in that dirty air\n[02:31.70] I'll be down here knee-deep in the Muckalee, uhm\n[02:36.02] \n[02:49.67] Huntin', Fishin', Lovin' everyday\n[02:52.88] I wanna see them tall pines sway\n[02:55.71] Y'all close them eyes\n[03:01.67] And let's go there in our minds\n[03:04.00] Huntin', fishin', and lovin' every day\n[03:08.05] That's the prayer this country boy prays\n[03:10.64] Thank God He made me this way\n[03:14.15] Huntin', fishin' and lovin' every day\n[03:16.87] Black coffee in the mornin' and dark whiskey in the evenin'\n[03:22.67] I get red dirt rich and Flint River pay\n[03:26.74] Huntin', fishin' and lovin' every day, woo\n[03:35.18] Come on\n[03:42.47] Won't you come along with me?\n[03:44.88] Won't you come along with me?\n[03:48.03] I know you'll wanna see\n[03:51.53] Huntin' and fishin' and lovin' every day, yeah\n[04:05.68]",
