        "fullLyrics": "[01:10.226] If I leave here tomorrow\n[01:18.464] Would you still remember me?\n[01:26.455] For I must be traveling on now\n[01:34.435] 'Cause there's too many places I've got to see\n[01:42.787] But if I stay here with you girl\n[01:51.170] Things just couldn't be the same\n[01:58.935] 'Cause I'm as free as a bird now\n[02:07.373] And this bird you cannot change\n[02:12.477] Oh\n[02:15.263] And the bird you cannot change\n[02:22.886] And this bird you cannot change\n[02:30.495] Lord knows I can't change\n[03:10.812] Bye-bye baby it's been a sweet love yeah yeah\n[03:18.862] Though this feeling I can't change\n[03:26.800] But please don't take it so badly\n[03:34.601] 'Cause the Lord knows I'm to blame\n[03:42.849] But if I stay here with you girl\n[03:51.016] Things just couldn't be the same\n[03:58.733] 'Cause I'm as free as a bird now\n[04:07.140] And this bird you cannot change\n[04:12.188] Oh\n[04:15.068] And the bird you cannot change\n[04:22.694] And this bird you cannot change\n[04:30.073] Lord knows I can't change\n[04:37.559] Lord help me I can't change\n[04:45.419] Lord I can't change\n[04:50.141] Won't you fly high free bird yeah",
