        "fullLyrics": "[00:19.02] Last night I dreamt of San Pedro\n[00:24.04] Just like I'd never gone, I knew the song\n[00:29.04] A young girl with eyes like the desert\n[00:34.01] It all seems like yesterday, not far away\n[00:38.05] Tropical the island breeze\n[00:41.08] All of nature wild and free\n[00:43.03] This is where I long to be\n[00:45.06] La isla bonita\n[00:48.05] And when the samba played\n[00:50.09] The sun would set so high\n[00:52.02] Ring through my ears and sting my eyes\n[00:55.06] Your Spanish lullaby\n[00:59.06] \n[01:07.07] I fell in love with San Pedro\n[01:12.05] Warm wind carried on the sea, he called to me\n[01:18.06] Te dijo te amo\n[01:22.00] I prayed that the days would last\n[01:24.07] They went so fast\n[01:26.03] Tropical the island breeze\n[01:28.00] All of nature wild and free\n[01:31.07] This is where I long to be\n[01:33.05] La isla bonita\n[01:36.02] And when the samba played\n[01:38.00] The sun would set so high\n[01:40.05] Ring through my ears and sting my eyes\n[01:43.01] Your Spanish lullaby\n[01:47.01] \n[01:55.07] I want to be where the sun warms the sky\n[01:59.01] When it's time for siesta you can watch them go by\n[02:04.06] Beautiful faces, no cares in this world\n[02:09.08] Where a girl loves a boy, and a boy loves a girl\n[02:19.08] \n[02:26.09] Last night I dreamt of San Pedro\n[02:31.07] It all seems like yesterday, not far away\n[02:36.00] Tropical the island breeze\n[02:38.03] All of nature wild and free\n[02:41.01] This is where I long to be\n[02:43.01] La isla bonita\n[02:46.08] And when the samba played\n[02:48.00] The sun would set so high\n[02:50.05] Ring through my ears and sting my eyes\n[02:52.05] Your Spanish lullaby\n[02:56.05] Tropical the island breeze\n[02:58.05] All of nature wild and free\n[03:01.08] This is where I long to be\n[03:03.02] La isla bonita\n[03:06.02] And when the samba played\n[03:08.03] The sun would set so high\n[03:10.08] Ring through my ears and sting my eyes\n[03:13.03] Your Spanish lullaby\n[03:17.03] \n[03:27.00] La la la la la la la\n[03:30.02] Te dijo te amo\n[03:32.03] La la la la la la la\n[03:34.08] Él dijo que te ama\n[03:36.07] La isla bonita\n[03:37.35]",
