        "fullLyrics": "[00:32.160] Papa I know you're going to be upset\n[00:36.607] Cause I was always your little girl\n[00:40.756] You should know by now\n[00:43.845] I'm not a baby\n[00:48.604] You always taught me right from wrong\n[00:52.532] I need your help daddy please be strong\n[00:56.467] I may be young at heart but I know what I'm saying\n[01:04.356] The one you warned me all about\n[01:08.284] The one you said I could do without\n[01:12.298] We're in an awful mess\n[01:14.938] And I don't mean maybe\n[01:18.161] Please\n[01:19.361] Papa don't preach I'm in trouble deep\n[01:23.109] Papa don't preach I've been losing sleep\n[01:27.653] But I made up my mind I'm keeping my baby\n[01:33.493] Ooh I'm gonna keep my baby mmm\n[01:39.842] He says that he's going to marry me\n[01:43.705] We can raise a little family\n[01:47.753] Maybe we'll be all right it's a sacrifice\n[01:54.743] But my friends keep telling me to give it up\n[01:59.078] Saying I'm too young I ought to live it up\n[02:03.414] What I need right now is some good advice\n[02:09.237] Please\n[02:10.341] Papa don't preach I'm in trouble deep\n[02:14.242] Papa don't preach I've been losing sleep\n[02:18.794] But I made up my mind I'm keeping my baby\n[02:25.272] Ooh I'm gonna keep my baby\n[02:46.392] Daddy daddy if you could only see\n[02:50.545] Just how good he's been treating me\n[02:54.489] You'd give us your blessing right now\n[02:57.457] Cause we are in love\n[03:01.673] We are in love so please\n[03:05.506] Papa don't preach I'm in trouble deep\n[03:09.395] Papa don't preach I've been losing sleep\n[03:13.883] But I made up my mind I'm keeping my baby\n[03:20.164] Ooh I'm gonna keep my baby\n[03:25.266] Papa don't preach I'm in trouble deep\n[03:29.001] Papa don't preach I've been losing sleep\n[03:33.129] Papa don't preach I'm in trouble deep\n[03:36.914] Papa don't preach I've been losing sleep\n[03:40.960] Papa don't preach\n[03:44.459] Oh I'm gonna keep my baby ooh\n[03:49.110] Don't you stop loving me daddy\n[03:53.123] I know I'm keeping my baby",
