        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.750] I'm at a payphone trying to call home\n[00:04.560] All of my change I spent on you\n[00:08.760] Where have the times gone\n[00:11.010] Baby it's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?\n[00:17.760] Yeah, I, I know it's hard to remember\n[00:21.240] The people we used to be\n[00:23.430] It's even harder to picture\n[00:25.590] That you're not here next to me\n[00:27.750] You say it's too late to make it\n[00:29.940] But is it too late to try?\n[00:32.190] And in our time that you wasted\n[00:34.050] All of our bridges burned down\n[00:36.720] I've wasted my nights\n[00:38.820] You turned out the lights\n[00:40.980] Now I'm paralyzed\n[00:43.230] Still stuck in that time when we called it love\n[00:47.550] But even the sun sets in paradise\n[00:52.530] I'm at a payphone trying to call home\n[00:56.940] All of my change I spent on you\n[01:01.140] Where have the times gone\n[01:03.390] Baby it's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?\n[01:09.660] If happy ever after did exist\n[01:14.310] I would still be holding you like this\n[01:18.660] All those fairytales are full of ****\n[01:23.010] One more ******* love song i'll be sick\n[01:28.890] You turned your back on tomorrow\n[01:31.020] Cause you forgot yesterday\n[01:33.240] I gave you my love to borrow\n[01:35.400] But you just gave it away\n[01:37.590] You can't expect me to be fine\n[01:39.840] I don't expect you to care\n[01:42.000] I know I've said it before\n[01:43.530] But all of our bridges burned down\n[01:46.530] I've wasted my nights\n[01:48.660] You turned out the lights\n[01:50.790] Now I'm paralyzed\n[01:53.040] Still stuck in that time when we called it love\n[01:57.360] But even the sun sets in paradise\n[02:02.340] I'm at a payphone trying to call home\n[02:06.780] All of my change I spent on you\n[02:11.040] Where have the times gone\n[02:13.230] Baby it's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?\n[02:19.440] If happy ever after did exist\n[02:24.120] I would still be holding you like this\n[02:28.590] All those fairytales are full of *******t\n[02:32.820] One more ******* love song i'll be sick\n[02:36.870] Now I'm at a payphone...\n[02:39.120] Wiz Khalifa\n[02:39.630] Man **** that *******t\n[02:40.470] I'll be out spending all this money while you sitting round\n[02:42.690] Wondering why it wasn't you who came up from nothing\n[02:44.790] Made it from the bottom\n[02:45.660] Now when you see me I'm stunning\n[02:47.160] And all of my cars start with the push up a button\n[02:49.170] Telling me the chances since I blew up or whatever you call it\n[02:51.570] Switched the number to my phone\n[02:52.650] So you never could call it\n[02:53.700] Don't need my name on my show\n[02:54.810] You can tell it I'm ballin'\n[02:55.950] Swish, what a shame could have got picked\n[02:58.050] Had a really good game but you missed your last shot\n[03:00.390] So you talk about who you see at the top\n[03:02.190] Or what you could've saw\n[03:03.090] But sad to say it's over for\n[03:04.710] Phantom pulled up valet open doors\n[03:06.870] Wiz like go away, got what you was looking for\n[03:09.060] Now it's me who they want\n[03:10.140] So you can go and take that little piece of *******t with you\n[03:12.180] I'm at a payphone trying to call home\n[03:16.590] All of my change I spent on you\n[03:20.820] Where have the times gone\n[03:23.040] Baby it's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?\n[03:29.220] If happy ever after did exist\n[03:33.990] I would still be holding you like this\n[03:38.340] All these fairytales are full of *******t\n[03:42.660] One more ******* love song i'll be sick\n[03:46.740] Now I'm at a Payphone",
