        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[01:00.32] So close, no matter how far\n[01:05.41] Couldn't be much more from the heart\n[01:10.66] Forever trusting who we are\n[01:15.26] And nothing else matters\n[01:20.50] \n[01:22.95] Never opened myself this way\n[01:28.01] Life is ours, we live it our way\n[01:32.87] All these words, I don't just say\n[01:38.32] And nothing else matters\n[01:43.34] \n[01:45.49] Trust I seek and I find in you\n[01:50.83] Every day for us something new\n[01:55.92] Open mind for a different view\n[02:01.07] And nothing else matters\n[02:08.79] Never cared for what they do\n[02:13.41] Never cared for what they know\n[02:18.51] But I know\n[02:25.13] So close, no matter how far\n[02:30.12] It couldn't be much more from the heart\n[02:35.30] Forever trusting who we are\n[02:40.19] And nothing else matters\n[02:47.76] Never cared for what they do\n[02:52.66] Never cared for what they know\n[02:57.74] But I know\n[03:02.70] \n[03:44.31] I never opened myself this way\n[03:49.67] Life is ours, we live it our way\n[03:54.11] All these words, I don't just say\n[03:59.52] And nothing else matters\n[04:06.84] Trust I seek and I find in you\n[04:12.24] Every day for us something new\n[04:17.41] Open mind for a different view\n[04:22.45] And nothing else matters\n[04:30.08] Never cared for what they say\n[04:34.93] Never cared for games they play\n[04:39.96] Never cared for what they do\n[04:44.85] Never cared for what they know\n[04:50.09] And I know, yeah, yeah\n[05:02.60] \n[05:24.52] So close, no matter how far\n[05:29.16] Couldn't be much more from the heart\n[05:34.47] Forever trusting who we are\n[05:39.45] No, nothing else matters\n[05:42.77]",
