        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:10.180] I'm Gonna Make A Change\n[00:13.120] For Once In My Life\n[00:18.670] It's Gonna Feel Real Good\n[00:21.160] Gonna Make A Difference\n[00:22.660] Gonna Make It Right\n[00:28.420] As I Turn Up The Collar On\n[00:31.630] My Favourite Winter Coat\n[00:34.030] This Wind Is Blowin' My Mind\n[00:37.750] I See The Kids In The Street\n[00:40.480] With Not Enough To Eat\n[00:42.010] Who Am I, To Be Blind?\n[00:44.350] Pretending Not To See Their Needs\n[00:48.400] A Summer's Disregard\n[00:50.830] A Broken Bottle Top\n[00:53.440] And A One Man's Soul\n[00:57.190] They Follow Each Other On The Wind Ya' Know\n[01:01.570] 'Cause They Got Nowhere To Go\n[01:05.080] That's Why I Want You To Know\n[01:07.780] I'm Starting With The Man In The Mirror\n[01:12.550] I'm Asking Him To Change His Ways\n[01:17.020] And No Message Could Have Been Any Clearer\n[01:21.190] If You Wanna Make The World A Better Place\n[01:23.590] Take A Look At Yourself\n[01:24.670] And Then Make A Change\n[01:36.490] I've Been A Victim Of A Selfish Kind Of Love\n[01:40.930] It's Time That I Realize\n[01:44.710] That There Are Some With No Home\n[01:47.440] Not A Nickel To Loan\n[01:49.210] Could It Be Really Me Pretending That They're Not Alone?\n[01:55.270] A Willow Deeply Scarred\n[01:57.550] Somebody's Broken Heart\n[02:00.310] And A Washed-Out Dream\n[02:04.180] They Follow The Pattern Of The Wind, Ya' See\n[02:08.650] Cause They Got No Place To Be\n[02:11.950] That's Why I'm Starting With Me\n[02:14.680] I'm Starting With The Man In The Mirror\n[02:19.420] I'm Asking Him To Change His Ways\n[02:23.950] And No Message Could Have Been Any Clearer\n[02:28.090] If You Wanna Make The World A Better Place\n[02:30.460] Take A Look At Yourself And Then Make A Change\n[02:33.760] I'm Starting With The Man In The Mirror\n[02:38.530] I'm Asking Him To Change His Ways\n[02:43.060] And No Message Could Have Been Any Clearer\n[02:47.230] If You Wanna Make The World A Better Place\n[02:49.600] Take A Look At Yourself And Then Make A Change\n[02:53.320] I'm Starting With The Man In The Mirror\n[02:57.700] I'm Asking Him To Change His Ways\n[03:01.270] And No Message Could Have Been Any Clearer\n[03:06.340] If You Wanna Make The World A Better Place\n[03:08.680] Take A Look At Yourself And Then Make A Change\n[03:11.050] You Gotta Get It Right, While You Got The Time\n[03:13.360] 'Cause When You Close Your Heart\n[03:14.650] You Can Close Your Mind!\n[03:17.980] With That Man In The Mirror\n[03:20.380] I'm Asking Him To Change His Ways\n[03:26.650] No Message Could Have Been Any Clearer\n[03:30.220] If You Wanna Make The World A Better Place\n[03:32.590] Take A Look At Yourself And Then Make A Change\n[03:49.660] I'm Gonna Make A Change\n[03:58.120] It's Gonna Feel Real Good! Come On\n[04:03.040] Just Lift Yourself You Know\n[04:06.610] You've Got To Stop It Yourself! Brother\n[04:12.700] I'm Gonna Make A Change, Today\n[04:15.820] Man in the Mirror\n[04:18.580] You Got To Not Let Yourself, Brother\n[04:24.550] You Know-I've Got To Get That Man, That Man\n[04:30.520] You've Got To Move! Come On\n[04:36.460] You Got To Stand Up!\n[04:40.030] Stand Up And Lift Yourself, Now!\n[04:44.470] Man in the Mirror\n[04:46.660] You Know It\n[04:56.230] Make That Change",
