        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:12.35] Looking back over my shoulder\n[00:18.64] I can see that look in your eye\n[00:23.79] I never dreamed it could be over\n[00:28.59] I never wanted to say goodbye\n[00:33.06] Looking back over my shoulder\n[00:39.44] With an aching deep in my heart\n[00:44.21] I wish that we were starting over\n[00:49.23] Oh instead of drifting so far apart\n[00:54.87] Everybody told me you were leaving\n[00:59.95] Funny I should be the last to know\n[01:05.36] Baby please tell me that I'm dreaming\n[01:09.80] I just never want to let you go\n[01:17.06] Looking back over my shoulder\n[01:23.10] I can see that look in your eye\n[01:28.79] Turning my heart over and over\n[01:33.16] I never wanted to say goodbye\n[01:38.38] I don't mind everybody laughing\n[01:44.17] But it's enough to make a grown man cry\n[01:49.02] Cos I can feel you slipping through my fingers\n[01:53.92] I don't even know the reason why\n[02:00.98] Every day it's a losing battle\n[02:28.37] Just to smile and hold my head up high\n[02:33.65] Could it be that we belong together\n[02:38.46] Baby won't you give me one more try\n[02:44.91] One more try\n[02:47.27] Looking back over my shoulder\n[02:53.99] I can see that look in your eye\n[02:59.77] I never dreamed it could be over\n[03:04.35] I never wanted to say goodbye\n[03:09.13] Looking back over my shoulder\n[03:15.75] Oh with an aching feeling inside\n[03:20.51] Cutting me up, deeper and deeper\n[03:25.28] Fills me with a sadness that I can't hide\n[03:30.05] Looking back over my shoulder\n[03:32.69] I can see that look in your eye\n[03:34.13] I never dreamed no no it could be over\n[03:36.38] I never wanted to say goodbye\n[03:37.01] Looking back over my shoulder\n[03:37.17] I can see that look in your eye\n[03:37.25]",
