        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.76] I'm walking in their footsteps\n[00:20.71] I'm singing their old songs\n[00:24.54] Somebody blazed this trail\n[00:27.72] I'm treadin' on\n[00:33.17] I'm bent, but I'm not broken\n[00:37.01] I'm stronger than I feel\n[00:41.15] I'm made of flesh and bone\n[00:44.38] Not made of steel\n[00:48.73] I'm the keeper of the flame\n[00:53.89] The teller of the story\n[00:57.25] Keeper of the flame\n[01:01.46] For the ones that came before me\n[01:05.81] For those little pilot lights, waiting to ignite\n[01:10.48] Like fireflies in the rain\n[01:13.67] Keeper of the flame\n[01:22.89] I've been burned out to ashes\n[01:26.81] Waiting for a wind\n[01:30.80] To carry me and start a fire again\n[01:39.02] Sometimes I'm just a flicker\n[01:43.19] A candle in your eye\n[01:47.16] But I swear to God\n[01:49.42] I'll never let it die\n[01:54.63] I'm the keeper of the flame\n[01:59.85] The teller of the story\n[02:03.20] Keeper of the flame\n[02:07.71] For the ones that came before me\n[02:11.84] For those little pilot lights, waiting to ignite\n[02:16.31] Like fireflies in the rain\n[02:19.84] Keeper of the flame\n[02:28.62] When I'm drowning\n[02:30.47] When I'm fighting\n[02:32.51] When I'm screaming\n[02:34.53] When I'm hiding\n[02:36.62] When I'm losing\n[02:38.43] When I'm winning\n[02:40.81] I go back to\n[02:42.84] The beginning\n[02:44.78] Keeper of the flame\n[02:49.50] The teller of the story\n[02:52.58] Keeper of the flame\n[02:57.28] I'm not doing it for the glory\n[03:00.85] But for those little pilot lights, waiting to ignite\n[03:05.84] Like fireflies in the rain\n[03:09.19] Keeper of the flame\n[03:17.24] I'm the keeper of the flame\n[03:26.41] Ooooh, oooh\n[03:33.89] I'm the keeper of the flame\n[03:43.45] Ooooh, oooh\n[03:53.42]",
