        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.61] Hold on, little girl\n[00:11.93] Show me what he's done to you\n[00:15.11] Stand up little girl\n[00:17.62] Broken heart can't be that bad\n[00:20.29] When it's through, it's through\n[00:23.20] Fate will twist the both of you\n[00:26.16] So come on baby, come on over\n[00:29.85] Let me be the one to show you\n[00:32.95] I'm the one who wants to be with you\n[00:37.96] Deep inside I hope you feel it too (feel it too)\n[00:43.08] Waited on a line of greens and blues (waited on a line)\n[00:49.33] Just to be the next to be with you\n[00:55.13] Build up your confidence\n[00:58.23] So you can be on top for once\n[01:01.19] Wake up who cares about\n[01:04.33] Little boys that talk too much\n[01:06.60] I've seen it all go down\n[01:08.92] The game of love was all rained out\n[01:12.74] So come on baby, come on over\n[01:15.59] Let me be the one to hold you\n[01:19.37] I'm the one who wants to be with you (I'm the one, yeah)\n[01:23.96] Deep inside I hope you feel it too (feel it too)\n[01:29.50] Waited on a line of greens and blues (waited on a line, yeah)\n[01:35.04] Just to be the next to be with you\n[01:43.07] Why be alone when we can be together, baby?\n[01:46.47] You can make my life worthwhile\n[01:50.35] I can make you start to smile\n[01:57.69] \n[02:15.54] When it's through, it's through\n[02:18.26] Fate will twist the both of you\n[02:21.34] So come on baby, come on over\n[02:23.91] Let me be the one to show you\n[02:27.37] I'm the one who wants to be with you (I'm the one)\n[02:33.48] Deep inside I hope you feel it too (feel it too)\n[02:40.01] Waited on a line of greens and blues (waited on a line)\n[02:45.58] Yeah, just to be the next to be with you\n[02:51.76] I'm the one who wants to be with you (I'm the one)\n[02:56.92] Deep inside I hope (deep inside) you feel it too (you feel it too)\n[03:02.94] Waited on a line of greens and blues (waited on that line)\n[03:08.61] Yeah, just to be the next to be with you\n[03:14.38] Just to be the next to be with you, ooh\n[03:21.40]",
