        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.00] Ain't nothing like a fast lane\n[00:22.00] The blur of the white lines\n[00:25.00] ain't nothing like the burn in a shadow whiskey\n[00:28.00] to fire up the night\n[00:31.00] Or the sting of a long kiss\n[00:33.00] Smoke rolling off a good bus,\n[00:36.00] When you get a little taste you just want more\n[00:39.00] man too much ain't enough\n[00:41.00] And with the money-man blow through it\n[00:44.00] I just wanna living like Cash would do\n[00:47.00] Yeah, walk the line on the wild side just to get back to it.\n[00:52.00] I'm gonna light it up and burn it down,\n[00:55.00] I'm gonna turn it up and play it loud\n[00:58.00] And when the party ends, wake up again and get right back to\n[01:16.00] Ain't nothing like a good girl\n[01:19.00] To pull you from a bad dream,\n[01:21.00] Ain't nothing like love in a getaway truck\n[01:24.00] with a full tank of gasoline.\n[01:27.00] Ain't nothing like a pay-check,\n[01:30.00] When you're down for your last time.\n[01:32.30] Ain't nothing like a sweet little souther thing\n[01:35.00] spinning all long Friday night.\n[01:37.00] And with the money-man blow through it\n[01:40.00] I just wanna living like Cash would do\n[01:43.00] Yeah, walk the line on the wild side just to get back to it.\n[01:49.00] I'm gonna light it up and burn it down,\n[01:52.00] I'm gonna turn it up and play it loud\n[01:55.00] And when the party ends, wake up again and get right back to\n[02:11.00] Let's Rock This Shit!\n[02:23.00] And with the money-man blow through it\n[02:25.30] I just wanna living like Cash would do\n[02:29.00] Yeah, walk the line on the wild side just to get back to it.\n[02:34.00] I'm gonna light it up and burn it down,\n[02:37.00] I'm gonna turn it up and play it loud\n[02:40.00] And when the party ends, wake up again and get right back to\n[02:45.00] And with the money-man blow through it\n[02:48.00] I just wanna living like Cash would do\n[02:51.00] Yeah, walk the line on the wild side just to get back to it.\n[02:57.00] I'm gonna light it up and burn it down,\n[03:00.00] I'm gonna turn it up and play it loud\n[03:30.00] And when the party ends, wake up again and get right back to",
