        "dateAdded": "2026-04-24T13:22:40.854Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.55] I was a ten-year train wreck\n[00:19.50] With a last-call long neck\n[00:22.52] I was searchin', I'd been hurt real bad\n[00:29.40] Movin' on, gettin' sidetracked\n[00:31.92] One step forward and five back\n[00:34.62] Not your fault, I was scared to fall\n[00:40.91] And I don't know why\n[00:43.94] Why you saw something in me, baby\n[00:46.66] Girl, but you saw right through\n[00:49.80] All the pain, and you came and saved me\n[00:52.92] Yeah, I know you didn't leave me lonely\n[00:55.93] Weren't the one that put the heartbreak on me\n[00:58.95] Picked up the pieces\n[01:01.43] It wasn't the mess that you made\n[01:05.27] Could've left me just the way you found me\n[01:08.21] But you came and put your wings around me\n[01:11.29] Girl, you went out of your way\n[01:14.45] To fix what you didn't break\n[01:21.58] You were the star in the pitch black\n[01:24.29] Shine the way on the way back\n[01:27.16] Out of nowhere, answered all my prayers\n[01:33.04] Picked up the towel that I threw in\n[01:36.75] Took in a heart that was ruined\n[01:39.84] Showed me the past ain't a tattoo\n[01:41.95] Loved me even when you didn't have to\n[01:45.28] Yeah, I know you didn't leave me lonely\n[01:48.35] Weren't the one that put the heartbreak on me\n[01:51.32] Picked up the pieces\n[01:54.28] It wasn't the mess that you made\n[01:57.62] Could've left me just the way you found me\n[02:00.43] But you came and put your wings around me\n[02:03.54] Girl, you went out of your way\n[02:06.86] To fix what you didn't break\n[02:10.18] To fix what you didn't break\n[02:25.59] And I don't know why\n[02:28.69] Why you saw something in me, baby\n[02:31.43] Girl, but you saw right through\n[02:34.52] All the pain, and you came and saved me\n[02:37.78] Yeah, I know you didn't leave me lonely\n[02:40.78] Weren't the one that put the heartbreak on me\n[02:43.51] Picked up the pieces\n[02:46.01] It wasn't the mess that you made\n[02:49.77] Could've left me just the way you found me\n[02:52.93] But you came and put your wings around me\n[02:55.96] Girl, you went out of your way\n[02:59.33] To fix what you didn't break\n[03:08.36] To fix what you didn't break\n[03:11.55]",
