        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.26] Now, I've wasted a paycheck on whiskey and long necks\n[00:13.43] Ever since you left trying to figure this out\n[00:17.77] This Jack I've been drinking's been wasted on thinking\n[00:22.07] Now, I got a new reason for throwing 'em down\n[00:26.15] Line 'em up (line 'em up), pour 'em tall (pour 'em tall)\n[00:30.26] Here's to us, happily never after all\n[00:34.76] Ain't gonna waste one more night missing, wanting you back\n[00:39.65] No, I ain't gonna cry another tear in this glass\n[00:43.76] You didn't waste any time finding somebody new\n[00:48.02] So, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[00:52.19] No, I ain't\n[00:57.03] To hell with the lonely, and the-why-don't-you-want-me\n[01:01.75] Yeah, bartender pour me a farewell round\n[01:05.54] Line 'em up (line 'em up), make 'em strong (make 'em strong)\n[01:09.89] Tell the band that I need me a drinking song\n[01:14.23] Ain't gonna waste one more night missing, wanting you back\n[01:18.42] No, I ain't gonna cry another tear in this glass\n[01:22.84] You didn't waste any time finding somebody new\n[01:26.90] So, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[01:31.48] No, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[01:36.37] No, I ain't\n[01:40.42] No, I ain't\n[01:43.26] \n[01:50.33] I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you, no\n[01:54.52] I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[01:58.11] Line 'em up (line 'em up), pour 'em tall (pour 'em tall)\n[02:02.39] Here's to us happily never after all\n[02:06.71] Ain't gonna waste one more night missing, wanting you back\n[02:11.14] No, I ain't gonna cry another tear in this glass\n[02:15.48] You didn't waste any time finding somebody new\n[02:19.66] So, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[02:24.02] No, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[02:28.52] No, I ain't, yeah (gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you)\n[02:32.98] No, I ain't (gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you)\n[02:38.49] Ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[02:41.90] No, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[02:45.83] No, I ain't\n[02:50.56] No, I ain't gonna waste another drop of whiskey on you\n[02:53.63]",
