        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.225] Never made it as a wise man\n[00:05.913] I couldn't cut it as a poor man stealing\n[00:08.846] Tired of living like a blind man\n[00:11.478] I'm sick of sight without a sense of feeling\n[00:14.029] And this is how you remind me\n[00:19.932] This is how you remind me\n[00:23.164] Of what I really am\n[00:25.493] This is how you remind me\n[00:28.645] Of what I really am\n[00:31.012] It's not like you to say sorry\n[00:33.894] I was waiting on a different story\n[00:36.784] This time I'm mistaken\n[00:39.581] For handing you a heart worth breaking\n[00:41.943] And I've been wrong I've been down\n[00:44.985] Been to the bottom of every bottle\n[00:47.927] These five words in my head\n[00:50.720] Scream are we having fun yet\n[00:53.861] Yeah yeah yeah no no\n[00:59.437] Yeah yeah yeah no no\n[01:04.478] It's not like you didn't know that\n[01:07.267] I said I love you and I swear I still do\n[01:10.130] And it must have been so bad\n[01:12.918] Cause living with me must have d**n near killed you\n[01:15.478] And this is how you remind me\n[01:18.949] Of what I really am\n[01:21.433] This is how you remind me\n[01:24.579] Of what I really am\n[01:26.896] It's not like you to say sorry\n[01:29.753] I was waiting on a different story\n[01:32.636] This time I'm mistaken\n[01:35.420] For handing you a heart worth breaking\n[01:37.875] And I've been wrong I've been down\n[01:40.759] Been to the bottom of every bottle\n[01:43.765] These five words in my head\n[01:46.631] Scream are we having fun yet\n[01:49.749] Yeah yeah yeah no no\n[01:55.260] Yeah yeah yeah no no\n[02:00.877] Yeah yeah yeah no no\n[02:06.453] Yeah yeah yeah no no\n[02:22.883] Never made it as a wise man\n[02:25.560] I couldn't cut it as a poor man stealing\n[02:28.109] And this is how you remind me\n[02:34.116] This is how you remind me\n[02:39.661] This is how you remind me\n[02:42.741] Of what I really am\n[02:45.205] This is how you remind me\n[02:48.309] Of what I really am\n[02:50.672] It's not like you to say sorry\n[02:53.493] I was waiting on a different story\n[02:56.391] This time I'm mistaken\n[02:59.205] For handing you a heart worth breaking\n[03:01.645] And I've been wrong I've been down\n[03:04.631] Been to the bottom of every bottle\n[03:07.608] These five words in my head\n[03:10.264] Scream are we having fun yet\n[03:13.538] Yeah yeah are we having fun yet\n[03:19.096] Yeah yeah are we having fun yet\n[03:24.671] Yeah yeah are we having fun yet\n[03:30.256] Yeah yeah no no",
