        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.919] I`m through with standing in line\n[00:02.170] To clubs we`ll never get in\n[00:04.025] It`s like the bottom of the ninth\n[00:05.656] And i`m never gonna win\n[00:07.331] This life hasn`t turned out\n[00:09.240] Quite the way i want it to be\n[00:13.330] I want a brand new house\n[00:15.693] On an episode of cribs\n[00:16.941] And a bathroom i can play baseball in\n[00:20.647] And a king size tub big enough\n[00:22.801] For ten plus me\n[00:27.120] I`ll need a credit card that`s got no limit\n[00:30.464] And a big black jet with a bedroom in it\n[00:34.066] Gonna join the mile high club\n[00:35.830] At thirty-seven thousand feet\n[00:40.416] I want a new tour bus full of old guitars\n[00:43.812] My own star on hollywood boulevard\n[00:47.286] Somewhere between cher and\n[00:49.219] James dean is fine for me\n[00:53.736] I`m gonna trade this life for fortune and fame\n[00:57.079] I`d even cut my hair and change my name\n[01:00.626] `cause we all just wanna be big rockstars\n[01:03.790] And live in hilltop houses driving fifteen cars\n[01:07.546] The girls come easy and the *** come cheap\n[01:10.840] We`ll all stay skinny `cause we just won`t eat\n[01:13.972] And we`ll hang out in the coolest bars\n[01:17.301] In the vip with the movie stars\n[01:20.633] Every good gold digger`s\n[01:22.366] Gonna wind up there\n[01:23.948] Every playboy bunny\n[01:25.623] With her bleach blond hair\n[01:28.101] Hey hey i wanna be a rockstar\n[01:34.670] Hey hey i wanna be a rockstar\n[01:39.880] I wanna be great like elvis without the tassels\n[01:43.661] Hire eight body guards that love to beat up assholes\n[01:47.179] Sign a couple autographs\n[01:48.407] So i can eat my meals for free\n[01:53.646] I`m gonna dress my ass\n[01:55.538] With the latest fashion\n[01:56.960] Get a front door key to the playboy mansion\n[02:00.275] Gonna date a centerfold that loves to\n[02:03.041] Blow my money for me\n[02:06.925] I`m gonna trade this life\n[02:08.815] For fortune and fame\n[02:10.269] I`d even cut my hair\n[02:12.182] And change my name\n[02:13.891] `cause we all just wanna be big rockstars\n[02:17.099] And live in hilltop houses driving fifteen cars\n[02:20.605] The girls come easy and the *** come cheap\n[02:23.957] We`ll all stay skinny `cause we just won`t eat\n[02:27.214] And we`ll hang out in the coolest bars\n[02:30.546] In the vip with the movie stars\n[02:33.782] Every good gold digger`s\n[02:35.515] Gonna wind up there\n[02:37.196] Every playboy bunny\n[02:38.809] With her bleach blond hair\n[02:40.490] And we`ll hide out in the private rooms\n[02:43.755] With the latest dictionary and\n[02:45.729] Today`s who`s who\n[02:47.409] They`ll get you anything\n[02:48.835] With that evil smile\n[02:50.463] Everybody`s got a\n[02:52.027] Drug dealer on speed dial\n[02:53.960] Hey hey i wanna be a rockstar\n[03:00.349] I`m gonna sing those songs\n[03:02.160] That offend the censors\n[03:03.835] Gonna pop my pills\n[03:05.527] From a pez dispenser\n[03:07.080] I`ll get washed-up singers writing all my songs\n[03:10.464] Lip sync em every night so i don`t get `em wrong\n[03:15.320] Well we all just wanna be big rockstars\n[03:18.605] And live in hilltop houses driving fifteen cars\n[03:22.292] The girls come easy and the *** come cheap\n[03:25.586] We`ll all stay skinny `cause we just won`t eat\n[03:28.851] And we`ll hang out in the coolest bars\n[03:32.154] In the vip with the movie stars\n[03:35.498] Every good gold digger`s\n[03:37.152] Gonna wind up there\n[03:38.804] Every playboy bunny\n[03:40.066] With her bleach blond hair\n[03:42.208] And we`ll hide out in the private rooms\n[03:45.494] With the latest dictionary and\n[03:47.387] Today`s who`s who\n[03:49.067] They`ll get you anything\n[03:50.481] With that evil smile\n[03:52.120] Everybody`s got a\n[03:53.395] Drug dealer on speed dialb",
