        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.10] Come as you are, as you were\n[00:24.97] As I want you to be\n[00:28.90] As a friend, as a friend\n[00:32.77] As an old enemy\n[00:36.89] Take your time, hurry up\n[00:41.35] Choice is yours, don't be late\n[00:44.81] Take a rest as a friend\n[00:48.61] As an old memoria\n[00:54.99] Memoria\n[00:59.12] Memoria\n[01:02.82] Memoria\n[01:08.10] Come doused in mud, soaked in bleach\n[01:12.64] As I want you to be\n[01:16.76] As a trend, as a friend\n[01:20.80] As an old memoria\n[01:27.03] Memoria\n[01:30.92] Memoria\n[01:35.16] Memoria\n[01:40.83] And I swear that I don't have a gun\n[01:46.76] No, I don't have a gun\n[01:50.50] No, I don't have a gun\n[01:55.02] \n[02:36.19] Memoria\n[02:38.66] Memoria\n[02:43.11] \n[02:46.28] Memoria (no, I don't have a gun)\n[02:50.79] And I swear and I don't have a gun\n[02:58.45] No, I don't have a gun\n[03:01.65] No, I don't have a gun\n[03:05.44] No, I don't have a gun\n[03:08.75] No, I don't have a gun\n[03:13.35] Memoria\n[03:17.20] \n[03:21.98] Memoria\n[03:26.70]",
