        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.78] Hey girl, what's up?\n[00:16.30] I know it's late, but I knew you'd pick it up\n[00:19.95] Naw, I ain't drunk\n[00:22.94] Okay, maybe I do have a little buzz but\n[00:26.24] That song came on and I just thought\n[00:28.75] What harm could come from one little call?\n[00:31.75] I know you say you're taken\n[00:34.99] But I say, \"Girl, you're taking too long\n[00:37.15] To tell him that it's over\n[00:40.91] Then bring it on over\n[00:44.97] Stringing him along any longer girl\n[00:47.73] It's just wasting precious time\n[00:50.72] Girl, you know it can't wait\n[00:53.24] Rip it off just like a band-aid\n[00:56.67] The way you look at me, girl, you can't pretend\n[01:00.38] I know you ain't in love with him, break up with him\"\n[01:16.99] I know, you don't wanna break his heart\n[01:19.68] But that ain't no good reason to be keeping us apart, look\n[01:23.22] Just tell him, it's you, it ain't him\n[01:25.72] And maybe you can lie to him\n[01:27.68] And say you'll still be friends\n[01:29.68] Whatever you got to say\n[01:35.51] To get through to him that you ain't in love\n[01:39.61] C'mon, you can't deny that you and I\n[01:40.36] Kinda fit like a glove\n[01:41.33] So tell him that it's over\n[01:44.17] Then bring it on over\n[01:47.53] Stringing him along any longer girl\n[01:50.95] It's just wasting precious time\n[01:53.56] Girl, you know it can't wait\n[01:56.59] Rip it off just like a band-aid\n[02:00.17] It ain't my business to be all up in\n[02:03.76] But I know you ain't in love with him\n[02:05.48] Break up with him\n[02:06.97] I know that you so done with him\n[02:08.73] Break up with him, break up with him (break up with him)\n[02:23.11] You oughta hung up by now\n[02:26.65] If you weren't thinking it too\n[02:29.74] No pressure, whatever, just do what you gotta do\n[02:33.88] But if I was you\n[02:34.96] I'd tell him that it's over\n[02:38.00] Then bring it on over\n[02:41.22] Stringing him along any longer girl\n[02:44.88] It's just wasting precious time\n[02:47.34] Girl, you know it can't wait\n[02:49.99] Just rip it off like a band-aid\n[02:53.65] Yeah, I know I said it, but I'll say it again\n[02:57.64] I know you ain't in love with him\n[02:59.18] Break up with him\n[03:00.97] The way you look at me, girl, you can't pretend\n[03:03.85] I know you ain't in love with him, break up with him, yeah\n[03:11.97] Just break up with him\n[03:18.66]",
