        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.52] Right now we both know\n[00:13.67] We're Marina del Rey\n[00:16.21] Plane's gonna fly away\n[00:19.56] And you'll be on it\n[00:21.48] And by this time tomorrow\n[00:25.43] I'll be singin' Yesterday\n[00:27.79] The sunshine's gonna fade\n[00:30.95] And we can't stop it\n[00:32.77] So before we turn in to\n[00:36.61] I can't make you love me\n[00:38.78] Let's be Brown Eyed Girl, Sweet Caroline\n[00:43.67] Free fallin' small town Saturday night\n[00:46.19] Before you Lose that Lovin' Feelin'\n[00:48.91] Let's go Dancin' on the Ceilin'\n[00:52.10] Keep on livin' that teenage dream\n[00:55.32] Paradise City where the grass is green\n[00:57.89] Pretty soon I'll be so Lonesome I Could Cry\n[01:01.56] But that's a song for another time\n[01:04.33] For just for one more day\n[01:07.09] \n[01:10.33] What do you say\n[01:11.55] Baby be my Pretty Woman\n[01:14.50] Because we know Sunday Morning's Coming Down\n[01:19.01] And let's take a drive, you and I, down some old country road\n[01:25.94] Talk about growin' old in one of those Pink Houses\n[01:30.60] Yeah we might be a Candle in the Wind\n[01:36.04] But let's pretend we're\n[01:38.62] Brown Eyed Girl, Sweet Caroline\n[01:41.67] Free fallin' Small Town Saturday night\n[01:43.91] Before you Lose that Lovin' Feelin'\n[01:46.93] Let's go Dancin' on the Ceilin'\n[01:50.12] Keep on livin' that teenage dream\n[01:52.63] Paradise city where the grass is green\n[01:55.61] Pretty soon you will be always on my mind\n[01:59.14] That's a song for another time\n[02:01.78] Oh before we say I Will Always Love You\n[02:07.61] \n[02:17.60] Let's sing Brown Eyed Girl, Sweet Caroline\n[02:22.08] Free fallin' small town Saturday night\n[02:24.69] Before you Lose that Lovin' Feelin'\n[02:27.55] Let's go Dancin' on the Ceilin'\n[02:30.64] Keep on livin' that teenage dream\n[02:33.19] Paradise City where the grass is green\n[02:36.04] Pretty soon I'll Be So Lonesome I Could Cry\n[02:39.72] But that's a song for another time\n[02:42.29] Ya that's a song for another time\n[02:45.56] \n[02:48.05] (Brown-eyed Girl, Sweet Caroline)\n[02:50.42] Ya that's a song for another time\n[02:53.82] (Small Town Saturday Night)\n[02:56.14] That's a song for another time\n[02:57.52]",
