        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.460] Maybe it's the way she walked,\n[00:24.420] straight into my heart and stole it.\n[00:28.470] Through the doors and past the guards,\n[00:32.670] just like she already own it.\n[00:35.700] I said can you give it back to me,\n[00:39.480] she said never in your wildest dreams.\n[00:44.340] And we danced all night\n[00:46.410] to the best song ever\n[00:48.420] We knew every line\n[00:50.340] now I can't remember\n[00:52.410] How it goes but I know\n[00:54.510] that I won't forget her\n[00:56.520] Cause we danced all night\n[00:58.530] to the best song ever\n[01:00.570] I think it went oh, oh, oh\n[01:02.490] I think it went yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:04.530] I think it goes...\n[01:08.970] Said her name was georgia rose,\n[01:13.230] and her daddy was a dentist\n[01:17.070] Said I had a dirty mouth\n[01:19.920] （i got a dirty mouth）\n[01:21.240] but she kissed me like she meant it\n[01:24.360] I said can I take you home with me,\n[01:28.260] she said never in your wildest dreams\n[01:32.940] And we danced all night\n[01:35.010] to the best song ever\n[01:37.020] We knew every line\n[01:39.000] now I can't remember\n[01:41.010] How it goes but I know\n[01:43.110] that I won't forget her\n[01:45.150] Cause we danced all night\n[01:47.130] to the best song ever\n[01:49.230] I think it went oh, oh, oh\n[01:51.090] I think it went yeah, yeah, yeah\n[01:53.130] I think it goes...\n[01:57.720] You know, I know,\n[01:59.280] you know I'll remember you,\n[02:01.650] And I know, you know,\n[02:03.390] I know you'll remember me,\n[02:05.760] And you know, I know,\n[02:07.350] you know I'll remember you,\n[02:09.780] And I know, you know,\n[02:11.430] I hope you'll remember how we danced,\n[02:14.820] （yeah yeah yeah） how we danced （1,2,1,2,3）\n[02:21.810] And we danced all night\n[02:23.670] to the best song ever\n[02:25.680] We knew every line\n[02:27.690] now I can't remember\n[02:29.610] How it goes but I know\n[02:31.710] that I won't forget her\n[02:33.720] Cause we danced all night （we danced, we danced,）\n[02:35.850] to the best song ever （it goes something like）\n[02:38.070] And we danced all night\n[02:39.870] to the best song ever\n[02:41.880] We knew every line\n[02:43.830] now I can't remember\n[02:45.810] How it goes but I know\n[02:47.910] that I won't forget her\n[02:50.280] Cause we danced all night\n[02:51.960] to the best song ever\n[02:54.060] I think it went oh, oh, oh\n[02:56.100] I think it went yeah, yeah, yeah\n[03:00.180] I think it goes....\n[03:02.550] Best song ever,\n[03:05.880] it was the best song ever,\n[03:09.930] It was the best song ever,\n[03:13.980] it was the best song ever",
