        "fullLyrics": "[00:30.00] Goodbye, strung out on the lawn\n[00:36.09] The line between us was drawn\n[00:42.05] All I can see is you're gone and you left me here\n[00:47.98] With this house on this ground, burn it down\n[00:55.18] \n[00:59.79] I'll leave my memories inside\n[01:05.55] In that bed, we loved in all night\n[01:11.85] Every word, every fight, every feeling\n[01:16.75] Stone cold, not a sound\n[01:21.25] Burn it down 'til it's ashes and smoke\n[01:27.24] Burn it down to the smoldering coals\n[01:33.18] Burn it down 'til I don't want you no more\n[01:38.24] Baby, burn it down\n[01:43.67] \n[01:47.21] Every last song that I wrote\n[01:52.97] About me and you growing old\n[01:58.92] Every sliver of hope, everything I know\n[02:04.92] Pile it up right now\n[02:08.65] Burn it down 'til it's ashes and smoke\n[02:14.56] Burn it down to the smoldering coals\n[02:20.57] Burn it down 'til I don't want you no more\n[02:25.79] Baby, burn it down\n[02:31.99] \n[02:50.08] Burn it down (burn it, burn it, burn it)\n[02:56.02] Burn it down (burn it, burn it, burn it)\n[03:02.02] Burn it down 'til it's ashes and smoke\n[03:07.88] Burn it down to the smoldering coals\n[03:13.78] Burn it down 'til I don't want you no more\n[03:19.00] Baby, burn it down (burn it, burn it, burn it)\n[03:25.70] Burn it down (burn it, burn it, burn it)\n[03:31.56] Burn it down (burn it, burn it, burn it)\n[03:37.53] Burn it down (burn it, burn it, burn it)\n[03:40.96]",
