        "fullLyrics": "[00:33.538] You know I never meant to see you again\n[00:37.547] But I only passed by as a friend yeah\n[00:48.884] All this time I stayed out of sight\n[00:53.572] I started wonderin' why\n[01:01.956] Now I\n[01:04.828] Ooh now I wish it would rain down\n[01:09.367] Down on me\n[01:12.127] Ooh yes I wish it would rain\n[01:15.383] Rain down on me now\n[01:19.775] Ooh yes I wish it would rain down\n[01:24.712] Down on me\n[01:27.423] Ooh yes I wish it would rain on me\n[01:34.329] You said you didn't need me in your life\n[01:39.327] Oh I guess you were right yeah\n[01:50.055] Ooh I never meant to cause you no pain\n[01:53.527] But it looks like I did it again yeah\n[02:02.977] Now I\n[02:05.509] Now I know I wish it would rain down\n[02:10.509] Down on me\n[02:13.221] Ooh yes I wish it would rain\n[02:16.205] Rain down on me now\n[02:20.789] Ooh but I wish it would rain down\n[02:25.621] Down on me\n[02:28.381] Ooh yes I wish it would rain on me\n[02:37.528] Though your hurt is gone\n[02:41.703] Mine's hangin' on inside\n[02:48.517] And I know\n[02:50.885] It's eating me through\n[02:51.912] It's eating me through every night and day\n[02:56.768] I'm just waitin' on your sign\n[03:05.000] 'Cause I know I know\n[03:09.232] I never meant to cause you no pain\n[03:12.024] And I realize I let you down oh yeah\n[03:20.729] But I know in my heart of hearts\n[03:25.050] I know I'm never gonna hold you again no no\n[03:34.406] Now I\n[03:37.118] Well now I know I wish it would rain down\n[03:41.957] Down on me\n[03:44.653] Oh you know I wish it would rain\n[03:47.751] Rain down on me now\n[03:52.221] Ooh yes I wish it would rain down\n[03:57.038] Down on me\n[04:00.005] Yes you know I wish it would rain down\n[04:03.902] Rain down over me\n[04:11.123] Just rain down over me\n[04:19.927] Just let it rain down let it rain down\n[04:27.693] Let it rain down oh yeah\n[04:36.872] Let it rain down rain down over me\n[04:50.463] Just let it rain down just let it rain down\n[04:58.232] Let it rain down\n[05:06.087] Just let it rain",
