        "fullLyrics": "[00:31.534] All day long he was fighting for you\n[00:35.716] And he didn't even know your name\n[00:41.380] Young men come and young men go\n[00:45.540] But life goes on just the same\n[00:50.012] And I don't know why\n[00:52.094] Why do we keep holding on\n[00:55.214] I don't know why\n[00:57.146] Pretending to be  oh  so strong\n[01:00.322] Oh  why\n[01:01.722] Is there something I don't know\n[01:04.418] Or something very wrong with you and me\n[01:09.829] Or maybe\n[01:15.349] That's the way it is\n[01:25.525] That's the way it is\n[01:31.485] They've been waiting for word to come down\n[01:35.437] They've been waiting for you night and day\n[01:41.453] They won't wait any longer for you\n[01:45.581] It may already be too late\n[01:50.143] And I don't know why\n[01:52.031] Why do we keep holding on\n[01:55.151] I don't know why\n[01:57.048] Pretending to be  oh  so strong\n[02:00.432] Oh why\n[02:01.808] Is there something I don't know\n[02:04.456] Or something very wrong with you and me\n[02:09.779] Or maybe\n[02:15.275] That's the way it is\n[02:25.109] That's just the way it is\n[02:31.109] You see the dying  you feel the pain\n[02:35.733] What have you got to say\n[02:41.101] If we agree that we can disagree\n[02:45.213] We could stop all of this today\n[02:53.627] It's been your life for as long as you can remember\n[02:57.931] But you cannot fight no more\n[03:02.993] You must want to look your son in the eyes\n[03:07.665] When he asks you what you did it for\n[03:13.793] Cause all day long he was fighting for you\n[03:18.017] And he didn't even know your name\n[03:23.929] Young men come and young men go\n[03:27.937] But life goes on just the same\n[03:32.425] And I don't know why\n[03:34.553] Why do we keep holding on\n[03:37.587] I don't know why\n[03:39.513] Pretending to be  oh  so strong\n[03:42.665] Oh  why\n[03:44.329] Is there something no one told me\n[03:47.033] Or something very wrong with you and me\n[03:52.300] Or maybe\n[03:57.870] That's the way it is\n[04:04.326] There's nothing I can do\n[04:07.606] That's just the way it is  oh\n[04:17.478] That's just the way it is\n[04:22.817] That's just the way it is\n[04:26.785] There's nothing I can do\n[04:32.665] That's just the way it is\n[04:37.721] That's just the way it is\n[04:42.657] That's the way\n[04:47.697] That's the way\n[04:52.801] That's the way",
