        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.63] La-da-da-da-da, la-da-da-da-da\n[00:13.21] Da-da-da\n[00:16.47] We are searchlights, we can see in the dark\n[00:21.57] \n[00:24.79] We are rockets, pointed up at the stars\n[00:29.46] \n[00:33.19] We are billions of beautiful hearts\n[00:38.50] \n[00:41.69] And you sold us down the river too far\n[00:47.01] \n[00:49.92] What about us?\n[00:52.13] What about all the times you said you had the answers?\n[00:55.75] \n[00:58.58] What about us?\n[01:00.55] What about all the broken happy ever afters?\n[01:04.23] \n[01:06.84] What about us?\n[01:08.90] What about all the plans that ended in disaster?\n[01:12.40] \n[01:15.39] What about love? What about trust?\n[01:18.92] What about us?\n[01:23.78] We are problems that want to be solved\n[01:28.74] \n[01:32.25] We are children that need to be loved\n[01:37.12] \n[01:40.62] We were willing, we came when you called\n[01:45.54] \n[01:48.61] But man, you fooled us, enough is enough, oh\n[01:54.70] \n[01:57.52] What about us?\n[01:59.49] What about all the times you said you had the answers?\n[02:03.13] \n[02:05.87] What about us?\n[02:07.95] What about all the broken happy ever afters?\n[02:12.44] Oh, what about us?\n[02:16.12] What about all the plans that ended in disaster?\n[02:20.06] \n[02:22.16] Oh, what about love? What about trust?\n[02:26.40] What about us?\n[02:30.08] \n[02:46.08] Oh, what about us?\n[02:49.96] What about all the plans that ended in disaster?\n[02:56.28] What about love? What about trust?\n[02:59.94] What about us?\n[03:05.28] Sticks and stones, they may break these bones\n[03:08.72] But then I'll be ready, are you ready?\n[03:13.75] It's the start of us, waking up, come on\n[03:18.16] Are you ready? I'll be ready\n[03:22.21] I don't want control, I want to let go\n[03:26.85] Are you ready? I'll be ready\n[03:30.45] 'Cause now it's time to let them know we are ready\n[03:36.53] What about us?\n[03:38.68] What about us?\n[03:40.44] What about all the times you said you had the answers?\n[03:46.69] So what about us?\n[03:49.02] What about all the broken happy ever afters?\n[03:53.54] Oh, what about us?\n[03:57.58] What about all the plans that ended in disaster?\n[04:02.75] Oh, what about love? What about trust?\n[04:07.43] What about us?\n[04:11.63] What about us?\n[04:13.68] What about us?\n[04:15.65] What about us?\n[04:20.16] What about us?\n[04:22.37] What about us?\n[04:24.32] What about us?\n[04:26.01]",
