        "fullLyrics": "[00:07.47] You took my hand\n[00:09.24] You showed me how\n[00:10.76] You promised me you'd be around\n[00:15.05] Uh-huh, that's right\n[00:21.04] I took your words and I believed\n[00:24.60] In everything, you said to me\n[00:28.46] Yeah, huh, that's right\n[00:33.91] If someone said three years from now\n[00:38.87] You'd be long gone\n[00:40.93] I'd stand up and punch them out\n[00:45.58] 'Cause they're all wrong\n[00:48.71] I know better\n[00:52.24] 'Cause you said forever and ever\n[00:57.32] Who knew?\n[01:01.48] \n[01:05.41] Remember when we were such fools\n[01:09.16] And so convinced and just too cool\n[01:13.37] Oh, no\n[01:14.95] No, no\n[01:19.31] I wish I could touch you again\n[01:22.87] I wish I could still call you friend\n[01:26.82] I'd give anything\n[01:32.19] When someone said count your blessings now\n[01:37.13] 'Fore they're long gone\n[01:39.32] I guess I just didn't know how\n[01:44.17] I was all wrong\n[01:46.99] They knew better\n[01:50.40] Still you said forever and ever\n[01:55.51] Who knew?\n[01:59.42] Yeah, yeah\n[02:03.82] I'll keep you locked in my head\n[02:07.50] Until we meet again\n[02:12.69] Until we, until we meet again\n[02:17.46] And I won't forget you my friend\n[02:21.16] What happened?\n[02:23.64] If someone said three years from now\n[02:28.61] You'd be long gone\n[02:30.77] I'd stand up and punch them out\n[02:35.41] 'Cause they're all wrong and\n[02:38.22] That last kiss\n[02:39.95] I'll cherish\n[02:41.75] Until we meet again\n[02:45.11] And time makes\n[02:46.85] It harder\n[02:48.38] I wish I could remember\n[02:51.83] But I keep\n[02:53.46] Your memory\n[02:55.35] You visit me in my sleep\n[02:59.09] My darling\n[03:00.92] Who knew?\n[03:03.96] My darling\n[03:05.67] My darling\n[03:07.65] Who knew?\n[03:09.56] My darling\n[03:10.90] I miss you\n[03:12.57] My darling\n[03:14.33] Who knew?\n[03:18.44] \n[03:21.20] Who knew?\n[03:23.35]",
