        "fullLyrics": "[00:01.47] We don't need no education\n[00:10.55] We don't need no thought control\n[00:19.66] No dark sarcasm in the classroom\n[00:28.86] Teacher, leave them kids alone\n[00:39.04] Hey, teacher, leave them kids alone\n[00:47.21] All in all, it's just another brick in the wall\n[00:56.46] All in all, you're just another brick in the wall\n[01:05.62] We don't need no education\n[01:14.88] We don't need no thought control\n[01:23.64] No dark sarcasm in the classroom\n[01:33.48] Teachers, leave them kids alone\n[01:42.82] Hey, teacher, leave us kids alone\n[01:51.34] All in all, you're just another brick in the wall\n[02:00.83] All in all, you're just another brick in the wall\n[03:20.71] (Wrong, do it again)\n[03:23.17] (Wrong, do it again)\n[03:25.16] If you don't eat yer meat, you can't have any pudding\n[03:28.65] How can you have any pudding if you don't eat yer meat?\n[03:32.22] You! (if you don't eat yer meat)\n[03:34.97] Yes, you behind the bike stands (you can't have any pudding)\n[03:37.83] (How can you have any pudding if you don't eat yer meat?) Stand still, laddy!\n[03:40.60] You! Yes, you behind the bike stands...\n[03:45.14]",
