        "fullLyrics": "[00:05.58] And disciplinary remains mercifully\n[00:08.10] Yes and um, I'm with you Derek, this star nonsense\n[00:11.93] Yes, yes\n[00:12.57] Now which is it?\n[00:13.66] I am sure of it\n[00:16.67] \n[01:34.46] So, so you think you can tell\n[01:41.41] Heaven from hell?\n[01:45.14] Blue skies from pain?\n[01:49.32] Can you tell a green field\n[01:53.47] From a cold steel rail?\n[01:57.81] A smile from a veil?\n[02:01.95] Do you think you can tell?\n[02:06.18] Did they get you to trade\n[02:10.13] Your heroes for ghosts?\n[02:14.29] Hot ashes for trees?\n[02:18.35] Hot air for a cool breeze?\n[02:22.16] Cold comfort for change?\n[02:26.01] Did you exchange\n[02:29.68] A walk-on part in the war\n[02:33.07] For a leading role in a cage?\n[02:38.33] \n[03:15.79] How I wish, how I wish you were here\n[03:22.31] We're just two lost souls\n[03:25.00] Swimming in a fish bowl\n[03:27.72] Year after year\n[03:31.89] Running over the same old ground\n[03:35.56] What have we found?\n[03:37.92] The same old fears\n[03:41.73] Wish you were here\n[03:43.25]",
        "genre": [
            "Rock"
        ],
