        "dateAdded": "2026-06-26T09:37:02.710Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.53] Hey there Delilah, what's it like in New York City?\n[00:13.05] I'm a thousand miles away, but girl, tonight you look so pretty\n[00:17.64] Yes you do\n[00:20.48] Times Square can't shine as bright as you, I swear it's true\n[00:27.83] Hey there Delilah, don't you worry about the distance\n[00:31.32] I'm right there if you get lonely give this song another listen\n[00:36.04] Close your eyes\n[00:39.01] Listen to my voice, it's my disguise, I'm by your side\n[00:45.58] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[00:50.57] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[00:55.02] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[00:59.53] Oh, it's what you do to me, what you do to me\n[01:07.32] Hey there Delilah, I know times are getting hard\n[01:10.41] But just believe me, girl, someday I'll pay the bills with this guitar\n[01:15.09] We'll have it good\n[01:18.32] We'll have the life we knew we would, my word is good\n[01:25.43] Hey there Delilah, I've got so much left to say\n[01:28.97] If every simple song I wrote to you would take your breath away\n[01:33.65] I'd write it all\n[01:36.92] Even more in love with me you'd fall, we'd have it all\n[01:43.72] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[01:48.18] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[01:52.89] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[01:57.20] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[02:02.13] A thousand miles seems pretty far\n[02:04.26] But they've got planes and trains and cars\n[02:06.56] I'd walk to you if I had no other way\n[02:11.50] Our friends would all make fun of us\n[02:13.32] And we'll just laugh along because\n[02:15.68] We know that none of them have felt this way\n[02:20.88] Delilah, I can promise you that by the time we get through\n[02:24.76] The world will never ever be the same, and you're to blame\n[02:34.73] Hey there Delilah, you be good and don't you miss me\n[02:38.43] Two more years and you'll be done with school\n[02:41.04] And I'll be making history\n[02:43.28] Like I do\n[02:46.35] You'll know it's all because of you\n[02:50.39] We can do whatever we want to\n[02:56.08] Hey there Delilah, here's to you\n[02:59.13] This one's for you\n[03:04.46] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[03:09.10] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[03:13.77] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[03:18.18] Oh, it's what you do to me\n[03:21.51] What you do to me\n[03:24.87] Oh-oh, oh-oh, oh-oh-oh, oh-oh\n[03:33.00] Oh-oh, oh-oh, oh-oh, oh-oh\n[03:37.75]",
