        "fullLyrics": "[00:34.77] We couldn't turn around\n[00:38.89] 'Til we were upside down \n[00:42.90] I'll be the bad guy now\n[00:46.96] But, no, I ain't too proud\n[00:50.96] I couldn't be there\n[00:55.05] Even when I tried\n[00:58.97] You don't believe it\n[01:02.97] We do this every time\n[01:05.13] Seasons change and our love went cold\n[01:09.05] Feed the flame 'cause we can't let it go\n[01:13.05] Run away, but we're running in circles\n[01:17.05] Run away, run away\n[01:19.38] I dare you to do something\n[01:23.37] I'm waiting on you again\n[01:26.84] So I don't take the blame\n[01:29.08] Run away, but we're running in circles\n[01:33.05] Run away, run away, run away\n[01:36.60] Let go\n[01:38.97] I got a feeling that it's time to let go\n[01:44.37] I say so\n[01:46.81] I knew that this was doomed from the get-go\n[01:51.40] You thought that it was special, special\n[01:55.29] But it was just the sex though, the sex though\n[01:59.33] And I still hear the echoes (the echoes)\n[02:02.85] I got a feeling that it's time to let it go, let it go\n[02:08.89] Seasons change and our love went cold\n[02:13.05] Feed the flame 'cause we can't let it go\n[02:17.08] Run away, but we're running in circles\n[02:21.08] Run away, run away\n[02:23.40] I dare you to do something\n[02:27.37] I'm waiting on you again\n[02:30.85] So I don't take the blame\n[02:33.05] Run away, but we're running in circles\n[02:37.05] Run away, run away, run away\n[02:41.17] Maybe you don't understand what I'm going through\n[02:44.97] It's only me\n[02:46.97] What you got to lose?\n[02:48.93] Make up your mind, tell me\n[02:50.41] What are you gonna do?\n[02:52.93] It's only me\n[02:54.96] Let it go\n[02:57.09] Seasons change and our love went cold\n[03:01.08] Feed the flame 'cause we can't let it go\n[03:05.01] Run away, but we're running in circles\n[03:08.84] Run away, run away\n[03:11.32] I dare you to do something\n[03:15.37] I'm waiting on you again\n[03:18.77] So I don't take the blame\n[03:21.16] Run away, but we're running in circles\n[03:25.08] Run away, run away, run away\n[03:29.77]",
