        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.88] On the porch\n[00:17.63] With a beer\n[00:19.45] Saw you park\n[00:21.26] Between all these jacked up trucks\n[00:24.92] And girl it's\n[00:26.75] Pretty clear\n[00:28.56] That you don't come around here much\n[00:31.24] Just had to stop you 'fore you got inside\n[00:34.48] And the boys started gettin' in line\n[00:37.54] Hey Mercedes\n[00:41.29] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your night\n[00:44.82] Pretty lady\n[00:48.54] Would you wanna take me out for a ride\n[00:52.28] I don't know why you came\n[00:54.05] Where you're from\n[00:54.83] What's your name\n[00:55.83] And I know that you don't know mine\n[00:59.59] Call me crazy\n[01:02.95] Hey Mercedes\n[01:05.05] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your life\n[01:14.08] Baby I'm\n[01:15.63] Standin' here\n[01:17.41] Tryna smoke\n[01:19.32] Had to have me a quick cigarette\n[01:23.05] And now all\n[01:24.86] That I know\n[01:26.63] Is I'm glad that I ain't quit yet\n[01:29.52] You never know girl it just might be fate\n[01:32.44] Or a damn good time if it ain't\n[01:35.81] Hey Mercedes\n[01:39.37] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your night\n[01:43.02] Pretty lady\n[01:46.73] Would you wanna take me out for a ride\n[01:50.44] I don't know why you came\n[01:52.28] Where you're from\n[01:53.06] What's your name\n[01:53.80] And I know that you don't know mine\n[01:57.54] Call me crazy\n[02:01.30] Hey Mercedes\n[02:03.37] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your life\n[02:12.39] I've had one too many\n[02:14.19] To take you down any\n[02:15.70] Of these backroads outside of town\n[02:19.44] I'm just thinking you might\n[02:21.08] Show me if that thing drives\n[02:23.17] Half as good as you look right now\n[02:26.66] Hey Mercedes\n[02:30.51] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your night\n[02:34.04] Pretty lady\n[02:37.93] Would you like to take me out for a ride\n[02:41.38] I don't know why you came\n[02:43.22] Where you're from\n[02:43.75] What's your name\n[02:44.78] And I know that you don't know mine\n[02:48.54] Call me crazy\n[02:52.29] Hey Mercedes\n[02:54.05] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your life\n[02:59.37] Hey Mercedes\n[03:06.51] Hey Mercedes\n[03:08.88] Whatcha doin' for the rest of your life\n[03:12.07]",
