        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.82] 40 hours got me goin' out my mind\n[00:12.71] Dallas dropped another game in overtime\n[00:16.95] Caught a ticket speeding down the 65\n[00:20.56] Don't know where I'm goin'\n[00:24.92] Guess I really went and messed it up again\n[00:29.02] Now, my baby's goner than the Tulsa wind\n[00:32.93] Judgin' by the stone-sober state I'm in\n[00:36.61] Need to crack one wide open\n[00:39.48] Somebody pour me a drink, somebody bum me a smoke\n[00:43.63] I'm 'bout to get on a buzz, I'm 'bout to get on a roll\n[00:47.74] Yeah, I been breakin' my back just keepin' up with the Joneses\n[00:51.93] Y'all know what I mean, and y'all know how it goes\n[00:55.78] When it's up on a Friday, and I'm paid, slide one over my way\n[01:01.16] I can't even think when I can hear one calling my name (hey)\n[01:07.70] Somebody pour me a drink\n[01:12.55] Pour me a drink\n[01:17.50] Bourbon-brown eyes tryna get me drunk\n[01:21.38] Ain't stoppin' 'til the bottle and the job is done\n[01:25.49] Hey, I think I might've found my future love\n[01:29.39] Buddy, you should probably buy her one\n[01:31.90] Somebody pour me a drink, somebody bum me a smoke\n[01:36.04] I'm 'bout to get on a buzz, I'm 'bout to get on a roll\n[01:40.17] Yeah, I been breakin' my back just keepin' up with the Joneses\n[01:44.47] Y'all know what I mean, yeah, y'all know how it goes\n[01:48.37] When it's up on a Friday, and I'm paid, slide one over my way\n[01:53.82] I can't even think when I can hear one calling my name (hey)\n[02:00.25] Somebody pour me a drink\n[02:04.13] Somebody pour me a drink\n[02:10.08] Ooh\n[02:18.32] Somebody pour me a drink (somebody bum me a smoke)\n[02:22.45] I'm 'bout to get on a buzz (I'm 'bout to get on a roll)\n[02:26.38] Yeah, I been breakin' my back (just keepin' up with the Joneses)\n[02:30.73] Y'all know what I mean (yeah, y'all know how it goes)\n[02:34.69] When it's up on a Friday, and I'm paid, slide one over my way\n[02:40.05] I can't even think when I can hear one calling my name (hey)\n[02:46.56] Somebody pour me a drink\n[02:50.41] Somebody pour me a drink\n[02:54.18] Yeah, somebody pour me a drink\n[02:58.78] Hey, yes sir, pour me a drink\n[03:01.90] I'm on it, buddy\n[03:03.41] Pour me a drink\n[03:06.77]",
