        "dateAdded": "2026-04-19T04:40:47.147Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.77] You got a lotta nerve, don't you, baby?\n[00:19.76] I only hit the curb 'cause you made me\n[00:23.47] You're tellin' all your friends that I'm crazy\n[00:27.56] Like I'm the only one\n[00:31.22] Why'd you throw them stones, if you\n[00:34.71] Had a wild hair of your own or two?\n[00:38.35] Livin' in your big glass house with a view\n[00:42.44] I thought you knew\n[00:44.58] I had some help\n[00:46.05] It ain't like I can make this kinda mess all by myself\n[00:49.79] Don't act like you ain't help me pull that bottle off the shelf\n[00:53.62] Been deep in every weekend if you couldn't tell\n[00:57.18] They say teamwork makes the dream work\n[00:59.43] Hell, I had some help (help)\n[01:04.38] (Help)\n[01:08.15] You thought I'd take the blame for us a-crumblin'\n[01:12.13] Go 'round like you ain't guilty of somethin'\n[01:15.77] Already lost the game that you been runnin'\n[01:20.17] Guess it's catchin' up to you, huh\n[01:23.45] You think that you're so innocent\n[01:27.56] After all the shit you did\n[01:31.46] I ain't an angel, you ain't heaven-sent\n[01:35.15] Can't wash our hands of this\n[01:37.26] I had some help\n[01:38.62] It ain't like I can make this kinda mess all by myself\n[01:42.39] Don't act like you ain't help me pull that bottle off the shelf\n[01:46.03] Been deep in every weekend if you couldn't tell\n[01:49.75] They say, \"Teamwork makes the dream work\"\n[01:51.94] Hell, I had some help (help)\n[01:57.08] (Help)\n[02:00.43] (Help)\n[02:04.02] (Help)\n[02:07.74] It takes two to break a heart in two, ooh\n[02:15.00] Baby, you blame me and, baby, I blame you\n[02:19.69] Aw, if that ain't truth (oh)\n[02:22.27] I had some help\n[02:23.72] It ain't like I can make this kinda mess all by myself\n[02:27.43] Don't act like you ain't help me pull that bottle off the shelf\n[02:31.02] Been deep in every weekend if you couldn't tell\n[02:34.71] They say teamwork makes the dream work\n[02:36.99] Hell, I had some help (help)\n[02:41.81] (Help)\n[02:45.43] (Help)\n[02:49.27] (Help)\n[02:49.70]",
