        "chorus": "Bb Gm F Eb Bb Gm F Bb",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "Verse",
        "dateAdded": "2026-04-22T05:17:48.000Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:19.13] I never meant to cause you any sorrow\n[00:27.47] I never meant to cause you any pain\n[00:31.13] \n[00:35.67] I only wanted one time to see you laughing\n[00:38.68] \n[00:41.25] I only want to see you laughing\n[00:45.76] In the purple rain\n[00:49.06] Purple rain, purple rain\n[00:54.91] \n[00:57.35] Purple rain, purple rain\n[01:02.87] \n[01:05.57] Purple rain, purple rain\n[01:11.05] \n[01:17.03] I only want to see you bathing\n[01:21.49] In the purple rain\n[01:24.03] I never wanted to be your weekend lover\n[01:29.54] \n[01:38.35] I only wanted to be some kind of friend, hey\n[01:45.74] Baby, I could never steal you from another\n[01:50.42] \n[01:54.08] It's such a shame our friendship had to end\n[01:59.63] Purple rain, purple rain\n[02:05.38] \n[02:08.12] Purple rain, purple rain\n[02:13.76] \n[02:16.34] Purple rain, purple rain\n[02:22.24] \n[02:27.80] Only wanted to see you underneath the purple rain\n[02:34.98] Honey, I know, I know, I know times are changing\n[02:41.54] \n[02:49.17] It's time we all reach out for something new\n[02:51.92] That means you too\n[02:55.43] \n[02:57.63] You say you want a leader\n[03:00.02] But you can't seem to make up your mind\n[03:02.81] And I think you better close it\n[03:05.99] And let me guide you to the purple rain\n[03:11.11] Purple rain, purple rain, yeah\n[03:19.53] Purple rain, purple rain\n[03:25.57] If you know what I'm singing about up here\n[03:26.96] Come on, raise your hand\n[03:28.02] Purple rain, purple rain\n[03:33.63] \n[03:40.22] I only want to see you\n[03:42.38] Only want to see you in the purple rain\n[03:46.29]",
