        "dateAdded": "2026-06-11T08:24:54.093Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.05] Here we stand or here we fall\n[00:19.71] History won't care at all\n[00:23.13] Make the bed light the light\n[00:26.92] Lady mercy won't be home tonight yeah\n[00:30.57] You don't waste no time at all\n[00:34.79] Don't hear the bell but you answer the call\n[00:38.20] It comes to you as to us all\n[00:41.60] We're just waiting\n[00:43.52] For the Hammer To Fall\n[00:53.23] Oh ev'ry night and every day\n[00:57.69] A little piece of you is falling away\n[01:00.86] But lift your face the western way\n[01:05.24] Build your muscles as your body decays yeah\n[01:08.70] Toe your line and play their game yeah\n[01:12.10] Let the anaesthetic cover it all\n[01:16.12] Till one day they call your name\n[01:19.59] You know it's time for the Hammer To Fall\n[01:31.36] Rich or poor or famous\n[01:33.52] For your truth it's all the same (oh no oh no)\n[01:42.31] Lock your door the rain is pouring\n[01:46.02] Through your window pane (oh no)\n[01:51.59] Baby now your struggle's all in vain\n[02:19.07] For we who grew up tall and proud\n[02:22.75] In the shadow of the mushroom cloud\n[02:25.84] Convinced our voices can't be heard\n[02:30.01] We just wanna scream it louder and louder louder\n[02:33.46] What the hell we fighting for?\n[02:37.21] Just surrender and it won't hurt at all\n[02:40.88] You just got time to say your prayers\n[02:44.57] While your waiting for the hammer to Hammer To Fall\n[02:52.98] It's gonna fall\n[02:58.35] Hammer, you know, Hammer To Fall\n[03:21.99] While you're waiting for the Hammer To Fall\n[03:30.82] Give it to me one more time\n[03:34.46]",
        "genre": [
            "Rock"
        ],
