        "fullLyrics": "[00:56.22] I'd sit alone and watch your light\n[01:00.56] My only friend through teenage nights\n[01:04.35] And everything I had to know\n[01:08.77] I heard it on my radio\n[01:15.12] You gave them all those old time stars\n[01:19.86] Through wars of worlds invaded by Mars\n[01:23.93] You made 'em laugh, you made 'em cry\n[01:27.92] You made us feel like we could fly (radio)\n[01:34.64] So don't become some background noise\n[01:38.71] A backdrop for the girls and boys\n[01:42.91] Who just don't know, or just don't care\n[01:47.41] And just complain when you're not there\n[01:51.73] You had your time, you had the power\n[01:55.93] You've yet to have your finest hour\n[02:00.49] Radio (radio)\n[02:04.88] All we hear is radio ga ga\n[02:08.98] Radio goo goo\n[02:11.06] Radio ga ga\n[02:13.51] All we hear is radio ga ga\n[02:17.53] Radio blah blah\n[02:19.94] Radio, what's new?\n[02:24.06] Radio, someone still loves you\n[02:32.56] \n[02:42.10] We watch the shows, we watch the stars\n[02:47.29] On videos for hours and hours\n[02:51.51] We hardly need to use our ears\n[02:55.69] How music changes through the years\n[03:02.37] Let's hope you never leave, old friend\n[03:06.54] Like all good things, on you we depend\n[03:11.09] So stick around, 'cause we might miss you\n[03:15.09] When we grow tired of all this visual\n[03:19.23] You had your time, you had the power\n[03:23.80] You've yet to have your finest hour\n[03:28.07] Radio (radio)\n[03:32.40] All we hear is radio ga ga\n[03:36.88] Radio goo goo\n[03:38.89] Radio ga ga\n[03:40.84] All we hear is radio ga ga\n[03:45.00] Radio goo goo\n[03:47.21] Radio ga ga\n[03:49.30] All we hear is radio ga ga\n[03:53.71] Radio blah blah\n[03:55.82] Radio, what's new?\n[04:00.20] Someone still loves you\n[04:06.64] \n[04:29.94] Radio ga ga (radio ga ga)\n[04:34.35] Radio ga ga (radio ga ga)\n[04:38.70] Radio ga ga (radio ga ga)\n[04:42.93] \n[05:04.13] You had your time, you had the power\n[05:08.43] You've yet to have your finest hour\n[05:12.86] Radio (radio)\n[05:16.22]",
