        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.924] I've paid my dues\n[00:04.684] Time after time\n[00:08.572] I've done my sentence\n[00:12.140] But committed no crime\n[00:16.292] And bad mistakes\n[00:20.030] I've made a few\n[00:23.991] I've had my share of sand kicked in my face\n[00:27.476] But I've come through\n[00:29.813] And I need to go on and on and on and on\n[00:34.393] We are the champions my friends\n[00:41.737] And we'll keep on fighting 'til the end\n[00:49.609] We are the champions\n[00:53.409] We are the champions\n[00:57.169] No time for losers\n[01:00.705] 'Cause we are the champions\n[01:06.153] Of the world\n[01:17.121] I've taken my bows\n[01:20.297] And my curtain calls\n[01:25.060] You brought me fame and fortune and everything that goes with it\n[01:29.347] I thank you all\n[01:32.011] But it's been no bed of roses\n[01:36.299] No pleasure cruise\n[01:39.787] I consider it a challenge before the whole human race\n[01:43.631] And I ain't gonna lose\n[01:45.850] And I need to go on and on and on and on\n[01:50.306] We are the champions my friends\n[01:57.722] And we'll keep on fighting 'til the end\n[02:05.670] We are the champions\n[02:09.446] We are the champions\n[02:13.247] No time for losers\n[02:16.686] 'Cause we are the champions\n[02:22.190] Of the world\n[02:22.737] We are the champions my friends\n[02:29.816] And we'll keep on fighting 'til the end oh\n[02:37.553] We are the champions\n[02:41.281] We are the champions\n[02:44.969] No time for losers\n[02:48.410] 'Cause we are the champions",
