        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.90] When your day is long\n[00:22.59] And the night, the night is yours alone\n[00:29.45] \n[00:32.29] When you're sure you've had enough\n[00:37.76] Of this life, well hang on\n[00:45.01] \n[00:47.46] Don't let yourself go\n[00:55.33] 'Cause everybody cries\n[01:00.63] \n[01:03.14] Everybody hurts sometimes\n[01:14.85] Sometimes everything is wrong\n[01:19.59] \n[01:22.62] Now it's time to sing along\n[01:25.57] When your day is night alone (hold on, hold on)\n[01:33.58] If you feel like letting go (hold on)\n[01:40.70] If you think you've had too much\n[01:46.54] Of this life, well hang on\n[01:53.86] \n[01:56.50] 'Cause everybody hurts\n[02:04.17] Take comfort in your friends\n[02:11.96] Everybody hurts\n[02:18.97] Don't throw your hand, oh no\n[02:30.04] \n[02:34.48] Don't throw your hand\n[02:42.33] If you feel like you're alone\n[02:48.20] No, no, no, you are not alone\n[02:55.16] \n[02:58.13] If you're on your own in this life\n[03:05.20] The days and nights are long\n[03:10.52] \n[03:12.72] When you think you've had too much\n[03:18.33] Of this life to hang on\n[03:25.54] \n[03:28.14] Well, everybody hurts sometimes\n[03:35.94] Everybody cries\n[03:43.71] Everybody hurts, sometimes\n[03:56.66] And everybody hurts sometimes\n[04:05.88] So hold on, hold on\n[04:13.66] Hold on, hold on, hold on\n[04:24.10] Hold on, hold on, hold on\n[04:35.27] Everybody hurts\n[04:39.10]",
