        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.34] Oh, life is bigger\n[00:20.51] It's bigger than you\n[00:22.73] And you are not me\n[00:26.16] The lengths that I will go to\n[00:29.75] The distance in your eyes\n[00:34.03] \n[00:36.05] Oh no, I've said too much\n[00:42.40] I set it up\n[00:45.96] That's me in the corner\n[00:49.90] That's me in the spotlight\n[00:53.19] Losing my religion\n[00:57.16] Trying to keep up with you\n[01:01.58] And I don't know if I can do it\n[01:06.58] Oh no, I've said too much\n[01:11.92] I haven't said enough\n[01:15.52] I thought that I heard you laughing\n[01:19.67] I thought that I heard you sing\n[01:24.76] I think I thought I saw you try\n[01:32.14] Every whisper, of every waking hour\n[01:37.76] I'm choosing my confessions\n[01:43.11] Trying to keep an eye on you\n[01:47.76] Like a hurt, lost, and blinded fool, fool\n[01:52.88] Oh no, I've said too much\n[01:59.16] I set it up\n[02:02.85] Consider this\n[02:05.63] Consider this, the hint of the century\n[02:10.74] Consider this the slip\n[02:15.20] That brought me to my knees, failed\n[02:19.08] What if all these fantasies come\n[02:23.54] Flailing around\n[02:26.29] Now I've said too much\n[02:32.53] I thought that I heard you laughing\n[02:36.58] I thought that I heard you sing\n[02:41.31] I think I thought I saw you try\n[02:46.62] \n[02:57.36] But that was just a dream\n[03:01.45] That was just a dream\n[03:03.66] That's me in the corner\n[03:07.32] That's me in the spotlight\n[03:10.65] Losing my religion\n[03:14.93] Trying to keep up with you\n[03:19.62] And I don't know if I can do it\n[03:24.44] Oh no, I've said too much\n[03:29.80] I haven't said enough\n[03:33.90] I thought that I heard you laughing\n[03:37.41] I thought that I heard you sing\n[03:42.82] I think I thought I saw you try\n[03:51.23] But that was just a dream\n[03:54.69] Try, cry, fly, try\n[03:58.98] That was just a dream\n[04:01.77] Just a dream\n[04:03.55] Just a dream\n[04:04.50]",
