        "fullLyrics": "[00:28.971] Sometimes I feel Like I don't have a partner\n[00:34.661] Sometimes I feel Like my only friend\n[00:39.731] Is the city I live in\n[00:42.841] The city of Angels\n[00:46.091] Lonely as I am\n[00:48.711] Together we cry\n[00:57.811] I drive on her streets\n[01:00.371] 'Cause she's my companion\n[01:03.441] I walk through her hills\n[01:06.061] 'Cause she knows who I am\n[01:08.621] She sees my good deeds and\n[01:12.231] She kisses me windy and\n[01:15.171] I never worry\n[01:17.971] Now that is a lie\n[01:26.711] I don't ever wanna feel\n[01:30.571] Like I did that day\n[01:32.451] Take me to the place I love\n[01:36.001] Take me all the way\n[01:38.121] I don't ever want to feel\n[01:41.631] Like I did that day\n[01:43.811] Take me to the place I love\n[01:47.241] Take me all that way (yeah yeah yeah)\n[01:55.911] It's hard to believe\n[02:02.941] That there's nobody out there\n[02:06.311] It's hard to believe\n[02:09.191] That I'm all alone\n[02:12.001] At least I have her love\n[02:14.871] The city she loves me\n[02:17.921] Lonely as I am\n[02:20.541] Together we cry\n[02:29.461] I don't ever wanna feel\n[02:32.831] Like I did that day\n[02:34.891] Take me to the place I love\n[02:38.381] Take me all the way\n[02:40.511] I don't ever want to feel\n[02:44.011] Like I did that day\n[02:46.191] Take me to the place I love\n[02:49.681] Take me all the way (yeah yeah yeah)\n[02:57.791] Ooh no (no no yeah yeah)\n[03:01.041] Love me I say yeah yeah\n[03:08.421] Under the bridge downtown\n[03:17.411] Is where I drew some blood\n[03:19.471] Under the bridge downtown\n[03:22.281] I could not get enough\n[03:24.901] Under the bridge downtown\n[03:28.081] Forgot about my love\n[03:30.321] Under the bridge downtown\n[03:33.461] I gave my life away (yeah yeah yeah)\n[03:41.071] Ooh no (no no yeah yeah)\n[03:46.131] Here I stay yeah yeah\n[03:56.051] Here I sta",
