        "fullLyrics": "[00:09.14] She got a heart of gold\n[00:13.20] She lights up every room she walks in\n[00:17.12] She got the Southern glow\n[00:21.44] My girl's a drop dead ten outta ten\n[00:25.78] Where she got it from\n[00:27.96] I was dyin' to know\n[00:29.53] Well, it all made sense\n[00:31.74] When she brought me home\n[00:34.69] I took one look at her mama\n[00:38.76] I took one look at the woman that raised her up right\n[00:43.05] I knew that I was a goner\n[00:47.07] Soon as I saw where my baby done got that smile\n[00:51.53] Oh, the pretty in her genes gon' last a lifetime it seems\n[00:56.41] I knew that peach didn't fall far from the tree\n[00:59.31] I took one look at her mama\n[01:04.44] She got that thing about her\n[01:08.56] That kind of classic that don't go outta style (don't go outta style)\n[01:12.52] And every time I'm around her\n[01:16.62] I wanna settle down and stay for a while\n[01:20.93] When she brought me home\n[01:23.01] We were more than friends\n[01:25.17] But I fell in love all over again\n[01:28.13] I took one look at her mama\n[01:32.14] I took one look at the woman that raised her up right (oh, raised her up)\n[01:36.34] I knew that I was a goner\n[01:40.39] Soon as I saw where my baby done got that smile\n[01:45.05] Oh, the pretty in her genes gon' last a lifetime it seems\n[01:49.69] I knew that peach didn't fall far from the tree\n[01:52.64] I took one look at her mama\n[01:56.70] I took one look at her mama\n[02:02.08] Come on\n[02:06.09] Yeah, yeah\n[02:10.39] I can't wait for the day that I'll ask for her hand\n[02:14.31] And tell my baby's daddy he's a lucky man\n[02:19.14] 'Cause I took one look at her mama\n[02:23.28] I took one look at the woman that raised her up right\n[02:27.46] I knew that I was a goner\n[02:31.57] Soon as I saw where my baby done got that smile\n[02:36.31] Oh, the pretty in her genes gon' last a lifetime it seems\n[02:40.95] I knew that peach didn't fall far from the tree\n[02:43.82] I took one look at her\n[02:45.97] I took one look at her mama (I took one look at her mama)\n[02:50.21] I took one look at her mama (I took one look)\n[02:54.06] I took one look at her mama\n[03:04.69]",
