        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.96] She's a very kinky girl\n[00:17.96] The kind you don't take home to mother\n[00:21.95] She will never let your spirits down\n[00:25.61] Once you get her off the street, ow, girl\n[00:29.17] She likes the boys in the band\n[00:32.72] She says that I'm her all-time favorite\n[00:36.69] When I make my move to her room, it's the right time\n[00:40.53] She's never hard to please, oh, no\n[00:43.92] That girl is pretty wild now (the girl's a super freak)\n[00:47.77] The kind of girl you read about (in new-wave magazines)\n[00:51.39] That girl is pretty kinky (the girl's a super freak)\n[00:54.80] I really love to taste her (every time we meet)\n[00:58.41] She's alright, she's alright\n[01:02.12] That girl's alright with me\n[01:07.42] Yeah, hey, hey, hey, hey!\n[01:14.50] She's a super freak, super freak\n[01:17.09] She's super-freaky, yow\n[01:20.76] Everybody sing\n[01:22.26] Super freak, super freak\n[01:25.54] She's a very special girl (the kind of girl you want to know)\n[01:29.01] From her head down to her toenails (down to her feet)\n[01:32.87] Yeah, she'll wait for me at backstage with her girlfriends\n[01:36.81] In a limousine (long and black and shining bright)\n[01:39.62] Three's not a crowd to her, she says (ménage à trois, ooh, la, la)\n[01:43.34] \"Room 714, I'll be waiting\"\n[01:47.44] When I get there, she's got incense, wine, and candles\n[01:50.81] It's such a freaky scene\n[01:54.55] That girl is pretty kinky (the girl's a super freak)\n[01:58.18] The kind of girl you read about (in new-wave magazines)\n[02:01.73] That girl is pretty wild now (the girl's a super freak)\n[02:05.46] I really like to taste her (every time we meet)\n[02:09.45] She's alright, she's alright\n[02:12.79] That girl's alright with me\n[02:18.02] Yeah, hey, hey, hey, hey!\n[02:25.17] She's a super freak, super freak\n[02:27.67] She's super-freaky, yow\n[02:31.85] Temptations sing\n[02:33.06] Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh\n[02:36.60] Super freak, super freak\n[02:38.67] That girl's a super freak\n[02:40.13] Oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh-oh\n[02:43.40] She's a very kinky girl\n[02:46.87] The kind you won't take home to mother\n[02:50.35] And she will never let your spirits down\n[02:54.22] Once you get her off the street\n[02:56.90] Blow Danny\n[03:01.55] Oh, girl\n[03:04.47] \n[03:16.01] Oh, girl\n[03:16.93]",
