        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.50] Come on, hold my hand\n[00:12.70] I wanna contact the living\n[00:18.09] Not sure I understand\n[00:22.97] This role I've been given\n[00:28.00] I sit and talk to God\n[00:32.05] And he just laughs at my plans\n[00:37.32] My head speaks a language\n[00:42.39] I don't understand\n[00:47.26] I just wanna feel real love\n[00:51.87] Feel the home that I live in\n[00:57.31] 'Cause I got too much life\n[00:59.92] Running through my veins\n[01:02.13] Going to waste\n[01:07.10] I don't wanna die\n[01:11.29] But I ain't keen on living either\n[01:17.00] Before I fall in love\n[01:21.44] I'm preparing to leave her\n[01:26.51] I scare myself to death\n[01:31.55] That's why I keep on running\n[01:36.55] Before I've arrived\n[01:40.90] I can see myself coming\n[01:46.54] I just wanna feel real love\n[01:50.78] Feel the home that I live in\n[01:56.23] 'Cause I got too much life\n[01:58.54] Running through my veins\n[02:01.08] Going to waste\n[02:05.81] And I need to feel\n[02:08.62] Real love and the love ever after\n[02:15.29] I cannot get enough\n[02:45.50] I just wanna feel real love\n[02:49.60] Feel the home that I live in\n[02:55.08] I got too much love\n[02:57.35] Running through my veins\n[02:59.40] To go to waste\n[03:04.76] I just wanna feel real love\n[03:09.05] And life ever after\n[03:14.00] There's a hole in my soul\n[03:16.59] You can see it in my face\n[03:18.95] It's a real big place\n[03:34.40] Come and hold my hand\n[03:38.18] I wanna contact the living\n[03:43.33] Not sure I understand\n[03:48.78] This role I've been given\n[03:53.43] Not sure I understand\n[03:58.31] Not sure I understand\n[04:03.00] Not sure I understand\n[04:08.00] Not sure I understand",
