        "fullLyrics": "[00:32.96] Living here without you\n[00:37.07] Is not an easy way of life\n[00:43.21] I spend my time without you\n[00:47.88] I try to make it worthwhile\n[00:54.05] Standing in a rainfall\n[00:58.61] Coming down from the sky\n[01:04.63] Why should I cry over you?\n[01:14.61] Why should I cry, cry, cry over you?\n[01:27.37] I keep on thinking about you\n[01:31.09] I've got no private pride to hide\n[01:37.49] I've built my world around you\n[01:41.99] Like a call without reply\n[01:48.82] My love has lost direction\n[01:52.53] She's got the sun in her eyes\n[01:58.58] Why should I cry over you?\n[02:09.05] Why should I cry, cry, cry over you?\n[02:22.65] Hearing your footsteps\n[02:25.60] Loud on my steps\n[02:28.20] (Awalking...) - living without you\n[02:33.42] Feeling the sweet sweet smell of love in the air\n[02:39.69] (I can feel it...) - living without you\n[02:44.15] Kissing the face\n[02:46.82] That I see everywhere\n[02:50.71] But I'm living without you\n[02:55.82] I'm living without\n[03:30.59] Why should I cry, cry, cry over you?\n[03:43.37] Hearing your footsteps loud on my steps\n[03:48.95] (Awalking...) - living without you\n[03:54.04] Kissing the face that I see everywhere\n[04:01.01] But I'm living without you\n[04:06.45] I'm living without\n[04:13.40] Cry, cry, cry over you\n[04:21.38] Why should I cry over you?\n[04:24.46] Cry, cry, cry over you\n[04:30.38] Oh oh oh\n[04:35.05] Cry, cry, cry over you\n[04:41.78] Why should I cry over you?\n[04:46.02] Cry, cry, cry over you\n[04:52.65] (Why should I cry over you?)) oh\n[04:58.66] Why should I cry, cry, cry over you?\n[05:07.51] Cry cry why should I cry over you?\n[05:14.95] From album \"Look Sharp!\" (1988)\n[05:16.85]",
