        "dateAdded": "2026-04-13T06:13:05.161Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.290] I see you comb your hair and gimme that grin \n[00:06.970] Its making me spin now  spinnin within \n[00:09.850] Before i melt like snow  i say hello -\n[00:14.720] How do you do \n[00:18.340] I love the way you undress now \n[00:20.880] Baby begin \n[00:22.760] Do your caress  honey  my hearts in a mess \n[00:26.600] I love your blue-eyed voice \n[00:28.100] Like tiny tim shines thru \n[00:30.860] How do you do \n[00:34.340] Well  here we are crackin jokes in the corner of our mouths\n[00:38.270] And i feel like i'm laughing in a dream \n[00:42.660] If i was young i could wait outside your school\n[00:46.220] Cos your face is like the cover of a magazine\n[00:48.640] How do you do  do you do  the things that you do \n[00:55.390] No one i know could ever keep up with you \n[00:58.620] How do you do \n[00:59.940] Did it ever make sense to you to say bye bye bye \n[01:05.981] I see you in that chair with the perfect skin \n[01:09.361] Well how have you been  baby  livin in sin \n[01:13.111] Hey  i gotta know  did you say hello -\n[01:17.681] How do you do \n[01:38.770] Well  here we are spending time in the louder part of town\n[01:41.840] And it feels like everythings surreal \n[01:44.260] When i get old i will wait outside your house\n[01:49.530] Cos your hands have got the power meant to heal",
