        "dateAdded": "2026-04-12T13:40:58.703Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.140] Hello, you fool,\n[00:15.510] I love you,\n[00:17.220] C'mon join the joyride,\n[00:27.780] I hit the road out of nowhere,\n[00:30.180] I had to jump in my car\n[00:32.490] And be a rider in a love game\n[00:34.770] Following the stars,\n[00:37.170] Don't need no book of wisdom,\n[00:39.480] I get no money talk at all.\n[00:46.440] She has a train going downtown,\n[00:48.780] She's got a club on the moon\n[00:51.360] And she's telling all her secrets\n[00:53.670] In a wonderful balloon.\n[00:55.260] Oh she's the heart of the funfair,\n[00:58.170] She's got me whistling her private tune.\n[01:04.200] And it all begins where it ends,\n[01:13.590] And she's all mine,\n[01:16.500] My magic friend.\n[01:20.430] She says:\n[01:21.240] Hello, you fool,\n[01:23.520] I love you,\n[01:25.170] C'mon join the joyride,\n[01:29.640] Join the joyride.\n[01:35.730] She's a flower, I can paint her,\n[01:38.070] She's a child of the sun,\n[01:40.470] We're a part of this together,\n[01:42.720] Could never turn around and run.\n[01:45.210] Don't need no fortune teller\n[01:47.490] To know where my lucky love belongs oh no.\n[01:53.370] Cos it all begins again when it ends,\n[02:02.790] And we're all magic friends.\n[02:09.750] She says:\n[02:10.470] Hello, you fool,\n[02:12.750] I love you,\n[02:14.370] C'mon join the joyride,\n[02:18.870] Join the joyride.\n[02:21.360] She says:\n[02:22.170] Hello, you fool,\n[02:24.510] I love you,\n[02:26.100] C'mon join the joyride,\n[02:30.660] Be a joyrider.\n[03:16.000] I take you on a skyride,\n[03:18.850] A felling like you're spellbound.\n[03:20.950] The sunshine is a lady\n[03:23.350] Who rox you like a baby.\n[03:27.010] She says:\n[03:27.790] Hello, you fool,\n[03:30.100] I love you,\n[03:31.720] C'mon join the joyride,\n[03:36.190] Join the joyride.\n[03:39.430] Hello, you fool,\n[03:41.770] I love you,\n[03:43.360] C'mon join the joyride,\n[03:47.920] Join the joyride.\n[03:52.870] hello, hello\n[03:54.640] You fool\n[03:55.900] I love You\n[03:57.040] C'mon join the joyride,\n[04:02.050] Be a joyrider.",
