        "chorusTitle": "",
        "dateAdded": "2026-06-13T07:18:00.068Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:33.49] I let go of everything I ever had\n[00:41.66] 'Cause I couldn't give the love you deserved\n[00:49.46] By The Gunner, you shouted, \"Oh, my God\"\n[00:56.74] It seemed churlish, but it's what I was owed, I suppose\n[01:04.41] Every flagstone of this town bears our prints\n[01:12.37] And all the bars 'round here serve my ghosts and carcasses\n[01:20.32] I wish I knew these things when I was young\n[01:27.62] 'Cause now I've just grown so numb\n[01:35.94] We take whatever we can to get the reason back\n[01:44.84] So please don't rein me in\n[01:51.01] (Ooh) don't rein me in\n[01:57.75] (Ooh) please don't rein me in\n[02:04.58] I'm workin' myself up to a nice warm bliss\n[02:08.63] All my memories of you ring like tinnitus\n[02:12.26] If I stop, it's just pain, please don't rein me in\n[02:21.96] I wish I could tell you everything\n[02:29.69] But my stomach was too weak\n[02:37.12] Sometimes it's easier to throw away your love\n[02:45.26] Instead of acceptin' its defeat\n[02:52.07] (Ooh) don't rein me in\n[02:59.25] (Ooh) please don't rein me in\n[03:06.76] I'm workin' myself up to a nice, warm bliss\n[03:10.50] All my memories of you ring like tinnitus\n[03:14.27] If I stop, it's just pain, please don't rein me in\n[03:22.23] (Ooh) and I'm, I'm stood here chewin' everybody's lugs off\n[03:30.00] (Ooh) tellin' everybody how much I fucked it up\n[03:38.07] (Ooh) tellin' everybody how much I fucked it up\n[03:45.75] (Ooh) tellin' everybody but you, how much I fucked it up\n[03:57.02] Slow down\n[04:03.90] Slow down\n[04:23.75] I'm workin' myself up to a nice, warm bliss\n[04:27.81] All my memories of you ring like tinnitus\n[04:31.37] If I stop, it's just pain, please don't rein me in\n[04:39.21] I'm workin' myself up to a nice, warm bliss\n[04:43.66] All my memories of you ring like tinnitus\n[04:46.98] If I stop, it's just pain, please don't rein me in\n[04:52.19]",
