        "fullLyrics": "[00:35.86] Wise man said just walk this way\n[00:40.30] To the dawn of the light\n[00:44.39] Wind will blow into your face\n[00:49.45] As the years pass you by\n[00:53.48] Hear this voice from deep inside\n[00:58.39] It's the call of your heart\n[01:02.15] Close your eyes and you will find\n[01:07.44] Passage out of the dark\n[01:11.75] Here I am (Here I am)\n[01:17.55] Will you send me an angel?\n[01:21.54] Here I am (Here I am)\n[01:26.68] In the land of the morning star\n[01:33.93] \n[01:46.94] Wise man said just find your place\n[01:52.11] In the eye of the storm\n[01:56.07] Seek the roses along the way\n[02:00.62] Just beware of the thorns\n[02:05.32] Here I am (Here I am)\n[02:10.94] Will you send me an angel?\n[02:14.96] Here I am (Here I am)\n[02:20.18] In the land of the morning star\n[02:27.71] \n[02:40.20] Wise man said just raise your hand\n[02:45.28] And reach out for the spell\n[02:49.32] Find the door to the promised land\n[02:53.82] Just believe in yourself\n[02:58.38] Hear this voice from deep inside\n[03:03.08] It's the call of your heart\n[03:07.30] Close your eyes and you will find\n[03:11.40] The way out of the dark\n[03:16.06] Here I am (Here I am)\n[03:22.13] Will you send me an angel?\n[03:26.26] Here I am (Here I am)\n[03:31.02] In the land of the morning star (Here I am)\n[03:37.65] \n[03:39.85] Will you send me an angel?\n[03:43.95] Here I am (Here I am)\n[03:49.48] In the land of the morning star (Here I am)\n[03:58.27] Will you send me an angel?\n[04:01.76] Here I am (Here I am)\n[04:06.47] In the land of the morning star (Here I am)\n[04:13.37] \n[04:15.56] Will you send me an angel?\n[04:19.72] Here I am (Here I am)\n[04:24.11] In the land of the morning star\n[04:26.90]",
