        "fullLyrics": "[00:22.746] I follow the Moskva\n[00:25.916] Down to Gorky Park\n[00:29.040] Listening to the wind of change\n[00:37.054] An August summer night\n[00:40.110] Soldiers passing by\n[00:43.337] Listening to the wind of change\n[01:11.776] The world is closing in\n[01:14.702] And did you ever think\n[01:17.976] That we could be so close like brothers\n[01:26.085] The future's in the air\n[01:28.952] Can feel it everywhere\n[01:32.185] I'm blowing with the wind of change\n[01:40.450] Take me to the magic of the moment\n[01:46.006] On a glory night\n[01:49.337] Where the children of tomorrow dream away\n[01:53.853] Dream away\n[01:55.101] In the wind of change\n[02:07.282] Walking down the street\n[02:10.229] And distant memories\n[02:13.352] Are buried in the past forever\n[02:21.420] I follow the Moskva\n[02:24.438] And down to Gorky Park\n[02:27.846] Listening to the wind of change\n[02:35.850] Take take me to the magic of the moment\n[02:41.524] On a glory\n[02:42.920] A glory night\n[02:44.864] Where the children of tomorrow dream away\n[02:49.209] Dream away\n[02:50.549] In the wind of change\n[02:52.307] The wind of change\n[02:56.275] The wind of change blows straight\n[02:59.415] Into the face of time\n[03:01.846] Like a storm wind that will ring\n[03:04.911] The freedom bell for peace of mind\n[03:08.826] Let your balalaika sing\n[03:11.184] What my guitar wants to sing\n[03:17.037] Sing\n[03:45.559] Take take me to the magic of the moment\n[03:51.137] On a glory\n[03:52.546] A glory night\n[03:54.520] Where the children of tomorrow share their dreams\n[[04:13.490] Where the children of tomorrow dream away\n[04:17.972] Dream away\n[04:19.298] In the wind of change\n[04:21.082] The wind of change",
