        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:24.37] There used to be a greying tower alone on the sea\n[00:30.66] You became the light on the dark side of me\n[00:37.45] Love remained a drug that's the high and not the pill\n[00:43.63] But did you know that when it snows\n[00:46.55] My eyes become large and\n[00:49.54] The light that you shine can't be seen?\n[00:54.70] Baby, I compare you to a kiss from a rose on the grey\n[01:00.16] Ooh, the more I get of you, the stranger it feels, yeah\n[01:06.37] And now that your rose is in bloom\n[01:11.42] A light hits the gloom on the grey\n[01:16.79] Ba-ya-ya, ba-da, ba-da-da-da, ba-ba-ya-ya\n[01:20.75] Ba-ya-ya, ba-da, ba-da-da-da, ba-ba-ya-ya\n[01:27.51] There is so much a man can tell you, so much he can say\n[01:34.93] You remain my power, my pleasure, my pain, baby\n[01:42.21] To me, you're like a growing addiction that I can't deny\n[01:47.17] Won't you tell me, is that healthy, baby?\n[01:50.69] But did you know that when it snows\n[01:53.59] My eyes become large and\n[01:56.39] The light that you shine can't be seen?\n[02:00.72] Baby, I compare you to a kiss from a rose on the grey\n[02:07.13] Ooh, the more I get of you, the stranger it feels, yeah (yeah)\n[02:14.58] Now that your rose is in bloom\n[02:18.46] A light hits the gloom on the grey\n[02:24.20] \n[02:39.74] I've been kissed by a rose on the grey\n[02:46.20] I, I've been kissed by a rose on the grey\n[02:51.59] I've been kissed by a rose on the grey (and if I should fall, would it all go away?)\n[02:57.32] I, I've been kissed by a rose on the grey\n[03:03.58] There is so much a man can tell you, so much he can say\n[03:08.25] You remain my power, my pleasure, my pain\n[03:15.82] To me, you're like a growing addiction that I can't deny (yeah)\n[03:19.91] Now, won't you tell me, is that healthy, baby?\n[03:23.52] But did you know that when it snows\n[03:26.49] My eyes become large and\n[03:29.37] The light that you shine can't be seen?\n[03:34.65] Baby, I compare you to a kiss from a rose on the grey\n[03:41.14] Ooh, the more I get of you, the stranger it feels, yeah\n[03:47.41] Now that your rose is in bloom\n[03:51.35] A light hits the gloom on the grey\n[03:55.40] Yes, I compare you to a kiss from a rose on the grey\n[04:00.28] Ooh, the more I get of you, the stranger it feels, yeah (yeah)\n[04:06.46] And now that your rose is in bloom\n[04:10.48] A light hits the gloom on the grey\n[04:15.84] \n[04:21.25] Ba-ya-ya, ba-da, ba-da-da-da, ba-ba-ya-ya\n[04:25.68] Now that your rose is in bloom\n[04:29.62] A light hits the gloom on the grey\n[04:43.08]",
