        "dateAdded": "2026-04-24T13:17:02.735Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.24] Sister's in love with a boy on drugs\n[00:11.94] Their selling pit bulls from the back of his truck\n[00:15.84] She's in so deep she can't get out\n[00:20.41] But it's one of those things we don't talk about\n[00:25.06] Brother's in the army he's a ticked off kid\n[00:32.58] In the shadow of things his brother did\n[00:37.16] He's fighting a war from the inside out\n[00:41.09] But it's one of those things we don't talk about\n[00:45.37] We talk about the weather do you think it's gonna rain\n[00:53.05] Are so and so together did you see the game\n[00:57.08] Butter up the biscuits and sugar coat the pain\n[01:01.64] We'll talk and we'll talk about everything in this town\n[01:08.03] Except the things we don't talk about\n[01:15.03] Mom and Dad couldn't make things right\n[01:17.98] Slamming doors and silent fights\n[01:21.97] Divorce papers are all signed now\n[01:26.04] But it's one of those things we don't talk about\n[01:30.96] We talk about the weather do you think it's gonna rain\n[01:38.55] Are so and so together did you see the game\n[01:43.54] Butter up the biscuits and sugar coat the pain\n[01:47.20] We'll talk and we'll talk about everything in this town\n[01:52.66] Except the things we don't talk about\n[01:58.81] Things we don't talk about\n[02:10.67] I love you is hard for me to say\n[02:17.03] They reach out but I push 'em away\n[02:21.28] Never thought about it like I do now\n[02:24.21] But it's one of those things I won't talk about\n[02:31.14] But we talk about the weather do you think it's gonna rain\n[02:36.62] Are so and so together did you see the game\n[02:40.91] Butter up the biscuits and sugar coat the pain\n[02:45.26] We'll talk and we'll talk about everything in this town\n[02:51.36] Except the things we don't talk about\n[03:05.45]",
