        "fullLyrics": "[00:28.97] Looks like we made it\n[00:32.13] Look how far we've come my baby\n[00:36.10] We mighta took the long way\n[00:39.43] We knew we'd get there someday\n[00:43.22] They said, I bet they'll never make it\n[00:49.37] But just look at us holdin' on\n[00:56.29] We're still toether, still goin' strong\n[01:03.40] (You're still the one)\n[01:04.81] You're still the one I run to\n[01:08.32] The one that I belong to\n[01:11.92] You're still the one I want for life\n[01:17.70] (You're still the one)\n[01:19.19] You're still the one that I love\n[01:22.56] The only one I dream of\n[01:26.16] You're still the one I kiss goodnight\n[01:33.24] Ain't nothin' better\n[01:37.01] We beat the odds together\n[01:40.57] I'm glad we didn't listen\n[01:43.81] Look at what we would be missin'\n[01:47.72] They said, I bet they'll never make it\n[01:53.94] But just look at us holdin' on\n[02:00.64] We're still together still goin' strong\n[02:07.71] (You're still the one)\n[02:09.35] You're still the one I run to\n[02:12.68] The one that I belong to\n[02:16.34] You're still the one I want for life\n[02:22.36] (You're still the one)\n[02:23.65] You're still the one that I love\n[02:27.09] The only one I dream of\n[02:30.62] You're still the one I kiss goodnight\n[02:36.56] (You're still the one)\n[02:40.47] \n[02:41.51] \n[02:50.67] Yeah (You're still the one)\n[02:52.35] You're still the one I run to\n[02:55.66] The one that I belong to\n[02:59.50] You're still the one I want for life\n[03:05.27] (You're still the one)\n[03:06.63] You're still the one that I love\n[03:10.10] The only one I dream of\n[03:13.77] You're still the one I kiss goodnight\n[03:20.85] I'm so glad we made it\n[03:24.22] Look how far we've come my baby\n[03:29.42]",
