        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.52] You've got a hold on me\n[00:16.74] Don't even know your power\n[00:20.24] I stand a hundred feet\n[00:23.11] But I fall when I'm around you\n[00:26.75] Show me an open door\n[00:29.78] Then you go and slam it on me\n[00:33.33] I can't take anymore\n[00:36.26] I'm saying\n[00:37.45] Baby, please have mercy on me\n[00:41.59] Take it easy on my heart\n[00:44.32] Even though you don't mean to hurt me\n[00:48.06] You keep tearing me apart\n[00:50.87] Would you please have mercy, mercy on my heart?\n[00:57.45] Would you please have mercy, mercy on my heart?\n[01:05.56] I'd drive through the night\n[01:08.80] Just to be near you, baby\n[01:12.17] Heart open, testify\n[01:15.24] Tell me that I'm not crazy\n[01:18.40] I'm not asking for a lot\n[01:21.77] Just that you're honest with me\n[01:24.85] My pride is all I got\n[01:28.02] I'm saying\n[01:29.20] Baby, please have mercy on me\n[01:33.35] Take it easy on my heart\n[01:36.21] Even though you don't mean to hurt me\n[01:39.67] You keep tearing me apart\n[01:42.61] Would you please have mercy on me?\n[01:46.16] I'm a puppet on your string\n[01:49.08] And even though you got good intentions\n[01:52.89] I need you to set me free\n[01:55.77] Would you please have mercy, mercy on my heart?\n[02:02.10] Would you please have mercy, mercy on my heart?\n[02:09.53] Consuming all the air inside my lungs\n[02:13.01] Ripping all the skin from off my bones\n[02:16.31] I'm prepared to sacrifice my life\n[02:19.18] I would gladly do it twice\n[02:22.60] Consuming all the air inside my lungs\n[02:26.05] Ripping all the skin from off my bones\n[02:29.35] I'm prepared to sacrifice my life\n[02:32.05] I would gladly do it twice\n[02:35.75] Oh, please have mercy on me\n[02:39.78] Take it easy on my heart\n[02:42.82] Even though you don't mean to hurt me\n[02:46.02] You keep tearing me apart\n[02:49.23] Would you please have mercy on me?\n[02:52.88] I'm a puppet on your string\n[02:55.43] And even though you got good intentions\n[02:59.30] I need you to set me free\n[03:02.32] I'm begging you for mercy, mercy\n[03:06.53] Begging you, begging you, please, baby (on my heart)\n[03:08.78] I'm begging you for mercy, mercy\n[03:13.27] Oh, I'm begging you, begging you, yeah (on my heart)\n[03:16.54]",
