        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.499] I love it when you call me señorita\n[00:19.560] I wish I could pretend I didn't need ya\n[00:23.638] But every touch is ooh la la la\n[00:26.742] It's true la la la\n[00:28.718] Ooh I should be runnin'\n[00:30.774] Ooh you keep me coming for ya\n[00:33.156] Shawn Mendes：\n[00:33.493] Land in Miami\n[00:35.427] The air was hot from summer rain\n[00:37.478] Sweat drippin' off me\n[00:39.640] Before I even knew her name la la la\n[00:44.615] It felt like ooh la la la\n[00:47.275] Yeah noo\n[00:49.678] Sapphire moonlight\n[00:51.703] We danced for hours in the sand\n[00:53.854] Tequila sunrise\n[00:55.913] Her body fit right in my hands la la la\n[01:01.058] It felt like ooh la la la yeah\n[01:04.483] Both：\n[01:04.674] I love it when you call me señorita\n[01:08.747] I wish I could pretend I didn't need ya\n[01:12.847] But every touch is ooh la la la\n[01:15.967] It's true la la la\n[01:18.064] Ooh I should be runnin'\n[01:20.052] Ooh you know I love it when you call me señorita\n[01:25.252] I wish it wasn't so damn hard to leave ya\n[01:29.321] But every touch is ooh la la la\n[01:32.461] It's true la la la\n[01:34.360] Ooh I should be runnin'\n[01:36.384] Ooh you keep me coming for ya\n[01:38.746] Camila Cabello：\n[01:39.069] Locked in the hotel\n[01:41.062] There's just somethings that never change\n[01:43.129] You say we're just friends\n[01:45.129] But friends don't know the way you taste la la la\n[01:50.831] 'Cause you know it's been a long time coming don't ya let me fall ooh\n[01:54.707] Both：\n[01:55.282] Ooh when your lips undress me\n[01:57.239] Hooked on your tongue\n[01:59.191] Ooh love your kiss is deadly don't stop\n[02:02.318] I love it when you call me señorita\n[02:06.246] I wish I could pretend I didn't need ya\n[02:10.247] But every touch is ooh la la la\n[02:13.310] It's true la la la\n[02:15.414] Ooh I should be runnin'\n[02:17.438] Ooh you know I love it when you call me señorita\n[02:22.622] I wish it wasn't so damn hard to leave ya\n[02:26.684] But every touch is ooh la la la\n[02:29.802] It's true la la la\n[02:31.818] Ooh I should be runnin'\n[02:33.882] Ooh you keep me coming for ya\n[02:37.648] All along I've been coming for ya\n[02:40.517] For you\n[02:41.902] And I hope it meant something to you\n[02:45.952] Call my name I'll be coming for ya\n[02:48.565] Coming for ya\n[02:49.626] Coming for ya\n[02:50.706] Coming for ya\n[02:52.012] For ya\n[02:56.004] For ya\n[02:58.071] Oh she loves it when I call\n[03:00.144] For ya\n[03:04.754] Ooh I should be runnin'\n[03:06.712] Ooh you keep me coming for ya",
