        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.472] My eyes are open wide\n[00:17.983] By the way\n[00:20.174] I made it through the day\n[00:24.042] I watch the world outside\n[00:27.528] Bye the way\n[00:29.736] I am leaving out today\n[00:33.354] I just saw halley&apos;s comet shooting\n[00:39.309] Said why you always running in place\n[00:43.201] Even the man in the moon disappears\n[00:49.245] Somewhere in the stratosphere\n[00:52.594] Tell my mother\n[00:54.837] Tell my father\n[00:57.609] I&apos;ve done the best i can\n[01:01.829] To make them realise\n[01:04.529] This is my life\n[01:07.205] I hope they understand\n[01:11.609] I&apos;m not angry  i&apos;m just saying\n[01:18.013] Sometimes goodbye\n[01:19.568] Is a second chance\n[01:24.022] Please don&apos;t cry one tear for me\n[01:27.436] I&apos;m not afraid of\n[01:29.860] What i have to say\n[01:33.620] This is my one and only voice\n[01:36.872] So listen close\n[01:39.336] It&apos;s only for today\n[01:43.166] I just saw hailey&apos;s comet shooting\n[01:48.724] Said why you always running in place\n[01:52.796] Even the man in the moon disappears\n[01:58.278] Somewhere in the stratosphere\n[02:02.068] Tell my mother\n[02:04.462] Tell my father\n[02:07.132] I&apos;ve done the best i can\n[02:11.514] To make them realise\n[02:14.226] This is my life\n[02:16.660] I hope they understand\n[02:21.007] I&apos;m not angry  i&apos;m just saying\n[02:27.551] Sometimes goodbye\n[02:29.118] Is a second chance\n[02:41.070] Here&apos;s my chance\n[02:45.455] This is my chance\n[02:54.881] Tell my mother\n[02:57.118] Tell my father\n[02:59.971] I&apos;ve done the best i can\n[03:04.193] To make them realise\n[03:06.901] This is my life\n[03:09.472] I hope they understand\n[03:14.025] I&apos;m not angry  i&apos;m just saying\n[03:20.333] Sometimes goodbye\n[03:22.067] Is a second chance\n[03:25.088] Sometimes goodbye\n[03:26.733] Is a second chance\n[03:29.555] Sometimes goodbye\n[03:31.733] Is a second chance",
