        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:06.501] Don't cry snowman not in front of me\n[00:10.814] Who'll catch your tears if you can't catch me darling\n[00:15.646] If you can't catch me darling\n[00:20.104] Don't cry snowman don't leave me this way\n[00:24.370] A puddle of water can't hold me close baby\n[00:29.091] Can't hold me close baby\n[00:34.464] I want you to know that I'm never leaving\n[00:37.904] 'Cause I'm Mrs. Snow 'til death we'll be freezing\n[00:41.336] Yeah you are my home my home for all seasons\n[00:44.720] So come on let's go\n[00:48.226] Let's go below zero and hide from the sun\n[00:51.658] I'll love you forever where we'll have some fun\n[00:54.953] Yes let's hit the North Pole and live happily\n[00:58.442] Please don't cry no tears now\n[01:00.188] It's Christmas baby\n[01:01.841] My snowman and me\n[01:08.725] My snowman and me\n[01:15.133] Baby\n[01:21.877] Don't cry snowman don't you fear the sun\n[01:25.975] Who'll carry me without legs to run honey\n[01:30.864] Without legs to run honey\n[01:35.578] Don't cry snowman don't you shed a tear\n[01:39.931] Who'll hear my secrets if you don't have ears baby\n[01:44.677] If you don't have ears baby\n[01:49.836] I want you to know that I'm never leaving\n[01:53.236] 'Cause I'm Mrs. Snow 'til death we'll be freezing\n[01:56.712] Yeah you are my home my home for all seasons\n[02:00.067] So come on let's go\n[02:03.576] Let's go below zero and hide from the sun\n[02:06.954] I'll love you forever where we'll have some fun\n[02:10.415] Yes let's hit the North Pole and live happily\n[02:13.781] Please don't cry no tears now\n[02:15.644] It's Christmas baby\n[02:17.470] My snowman and me\n[02:24.101] My snowman and me\n[02:30.549] Baby",
