        "chorus": "Am Bm C D 4x",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "VERSE",
        "dateAdded": "2026-05-20T19:32:57.463Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:37.04] Don't you look back on a big lost world (crying out tomorrow)\n[00:41.67] Don't you look down like the heroes say (come tell me all about it)\n[00:46.17] Take me to the streets where the bonfires burn\n[00:51.08] Take me in your arms and I'll fade away\n[00:52.83] When I hear you say what you got to say\n[00:55.63] (Anywhere you go, you know I'll still be waiting)\n[01:00.08] All the things she said, she said\n[01:04.56] (Little darling close your eyes, there'll be no compromising)\n[01:09.22] Of all the things she said, she said\n[01:13.97] Throw me to the street where the heartbeat's beating (it's beating all around me)\n[01:17.72] To the peaceful revolution and the perfect wave, surround me\n[01:23.36] Tell me 'bout the ocean moving in slow motion\n[01:26.90] I see it glitter in the sun, then it's freezing in the moonlight\n[01:30.37] Never look back, never look back, never look away\n[01:32.43] (If freedom comes and goes, you know I'll still be waiting)\n[01:37.26] All the things she said, she said\n[01:41.56] (You've fought the fight so long, no surrender to temptation)\n[01:46.21] All the things she said, she said\n[01:50.00] \n[01:54.19] Stars will fall out for you\n[01:59.03] Luck will surrender\n[02:03.72] I'm calling out to you\n[02:09.07] (Oh to be near you in the first morning light)\n[02:14.32] I'd be with you, I dream about you\n[02:18.93] (If I could leave here, I would leave here tonight)\n[02:23.65] I'd be with you, I'd stay with you tonight\n[02:29.89] \n[02:36.73] Tonight\n[02:42.10] \n[02:46.59] (Anywhere you go, you know I'll still be waiting)\n[02:50.79] Of all the things she said, she said\n[02:54.10] \n[03:13.69] (When I look into your eyes, I see a new day rising)\n[03:18.56] Of all the things she said, she said\n[03:23.46] (Through the eyes of love, and to never know what hate is)\n[03:27.73] Of all the things she said, she said\n[03:31.84] She said, \"This is our time\", she said, \"This is our place\"\n[03:36.84] This is the space my heart wants to be\n[03:41.52] (Little darling close your eyes, there'll be no compromising)\n[03:46.57] All the things she said, she said\n[03:51.18]",
