        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:03.72] Hey, hey, hey, hey\n[00:06.88] Ooh-ooh-hoo, woah\n[00:12.13] \n[00:18.91] Won't you come see about me\n[00:22.76] I'll be alone, dancing, you know it, baby\n[00:27.76] Tell me your troubles and doubts\n[00:31.45] Givin' me everything inside and out, and\n[00:36.26] Love's strange, surreal in the dark\n[00:39.99] Think of the tender things that we were working on\n[00:44.73] Slow change may pull us apart\n[00:48.82] When the light gets into your heart, baby\n[00:53.54] Don't you forget about me\n[00:59.59] Don't, don't, don't, don't\n[01:02.43] Don't you forget about me\n[01:08.15] \n[01:10.50] Will you stand above me\n[01:14.62] Look my way, never love me\n[01:19.03] Rain keeps fallin', rain keeps fallin'\n[01:23.78] Down, down, down\n[01:27.87] Will you recognize me\n[01:31.96] Call my name or walk on by?\n[01:36.40] Rain keeps fallin', rain keeps fallin'\n[01:40.73] Down, down, down, down\n[01:47.08] Hey, hey, hey, hey\n[01:50.47] Ooh-ooh-hoo, woah\n[01:56.16] \n[02:02.76] Don't you try and pretend\n[02:06.53] It's my feeling, we'll win in the end\n[02:09.66] I won't harm you or touch your defences\n[02:14.75] Vanity, insecurity, ah\n[02:19.81] Don't you forget about me\n[02:23.37] I'll be alone, dancing, you know it, baby\n[02:28.37] Going to take us apart\n[02:32.51] I'll put us back together at heart, baby\n[02:37.38] Don't you forget about me\n[02:42.96] Don't, don't, don't, don't\n[02:45.82] Don't you forget about me\n[02:52.13] As you walk on by\n[02:56.51] Will you call my name?\n[03:00.98] As you walk on by\n[03:05.40] Will you call my name\n[03:09.50] When you walk away?\n[03:13.30] \n[03:17.69] Or will you walk away?\n[03:21.59] \n[03:26.73] When you walk on by\n[03:30.28] \n[03:32.53] Come on, call my name\n[03:36.88] Won't you call my name?\n[03:41.26] \n[03:44.45] I sing, \"La, la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la\n[03:50.44] La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la\n[03:54.90] La-la-la-la, la-la-la-la\n[03:58.99] La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la\n[04:03.02] La-la-la-la, la-la-la-la\n[04:07.28] La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la\"\n[04:11.25] When you walk on by (walk on by)\n[04:15.53] And you call my name\n[04:17.14]",
