        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.000]  Rhythm is a dancer, it's a soul's companion\n[00:50.580] You can feel it everywhere\n[00:54.330] Lift your hands and voices, free your mind and join us\n[00:58.320] You can feel it in the air\n[01:03.510] Ooh, it's a passion\n[01:05.430] Ooh, you can feel it in the air\n[01:11.190] Ooh, it's a passion, ooh\n[01:48.390] Rhythm is a dancer, it's a soul's companion\n[01:52.320] You can feel it everywhere\n[01:56.100] Lift your hands and voices, free your mind and join us\n[02:00.060] You can feel it in the air, ooh\n[02:05.730] A far away light in the futuristic place we might be,\n[02:08.820] It's a tiny world just big enough to support the kingdom of one knowledgeable,\n[02:13.650] throw away the loneliness and head back down,\n[02:16.650] I'm going too fast, I'm going too fast\n[03:21.000] Rhythm is a dancer, it's a soul's companion\n[03:24.930] You can feel it everywhere\n[03:28.740] Lift your hands and voices, free your mind and join us\n[03:32.640] You can feel it in the air, ooh\n[03:38.250] I plunge right on through the office door, and into the arms of the bottomless negro  of love,\n[03:42.480] Suddenly I can't remember, how to stop, or turn around,\n[03:46.470] Do I have to get behind myself, do I have to turn around before I can point,\n[03:50.970] I flip 'til I can breathe\n[05:09.030] Rhythm is a dancer, it's a soul's companion\n[05:12.930] You can feel it everywhere\n[05:16.800] Lift your hands and voices, free your mind and join us\n[05:20.700] You can feel it in the air, ooh",
