        "dateAdded": "2026-05-18T06:38:58.156Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:02.71] We'll do it all\n[00:07.32] Everything\n[00:11.84] On our own\n[00:17.05] \n[00:21.64] We don't need\n[00:26.11] Anything\n[00:30.45] Or anyone\n[00:36.69] If I lay here\n[00:41.03] If I just lay here\n[00:45.76] Would you lie with me and just forget the world?\n[00:53.66] \n[00:58.05] I don't quite know\n[01:02.69] How to say\n[01:07.22] How I feel\n[01:11.90] \n[01:16.66] Those three words\n[01:20.87] Are said too much\n[01:25.55] They're not enough\n[01:29.65] \n[01:31.66] If I lay here\n[01:35.80] If I just lay here\n[01:40.77] Would you lie with me and just forget the world?\n[01:47.43] \n[01:49.83] Forget what we're told\n[01:54.40] Before we get too old\n[01:59.27] Show me a garden that's bursting into life\n[02:05.95] \n[02:09.75] Let's waste time\n[02:14.02] Chasing cars\n[02:18.80] Around our heads\n[02:23.55] I need your grace\n[02:23.91] To remind me\n[02:24.37] To find my own\n[02:24.91] If I lay here\n[02:29.76] If I just lay here\n[02:34.38] Would you lie with me and just forget the world?\n[02:41.29] Forget what we're told\n[02:41.57] Before we get too old\n[02:41.90] Show me a garden that's bursting into life\n[02:43.43] All that I am\n[02:48.11] All that I ever was\n[02:52.71] Is here in your perfect eyes, they're all I can see\n[02:57.37] \n[03:01.98] I don't know where\n[03:06.30] Confused about how as well\n[03:11.25] Just know that these things will never change for us at all\n[03:16.53] \n[03:20.45] If I lay here\n[03:24.95] If I just lay here\n[03:29.65] Would you lie with me and just forget the world?\n[03:33.75]",
