        "fullLyrics": "[00:22.400] Lookin' in your eyes I see a paradise\n[00:27.170] This world that I've found\n[00:29.390] is too good to be true\n[00:32.390] Standin' here beside you\n[00:34.910] want so much to give you\n[00:37.190] This love in my heart\n[00:39.380] that I'm feelin' for you\n[00:43.010] Let 'em say we're crazy\n[00:45.500] I don't care about that\n[00:48.080] Put your hand in my hand\n[00:49.640] baby don't ever look back\n[00:53.090] Let the world around us just fall apart\n[00:58.070] Baby we can make it\n[00:59.750] if we're heart-to-heart\n[01:03.410] And we can build this dream together\n[01:07.340] Standing strong forever\n[01:09.920] Nothing's gonna stop us now\n[01:13.760] And if this world runs out of lovers\n[01:17.420] We'll still have each other\n[01:19.970] Nothing's gonna stop us\n[01:22.430] nothing's gonna stop us now\n[01:26.840] whoa no\n[01:29.960] I'm so glad I found you\n[01:32.450] I'm not gonna lose you\n[01:34.940] Whatever it takes,\n[01:36.860] I will stay here with you\n[01:39.890] Take you to the good times\n[01:42.350] see you through the bad times\n[01:44.960] Whatever it takes is what I'm gonna do\n[01:50.510] Let 'em say we're crazy\n[01:53.000] what do they know\n[01:55.550] Put your arms around me\n[01:57.110] baby, don't ever let go\n[02:00.530] Let the world around us just fall apart\n[02:05.570] Baby, we can make it if we're heart-to-heart\n[02:10.910] And we can build this dream together\n[02:14.840] Standing strong forever\n[02:17.420] Nothing's gonna stop us now\n[02:21.260] And if this world runs out of lovers\n[02:24.950] We'll still have each other\n[02:27.440] Nothing's gonna stop us\n[02:29.960] nothing's gonna stop us ooh\n[02:35.390] All that I need is you\n[02:40.220] All that I ever need\n[02:44.990] All that I want to do\n[02:50.030] Is hold you forever forever and ever\n[03:15.890] And we can build this dream together\n[03:19.790] Standing strong forever\n[03:22.460] Nothing's gonna stop us now\n[03:26.240] And if this world runs out of lovers\n[03:29.960] We'll still have each other\n[03:32.450] Nothing's gonna stop us\n[03:35.210] nothing's gonna stop us\n[03:37.190] Build this dream together\n[03:39.710] Standing strong forever\n[03:46.490] Nothing's gonna stop us now\n[03:49.220] And if this world runs out of lovers\n[03:50.420] We'll still have each other\n[03:53.030] Nothing's gonna stop us now\n[03:57.350] And we can build this dream together\n[04:03.320] Standing strong forever\n[04:05.300] Nothing's gonna stop us now\n[04:07.640] And if this world runs out of lovers\n[04:09.980] We'll still have each other\n[04:12.410] Nothing's gonna stop us\n[04:15.230] nothing's gonna stop us\n[04:17.030] Build this dream together\n[04:22.490] Standing strong forever",
