        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.52] I heat up, I can't cool down\n[00:19.98] You got me spinnin'\n[00:22.39] 'Round and 'round\n[00:23.80] 'Round and 'round and 'round it goes\n[00:27.43] Where it stops nobody knows\n[00:31.06] Every time you call my name\n[00:34.86] I heat up like a burnin' flame\n[00:38.80] Burnin' flame full of desire\n[00:42.32] Kiss me baby, let the fire get higher\n[00:45.98] Abra-abra-cadabra\n[00:50.08] I want to reach out and grab ya\n[00:52.96] Abra-abra-cadabra\n[00:58.03] Abracadabra\n[01:01.23] You make me hot, you make me sigh\n[01:05.14] You make me laugh, you make me cry\n[01:09.07] Keep me burnin' for your love\n[01:12.65] With the touch of a velvet glove\n[01:16.09] Abra-abra-cadabra\n[01:20.18] I want to reach out and grab ya\n[01:23.23] Abra-abra-cadabra\n[01:28.26] Abracadabra\n[01:30.90] I feel the magic in your caress\n[01:35.27] I feel magic when I touch your dress\n[01:39.18] Silk and satin, leather and lace\n[01:42.81] Black panties with an angel's face\n[01:46.47] I see magic in your eyes\n[01:50.10] I hear the magic in your sighs\n[01:54.05] Just when I think I'm gonna get away\n[01:57.74] I hear those words that you always say\n[02:00.95] Abra-abra-cadabra\n[02:05.37] I want to reach out and grab ya\n[02:08.18] Abra-abra-cadabra\n[02:12.95] Abracadabra\n[02:16.77] Every time you call my name\n[02:20.47] I heat up like a burnin' flame\n[02:23.89] Burnin' flame full of desire\n[02:27.73] Kiss me baby, let the fire get higher\n[02:31.17] \n[02:33.36] \n[03:16.73] I heat up, I can't cool down\n[03:20.18] My situation goes 'round and 'round\n[03:23.96] I heat up, I can't cool down\n[03:27.62] My situation goes 'round and 'round\n[03:31.57] I heat up, I can't cool down\n[03:35.22] My situation goes 'round and 'round\n[03:37.94]",
