        "fullLyrics": "[00:02.426] Some people call me the space cowboy yeah\n[00:08.318] Some call me the gangster of love\n[00:14.245] Some people call me Maurice\n[00:18.671] 'Cause I speak of the pompatus of love\n[00:26.414] People talk about me baby\n[00:31.630] Say I'm doing you wrong doing you wrong\n[00:37.603] Well don't you worry baby don't worry\n[00:42.134] 'Cause I'm right here right here right here right here at home\n[00:47.581] 'Cause I'm a picker I'm a grinner\n[00:50.829] I'm a lover and I'm a sinner\n[00:54.544] I play my music in the sun\n[00:59.405] I'm a joker I'm a smoker\n[01:02.194] I'm a midnight toker\n[01:06.084] I get my lovin' on the run\n[01:10.513] Whoo\n[01:13.309] Whoo\n[01:37.601] You're the cutest thing that I ever did see\n[01:43.089] I really love your peaches wanna shake your tree\n[01:49.785] Lovey-dovey lovey-dovey lovey-dovey all the time\n[01:54.981] Oee baby I'll sure show you a good time\n[02:00.273] 'Cause I'm a picker I'm a grinner\n[02:03.097] I'm a lover and I'm a sinner\n[02:07.024] I play my music in the sun\n[02:11.653] I'm a joker I'm a smoker\n[02:14.515] I'm a midnight toker\n[02:18.660] I sure don't want to hurt no one\n[02:45.706] Whoo\n[02:47.301] Whoo\n[02:50.972] People keep talking about me baby\n[02:56.948] Say I'm doing you wrong\n[03:02.661] Well don't you worry don't worry no don't worry mama\n[03:07.981] 'Cause I'm right here at home\n[03:13.774] You're the cutest thing I ever did see\n[03:18.588] Really love your peaches wanna shake your tree\n[03:24.962] Lovey-dovey lovey-dovey lovey-dovey all the time\n[03:30.530] C'mon baby now I'll show you a good time",
