        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.45] There it is, right, two, a one, two, three\n[00:09.04] Well, I've been spending all my money on weed n' pills\n[00:12.26] Tryin' to write a song that'll pay the bills\n[00:14.52] But it ain't came yet, so I guess I'll have to rob a bank\n[00:19.66] I guess it could be worse, it ain't that bad\n[00:22.34] At least I ain't sittin' in old Baghdad\n[00:24.83] In the middle of a hot damn desert sittin' in a tank\n[00:29.62] Well, every time the wife talks, a baby gets mentioned\n[00:32.80] I'm so broke I can't pay attention\n[00:35.67] Lord, how it tears me up to see her cry\n[00:39.96] Oh, I've been spendin' all my nights on the internet\n[00:43.05] Looking for a clue but ain't found one yet\n[00:45.45] Just a bunch of Mopars, guitars and other stuff I can't buy\n[00:50.30] Well, now Lord, if you can hear me won't you throw a damn dog a bone\n[00:55.63] 'Cause if the Devil shows up with a better deal this old soul's a-goin' down\n[01:01.93] Oh, I sing 'em real pretty, sing 'em real sad\n[01:04.68] And all the people in the crowd say \"He ain't half bad\"\n[01:09.16] Well, they call me King Turd up here on Shit Mountain\n[01:12.01] If you want it you can have the crown\n[01:26.77] Well, I've been sittin' on my ass like a bump on a log\n[01:30.62] Watchin' Andy and ol' Boss Hog\n[01:32.50] I guess I oughta get up and go out and find a job\n[01:37.42] Instead of sittin' on the couch trying to find the next line\n[01:40.25] I'm sure there's gotta be a better use of my time\n[01:42.52] Like figuring out which one of these banks I'm gonna go rob\n[01:47.44] Well, the name of the game is hurry up and wait\n[01:50.78] But that ain't putting no food on my plate\n[01:53.07] Or gas in my car and I drive a Bronco\n[01:58.03] So Lord, if I could just get me a record deal\n[02:00.73] I might not have to worry about my next meal\n[02:03.37] But I'll still be trying to figure out what the hell rhymes with Bronco\n[02:08.10] Well, now Lord, if you can hear me won't you throw a damn dog a bone\n[02:13.66] 'Cause if the Devil shows up with a better deal this old soul's a-goin' down\n[02:20.00] Oh, I sing 'em real pretty, sing 'em real sad\n[02:22.77] And all the people in the crowd say \"He ain't half bad\"\n[02:27.23] Well, they call me King Turd up here on Shit Mountain\n[02:30.13] If you want it you can have the crown\n[02:33.86] Well, they call me King Turd up here on Shit Mountain\n[02:36.64] If you want it you can have the crown",
