        "chorus": "Cm G# A# Cm 4x ",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "VERSE",
        "dateAdded": "2026-04-28T15:15:17.246Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:49.52] Rising up, back on the street\n[00:53.93] Did my time, took my chances\n[00:58.39] Went the distance, now I'm back on my feet\n[01:01.68] Just a man and his will to survive\n[01:06.77] So many times it happens too fast\n[01:11.35] You trade your passion for glory\n[01:15.60] Don't lose your grip on the dreams of the past\n[01:19.23] You must fight just to keep them alive\n[01:23.44] It's the eye of the tiger\n[01:25.96] It's the thrill of the fight\n[01:27.89] Rising up to the challenge of our rival\n[01:32.38] And the last known survivor\n[01:34.60] Stalks his prey in the night\n[01:36.69] And he's watching us all with the eye of the tiger\n[01:44.59] \n[01:46.86] Face to face, out in the heat\n[01:51.34] Hanging tough, staying hungry\n[01:55.49] They stack the odds 'til we take to the street\n[01:59.09] For the kill with the skill to survive\n[02:03.13] It's the eye of the tiger\n[02:05.60] It's the thrill of the fight\n[02:07.56] Rising up to the challenge of our rival\n[02:11.99] And the last known survivor\n[02:14.37] Stalks his prey in the night\n[02:16.39] And he's watching us all with the eye of the tiger\n[02:24.12] \n[02:30.94] Rising up, straight to the top\n[02:35.40] Had the guts, got the glory\n[02:39.71] Went the distance, now I'm not gonna stop\n[02:43.09] Just a man and his will to survive\n[02:47.21] It's the eye of the tiger\n[02:49.72] It's the thrill of the fight\n[02:51.60] Rising up to the challenge of our rival\n[02:56.03] And the last known survivor\n[02:58.35] Stalks his prey in the night\n[03:00.40] And he's watching us all with the eye of the tiger\n[03:10.40] \n[03:19.72] The eye of the tiger\n[03:24.04] \n[03:28.52] The eye of the tiger\n[03:31.15] The eye of the tiger\n[03:35.47] \n[03:46.22] The eye of the tiger\n[03:47.69]",
