        "dateAdded": "2026-06-09T08:37:17.922Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:26.26] My name is Luka\n[00:29.98] I live on the second floor\n[00:33.76] I live upstairs from you\n[00:37.59] Yes I think you've seen me before\n[00:41.17] If you hear something late at night\n[00:44.95] Some kind of trouble, some kind of fight\n[00:49.08] Just don't ask me what it was\n[00:52.84] Just don't ask me what it was\n[00:56.72] Just don't ask me what it was\n[01:00.82] I think it's because I'm clumsy\n[01:04.48] I try not to talk too loud\n[01:08.27] Maybe it's because I'm crazy\n[01:12.14] I try not to act too proud\n[01:14.26] They only hit until you cry\n[01:19.15] And after that you don't ask why\n[01:23.44] You just don't argue anymore\n[01:26.40] You just don't argue anymore\n[01:31.26] You just don't argue anymore\n[01:36.12] \n[01:51.01] Yes I think I'm okay\n[01:52.47] I walked into the door again\n[01:58.23] If you ask that's what I'll say\n[02:01.88] And it's not your business anyway\n[02:05.71] I guess I'd like to be alone\n[02:09.64] With nothing broken, nothing thrown\n[02:13.52] Just don't ask me how I am\n[02:17.41] Just don't ask me how I am\n[02:21.26] Just don't ask me how I am\n[02:25.36] My name is Luka\n[02:29.05] I live on the second floor\n[02:32.81] I live upstairs from you\n[02:36.67] Yes I think you've seen me before\n[02:40.22] If you hear something late at night\n[02:44.09] Some kind of trouble, some kind of fight\n[02:48.13] Just don't ask me what it was\n[02:51.92] Just don't ask me what it was\n[02:55.87] Just don't ask me what it was\n[02:59.59] They only hit until you cry\n[03:03.00] And after that you don't ask why\n[03:07.11] You just don't argue anymore\n[03:10.22] You just don't argue anymore\n[03:14.82] You just don't argue anymore\n[03:17.70]",
