        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.650] There's something 'bout the way the street looks when it's just rained\n[00:25.763] There's a glow off the pavement you walk me to the car\n[00:30.561] And you know I wanna ask you to dance right there\n[00:35.316] In the middle of the parking lot yeah\n[00:43.717] Oh yeah\n[00:49.504] We're driving down the road I wonder if you know\n[00:54.284] I'm trying so hard not to get caught up now\n[00:59.075] But you're just so cool run your hands through your hair\n[01:04.154] Absentmindedly making me want you\n[01:08.816] And I don't know how it gets better than this\n[01:13.469] You take my hand and drag me head first fearless\n[01:18.196] And I don't know why but with you I'd dance\n[01:23.416] In a storm in my best dress fearless\n[01:37.472] So baby drive slow 'til we run out of road in this one horse town\n[01:44.666] I wanna stay right here in this passenger's seat\n[01:49.554] You put your eyes on me\n[01:52.210] In this moment now capture it remember it\n[01:56.682] 'Cause I don't know how it gets better than this\n[02:01.431] You take my hand and drag me head first fearless\n[02:06.338] And I don't know why but with you I'd dance\n[02:11.502] In a storm in my best dress fearless\n[02:35.285] Well you stood there with me in the doorway\n[02:38.932] My hands shake I'm not usually this way but\n[02:44.671] You pull me in and I'm a little more brave\n[02:48.331] It's the first kiss it's flawless really something\n[02:54.874] It's fearless\n[03:00.490] Oh yeah\n[03:06.317] 'Cause I don't know how it gets better than this\n[03:11.296] You take my hand and drag me head first fearless\n[03:15.891] And I don't know why but with you I'd dance\n[03:21.002] In a storm in my best dress fearless\n[03:25.458] 'Cause I don't know how it gets better than this\n[03:30.312] You take my hand and drag me head first fearless\n[03:35.100] And I don't know why but with you I'd dance\n[03:40.176] In a storm in my best dress fearless\n[03:46.193] Oh oh\n[03:48.688] Oh yeah",
