        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.440] I Knew It, I Knew You - Taylor Swift\n[00:01.697] Lyrics by：Jack Antonoff/Taylor Swift\n[00:02.609] Composed by：Jack Antonoff/Taylor Swift\n[00:03.562] Produced by：Jack Antonoff/Taylor Swift\n[00:06.488] I knew you\n[00:08.658] Through the daze of the blades of the grass in summer\n[00:11.921] Parachutes for the free fall of being younger\n[00:15.761] I memorized the sound of your bare footsteps running wild\n[00:24.868] It's been a long time\n[00:27.643] Life has ways of leaving those days behind\n[00:32.636] But seeing you tonight\n[00:35.829] I remembered I loved you\n[00:37.569] Came back when it mattered\n[00:38.905] I saw you standing there in the light of the window\n[00:42.381] Wearing that same smile\n[00:44.106] Man it's been a while\n[00:45.819] But I knew it I knew you\n[00:49.915] I knew it I knew you\n[00:52.684] I knew you all your blues like a mood ring changing colors\n[00:58.277] You did too there were times we could fight like brothers\n[01:02.484] I watched you drive around the bend\n[01:07.311] For what I thought would be the last time I saw my friend\n[01:13.748] But love has ways of bringing things back to life\n[01:19.340] All you said was \"Hi\"\n[01:22.084] And I remembered I loved you\n[01:23.996] Came back when it mattered\n[01:25.324] I saw you standing there in the light of the window\n[01:28.841] Wearing that same smile\n[01:30.610] Man it's been a while\n[01:32.240] But I knew it I knew you\n[01:37.574] I knew it I knew you\n[01:42.814] I knew it I knew you\n[01:55.286] Oh the rivers I cried when we said goodbye\n[02:00.617] Wondering if I'd made it up in my mind\n[02:05.280] But now you look me in the eye\n[02:08.562] And you told me I loved you\n[02:10.449] Came back when it mattered\n[02:11.792] I saw you standing there in the light of the window\n[02:15.473] Wearing that same smile\n[02:16.988] Yeah it's been a while\n[02:18.884] Oh\n[02:20.545] Wearing that same smile\n[02:22.053] Man it's been a while\n[02:25.711] Wearing that same smile\n[02:27.277] Man it's been a while\n[02:29.147] But I knew it I knew you\n[02:34.347] I knew it I knew you\n[02:38.683] Wearing that same smile\n[02:42.232] I knew it I knew you\n[02:47.296] I knew it I knew you\n[02:49.832] I knew it",
