        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.206] We were both young when I first saw you\n[00:19.939] I close my eyes and the flashback starts\n[00:23.525] I'm standing there on a balcony in summer air\n[00:32.362] See the lights see the party the ball gowns\n[00:36.380] See you make your way through the crowd\n[00:39.561] And say hello\n[00:43.519] Little did I know\n[00:48.263] That you were Romeo you were throwing pebbles\n[00:52.008] And my daddy said\n[00:53.451] Stay away from Juliet\n[00:55.724] And I was crying on the staircase\n[00:58.523] Begging you please don't go\n[01:03.061] And I said\n[01:04.566] Romeo take me somewhere we can be alone\n[01:08.646] I'll be waiting all there's left to do is run\n[01:12.720] You'll be the prince and I'll be the princess\n[01:16.673] It's a love story baby just say yes\n[01:24.551] So I sneak out to the garden to see you\n[01:28.842] We keep quiet 'cause we're dead if they knew\n[01:32.111] So close your eyes escape this town for a little while\n[01:40.691] 'Cause you were Romeo I was a scarlet letter\n[01:44.360] And my daddy said\n[01:45.961] Stay away from Juliet\n[01:48.156] But you were everything to me\n[01:50.475] I was begging you please don't go\n[01:55.453] And I said Romeo take me somewhere we can be alone\n[02:01.101] I'll be waiting all there's left to do is run\n[02:05.123] You'll be the prince and I'll be the princess\n[02:09.194] It's a love story baby just say yes\n[02:13.249] Romeo save me they're trying to tell me how to feel\n[02:17.486] This love is difficult but it's real\n[02:21.274] Don't be afraid we'll make it out of this mess\n[02:25.249] It's a love story baby just say yes\n[02:32.668] Oh oh\n[02:44.365] I got tired of waiting\n[02:48.566] Wondering if you were ever coming around\n[02:52.235] My faith in you was fading\n[02:57.152] When I met you on the outskirts of town\n[03:00.377] And I said\n[03:01.624] Romeo save me I've been feeling so alone\n[03:05.647] I keep waiting for you but you never come\n[03:09.353] Is this in my head I don't know what to think\n[03:13.262] He knelt to the ground and pulled out a ring and said\n[03:17.722] Marry me Juliet you'll never have to be alone\n[03:21.762] I love you and that's all I really know\n[03:25.577] I talked to your dad go pick out a white dress\n[03:29.810] It's a love story baby just say yes\n[03:37.234] Oh oh\n[03:40.651] Oh oh\n[03:45.738] 'Cause we were both young when I first saw you",
