        "fullLyrics": "[00:01.291] You with your words like knives\n[00:04.095] And swords and weapons that you use against me\n[00:07.191] You have knocked me off my feet again\n[00:11.268] Got me feeling like I'm nothing\n[00:13.091] You with your voice like nails on a chalkboard\n[00:16.650] Calling me out when I'm wounded\n[00:18.833] You picking on the weaker man\n[00:25.719] But you can take me down with just one single blow\n[00:33.209] But you don't know what you don't know\n[00:36.301] Someday I'll be living in a big old city\n[00:41.870] And all you're ever gonna be is mean\n[00:47.830] Someday I'll be big enough so you can't hit me\n[00:53.513] And all you're ever gonna be is mean\n[00:58.390] Why you gotta be so mean\n[01:05.725] You with your switching sides\n[01:08.321] And your wildfire lies and your humiliation\n[01:11.475] You have pointed out my flaws again\n[01:15.703] As if I don't already see them\n[01:17.706] I walk with my head down trying to block you out\n[01:21.579] 'Cause I'll never impress you\n[01:23.308] I just want to feel okay again\n[01:29.431] I bet you got pushed around\n[01:32.134] Somebody made you cold\n[01:35.306] But the cycle ends right now\n[01:37.724] 'Cause you can't lead me down that road\n[01:40.530] And you don't know what you don't know\n[01:43.617] Someday I'll be living in a big old city\n[01:49.249] And all you're ever gonna be is mean\n[01:55.186] Someday I'll be big enough so you can't hit me\n[02:00.889] And all you're ever gonna be is mean\n[02:05.631] Why you gotta be so mean\n[02:17.957] And I can see you years from now in a bar\n[02:22.103] Talking over a football game\n[02:24.983] With that same big loud opinion\n[02:27.150] But nobody's listening\n[02:30.924] Washed up and ranting about the same old bitter things\n[02:39.289] Drunk and grumbling on about how I can't sing\n[02:45.486] But all you are is mean\n[02:51.246] All you are is mean\n[02:53.664] And a liar and pathetic and alone in life\n[02:58.075] And mean and mean and mean and mean\n[03:03.752] But someday I'll be living in a big old city\n[03:09.791] And all you're ever going to be is mean yeah\n[03:15.867] Someday I'll be big enough so you can't hit me\n[03:21.334] And all you're ever going to be is mean\n[03:26.232] Why you gotta be so mean\n[03:27.966] Someday I'll be living in a big old city\n[03:32.209] Why you gotta be so mean\n[03:33.465] And all you're ever gonna be is mean\n[03:37.926] Why you gotta be so mean\n[03:39.427] Someday I'll be big enough so you can't hit me\n[03:43.879] Why you gotta be so mean\n[03:45.090] And all you're ever gonna be is mean\n[03:49.679] Why you gotta be so mean",
