        "fullLyrics": "[00:06.130] I remember when we broke up the first time\n[00:08.908] Saying this is it I've had enough 'cause like\n[00:11.819] We hadn't seen each other in a month\n[00:14.291] When you said you needed space\n[00:17.271] What\n[00:18.032] Then you come around again and say\n[00:20.195] Baby I miss you and I swear I'm gonna change trust me\n[00:24.066] Remember how that lasted for a day\n[00:26.138] I say I hate you we break up you call me I love you\n[00:30.012] Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[00:32.792] We called it off again last night but\n[00:36.220] Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[00:38.921] This time I'm telling you I'm telling you\n[00:45.334] We are never ever ever getting back together\n[00:51.147] We are never ever ever getting back together\n[00:57.044] You go talk to your friends talk to my friends talk to me\n[01:02.455] But we are never ever ever ever\n[01:07.825] Getting back together\n[01:11.344] Like ever\n[01:14.845] I'm really gonna miss you picking fights\n[01:17.212] And me falling for it screaming that I'm right\n[01:20.342] And you would hide away and find your peace of mind\n[01:23.266] With some indie record that's much cooler than mine\n[01:26.934] Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[01:29.864] You called me up again tonight but\n[01:33.205] Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[01:35.866] This time I'm telling you I'm telling you\n[01:39.235] We\n[01:39.414] We\n[01:40.112] Are never ever ever getting back together\n[01:45.101] We are never ever ever getting back together\n[01:51.192] You go talk to your friends talk to my friends talk to me\n[01:56.690] But we are never ever ever ever\n[02:01.846] Getting back together\n[02:04.145] Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[02:07.906] Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh\n[02:10.860] Ooh-ooh\n[02:12.342] Oh-oh-oh\n[02:15.122] I used to think that we were forever ever\n[02:20.643] And I used to say never say never\n[02:27.624] Ugh he calls me up and he's like I still love you\n[02:30.647] And I'm like I'm just I mean this is exhausting you know\n[02:35.056] Like we are never getting back together like ever\n[02:38.593] No\n[02:39.780] We are never ever ever getting back together\n[02:44.815] We are never ever ever\n[02:49.278] Getting back together\n[02:51.106] You go talk to your friends talk to my friends talk to me\n[02:56.555] But we are never ever ever ever\n[03:01.879] Getting back together\n[03:03.365] Ooh-ooh\n[03:06.606] Getting back together\n[03:12.253] Ooh-ooh\n[03:13.200] Getting back together\n[03:15.526] You go talk to your friends talk to my friends talk to me\n[03:20.445] Talk to me\n[03:22.238] But never ever ever ever\n[03:25.966] Getting back together",
