        "dateAdded": "2026-03-26T21:00:00.000Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:12.320] When Emma falls in love she paces the floor\n[00:15.550] Closes the blinds and locks the door\n[00:24.672] When Emma falls in love she calls up her mom\n[00:27.755] Jokes about the ways that this one could go wrong\n[00:36.961] She waits and takes her time\n[00:39.102] 'Cause little Miss Sunshine always thinks it's gonna rain\n[00:49.229] When Emma falls in love I know that boy will never be the same\n[00:55.521] 'Cause she's the kind of book that you can't put down\n[01:01.283] Like if Cleopatra grew up in a small town\n[01:07.370] And all the bad boys would be good boys\n[01:10.275] If they only had a chance to love her\n[01:13.691] And to tell you the truth\n[01:15.427] Sometimes I wish I was her\n[01:20.060] When Emma falls in love it's all on her face\n[01:23.125] Hangs in the air like stars in outer space\n[01:32.415] When Emma falls in love she disappears\n[01:35.113] And we all just laugh after seeing it all these years\n[01:44.635] When Emma falls apart it's when she's alone\n[01:47.520] She takes on the pain and bears it on her own\n[01:56.698] 'Cause when Emma falls in love she's in it for keeps\n[01:59.702] She won't walk away unless she knows she absolutely has to leave\n[02:09.328] And she's the kind of book that you can't put down\n[02:15.085] Like if Cleopatra grew up in a small town\n[02:21.301] And all the bad boys would be good boys\n[02:24.050] If they only had a chance to love her\n[02:27.494] And to tell you the truth\n[02:29.221] Sometimes I wish I was her\n[02:45.750] Well she's so New York\n[02:49.322] When she's in L.A.\n[02:52.049] She won't lose herself in love the way that I did\n[02:58.102] 'Cause she'll call you out\n[03:01.349] She'll put you in your place\n[03:04.458] When Emma falls in love I'm learning\n[03:14.123] Emma met a boy with eyes like a man\n[03:16.953] Turns out her heart fits right in the palm of his hand\n[03:26.019] Now he'll be her shelter when it rains\n[03:29.138] Little does he know his whole world's about to change\n[03:38.470] 'Cause she's the kind of book that you can't put down\n[03:44.268] Like if Cleopatra grew up in a small town\n[03:50.470] And all the bad boys would be good boys\n[03:53.339] If they only had a chance to love her\n[03:56.802] And to tell you the truth\n[03:58.496] Sometimes I wish I was her\n[04:02.798] Yeah between me and you\n[04:04.562] Sometimes I wish I was her",
