        "fullLyrics": "[00:13.564] He said let's get out of this town\n[00:16.784] Drive out of the city away from the crowds\n[00:20.336] I thought Heaven can't help me now\n[00:23.515] Nothing lasts forever\n[00:25.904] But this is gonna take me down\n[00:28.176] He's so tall and handsome as hell\n[00:31.507] He's so bad but he does it so well\n[00:34.724] I can see the end as it begins\n[00:38.042] My one condition is\n[00:41.408] Say you'll remember me\n[00:43.936] Standing in a nice dress staring at the sunset babe\n[00:48.461] Red lips and rosy cheeks say you'll see me again\n[00:52.708] Even if it's just in your\n[00:55.380] Wildest dreams aah ha\n[01:02.283] Wildest dreams aah ha\n[01:11.851] I said no one has to know what we do\n[01:14.783] His hands are in my hair \n[01:16.496] His clothes are in my room\n[01:18.904] And his voice is a familiar sound \n[01:21.915] Nothing lasts forever\n[01:24.203] But this is getting good now\n[01:26.498] He's so tall and handsome as hell\n[01:29.772] He's so bad but he does it so well\n[01:33.214] And when we've had our very last kiss\n[01:36.258] My last request is\n[01:39.766] Say you'll remember me\n[01:42.255] Standing in a nice dress staring at the sunset babe\n[01:46.769] Red lips and rosy cheeks say you'll see me again\n[01:51.000] Even if it's just in your\n[01:53.481] Wildest dreams aah ha\n[02:00.597] Wildest dreams aah ha\n[02:07.179] You'll see me in hindsight\n[02:09.047] Tangled up with you all night\n[02:10.782] Burning it down\n[02:13.981] Someday when you leave me\n[02:15.839] I bet these memories\n[02:17.633] Follow you around\n[02:20.796] You'll see me in hindsight\n[02:22.624] Tangled up with you all night\n[02:24.390] Burning it down\n[02:27.708] Someday when you leave me\n[02:29.566] I bet these memories\n[02:31.202] Follow you around\n[02:38.425] Say you'll remember me\n[02:40.623] Standing in a nice dress\n[02:42.503] Staring at the sunset babe\n[02:45.079] Red lips and rosy cheeks say\n[02:47.805] You'll see me again\n[02:49.163] Even if it's just pretend\n[02:53.359] Say you'll remember me\n[02:56.097] Standing in a nice dress staring at the sunset babe\n[03:00.368] Red lips and rosy cheeks say you'll see me again\n[03:04.491] Even if it's just in your\n[03:07.162] Wildest dreams aah ha\n[03:13.192] In your wildest dreams aah ha\n[03:18.236] Even if it's just in your\n[03:19.970] In your wildest dreams aah ha\n[03:26.819] In your wildest dreams aah ha",
