        "fullLyrics": "[00:07.540] You're on the phone with your girlfriend ,she's upset.\n[00:11.470] She's going off about something that you said\n[00:15.220] Cause she doesn't, get your humor like I do...\n[00:22.330] I'm in the room\n[00:23.830] It's a typical Tuesday night\n[00:26.380] I'm listening to the kind of music she doesn't like\n[00:30.070] and she'll never know your story like I do ...\n[00:36.790] But she wears short skirts\n[00:39.010] I wear T-shirts\n[00:40.780] She's cheer captain\n[00:42.270] And I'm on the bleachers\n[00:44.530] Dreaming about the day when you wake up\n[00:46.900] And find that what you're looking for has been here the whole time\n[00:51.280] If you could see that I'm the one who understands you\n[00:55.540] been here all along so why can't you see,\n[01:01.540] You belong with me\n[01:05.260] You belong with me\n[01:10.210] Walk in the streets with you in your worn-out jeans\n[01:14.350] I can't help thinking this is how it ought to be\n[01:18.160] Laughing on a park bench, thinking to myself\n[01:21.970] Hey isn't this easy\n[01:24.970] And you've got a smile that could light up this whole town\n[01:29.140] I haven't seen it in a while since she brought you down\n[01:32.800] You say you're fine\n[01:33.730] I know you better than that\n[01:36.100] Hey what you doing with a girl like that\n[01:39.730] She wears high heels\n[01:41.770] I wear sneakers\n[01:43.510] She’s cheer captain and\n[01:45.460] I'm on the bleachers\n[01:47.260] Dreaming about the day when you wake up and find\n[01:50.320] That what you're looking for has been here the whole time\n[01:54.040] If you could see that I'm the one who understands you\n[01:58.270] Been here all along so why can't you see\n[02:04.240] You belong with me\n[02:09.130] Standing by and waiting at your back door\n[02:13.150] all this time how could you not know Baby....\n[02:19.090] You belong with me\n[02:21.880] You belong with me\n[02:36.880] Oh I remember you driving to my house in the middle of the night\n[02:42.280] I'm the one who makes you laugh\n[02:44.080] When you know you're about to cry\n[02:46.150] I know your favorite songs\n[02:47.830] And you tell me about your dreams\n[02:49.570] I think I know where you belong\n[02:51.370] I think I know it's with me.\n[02:55.030] Can't you see that I'm the one who understands you\n[02:59.230] Been here all along\n[03:01.270] So why can't you see\n[03:05.230] You belong with me\n[03:10.090] Standing by and waiting at your back door\n[03:14.080] All this time\n[03:15.460] How could you not know\n[03:17.260] Baby you belong with me\n[03:22.840] You belong with me\n[03:27.250] You belong with me\n[03:30.130] Have you ever thought just maybe\n[03:34.750] you belong with me\n[03:38.590] You belong with me...",
