        "fullLyrics": "[00:05.58] Something's got a hold of me lately\n[00:08.36] No, I don't know myself anymore\n[00:14.85] Feels like the walls are all closing in\n[00:17.53] And the devil's knocking at my door, whoa\n[00:22.94] Out of my mind, how many times\n[00:25.30] Did I tell you I'm no good at being alone?\n[00:30.98] Yeah, it's taking a toll on me, trying my best to keep\n[00:35.74] From tearing the skin off my bones, don't you know\n[00:41.69] I lose control\n[00:48.73] When you're not next to me\n[00:53.78] I'm falling apart right in front of you, can't you see?\n[00:59.51] I lose control\n[01:06.56] When you're not next to me, mm-hmm\n[01:11.25] Yeah, you're breaking my heart, baby\n[01:14.37] You make a mess of me\n[01:17.83] Problematic\n[01:19.95] Problem is I want your body like a fiend, like a bad habit\n[01:24.53] Bad habit's hard to break when I'm with you\n[01:27.62] Yeah, I know, I could do it on my own, but I want\n[01:31.44] That real full moon black magic and it takes two\n[01:35.40] Problematic\n[01:37.90] Problem is, when I'm with you, I'm an addict\n[01:42.21] And I need some relief, my skin in your teeth\n[01:46.42] Can't see the forest through the trees\n[01:48.53] Got me down on my knees, darling, please, oh\n[01:53.69] I lose control\n[02:00.48] When you're not next to me\n[02:05.87] I'm falling apart right in front of you, can't you see?\n[02:11.65] I lose control\n[02:18.70] When you're not next to me, mm-hmm\n[02:23.44] Yeah, you're breaking my heart, baby\n[02:26.45] You make a mess of me, yeah\n[02:32.93] \n[02:47.86] I lose control\n[02:54.59] When you're not here with me, mm\n[02:59.98] I'm falling apart right in front of you, can't you see?\n[03:05.80] I lose control\n[03:12.89] When you're not here with me, mm-hmm\n[03:17.56] Yeah, you're breaking my heart, baby\n[03:20.34] You make a mess of me\n[03:23.87]",
