        "chorus": "G A Bm A G A E G A Bm",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "BRIDGE",
        "dateAdded": "2026-06-13T07:09:02.473Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.50] She like the low, she like the high\n[00:20.49] I've seen it all too many times\n[00:23.96] Geronimo, she's dropping by\n[00:28.16] Fork in the road, this fate of mine\n[00:31.14] I can't act like I don't keep dressing for the storm, then blame the sky\n[00:38.44] Oh, I know I'm damned if I do, damned if I don't\n[00:42.65] Wherever I end up, it's never no surprise\n[00:46.92] Should've told you I could see this coming\n[00:50.68] Like I'm looking right into a crystal ball\n[00:54.28] When I fall in love, it's with misfortune\n[00:58.21] Oh, I wish I wasn't Mr. Know It All\n[01:02.14] Give you everything you say you wanted\n[01:05.70] See the future like it's written on the wall\n[01:09.67] You're the only thing that's missing from it\n[01:13.26] Oh, I wish I wasn't Mr. Know It All\n[01:18.67] Mr. Know It All (Mr.)\n[01:23.87] Pulling dominoes from a coffee can\n[01:27.63] Set 'em up and watch 'em fall, do it over again\n[01:31.41] Like a tennis ball through a ceiling fan\n[01:35.13] Bet you never end up falling back in my hands, oh\n[01:39.90] Should've told you I could see this coming (see this coming)\n[01:43.83] Like I'm looking right into a crystal ball\n[01:47.54] When I fall in love, it's with misfortune\n[01:51.44] Oh, I wish I wasn't Mr. Know It All\n[01:55.14] Give you everything you say you wanted (say you wanted)\n[01:58.91] See the future like it's written on the wall\n[02:02.66] You're the only thing that's missing from it (missing from it)\n[02:06.99] Oh, I wish I wasn't Mr. Know It All\n[02:10.66] I don't wanna stay (stay), I don't wanna run\n[02:14.59] I already know what this'll become\n[02:18.47] I'm watching you dance and falling in love\n[02:22.15] I'm getting way too close to the sun\n[02:29.58] Should've told you I could see this coming (coming)\n[02:33.35] Like I'm lookin' right into a crystal ball\n[02:37.43] When I fall in love, it's with misfortune (oh, it's with misfortune)\n[02:41.02] Oh, I wish I wasn't Mr. Know It All\n[02:44.89] Give you everything you say you wanted (you say you wanted)\n[02:48.48] See the future like it's written on the wall (written on the wall)\n[02:52.54] You're the only thing that's missing from it (missing from it)\n[02:56.47] Oh, I wish I wasn't Mr. Know It All\n[03:01.66] Mr. Know It All (Mr. Know It All)\n[03:04.64] (Mr., Mr, Know It All, Mr.)\n[03:08.90] Mr. Know It All\n[03:12.76]",
