        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.02] Here comes the sun, doo-doo-doo-doo\n[00:18.77] Here comes the sun, and I say\n[00:22.06] It's alright\n[00:24.97] \n[00:27.54] Little darlin', it's been a long, cold, lonely winter\n[00:34.86] Little darlin', it feels like years since it's been here\n[00:42.51] Here comes the sun, doo-doo-doo-doo\n[00:46.46] Here comes the sun, and I say\n[00:50.28] It's alright\n[00:53.15] \n[00:59.56] Little darlin', the smile's returning to their faces\n[01:06.95] Little darlin', it seems like years since it's been here\n[01:14.53] Here comes the sun\n[01:18.24] Here comes the sun, and I say\n[01:21.60] It's alright\n[01:24.67] \n[01:36.48] Sun, sun, sun, here it comes\n[01:42.24] Sun, sun, sun, here it comes\n[01:48.09] Sun, sun, sun, here it comes\n[01:53.93] Sun, sun, sun, here it comes\n[01:59.88] Sun, sun, sun, here it comes\n[02:04.66] \n[02:11.92] Little darlin', I feel that ice is slowly melting\n[02:19.16] Little darlin', it seems like years since it's been clear\n[02:26.85] Here comes the sun, doo-doo-doo-doo\n[02:30.76] Here comes the sun, and I say\n[02:34.52] It's alright\n[02:37.20] \n[02:40.15] Here comes the sun, doo-doo-doo-doo\n[02:43.83] Here comes the sun\n[02:47.42] It's alright\n[02:49.99] \n[02:52.94] It's alright\n[02:53.27]",
