        "chorus": "",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "Block 3",
        "dateAdded": "2026-04-23T10:12:23.593Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:20.90] What's wrong with the world, mama?\n[00:23.01] People livin' like they ain't got no mamas\n[00:25.29] I think the whole world's addicted to the drama\n[00:27.61] Only attracted to things that'll bring you trauma\n[00:30.22] Overseas, yeah, we tryna stop terrorism\n[00:32.60] But we still got terrorists here livin'\n[00:35.33] In the USA, the big CIA\n[00:37.95] The Bloods and The Crips and the KKK\n[00:40.70] But if you only have love for your own race\n[00:42.92] Then you only leave space to discriminate\n[00:45.42] And to discriminate only generates hate\n[00:47.95] And when you hate, then you're bound to get irate, yeah\n[00:51.72] Madness is what you demonstrate\n[00:53.46] And that's exactly how anger works and operates\n[00:55.60] Man, you gotta have love just to set it straight\n[00:58.09] Take control of your mind and meditate\n[01:00.85] Let your soul gravitate to the love, y'all, y'all\n[01:02.28] People killin', people dyin'\n[01:04.79] Children hurt, hear them cryin'\n[01:07.25] Can you practice what you preach\n[01:09.74] Or would you turn the other cheek?\n[01:12.34] Father, Father, Father, help us\n[01:15.04] Send some guidance from above\n[01:17.55] 'Cause people got me, got me questionin'\n[01:20.79] Where is the love (love)\n[01:23.24] Where is the love? (The love)\n[01:25.41] Where is the love? (The love)\n[01:27.97] Where is the love, the love, the love?\n[01:32.72] It just ain't the same, old ways have changed\n[01:34.82] New days are strange, is the world insane?\n[01:37.54] If love and peace are so strong\n[01:39.86] Why are there pieces of love that don't belong?\n[01:41.77] Nations droppin' bombs\n[01:43.19] Chemical gasses fillin' lungs of little ones\n[01:44.88] With ongoin' sufferin' as the youth die young\n[01:47.62] So ask yourself, is the lovin' really gone?\n[01:49.82] So I could ask myself really what is goin' wrong\n[01:52.98] In this world that we livin' in people keep on givin' in\n[01:55.48] Makin' wrong decisions, only visions of them dividends\n[01:57.80] Not respectin' each other, deny thy brother\n[02:00.20] A war is goin' on but the reason's undercover\n[02:02.86] The truth is kept secret, it's swept under the rug\n[02:05.33] If you never know truth then you never know love\n[02:07.96] Where's the love, y'all, come on? (I don't know)\n[02:10.62] Where's the truth, y'all, come on? (I don't know)\n[02:12.85] Where's the love, y'all?\n[02:14.65] People killin', people dyin'\n[02:16.38] Children hurt, hear them cryin'\n[02:18.67] Can you practice what you preach\n[02:21.16] Or would you turn the other cheek?\n[02:23.57] Father, Father, Father, help us\n[02:26.26] Send some guidance from above\n[02:28.82] 'Cause people got me, got me questionin'\n[02:32.01] Where is the love (love)\n[02:34.46] Where is the love? (The love)\n[02:36.74] Where is the love? (The love)\n[02:39.48] Where is the love? (The love)\n[02:42.96] Where is the love? (The love)\n[02:45.29] Where is the love? (The love)\n[02:46.72] Where is the love? (The love)\n[02:48.18] Where is the love, the love, the love?\n[02:49.53] I feel the weight of the world on my shoulder\n[02:51.08] As I'm gettin' older, y'all, people gets colder\n[02:52.25] Most of us only care about money makin'\n[02:53.33] Selfishness got us followin' the wrong direction\n[02:54.57] Wrong information always shown by the media\n[02:56.37] Negative images is the main criteria\n[02:58.75] Infecting the young minds faster than bacteria\n[03:01.26] Kids wanna act like what they see in the cinema, yo'\n[03:04.26] Whatever happened to the values of humanity?\n[03:06.95] Whatever happened to the fairness and equality?\n[03:09.66] Instead of spreading love we're spreading animosity\n[03:12.32] Lack of understanding, leading us away from unity\n[03:15.19] That's the reason why sometimes I'm feelin' under\n[03:17.63] That's the reason why sometimes I'm feelin' down\n[03:19.95] There's no wonder why sometimes I'm feelin' under\n[03:22.74] Gotta keep my faith alive 'til love is found\n[03:25.38] Now ask yourself\n[03:27.33] Where is the love?\n[03:28.52] Where is the love?\n[03:30.24] Where is the love?\n[03:32.40] Where is the love?\n[03:35.28] Father, Father, Father, help us\n[03:37.47] Send some guidance from above\n[03:40.22] 'Cause people got me, got me questionin'\n[03:43.33] Where is the love?\n[03:45.62] Sing with me y'all (one world, one world)\n[03:49.81] We only got (one world, one world)\n[03:52.09] That's all we got (one world, one world)\n[03:54.51] And something's wrong with it (yeah)\n[03:56.83] Something's wrong with it (yeah)\n[03:58.87] Something's wrong with the wo-wo-world, yeah\n[04:00.55] We only got (one world, one world)\n[04:02.62] That's all we got (one world, one world)\n[04:03.99]",
