        "dateAdded": "2026-06-08T09:57:24.871Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.45] Should've been different, but it wasn't different was it\n[00:19.50] Same old story and Dear John and so long\n[00:23.13] It should have fit like a glove\n[00:25.34] It should've fit like a ring, like a diamond ring\n[00:28.36] A token of a true love\n[00:30.99] Should've all worked out but it didn't\n[00:34.68] She should be here now but she isn't\n[00:38.20] There's your trouble, there's your trouble\n[00:41.39] Keep seein' double with the wrong one\n[00:45.26] And you can see I love you, you can't see she doesn't\n[00:49.04] But you just keep holding on\n[00:52.69] There's your trouble\n[00:55.86] \n[01:01.19] So now you're thinkin' bout all you're missin'\n[01:04.13] How deep you're sinkin' round and round and draggin' down\n[01:08.50] Why don't you cash in your chips\n[01:10.76] Why don't you call it a loss, not such a big loss\n[01:14.00] Chalk it up for better luck\n[01:16.47] Could have been true love, but it wasn't\n[01:20.39] It should all add up, but it doesn't\n[01:23.84] There's your trouble, there's your trouble\n[01:26.70] Keep seein' double with the wrong one\n[01:30.61] And you can see I love you, you can't see she doesn't\n[01:34.69] But you just keep holding on\n[01:38.01] There's your trouble\n[01:41.88] \n[01:54.32] Should have all worked out but it didn't\n[01:58.10] She should be here now but she isn't\n[02:01.73] There's your trouble, there's your trouble\n[02:04.75] Keep seein' double with the wrong one\n[02:08.80] And you can see I love you, you can't see she doesn't\n[02:12.62] But you just keep holding on\n[02:16.33] There's your trouble\n[02:19.66] There's your trouble\n[02:23.42] There's your trouble\n[02:27.46] There's your trouble\n[02:30.50] There is your trouble\n[02:31.47]",
