        "dateAdded": "2026-05-20T06:47:33.300Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:29.97] I don't care if Monday's blue\n[00:33.70] Tuesday's gray and Wednesday too\n[00:37.73] Thursday, I don't care about you\n[00:41.41] It's Friday, I'm in love\n[00:43.81] Monday you can fall apart\n[00:48.68] Tuesday, Wednesday break my heart\n[00:51.21] Or Thursday doesn't even start\n[00:55.65] It's Friday, I'm in love\n[00:58.26] Saturday wait\n[01:01.96] Sunday always comes too late\n[01:06.16] But Friday never hesitate\n[01:09.09] I don't care if Monday's black\n[01:13.23] Tuesday, Wednesday heart attack\n[01:16.53] Thursday never looking back\n[01:19.54] It's Friday, I'm in love\n[01:23.28] Monday, you can hold your head\n[01:27.49] \n[01:43.94] Tuesday, Wednesday stay in bed\n[01:45.20] Or Thursday watch the walls instead\n[01:48.03] It's Friday, I'm in love\n[01:51.14] Saturday wait\n[01:54.49] And Sunday always comes too late\n[01:58.38] But Friday never hesitate\n[02:02.36] Dressed up to the eyes\n[02:04.80] It's a wonderful surprise\n[02:06.84] To see your shoes and your spirits rise\n[02:10.18] Throw out your frown\n[02:12.46] And just smile at the sound\n[02:13.96] Sick as a sheep spinning round, round, round\n[02:17.14] Always take a big bite\n[02:19.26] It's such a gorgeous sight\n[02:21.14] To see you in, in the middle of the night\n[02:24.50] You can never get enough\n[02:26.36] Enough of this stuff\n[02:28.37] It's Friday, I'm in love\n[02:30.91] I don't care if Monday's blue\n[02:33.88] Tuesday's gray and Wednesday too\n[02:37.15] Thursday, I don't care about you\n[02:41.11] It's Friday, I'm in love\n[02:44.03] Monday you can fall apart\n[02:47.41] Tuesday, Wednesday break my heart\n[02:51.67] Thursday doesn't even start\n[02:55.09] It's Friday I'm in love\n[02:57.84]",
