        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:01.00] Josie's on a vacation far away\n[00:04.73] Come around and talk it over\n[00:07.97] So many things that I want to say\n[00:12.16] You know I like my girls a little bit older\n[00:15.66] I just wanna use your love tonight\n[00:22.21] I don't wanna lose your love tonight\n[00:29.85] I ain't got many friends left to talk to\n[00:34.32] Nowhere to run when I'm in trouble\n[00:38.08] You know I'd do anything for you\n[00:41.71] Stay the night but keep it undercover\n[00:45.25] I just wanna use your love tonight, whoa\n[00:52.48] I don't wanna lose your love tonight\n[01:04.20] \n[01:14.33] Try to stop my hands from shakin'\n[01:18.89] 'Cause somethin' in my mind's not makin' sense\n[01:22.35] It's been awhile since we were all alone\n[01:25.77] I can't hide the way I'm feelin'\n[01:29.41] As you're leaving, please, would you close the door?\n[01:33.48] And don't forget what I told ya\n[01:36.87] Just 'cause you're right, that don't mean I'm wrong\n[01:41.19] Another shoulder to cry upon\n[01:44.82] I just wanna use your love tonight, yeah\n[01:51.90] I don't wanna lose your love tonight\n[01:58.82] Yeah, I just wanna use your love tonight\n[02:06.60] I don't wanna lose your love tonight\n[02:14.26] I just wanna use your love tonight\n[02:20.83] I don't wanna lose your love tonight\n[02:28.53] (Lose your love)\n[02:35.45] (Lose your love)\n[02:43.10] Tonight (lose your love)\n[02:49.71] No, I don't wanna lose (lose your love tonight)\n[02:56.14] I don't wanna, no, I don't wanna\n[02:58.50] I don't wanna lose (lose your love tonight)\n[03:03.04] No, no (lose your love tonight)\n[03:12.32] (Lose your love tonight)\n[03:17.88] No, no (I don't wanna lose your love tonight)\n[03:27.62] (Lose your love tonight)\n[03:32.43]",
