        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.24] Been waiting at these crossroads forever and a day\n[00:21.24] And no guy to buy my soul\n[00:25.88] I've spent all night and day\n[00:27.76] How much harder can I play?\n[00:29.53] You know I gave my life to rock 'n roll\n[00:34.38] Here I go\n[00:39.03] Mama, begged me, please\n[00:40.66] Yes, she got down on her knees\n[00:42.71] Said you'd burn in that Mississippi sun\n[00:47.17] But I'm the only one that's standing here\n[00:49.53] So, mama don't you have no fear\n[00:51.57] I'm either last or I've already won\n[00:55.76] Here I go\n[00:58.47] \n[01:00.61] Take me down, take me down\n[01:10.30] Take me down, won't you take me down?\n[01:18.04] \n[01:35.14] Standing at the crossroads, would draw a pen in hand\n[01:39.12] The conversation went like this\n[01:43.88] \"Tell me your desire, why you pulled me from the fire\n[01:47.63] And we'll seal the deal with a kiss\"\n[01:52.24] Don't wanna waste the dead\n[01:54.04] Find a note that I can shred on my walls\n[01:57.73] I scroll my Gods\n[02:00.50] Don't care what happens when I die as long as I'm alive\n[02:05.49] All in wanna do is rock, rock, rock\n[02:12.09] Take me down, take me down\n[02:21.56] Take me down, won't you take me down?\n[02:29.45] \n[02:45.76] Ooh, signed with the Devil\n[02:48.53] Signed with the Devil\n[02:50.74] Signed with the Devil\n[02:52.64] Oh\n[02:55.03] Signed with the Devil\n[02:57.17] Signed with the Devil\n[02:59.38] Signed with the Devil\n[03:01.31] Oh\n[03:03.74] Signed with the Devil\n[03:05.90] Signed with the Devil\n[03:08.08] Signed with the Devil\n[03:10.06] Oh\n[03:12.37] Signed with the Devil\n[03:14.57] Signed with the Devil\n[03:16.74] Signed with the Devil\n[03:18.71] Oh\n[03:21.03] Take me down, take me down\n[03:30.90] Take me down, won't you take me down?\n[03:38.32] Take me down, (signed with the Devil) take me down (signed with the Devil)\n[03:48.13] Take me down (signed with the Devil) won't you (signed with the Devil)\n[03:52.54] Take me down, down?\n[03:55.78]",
