        "chorusTitle": "PRE CHORUS",
        "dateAdded": "2026-06-15T09:30:13.772Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:18.43] Angie, Angie\n[00:25.07] When will those clouds all disappear?\n[00:30.12] \n[00:32.67] Angie, Angie\n[00:39.84] Where will it lead us from here?\n[00:45.96] With no loving in our souls\n[00:49.61] And no money in our coats\n[00:54.26] You can't say we're satisfied\n[01:00.78] Angie, Angie\n[01:08.66] You can't say we never tried\n[01:15.85] Angie, you're beautiful, yeah\n[01:22.53] But ain't it time we said goodbye?\n[01:27.73] \n[01:30.04] Angie,\n[01:33.20] I still love you\n[01:36.58] Remember all those nights we cried?\n[01:42.04] All the dreams we held so close\n[01:45.29] Seemed to all go up in smoke\n[01:50.13] Let me whisper in your ear\n[01:56.28] Angie, Angie\n[02:03.51] Where will it lead us from here?\n[02:09.28] \n[02:36.86] Oh, Angie, don't you weep\n[02:40.16] All your kisses still taste sweet\n[02:45.26] I hate that sadness in your eyes\n[02:51.02] But, Angie, Angie\n[02:58.85] Ain't it time we said goodbye, yeah?\n[03:07.51] \n[03:17.93] With no loving in our souls\n[03:21.42] And no money in our coats\n[03:26.34] You can't say we're satisfied\n[03:32.30] But, Angie, I still love you, baby\n[03:39.50] Everywhere I look, I see your eyes\n[03:46.31] There ain't a woman that comes close to you\n[03:53.32] Come on, baby, dry your eyes\n[03:59.23] Angie, Angie\n[04:06.89] Ain't it good to be alive?\n[04:14.08] Angie, Angie\n[04:20.57] They can't say we never tried\n[04:25.50]",
