        "chordData": {
            "barOffset": 0,
            "duration": 300,
            "name": "Rolling Stones - Paint It Black",
            "tempo": "120",
            "useFlatNotation": false
        },
        "chorus": "Em B 2x Em D G D Em B",
        "chorusCue": "",
        "chorusTitle": "Verse",
        "dateAdded": "2026-04-15T20:13:46.892Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.08] I see a red door\n[00:16.84] And I want it painted black\n[00:20.79] No colors anymore\n[00:23.02] I want them to turn black\n[00:26.84] I see the girls walk by\n[00:29.28] Dressed in their summer clothes\n[00:32.96] I have to turn my head\n[00:35.23] Until my darkness goes\n[00:39.03] I see a line of cars\n[00:41.28] And they're all painted black\n[00:45.05] With flowers and my love\n[00:47.35] Both never to come back\n[00:51.17] I've seen people turn their heads\n[00:53.42] And quickly look away\n[00:57.11] Like a newborn baby\n[00:59.11] It just happens everyday\n[01:03.04] I look inside myself\n[01:05.56] And see my heart is black\n[01:09.32] I see my red door\n[01:11.12] I must have it painted black\n[01:15.33] Maybe then, I'll fade away\n[01:17.51] And not have to face the facts\n[01:21.07] It's not easy facing up\n[01:23.32] When your whole world is black\n[01:27.33] No more will my green sea\n[01:29.53] Go turn a deeper blue\n[01:33.78] I could not foresee this thing\n[01:36.45] Happening to you\n[01:39.89] If I look hard enough\n[01:42.04] Into the setting sun\n[01:46.09] My love will laugh with me\n[01:48.27] Before the morning comes\n[01:52.08] I see a red door\n[01:53.78] And I want it painted black\n[01:58.00] No colors anymore\n[02:00.13] I want them to turn black\n[02:04.17] I see the girls walk by\n[02:06.26] Dressed in their summer clothes\n[02:10.16] I have to turn my head\n[02:12.41] Until my darkness goes\n[02:16.62] \n[02:38.94] I wanna see it painted\n[02:41.22] Painted black\n[02:42.68] Black as night\n[02:44.21] Black as coal\n[02:45.75] I wanna see the sun\n[02:48.48] Blotted out from the sky\n[02:50.93] I wanna see it painted, painted, painted\n[02:54.49] Painted black, yeah\n[02:56.45]",
        "genre": [
            "Rock"
        ],
