        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.82] I can't get no satisfaction\n[00:21.67] I can't get no satisfaction\n[00:27.68] 'Cause I try\n[00:29.40] And I try\n[00:31.14] And I try\n[00:32.70] And I try\n[00:34.77] I can't get no\n[00:37.86] I can't get no\n[00:41.17] When I'm drivin' in my car\n[00:44.77] And the man comes on the radio\n[00:49.13] He's tellin' me more and more\n[00:51.60] About some useless information\n[00:55.03] Supposed to drive my imagination\n[00:58.90] I can't get no\n[01:02.22] Oh no, no, no\n[01:05.83] Hey, hey, hey\n[01:09.04] That's what I say\n[01:11.86] \n[01:14.14] I can't get no satisfaction\n[01:21.31] I can't get no satisfaction\n[01:27.26] 'Cause I try\n[01:29.08] And I try\n[01:30.56] And I try\n[01:32.29] And I try\n[01:34.27] I can't get no\n[01:37.45] I can't get no\n[01:40.98] When I'm watchin' my TV\n[01:44.54] And a man comes on and tells me\n[01:48.32] How white my shirts could be\n[01:51.62] But he can't be a man\n[01:53.88] 'Cause he doesn't smoke\n[01:55.67] The same cigarettes as me\n[01:58.74] I can't get no\n[02:02.06] Oh no, no, no\n[02:05.45] A hey, hey, hey\n[02:08.74] That's what I say\n[02:11.14] \n[02:14.11] I can't get no satisfaction\n[02:21.07] I can't get no girl reaction\n[02:27.01] 'Cause I try\n[02:28.87] And I try\n[02:30.64] And I try\n[02:32.29] And I try\n[02:33.92] I can't get no\n[02:37.45] I can't get no\n[02:40.82] When I'm ridin' round the world\n[02:44.41] And I'm doin' this and I'm signing that\n[02:48.26] And I'm tryin' to make some girl\n[02:51.26] Who tells me, \"baby better come back\n[02:54.15] Maybe next week\n[02:55.31] 'Cause you see I'm on\n[02:57.57] A losing streak\"\n[02:58.82] I can't get no\n[03:01.89] Oh no, no, no\n[03:05.33] A hey, hey, hey\n[03:08.72] That's what I say\n[03:12.77] I can't get no\n[03:16.29] I can't get no\n[03:19.80] I can't get no\n[03:23.11] Satisfaction\n[03:26.42] No satisfaction\n[03:29.82] No satisfaction\n[03:33.40] No satisfaction\n[03:37.49] I can't get no\n[03:38.71]",
