        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.83] Childhood living\n[00:24.66] \n[00:28.90] Is easy to do\n[00:34.98] The things you wanted\n[00:42.15] I bought them for you\n[00:48.25] \n[00:50.45] Graceless lady\n[00:58.42] You know who I am\n[01:04.55] You know I can't let you\n[01:10.27] \n[01:12.81] Slide through my hands\n[01:19.58] Wild horses\n[01:23.27] Couldn't drag me away\n[01:28.85] \n[01:32.39] Wild, wild horses\n[01:39.25] Couldn't drag me away\n[01:46.18] I watched you suffer\n[01:52.11] \n[01:54.42] A dull aching pain\n[01:59.75] Now you decided\n[02:06.77] To show me the same\n[02:13.31] No sweeping exits\n[02:20.35] Or off stage lines\n[02:26.95] Could make me feel bitter\n[02:34.43] Or treat you unkind\n[02:40.38] Wild horses\n[02:47.24] Couldn't drag me away\n[02:53.99] Wild, wild horses\n[03:00.52] Couldn't drag me away\n[03:05.63] \n[03:20.84] I know I dreamed you\n[03:28.26] \n[03:34.19] A sin and a lie\n[03:40.05] I have my freedom\n[03:46.43] But I don't have much time\n[03:53.04] Faith has been broken\n[04:00.38] Tears must be cried\n[04:06.16] Let's do some living\n[04:12.85] After we die\n[04:18.98] Wild horses\n[04:25.32] Couldn't drag me away\n[04:32.01] Wild, wild horses\n[04:37.92] We'll ride them someday\n[04:44.17] \n[05:10.94] Wild horses\n[05:16.57] Couldn't drag me away\n[05:21.36] \n[05:23.52] Wild, wild horses\n[05:30.42] We'll ride them someday\n[05:34.47]",
