        "fullLyrics": "[00:15.54] My hands are cold, my body's numb\n[00:19.62] I'm still in shock, what have you done?\n[00:23.87] My head is pounding, my vision's blurred\n[00:28.01] Your mouth is moving, I don't hear a word\n[00:32.25] And I hurt so bad, that I search my skin\n[00:36.18] For the entry point, where love went in\n[00:40.53] And ricocheted and bounced around\n[00:44.79] And left a hole when you walked out, yeah\n[00:49.95] I'm falling through the doors of the emergency room\n[00:54.16] Can anybody help me with these exit wounds?\n[00:58.31] I don't know how much more love this heart can lose\n[01:02.08] And I'm dying, dying from these exit wounds\n[01:09.37] Wounds!\n[01:10.09] Where they're leaving, the scars you're keeping\n[01:14.01] Exit wounds\n[01:18.40] Where they're leaving, the scars you're keeping\n[01:24.09] \n[01:30.72] Marks of battle, they still feel raw\n[01:34.89] A million pieces of me, on the floor\n[01:39.06] I'm damaged goods, for all to see\n[01:43.12] Now who would ever wanna be with me?\n[01:47.33] I've got all the baggage, drink the pills\n[01:51.85] Yeah, this is living but without the will\n[01:55.70] I'm backing out, I'm shutting down\n[01:59.81] You left a hole when you walked out, yeah\n[02:05.14] I'm falling through the doors of the emergency room\n[02:09.20] Can anybody help me with these exit wounds?\n[02:13.44] I don't know how much more love this heart can lose\n[02:17.12] And I'm dying, dying from these exit wounds\n[02:22.07] Wounds!\n[02:25.12] Where they're leaving, the scars you're keeping\n[02:29.43] Exit wounds\n[02:33.52] Where they're leaving, the scars you're keeping\n[02:38.73] Lose your clothes and show your scars that's who you are\n[02:47.01] Lose your clothes and show your scars that's who you are\n[02:53.94] Lose your clothes and show your scars that's who you are\n[03:02.58] Lose your clothes and show your scars\n[03:11.00] Marks of battle, they still feel raw\n[03:15.08] A million pieces of me, on the floor\n[03:20.28] I'm falling through the doors of the emergency room\n[03:24.35] Can anybody help me with these exit wounds?\n[03:28.54] I don't know how much more love this heart can lose\n[03:32.29] And I'm dying, dying from these exit wounds\n[03:37.24] Wounds!\n[03:40.31] Where they're leaving, the scars you're keeping\n[03:44.29] Exit wounds\n[03:48.65] Where they're leaving, the scars you're keeping\n[03:54.11]",
