        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.49] You know there's a light that glows by the front door\n[00:22.58] Don't forget the key's under the mat\n[00:27.26] When childhood stars shine\n[00:30.54] Always stay humble and kind\n[00:34.77] \n[00:37.13] Go to church 'cause your mamma says to\n[00:41.84] Visit grandpa every chance that you can\n[00:46.68] It won't be wasted time\n[00:49.35] Always stay humble and kind\n[00:53.69] \n[00:56.49] Hold the door, say \"please\", say \"thank you\"\n[01:00.69] Don't steal, don't cheat, and don't lie\n[01:05.33] I know you got mountains to climb\n[01:08.56] But always stay humble and kind\n[01:12.24] \n[01:15.01] When the dreams you're dreamin' come to you\n[01:19.68] When the work you put in is realized\n[01:24.79] Let yourself feel the pride\n[01:27.32] But always stay humble and kind\n[01:32.17] \n[01:34.38] Don't expect a free ride from no one\n[01:38.70] Don't hold a grudge or a chip and here's why\n[01:43.35] Bitterness keeps you from flyin'\n[01:46.85] Always stay humble and kind\n[01:50.84] \n[01:53.35] Know the difference between sleeping with someone\n[01:57.67] And sleeping with someone you love\n[02:02.47] \"I love you\" ain't no pick-up line\n[02:05.44] So, always stay humble and kind\n[02:09.80] \n[02:11.87] Hold the door, say \"please\", say \"thank you\"\n[02:16.78] Don't steal, don't cheat, and don't lie\n[02:21.48] I know you got mountains to climb\n[02:24.43] But always stay humble and kind\n[02:29.02] \n[02:31.33] When those dreams you're dreamin' come to you\n[02:35.68] When the work you put in is realized\n[02:40.57] Let yourself feel the pride\n[02:43.22] But always stay humble and kind, yeah\n[02:47.46] \n[03:29.08] When it's hot, eat a root beer popsicle\n[03:32.83] Shut off the AC and roll the windows down\n[03:37.36] Let that summer sun shine\n[03:40.51] Always stay humble and kind\n[03:44.90] \n[03:47.08] Don't take for granted the love this life gives you\n[03:51.53] When you get where you're going don't forget turn back around\n[03:56.37] And help the next one in line\n[03:59.46] Always stay humble and kind\n[04:01.59]",
