        "fullLyrics": "[00:28.17] Bet your window's rolled down and your hair's pulled back\n[00:32.94] And I bet you got no idea you're goin' way too fast\n[00:39.37] You're tryin' not to think about what went wrong\n[00:42.57] Tryin' not to stop 'til you get where you're goin'\n[00:45.78] You're tryin' to stay awake, so I bet you turned on the radio\n[00:50.23] And the song goes\n[00:51.83] I can't live without you, I can't live without you, baby\n[00:57.48] I can't live without you, I can't live without you, baby, oh baby\n[01:04.46] The highway won't hold you tonight\n[01:07.02] The highway don't know you're alive\n[01:10.07] The highway don't care if you're all alone\n[01:14.02] But I do, I do\n[01:16.26] The highway won't dry your tears\n[01:18.90] The highway don't need you here\n[01:21.87] The highway don't care if you're comin' home\n[01:26.13] But I do, I do\n[01:31.46] I bet you got a dead cell phone in your shotgun seat\n[01:36.86] Yeah, I bet you're bendin' God's ear talkin' 'bout me\n[01:42.91] You're tryin' not to let the first tear fall down\n[01:46.19] You're tryin' not to think about turnin' around\n[01:49.33] You're tryin' not to get lost in the sound, but that song is always on\n[01:54.92] So you sing along\n[01:55.77] I can't live without you, I can't live without you, baby\n[02:01.02] I can't live without I can't live without you, baby, oh baby\n[02:08.03] The highway won't hold you tonight\n[02:10.65] The highway don't know you're alive\n[02:13.63] The highway don't care if you're all alone\n[02:18.29] But I do, I do\n[02:19.69] The highway won't dry your tears\n[02:22.59] The highway don't need you here\n[02:25.76] The highway don't care if you're comin' home\n[02:29.76] But I do, I do\n[02:31.36] \n[02:56.63] I can't live without you, I can't live without you, baby\n[03:02.24] I can't live without I can't live without you, baby, oh baby\n[03:08.94] (The highway don't care)\n[03:11.32] (The highway don't care)\n[03:14.37] (The highway don't care)\n[03:18.58] But I do, I do\n[03:20.10] (The highway don't care)\n[03:22.54] I can't live without you, baby, baby\n[03:24.10] (The highway don't care)\n[03:26.67] I can't live without you, I can't live without you, baby, oh baby\n[03:31.96] But I do, I do\n[03:33.07] (The highway don't care)\n[03:34.47] (The highway don't care)\n[03:36.03] (The highway don't care)\n[03:37.30] (The highway don't care)\n[03:38.93] (The highway don't care)\n[03:41.30] I can't live without I can't live without you, baby, baby\n[03:44.02] But I do, I do\n[03:45.33] (The highway don't care)\n[03:46.74] (The highway don't care)\n[03:48.04] (The highway don't care)\n[03:49.61] (The highway don't care)\n[03:50.96] (The highway don't care)\n[03:53.18] I can't live without you, baby, baby\n[03:55.26] But I do, I do\n[03:56.84] \n[04:21.99] I can't live without you, I can't live without you, baby\n[04:28.88]",
