        "fullLyrics": "[00:11.49] She's a good girl, loves her mama\n[00:16.99] Loves Jesus and America too\n[00:22.62] She's a good girl, is crazy 'bout Elvis\n[00:28.62] Loves horses and her boyfriend too\n[00:33.70] \n[00:39.78] And it's a long day livin' in Reseda\n[00:45.78] There's a freeway runnin' through the yard\n[00:51.00] And I'm a bad boy, 'cause I don't even miss her\n[00:56.90] I'm a bad boy for breakin' her heart\n[01:02.36] And I'm free\n[01:07.94] Free fallin'\n[01:13.76] Yeah, I'm free\n[01:19.43] Free fallin'\n[01:25.15] And all the vampires walkin' through the valley\n[01:31.05] Move west down Ventura Boulevard (Ventura Boulevard)\n[01:36.78] And all the bad boys are standin' in the shadows\n[01:42.47] And the good girls are home with broken hearts\n[01:47.96] And I'm free\n[01:53.17] I'm free fallin'\n[01:59.26] Yeah, I'm free\n[02:04.62] Free fallin'\n[02:07.59] \n[02:17.11] Free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm\n[02:22.72] \n[02:28.55] Free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm\n[02:33.74] I wanna glide down over Mulholland (oh-ah)\n[02:39.38] I wanna write her name in the sky (oh-ah)\n[02:44.85] I'm gonna free fall out into nothin' (oh-ah)\n[02:50.69] Gonna leave this world for awhile (oh-ah)\n[02:56.12] And I'm free (free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[03:01.68] Free fallin' (free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[03:07.33] Yeah, I'm free (free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[03:13.08] Free fallin' (free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[03:19.79] \n[03:25.75] Free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm\n[03:30.13] Yeah, I'm free\n[03:35.88] Free fallin'\n[03:41.57] Oh! (Free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[03:47.15] Free fallin' (free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[03:53.06] And I'm free (free fallin', now I'm free fallin') oh! (Now I'm)\n[03:58.87] Free fallin' (free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm)\n[04:05.45] Free fallin', now I'm free fallin', now I'm\n[04:09.97] Free fallin' (free fallin', now I'm free...)\n[04:14.32]",
