        "fullLyrics": "[00:08.20] Well, I won't back down\n[00:12.42] No I won't back down\n[00:16.72] You could stand me up at the gates of Hell\n[00:20.95] But I won't back down\n[00:25.02] No I'll stand my ground\n[00:29.46] Won't be turned around\n[00:33.40] And I'll keep this world from draggin' me down\n[00:37.79] Gonna stand my ground\n[00:41.75] And I won't back down\n[00:45.28] (I won't back down) Hey baby\n[00:51.29] There ain't no easy way out (I won't back down)\n[00:54.75] Hey I will stand my ground\n[01:03.04] And I won't back down\n[01:07.04] Well, I know what's right\n[01:11.24] I got just one life\n[01:15.34] In a world that keeps on pushin' me around\n[01:19.68] But I'll stand my ground\n[01:23.64] And I won't back down\n[01:27.41] (I won't back down) Hey baby\n[01:33.37] There ain't no easy way out (I won't back down)\n[01:37.02] Hey I will stand my ground (I won't back down)\n[01:44.92] And I won't back down\n[01:48.86] \n[02:09.44] (I won't back down) Hey baby\n[02:15.17] There ain't no easy way out (I won't back down)\n[02:18.57] Hey I won't back down\n[02:26.19] (I won't back down) Hey baby\n[02:31.88] There ain't no easy way out (I won't back down)\n[02:35.73] Hey I will stand my ground (I won't back down)\n[02:43.62] And I won't back down (I won't back down)\n[02:47.98] No I won't back down\n[02:55.08]",
