        "fullLyrics": "[00:16.41] Well, I started out\n[00:20.31] Down a dirty road\n[00:24.78] Started out\n[00:28.90] All alone\n[00:32.85] And the sun went down\n[00:37.05] As I crossed the hill\n[00:41.15] And the town lit up\n[00:45.35] The world got still\n[00:49.18] I'm learning to fly\n[00:53.42] But I ain't got wings\n[00:57.72] Coming down\n[01:01.73] Is the hardest thing\n[01:05.68] Well, the good old days\n[01:09.74] May not return\n[01:13.90] And the rocks might melt\n[01:18.12] And the sea may burn\n[01:22.03] I'm learning to fly (learning to fly)\n[01:26.18] But I ain't got wings (learning to fly)\n[01:30.57] Coming down (learning to fly)\n[01:34.45] Is the hardest thing (learning to fly)\n[01:37.29] \n[01:59.19] Well, some say life\n[02:03.23] Will beat you down\n[02:07.47] Break your heart\n[02:11.76] Steal your crown\n[02:15.65] So I started out\n[02:19.83] For God knows where\n[02:23.96] I guess I'll know\n[02:28.14] When I get there\n[02:31.91] I'm learning to fly\n[02:36.36] Around the clouds\n[02:40.27] But what goes up (learning to fly)\n[02:44.61] Must come down\n[03:01.08] I'm learning to fly (learning to fly)\n[03:05.15] But I ain't got wings\n[03:09.21] Coming down\n[03:13.23] Is the hardest thing\n[03:17.31] I'm learning to fly (learning to fly)\n[03:21.37] Around the clouds\n[03:25.69] But what goes up (learning to fly)\n[03:29.99] Must come down\n[03:33.89] I'm learning to fly (learning to fly, learning to fly)\n[03:37.24] \n[03:41.92] I'm learning to fly (learning to fly, learning to fly)\n[03:45.13] \n[03:52.43] (Learning to fly, learning to fly)\n[03:53.50]",
