        "fullLyrics": "[00:17.335] All I wanna do when I wake up\n[00:19.275] In the morning is see you eyes\n[00:22.404] Rosanna  Rosanna\n[00:25.903] I never thought that a girl like\n[00:27.723] You could ever care for me  Rosanna\n[00:37.292] All I wanna do in the middle of the\n[00:39.202] Evening is hold you tight\n[00:42.591] Rosanna  Rosanna\n[00:45.750] I didn't know you were looking for\n[00:47.520] More than I could ever be\n[00:51.689] Not quite a year since she went away \n[00:56.678] Rosanna yeah\n[01:00.468] Now she's gone and I have to say\n[01:09.573] Meet you all the way \n[01:15.464] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[01:21.014] Meet you all the way \n[01:26.624] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[01:34.724] I can see your face still shining\n[01:36.484] Through the window on the other side\n[01:39.774] Rosanna  Rosanna\n[01:43.374] I didn't know that a girl\n[01:44.894] Like you could make me feel so sad \n[01:48.544] Rosanna\n[01:54.603] All I wanna take is a night\n[01:56.313] You'll never ever have to compromise\n[01:59.833] Rosanna  Rosanna\n[02:03.402] I never thought that losing\n[02:04.872] You could ever hurt so bad\n[02:09.051] Not quite a year since she went away \n[02:14.051] Rosanna yeah\n[02:18.080] Now she's gone and I have to say\n[02:27.160] Meet you all the way \n[02:32.830] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[02:38.550] Meet you all the way \n[02:44.300] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[02:52.439]  \n[03:27.343] Not quite a year since she went away \n[03:32.573] Rosanna yeah\n[03:36.513] Now she's gone and I have to say\n[03:44.913] Meet you all the way \n[03:51.033] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[03:56.833] Meet you all the way \n[04:02.451] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[04:09.940] Meet you all the way \n[04:15.630] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[04:21.500] Meet you all the way \n[04:27.279] Meet you all the way  Rosanna yeah\n[04:35.947]",
