        "fullLyrics": "[00:04.04] Hey, hey\n[00:05.77] Hey-hey, hey-hey\n[00:08.16] Hey-hey, hey-hey\n[00:11.75] Your lipstick stains\n[00:15.03] On the front lobe of my left side brains\n[00:20.45] I knew I wouldn't forget you\n[00:22.94] And so I went and let you blow my mind\n[00:28.05] \n[00:31.50] Your sweet moonbeam\n[00:34.66] The smell of you in every single dream I dream\n[00:40.48] I knew when we collided\n[00:42.41] You're the one I have decided who's one of my kind\n[00:48.41] \n[00:51.68] Hey, soul sister\n[00:53.75] Ain't that Mr. Mister on the radio, stereo\n[00:58.51] The way you move ain't fair, you know\n[01:01.53] Hey, soul sister\n[01:03.61] I don't wanna miss a single thing you do tonight\n[01:13.17] Hey, hey\n[01:15.10] Hey-hey, hey-hey\n[01:17.49] Hey-hey, hey-hey\n[01:21.19] Just in time\n[01:24.42] I'm so glad you have a one-track mind like me\n[01:29.83] You gave my life direction\n[01:32.38] A game show love connection we can't deny\n[01:41.05] I'm so obsessed\n[01:44.04] My heart is bound to beat right out my untrimmed chest\n[01:49.80] I believe in you, like a virgin, you're Madonna\n[01:54.29] And I'm always gonna wanna blow your mind\n[02:00.82] Hey, soul sister\n[02:02.98] Ain't that Mr. Mister on the radio, stereo\n[02:07.85] The way you move ain't fair, you know\n[02:10.72] Hey, soul sister\n[02:12.82] I don't wanna miss a single thing you do tonight\n[02:21.42] The way you can cut a rug\n[02:23.19] Watching you is the only drug I need\n[02:25.97] So gangsta, I'm so thug\n[02:27.95] You're the only one I'm dreaming of\n[02:30.34] You see, I can be myself now finally\n[02:33.12] In fact, there's nothing I can't be\n[02:36.55] I want the world to see you'll be with me\n[02:40.31] Hey, soul sister\n[02:42.68] Ain't that Mr. Mister on the radio, stereo\n[02:47.46] The way you move ain't fair, you know\n[02:50.48] Hey, soul sister\n[02:52.54] I don't wanna miss a single thing you do tonight\n[03:00.28] Hey, soul sister\n[03:02.52] I don't wanna miss a single thing you do tonight\n[03:11.75] Hey, hey\n[03:13.86] Hey-hey, hey-hey\n[03:16.11] Hey-hey, hey-hey (tonight)\n[03:21.75] Hey, hey\n[03:23.75] Hey-hey, hey-hey\n[03:26.13] Hey-hey, hey-hey (tonight)\n[03:26.79]",
