        "fullLyrics": "[00:14.579] Is it getting better \n[00:19.579] Or do you feel the same \n[00:24.829] Will it make it easier on you now \n[00:30.079] You got someone to blame\n[00:33.892] You say\n[00:35.079] One love\n[00:37.579] One life\n[00:39.951] When it's one need\n[00:42.641] In the night\n[00:45.701] One love\n[00:48.017] We get to share it\n[00:50.891] Leaves you baby if you\n[00:53.633] Don't care for it\n[01:08.040] Did I disappoint you \n[01:12.035] Or leave a bad taste in your mouth \n[01:17.852] You act like you never had love\n[01:22.476] And you want me to go without\n[01:26.476] Well it's\n[01:27.978] Too late' Tonight\n[01:32.791] To drag the past out into the light\n[01:38.228] We're one' but we're not the same\n[01:42.664] We get to carry each other\n[01:45.603] Carry each other    One\n[02:00.226] Have you come here for forgiveness \n[02:05.538] Have you come to raise the dead \n[02:10.604] Have you come here to play Jesus \n[02:15.854] To the lepers in your head\n[02:20.727] Did I ask too much \n[02:23.542] More than a lot \n[02:25.851] You gave me nothing\n[02:27.979] Now it's all I got\n[02:31.292] We're one but we're not the same\n[02:35.353] Well we hurt each other\n[02:38.292] Then we do it again\n[02:40.542] You say love is a temple\n[02:43.917] Love a higher law\n[02:46.604] Love is a temple\n[02:49.227] Love the higher law\n[02:51.667] You ask me to enter\n[02:54.353] But then you make me crawl\n[02:57.167] And I can't be holding on\n[03:00.821] To what you got\n[03:03.446] When all you got is hurt\n[03:05.945] One love ' One blood\n[03:11.133] One life ' You got to do what you should\n[03:16.321] One life with each other\n[03:21.819] Sisters ' Brothers\n[03:26.884] One life ' But we're not the same\n[03:30.947] We get to carry each other\n[03:34.197] Carry each other\n[03:36.509] One",
