        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:27.560] One man come in the name of love\n[00:32.300] One man come and go\n[00:36.890] One man come, he to justify\n[00:41.390] One man to overthrow\n[00:45.260] In the name of love\n[00:49.760] What more in the name of love\n[00:54.320] In the name of love\n[00:58.790] What more in the name of love\n[01:03.980] One man caught on a barbed wire fence\n[01:08.480] One man he resist\n[01:13.070] One man washed on an empty beach.\n[01:17.540] One man betrayed with a kiss\n[01:21.500] In the name of love\n[01:25.970] What more in the name of love\n[01:30.530] In the name of love\n[01:35.000] What more in the name of love\n[01:40.400] （nobody like you...）\n[02:26.060] Early morning, April 4\n[02:29.990] Shot rings out in the Memphis sky\n[02:34.910] Free at last, they took your life\n[02:38.600] They could not take your pride\n[02:43.130] In the name of love\n[02:47.600] What more in the name of love\n[02:52.190] In the name of love\n[02:56.750] What more in the name of love\n[03:01.340] In the name of love\n[03:05.960] What more in the name of love\n[03:10.580] In the name of love\n[03:15.170] What more in the name of love",
