        "fullLyrics": "[00:02.17] Hey, hey, hey, yeah\n[00:05.76] Hey, hey, hey yeah\n[00:10.04] I was a sailor, I was lost at sea\n[00:13.66] I was under the waves\n[00:15.21] Before love rescued me\n[00:17.86] I was a fighter, I could turn on a thread\n[00:21.88] Now I stand accused of the things I've said\n[00:26.16] Love comes to town I'm gonna jump that train\n[00:30.35] When love comes to town I'm gonna catch that flame\n[00:34.44] Maybe I was wrong to ever let you down\n[00:38.94] But I did what I did before love came to town\n[00:43.43] \n[00:51.40] Used to make love under a red sunset\n[00:55.48] I was making promises I was soon to forget\n[00:59.34] She was pale as the lace of her wedding gown\n[01:03.59] But I left her standing before love came to town\n[01:08.63] I ran into a juke joint when I heard a guitar scream\n[01:12.08] The notes were turning blue, I was dazing in a dream\n[01:16.11] As the music played I saw my life turn around\n[01:20.26] That was the day before love came to town\n[01:24.95] When love comes to town I'm gonna jump that train\n[01:28.56] When love comes to town I'm gonna catch that flame\n[01:32.72] Maybe I was wrong to ever let you down\n[01:36.55] But I did what I did before love came to town\n[01:42.74] \n[01:58.33] When love comes to town I'm gonna jump that train\n[02:01.72] When love comes to town I'm gonna catch that flame\n[02:06.04] Maybe I was wrong to ever let you down\n[02:10.20] But I did what I did before love came to town\n[02:16.21] \n[02:37.10] I was there when they crucified my Lord\n[02:39.92] I held the scabbard when the soldier drew his sword\n[02:43.63] I threw the dice when they pierced his side\n[02:47.73] But I've seen love conquer the great divide\n[02:52.19] When love comes to town I'm gonna catch that train\n[02:56.28] When love comes to town I'm gonna catch that flame\n[03:00.57] Maybe I was wrong to ever let you down\n[03:04.95] But I did what I did before love came to town\n[03:10.00] Hey, hey, yeah, yeah\n[03:14.53] Hey, hey, yeah, yeah\n[03:17.64] Hey, hey, hey, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[03:21.63] \n[03:29.96] Hey, hey, yeah, yeah\n[03:35.06] \n[04:02.29] Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[04:02.98] Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[04:03.40]",
