        "fullLyrics": "[00:48.097] Hey\n[01:07.798] Everybody's lookin for somethin\n[01:12.601] Somethin' to fill in the holes\n[01:17.651] We think a lot but don't talk much about it\n[01:22.521] Til things get out of control\n[01:26.601] How do I know when it's love\n[01:30.651] I can't tell you but it lasts forever\n[01:36.921] How does it feel when it's love\n[01:40.281] It's just something you feel together\n[01:45.671] When it's love\n[01:56.021] You look at every face in a crowd\n[02:00.850] Some shine and some keep you guessin\n[02:05.581] Waiting for someone to come into focus\n[02:10.941] Teach you your final love lesson\n[02:15.511] How do I know when it's love\n[02:18.621] I can't tell you but it lasts forever\n[02:25.171] How does it feel when it's love\n[02:28.601] It's just something you feel together\n[02:35.361] Oh oh oh oh\n[02:37.671] Oh when it's love\n[02:40.421] Oh oh oh oh\n[02:42.451] You can feel it yeah\n[02:45.131] Oh oh oh oh\n[02:49.321] Nothing's missing\n[02:53.161] Yeah\n[03:13.911] Oh oh oh oh\n[03:16.391] Yeah You can feel it\n[03:18.651] Oh oh oh oh\n[03:21.081] Oh when it's love\n[03:23.951] Oh oh oh oh\n[03:27.911] Nothing's missing\n[03:33.001] How do I know when it's love \n[03:36.381] I can't tell you but it lasts forever\n[03:42.331] How does it feel when it's love\n[03:45.941] It's just something you feel together\n[03:52.031] How do I know when it's love \n[03:55.681] I can't tell you but it lasts forever\n[04:00.601] When it's love\n[04:10.701] When it's love\n[04:19.041] It'll last forever\n[04:25.151] When it's love\n[04:36.498] You and i\n[04:38.431] We're gonna feel this thing together\n[04:44.341] When it's love\n[04:49.621] When it's love\n[04:57.801] You can feel it\n[05:07.561] We'll make it last forever\n[05:17.991] When it's love",
