        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:02.570] Send \"I'm  Still  Here\"Ringtone  to  your  Cell\n[00:04.521] \"I'm  Still  Here\"\n[00:11.393] I  found  the  pieces  in  my  hand\n[00:13.593] They  were  always  there\n[00:18.393] It  just  took  some  time  for  me  to  understand\n[00:21.543] You  gave  me  words  I  just  can't  say\n[00:26.744] So  if  nothing  else\n[00:28.395] I'll  just  hold  on  while  you  drift  away\n[00:30.795] Cause  everything  you  wanted  me  to  hide\n[00:36.846] Is  everything  that  makes  me  feel  alive\n[00:39.696] The  cities  grow\n[00:43.648] The  rivers  flow\n[00:44.348] Where  you  are,I'll  never  know\n[00:47.149] But  I'm  still  here\n[00:52.152] If  you  were  right  and  I  was  wrong\n[00:54.852] Why  are  you  the  one  who's  gone\n[00:57.152] And  I'm  still  here\n[01:00.602] Still  here\n[01:04.303] Seeing  the  ashes  in  my  heart\n[01:14.257] The  smile  the  widest\n[01:15.556] When  I  cry  inside  and  my  insides  blow  apart\n[01:19.357] I  tried  to  wear  another  face\n[01:24.507] Just  to  make  you  proud\n[01:25.907] Just  to  make  you  put  me  in  my  place\n[01:28.108] But  everything  you  wanted  from  me\n[01:34.624] Is  everything  that  I  could  never  be\n[01:39.774] The  cities  grow\n[01:40.974] The  rivers  flow\n[01:42.424] Where  you  are,I'll  never  know\n[01:44.625] But  I'm  still  here\n[01:49.876] If  you  were  right  and  I  was  wrong\n[01:52.826] Why  are  you  the  one  who's  gone\n[01:54.926] And  I'm  still  here\n[02:00.260] Maybe  tonight\n[02:05.104] It's  gonna  be  alright\n[02:06.204] I  will  get  better\n[02:11.455] Maybe  today\n[02:14.856] It's  gonna  be  okay\n[02:17.406] I  will  remember\n[02:18.806] I  held  the  pieces  of  my  soul\n[02:27.090] I  was  shattered  and  I  wanted  you  to  come  and  make  me  whole\n[02:35.510] When  I  saw  you  yesterday\n[02:38.211] But  you  didn't  notice\n[02:41.661] And  you  just  walked  away\n[02:45.513] Cause  everything  you  wanted  me  to  hide\n[02:50.715] Is  everything  that  makes  me  feel  alive\n[02:53.415] The  cities  grow\n[02:56.615] The  rivers  flow\n[02:57.565] Where  you  are,I'll  never  know\n[03:00.466] But  I'm  still  here\n[03:05.974] If  you  were  right  and  I  was  wrong\n[03:09.325] Why  are  you  the  one  who's  gone\n[03:11.375] And  I'm  still  here\n[03:16.176] The  lights  go  out,the  bridges  burn\n[03:18.776] Once  you're  gone,you  can't  return\n[03:22.412] But  I'm  still  here\n[03:26.515] Remember  how  you  used  to  say  I'd  be  the  one  to  runaway\n[03:31.616] But  I'm  still  here",
