        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:30.59] You got me tied down with battleship chains\n[00:34.40] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[00:38.31] Tied down with battleship chains\n[00:41.92] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[00:45.12] I can't move my arms\n[00:47.30] To hold nobody\n[00:49.19] Hold nobody but you\n[00:52.66] I can't move my legs\n[00:54.76] To chase nobody\n[00:56.44] To kick nobody but you\n[01:00.01] You got me tied down with battleship chains\n[01:04.17] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[01:07.81] Tied down with battleship chains\n[01:11.52] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[01:14.84] I can't move eyes\n[01:16.94] To see nobody\n[01:18.71] See nobody but you\n[01:22.15] I can't move my tongue\n[01:24.58] To taste nobody\n[01:26.23] To lick nobody but you\n[01:30.16] You got me tied down with battleship chains\n[01:31.45] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[01:32.09] Tied down with battleship chains\n[01:32.42] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[01:59.16] I can't move my lips\n[02:01.17] To kiss nobody\n[02:03.15] Kiss nobody but you\n[02:06.56] I can't move my heart\n[02:08.60] To love nobody\n[02:10.57] To love nobody but you\n[02:14.03] You got me tied down with battleship chains\n[02:17.91] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[02:21.57] Tied down with battleship chains\n[02:25.35] Fifty foot long and a two ton anchor\n[02:28.62] You got me tied, tied\n[02:32.60] Tied tied\n[02:34.85] Don't you know you got me\n[02:36.61] Tied tied, tied, tied\n[02:41.97] Baby don't you know you got me\n[02:43.81] Tied tied, tied, tied\n[02:49.76]",
