        "fullLyrics": "[00:27.672] I've been tryna call\n[00:30.456] I've been on my own for long enough\n[00:33.176] Maybe you can show me how to love\n[00:35.975] Maybe\n[00:38.637] I'm going through withdrawals\n[00:41.554] You don't even have to do too much\n[00:44.362] You can turn me on with just a touch baby\n[00:49.988] I look around and\n[00:51.142] Sin city's cold and empty\n[00:53.503] Oh\n[00:54.029] No one's around to judge me\n[00:56.221] Oh\n[00:56.741] I can't see clearly when you're gone\n[00:59.814] Oh oh\n[01:00.952] I said ooh I'm blinded by the lights\n[01:06.985] No I can't sleep until I feel your touch\n[01:12.438] I said ooh I'm drowning in the night\n[01:18.289] Oh when I'm like this you're the one I trust\n[01:22.887] Hey hey hey\n[01:34.925] I'm running out of time\n[01:37.693] 'Cause I can see the sun light up the sky\n[01:40.573] So I hit the road in overdrive baby oh\n[01:47.450] The city's cold and empty\n[01:49.762] Oh\n[01:50.101] No one's around to judge me\n[01:52.364] Oh\n[01:52.826] I can't see clearly when you're gone\n[01:56.089] Oh oh\n[01:57.281] I said ooh I'm blinded by the lights\n[02:03.274] No I can't sleep until I feel your touch\n[02:08.579] I said ooh I'm drowning in the night\n[02:14.454] Oh when I'm like this you're the one I trust\n[02:19.976] I'm just walking by to let you know\n[02:22.117] By to let you know\n[02:22.989] I can never say it on the phone\n[02:24.822] Say it on the phone\n[02:26.038] Will never let you go this time\n[02:30.244] Ooh\n[02:31.035] I said ooh I'm blinded by the lights\n[02:36.937] No I can't sleep until I feel your touch\n[02:41.367] Hey hey hey\n[02:52.609] Hey hey hey\n[03:04.767] I said ooh I'm blinded by the lights\n[03:10.647] No I can't sleep until I feel your touch",
