        "dateAdded": "2026-05-03T08:17:58.530Z",
        "externalUrl": "",
        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:32.32] I should have known better than to let you go alone\n[00:38.08] It's times like these I can't make it on my own\n[00:43.09] Wasted days and sleepless nights\n[00:47.90] And I can't wait to see you again\n[00:53.53] I find I spend my time waiting on your call\n[00:59.16] How can I tell you, babe, my back's against the wall\n[01:04.36] I need you by my side to tell me it's all right\n[01:09.29] 'Cause I don't think I can take anymore\n[01:13.72] Is this love that I'm feeling?\n[01:18.78] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[01:24.88] Is this love or am I dreaming?\n[01:29.46] This must be love\n[01:31.63] 'Cause it's really got a hold on me\n[01:39.73] A hold on me\n[01:42.14] Can't stop the feeling, I've been this way before\n[01:57.77] But with you I've found the key to open any door\n[02:03.05] I can feel my love for you growing stronger day by day\n[02:07.99] And I can't wait to see you again\n[02:12.58] So I can hold you in my arms\n[02:15.43] Is this love that I'm feeling?\n[02:20.16] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[02:26.10] Is this love (Is this love?) or am I dreaming?\n[02:30.77] This must be love\n[02:34.18] 'Cause it's really got a hold on me\n[02:40.81] A hold on me\n[03:05.97] Is this love that I'm feeling?\n[03:10.40] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[03:16.65] Is this love (Is this love?) or am I dreaming?\n[03:21.34] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[03:27.35] Is this love (Is this love?) or am I dreaming?\n[03:32.27] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[03:38.47] Is this love (Is this love?) or am I dreaming?\n[03:42.54] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[03:48.47] Is this love (Is this love?) or am I dreaming?\n[03:52.97] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[03:54.48] Is this love (Is this love?) or am I dreaming?\n[03:55.13] Is this the love that I've been searching for?\n[03:55.73]",
