        "favorite": false,
        "fullLyrics": "[00:00.31] If I should stay\n[00:08.33] I would only be in your way\n[00:18.35] So I'll go, but I know\n[00:25.35] I'll think of you every step of the way\n[00:38.12] And I will always love you\n[00:52.95] I will always love you\n[01:02.58] You\n[01:05.83] My darling, you, mm, mm\n[01:12.46] Bittersweet memories\n[01:19.45] That is all I'm taking with me\n[01:27.39] So goodbye, please don't cry\n[01:34.72] We both know I'm not what you, you need\n[01:41.77] And I will always love you\n[01:47.17] I will always love you\n[01:56.46] \n[02:01.95] You\n[02:04.85] \n[02:31.06] I hope life treats you kind\n[02:38.31] And I hope you have all you've dreamed of\n[02:45.68] And I wish you joy and happiness\n[02:52.34] But above all this, I wish you love\n[02:59.35] \n[03:04.01] And I will always love you\n[03:15.28] I will always love you\n[03:20.65] I will always love you\n[03:29.23] I will always love you\n[03:38.01] I will always love you\n[03:44.45] I, I will always love you\n[03:59.92] You\n[04:02.27] Darling, I love you\n[04:07.01] I'll always, I'll always love you\n[04:07.12]",
