        "fullLyrics": "[00:24.76] I got to have a shot\n[00:28.17] 'Cause what you got is, oh, so sweet\n[00:32.21] You got to make it hot\n[00:36.28] Like a boomerang I need a repeat\n[00:40.75] Gimme all your lovin'\n[00:42.61] All your hugs and kisses too\n[00:46.17] \n[00:48.73] Gimme all your lovin'\n[00:50.81] Don't let up until we're through\n[00:56.47] You got to whip it up\n[01:00.59] And hit me like a ton of lead\n[01:04.49] If I blow my top\n[01:08.60] Will you let it go to your head?\n[01:12.72] Gimme all your lovin'\n[01:14.83] All your hugs and kisses too\n[01:20.88] Gimme all your lovin'\n[01:22.85] Don't let up until we're through\n[01:28.31] \n[02:21.14] You got to move it up\n[02:24.80] And use it like a screwball would\n[02:28.70] You got to pack it up\n[02:32.82] Work it like a new boy should\n[02:36.88] Gimme all your lovin'\n[02:39.05] All your hugs and kisses too\n[02:45.02] Gimme all your lovin'\n[02:47.01] Don't let up until we're through\n[02:47.99]",
